window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_LEGEND_OF_SWORDSMAN_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":6401,"title":"Chapter 6401: Harvest","paragraphs":["Chapter 6401: Harvest","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The power and supreme treasures were different, and so was the way they were driven.","Only when a particular sequence of the Divine Eye technique was cultivated to perfection could it be used, making it somewhat niche.","After all, not everyone could cultivate the sequence of the Divine Eye to perfection.","This wasn’t dependent on one’s realm, but rather on the innate gift of comprehension.","For example, back when Wei Jiuxian from the Crimson Eyes Realm only had the Divine Aspect realm, he was already able to cultivate the third sequence of the Divine Eye technique to perfection.","Many True Immortals couldn’t achieve this, though there were some who were in the Mahayana stage that could.","The main factor was comprehension.","The other factor was time.","Wei Jiuxian wholeheartedly devoted himself to understanding the Divine Eye technique. He didn’t struggle with the mysteries of the Origin Source nor did he attempt to create his own cultivation method, so he could maintain a state of selflessness during his cultivation.","However, in the Ancient Domain World, very few people could manage such a feat. After all, as soon as you opened your eyes, everything cost money.","Even finding a safe place to go into seclusion within the city came with a price, charged by the hour.","This was why everyone fought for resources.","In times of scarcity, it wasn’t just about comprehending the Divine Eye technique or the Origin Source.","One had to secure even more resources to survive.","Guardians like Qifeng, Yunhai, and Xue He were no different.","They were unwilling to miss any opportunity.","For instance, when Guardian Qifeng used up some of his Immortal Power earlier, he agonized over it for most of the day. He even risked offending Chu Xiong, forcing Xue He to bleed a little, just to recover the Immortal Power he had lost.","For him, this was a significant expense.","It was possible that the path ahead might be delayed due to this very cost, hindering his progress towards merging with the Dao.","The conflicts over orthodoxy were not only dull but also the saddest of times.","If the path of cultivation had been unified, then the powerful figures in the Ancient Domain World would have long since traveled to other worlds to seek treasures and break through to the Emperor level.","Instead, they remained in the Ancient Domain World, embroiled in internal strife, fighting over an elusive and illusory orthodoxy.","But this mistake was made in every world, leading to constant battles.","In the end, each world chose the simplest and most efficient cultivation system.","If nothing unexpected happened, the Origin Source path was sure to emerge victorious.","After all, compared to the Divine Eye technique, it was much simpler.","The demise of the Ancient Demon era allowed the human race to rise and attain a rightful position.","Now, humans were even digging up their graves!","This was truly a form of sorrow.","“Haha, it worked on the first try! This compass is made from innate materials. Selling it will fetch a good price, at least five million Immortal Crystals!” Guardian Qifeng licked his lips greedily.","Five million Immortal Crystals was quite a decent haul.","After all, the net worth of a Five-Step True Immortal was generally only around a million Immortal Crystals.","The likes of Tian Can and Fairy Ziyu, both True Immortals, were not in the ordinary ranks. One of them harbored a great secret, while the other had a powerful background and strong connections. Naturally, their worth had multiplied many times over.","At the very least, they were comparable to Six-Step or even Seven-Step True Immortals in terms of value.","Their worth ranged between three and five million.","And this time, securing five million Immortal Crystals equated to the worth of a Seven-Step True Immortal.","“Just a piece of innate material, and you’re this excited?” Xue He, the Blood River Ancestor, said coldly, taking the opportunity to mock Guardian Qifeng.","There was no need to be polite anymore, as the two of them had already torn away any pretense.","Guardian Qifeng rubbed his chin and retorted sarcastically, “You still don’t believe you’re an uncouth fool, do you? Do you think I’m happy about the five million Immortal Crystals? I’m excited because I was able to easily shatter this compass. If this place can be easily destroyed, so can the rest. The entire Ancient Demon Palace is worth at least a billion Immortal Crystals. Do you get it?”","These words were quite accurate.","Despite Guardian Qifeng’s rough and brutal nature, he also had a keen mind.","Xue He laughed coldly and shook his head, ceasing his attempts at mockery. Indeed, he had been too narrow-minded earlier, hoping to take a shot at Guardian Qifeng, only to find that the man had completely dismissed him, thinking on a grander scale.","A billion Immortal Crystals!","Even a Nine-Step True Immortal didn’t have such a high net worth.","Even Xue He, a powerhouse among True Immortals, couldn’t easily come up with a billion Immortal Crystals unless he sold his most treasured items.","But these treasures had been with him for tens of thousands of years, long ingrained into his combat strength. How could he sell them?","Thus, those who could easily come up with a billion Immortal Crystals were mostly Dao Lords.","“Haha, Qifeng is right. We didn’t come here in vain. We might be able to break through the entire Ancient Demon Palace. Just selling the materials alone will be worth at least a billion, and if we uncover any special innate materials, it could even reach two billion!” Guardian Yunhai was equally thrilled.","He gathered the materials, worth five million, into a pile, roughly ten thousand kilograms.","These materials were primarily used to craft Immortal weapons.","Of course, they could also be used to craft Origin weapons, but the resulting item would at least be a supreme-grade Origin weapon.","Xue He couldn’t hide his excitement either, though he maintained a cold expression and said, “Let’s continue dismantling this place. We’ve already made quite a commotion, and we don’t want to attract any unwanted attention!”","“Alright, this time, we’ll choose...” Guardian Yunhai began selecting a new area.","“Wait!”","However, Guardian Qifeng interrupted him again.","Guardian Yunhai turned his head impatiently and asked, “Qifeng, what now?”","“Brother Yunhai, don’t you feel something is off?” Guardian Qifeng asked as he shot a glance at Xue He.","Being stared at, Xue He immediately roared, “Qifeng, you’d better not stir up trouble now, or I’ll expose everything happening here. Even if I get nothing, I won’t let you take it all!”","“Heh, I’m not that despicable. I understand the rules!” Guardian Qifeng said indifferently.","Guardian Yunhai frowned and said, “Then what are you waiting for?”","“Waiting for what?” Guardian Qifeng walked over to the mountain of innate materials, casually picking up a fragment and weighing it in his hand. “Of course, to split the spoils. We three should at least discuss how to divide things later, right?”","“So that’s what you meant!” Guardian Yunhai was initially taken aback but quickly understood.","The three of them had all contributed.","Two were Dao Lords, and one was a Nine-Step True Immortal.","He and Guardian Qifeng were at a disadvantage.","On the surface, all three of them were working to destroy the Ancient Demon Palace with all their strength.","But the power of a Dao Lord was not the same as that of a Nine-Step True Immortal.","A single blow from a Dao Lord was equivalent to a full-force attack from a Nine-Step True Immortal.","Even though Xue He’s expertise far surpassed that of most Nine-Step True Immortals, it barely amounted to one-third of their combined strength.","This clearly put him at a significant disadvantage.","Xue He’s heart sank. He had known this issue would arise, which was why he had maintained a foul expression, trying to appear as if he was the one at a disadvantage when, in reality, he was the one making a massive profit.","Now that Guardian Qifeng had pointed it out, there was no more room for pretenses. He began to argue cunningly, “Guardian Qifeng does have a point.”","He first acknowledged the other’s words, hoping to make it seem like he was open to discussion rather than entering into another verbal confrontation."]},{"number":6402,"title":"Chapter 6402: Details","paragraphs":["Chapter 6402: Details","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Qifeng squinted, staring at Ancestor Xue He. He wanted to see what more the old man could say in his defense.","To his surprise, Xue He admitted everything without hesitation, something Qifeng had not expected.","“Since you agree that it’s reasonable, let’s establish some rules,” Guardian Qifeng began. “Your ultimate skill might be able to rival about a third of my power, and among the Nine-Step True Immortals, you’re quite strong, maybe even at the peak. But still, you’re two-thirds weaker than Yunhai and me, so your share will naturally be reduced by two-thirds!” He bluntly laid out his rules for dividing the spoils.","The distribution was based on strength.","He didn’t bother calculating the difference between himself and Guardian Yunhai.","But Xue He’s weakness was far too obvious, and they had to split everything accordingly.","For example, if there were a total of ten million Immortal Crystals, the three of them would each originally get 3.33 million.","Now, Xue He would lose 2.22 million, and the remainder would be split equally between Guardian Yunhai and Guardian Qifeng.","Thus, the ten million was split into three shares: two four-and-a-half portions, and one portion for Xue He.","When Guardian Yunhai heard Qifeng’s division, he frowned, feeling dissatisfied. “Qifeng, I know you two have some old grudges, but you can’t target Brother Xue He over this! Only giving him one-tenth is too much!”","“Then how would you divide it?” Qifeng retorted, aware that Yunhai often played the role of the nice guy, though it was clearly an act.","Xue He, standing silently nearby, watched the two bicker, calculating his own next move.","After a long moment of deliberation, Guardian Yunhai clapped his hands and suggested, “I think it’s better to divide it this way: while it’s true that the two of us contributed the most, we can’t bully Brother Xue He. Let’s keep it simple. Since we’re all brothers, let’s do a 40-40-20 split. If we end up with one billion in materials, you and I take 40 million each, and the remaining 20 million goes to Brother Xue He!”","“No way!” Qifeng immediately rejected this, his tone aggressive as if ready for a fight. He snarled, “Brothers may be close, but business is business. The one who does more gets more. Otherwise, we should all just give up now, and I’ll notify everyone. Let’s have a free-for-all and see who’s stronger! Xue He has a lot of men, right? Let’s see who can take what!”","Yunhai pretended to be in a difficult spot, trying again to persuade Qifeng with honeyed words.","At the same time, he motioned for Xue He to join in on convincing Qifeng.","Seeing through their act, Xue He’s lips curled into a sneer, and he coldly remarked, “Stop pretending. You’ve both been acting like this for years—playing the same old tricks, good cop, bad cop. Isn’t it all just to make me give in?”","His words shattered the facade, leaving Qifeng looking slightly embarrassed. However, Yunhai maintained his usual calm smile. “Brother Xue He, you can’t say it like that. The truth is, the material here isn’t that sturdy, and with the compass already shattered, the two of us could easily disassemble this place with just a bit of Immortal Power. Do you understand what I mean?”","Qifeng secretly cheered for Yunhai. He hadn’t thought of that angle.","Even Xue He hadn’t realized this point. Now that he considered it, it was indeed true.","Even if he went to call for reinforcements, it would take time.","By the time they arrived, the place would likely already be torn apart.","But two-tenths? He couldn’t accept that.","After a moment of silence, Xue He raised three fingers and said, “I want at least 30 million!”","“That’s outrageous!” Qifeng finally snapped, glaring as he shouted, “The most you’ll get is 23 million! Take it or leave it!”","Guardian Yunhai spoke again, “Three thousand is fine, but let me make one thing clear beforehand: after dismantling everything, I’ll give you thirty million Immortal Crystals directly. Whatever you can sell the materials for has nothing to do with you!”","“This...” Xue He, the Old Ancestor, glanced around, unsure about the deal.","He preferred to get thirty percent instead of just thirty million Immortal Crystals. Who knew if there were any special treasures still hidden here?","Qifeng, the Guardian, who had just recovered his composure, also thought that thirty million would be enough, considering it as hush money.","Guardian Yunhai shot Xue He a displeased look and said, “Xue He, if you keep being ungrateful, you’ll have really crossed the line!”","This time, he wasn’t bluffing.","Xue He knew that Guardian Yunhai was capable of anything. If he pushed for more, the other party might not compromise, and he could even end up with nothing, not even the thirty million Immortal Crystals.","For a Nine-Step True Immortal, thirty million was still a substantial gain, and there was no risk involved.","“Deal!” Xue He finally gave in.","There was no need to push further.","Guardian Yunhai flashed his signature smile and said, “Now that’s more like it!”","“Tian Can, you handle calculating the value of the materials. The three of us will get to work!” Guardian Yunhai flicked his wrist and pointed at the stone wall ahead. “Let’s start by breaking down this wall!”","“Alright!”","The three of them summoned their immortal powers, which transformed into massive hammers, and began smashing the wall.","As pieces of materials broke off, Tian Can and Zi Yu Immortal were tasked with collecting them from behind.","Each piece was a priceless, innate material, and as Tian Can picked up each one, he silently repeated a number in his mind.","“Eighty, eighty, eighty!”","Each piece was worth eighty thousand Immortal Crystals.","If they hadn’t been caught and had snuck in here, just a few pieces of these materials would have been worth the trip.","What Tian Can needed wasn’t some great fortune; what he needed was a treasure to boost his Origin Source.","As long as his Origin Source advanced by two steps, reaching the level of a Seven-Step True Immortal, he could go seek a deal with that powerful entity from the other realm.","But he had failed at this critical step.","Despite his regret, it was too late.","All he could do now was drool over these innate materials.","Soon, the entire wall was smashed down. Out of the four walls, one was completely destroyed, and the remaining three would be easier to handle.","Their speed increased significantly.","Xue He glanced at the innate materials that had just been broken off the wall, made a rough estimate, and felt his heart bleed.","The materials from just one wall were worth more than thirty million Immortal Crystals.","The four walls alone were worth over a hundred million Immortal Crystals.","In addition to the four large walls, there were several smaller rooms made of even rarer materials.","Even if they were sold at the usual price, the total haul from this endeavor could easily reach over two hundred million, maybe even three hundred million.","If he had negotiated for twenty percent, he could have received sixty million.","Twice as much.","This time, his cleverness had backfired, and the loss was immense.","But a deal was a deal, and there was nothing he could do. All he could do now was vent his frustration by smashing the walls even harder.","The group worked tirelessly.","Before long, they had demolished all the walls of the palace, leaving only the ordinary rocks surrounding them.","“Haha, just these materials alone are worth over a hundred million. This haul turned out pretty well!” Qifeng, the Guardian, laughed wickedly.","Guardian Yunhai chuckled and said, “This is just the start. We haven’t even counted the floor yet. The structure alone could sell for two billion, and don’t forget those hidden chambers in the small rooms. Their materials are even rarer. I’d say this haul will be worth at least three billion!”"]},{"number":6403,"title":"Chapter 6403: Deep Sea Pearl","paragraphs":["Chapter 6403: Deep Sea Pearl","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","ian Wushuang and Realm King fought with increasing intensity, their momentum building with each clash.","Yet it was Xue He, the Old Ancestor, who suffered the most.","“Stop standing there, get moving. Let’s head to the smaller chamber first, then tear up the ground!” Guardian Qifeng patted Xue He on the shoulder.","With those words, he strode toward the smaller chamber.","Thanks to their prior experience, their pace quickened considerably.","In less than an hour, they had dismantled all the smaller chambers.","Beneath one of the chambers, they discovered an innate spiritual treasure.","It was a small, blue-glowing pearl.","Guardian Qifeng toyed with the pearl in his hand, immediately feeling invigorated.","“This is a treasure for enlightenment. We’ve truly hit the jackpot this time!” Guardian Qifeng laughed heartily.","Guardian Yunhai grabbed the blue pearl, brought it close to his nose for a sniff, and then tested it within his Origin Source. After a moment, he reached a conclusion.","“This is an innate spiritual object, the Deep Sea Pearl. When the ancient domain was first created, there was a deep sea, and the entire ocean drew its power from this very pearl!”","Xue He felt worse than if he had eaten something foul.","The Deep Sea Pearl was a legendary treasure!","Just one of them was worth a fortune.","Throughout the ancient domain, fewer than ten Deep Sea Pearls had ever been found.","Eight were housed in the ancient court.","Another one resided in the sacred lands.","Rumor had it that one more was in the hands of an unknown powerful figure, and its discovery had once caused quite a stir.","They had never imagined there would be one here.","An enlightenment treasure—if sold—could fetch at least tens of billions, if not hundreds of billions.","There was no standard price, so it was impossible to say for sure.","Especially in the ancient court, where practitioners of the Origin Source Path held such treasures in the highest regard.","“We’re rich, truly rich this time!” Guardian Qifeng exclaimed. “Yunhai, we need to take this pearl to the ancient court. Over there, it will fetch a heavenly price!”","But Guardian Yunhai furrowed his brow and rebuked him, “Qifeng, are you crazy? With a treasure this valuable, do you really think we can sell it with our status?”","Those words snapped Guardian Qifeng back to reality.","Both of them were well-known figures in the outside world.","If they tried to sell such a treasure in the ancient court’s domain, it would attract far too much attention. The real challenge would be whether they could even leave the court’s territory alive.","After all, the value of the pearl far exceeded their personal worth.","Even a Dao Lord’s assets barely amounted to more than ten billion.","For people like them, a full set of high-level treasures would be worth around thirty billion at most.","This pearl, however, was likely valued at over a hundred billion, possibly several hundred billion.","“So, what do you suggest we do?” Guardian Qifeng, now feeling stumped, asked.","Guardian Yunhai chuckled and replied, “Of course, we should hand it over to the palace lord. Treasures this precious aren’t something we can keep for ourselves. If we offer it to the palace lord, we’ll gain merit in exchange—perhaps even stronger treasures or the chance for one-on-one guidance from the palace lord himself!”","While the Twin-faced Buddha was known for his ruthlessness, he was also clear about rewarding his subordinates.","Handing over such a valuable treasure to him would undoubtedly earn them a huge amount of merit.","They could then exchange that merit for top-tier treasures, or even an entire set of supreme treasures.","If they preferred to trade individually, they could exchange for pinnacle-level treasures as well.","The Twin-faced Buddha had an abundance of treasures, many of which were simply stored in the Hall of Merit, available for anyone to claim as long as they had accumulated enough merit.","Guardian Qifeng swallowed hard, already imagining himself adorned in a full set of top-tier treasures. With that, his strength would reach a new level, potentially placing him in the top thirty of the entire Mangshan Country.","This was something he had dreamed of.","There was even more to it; in the future, he would ask for assistance in mastering the divine eye inheritance techniques.","Once he had elevated the second divine eye technique to perfection, his strength wouldn’t merely be in the top thirty but the top twenty.","If he could perfect two sequences, he would have the chance to comprehend the full inheritance of the five major sequences at the Sacred Ground.","Who knows? Perhaps, with an epiphany, he could even merge the two sequences.","That would truly set him on the path to ascend.","He could directly surpass the Palace Master and rank among the top fifty in the entire Sacred Ground.","He wasn’t the only one fantasizing; Guardian Yunhai shared the same thoughts.","The two exchanged glances and revealed wicked smiles.","Only Xue He, the old ancestor, wore a sullen expression.","At this moment, he felt like banging his head against the wall.","He no longer cared for thirty percent, nor even twenty percent. He would be satisfied with just ten percent.","Noticing Xue He’s peculiar gaze, Guardian Yunhai coughed lightly and consoled him, “Brother Xue, it seems luck wasn’t on your side this time, but don’t worry too much. I’ll personally give you an extra twenty million immortal crystals. How does that sound?”","“I’ll add another fifty million to round it off!” Guardian Qifeng laughed heartily as he spoke.","The materials here were worth three hundred million. What was the harm in giving them all away?","In reality, even if Xue He had chosen twenty percent, he still wouldn’t have received it in the end.","Because Guardian Yunhai planned to kill him.","Silence him!","While Guardian Qifeng was ruthless, he still had a sense of loyalty and wouldn’t slaughter his own people.","But Guardian Yunhai had far fewer moral constraints.","If he had the strength, he’d probably have killed Guardian Qifeng as well.","“Enough, let’s pack up and leave!” Guardian Yunhai exclaimed excitedly.","At this point, he didn’t even care to take the bricks from the ground.","After Xue He collected materials worth a hundred million, he noticed the two weren’t concerned with the ground materials. His heart warmed slightly; at least he regained something.","“Tian Can, follow me!” Guardian Qifeng ordered.","Tian Can and Fairy Ziyu, who had been in shock, quickly snapped out of it and nodded in agreement.","They had heard of the Deep Sea Pearl before.","Now, they felt even more regretful and frustrated.","How wonderful would it have been if they had entered instead?","If only!","But alas, there was no “if.”","Even if they had gone in, they likely wouldn’t have found anything.","Even if they did, had they let True Lord Xue Yang sell the item, each of them would have had the potential to become a Dao Lord.","No!","They would have certainly become Dao Lords.","But now, it was all gone—everything, even themselves.","Xue He had no intention of leaving, so only the four prepared to head out.","Just then, a voice stopped them.","“Destroy my palace, take my treasures, and you think you can just leave?”","The voice thundered through the air like that of a primordial demon lord.","Guardians Qifeng and Yunhai, who were leading the way, froze in place, their eyes widening in shock as they glanced around, thinking they had misheard.","But soon after, a massive face slowly rose within the vast hall.","That face could not simply be described as ugly; words like menacing or terrifying would be more appropriate.","“What is that?”","Everyone was instantly petrified.","The enormous face was nearly ten feet tall, its skin pitch-black, with sharp spikes protruding from its surface. It had no ears, just one eye, a mouth, and a nose.","Its crimson eye turned slightly, and the aura it emitted was so overwhelming that it knocked everyone to the ground.","It was a pressure that came from the very essence of life itself.","Without using any power, just its sheer presence crushed them.","“This isn’t an ancient demon. Ancient demons shouldn’t be this powerful. Who are you?” Guardian Yunhai, who had seen much in his time, asked in shock.","The massive face didn’t answer; instead, it flashed a cold, sinister smile."]},{"number":6404,"title":"Chapter 6404: Invisible","paragraphs":["Chapter 6404: Invisible","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“With a life level a million times greater, it would be enough to crush a Dao Master. If it were ten million times, even an Emperor Lord might kneel!”","The owner of the face was, of course, not the Ancient Demon.","The Ancient Demon’s maximum strength was five thousand times, and even if he could increase it to ten thousand times, that would already be the limit of the Ancient Domain World.","Moreover, this face was the Origin Source of all special life forms, or rather, all life forms.","“A Realm Beast!”","The face belonged to a Realm Beast.","In this world, or rather, the entire Realm God Continent, only Jian Wushuang could transform into a Realm Beast.","The face belonged to none other than Jian Wushuang in his transformed state.","Seeing everyone trembling in fear, unable to even stand, Jian Wushuang found it rather boring and reverted back to his true form.","The first to be shocked were not the people inside the Ancient Demon’s Palace, but the few individuals inside the Nine Prison Pagoda.","“Jian Wushuang, what exactly are you? In that state just now, why couldn’t I sense any trace of your life?” Immortal Jiu Chen’s eyes were filled with shock.","Just moments before, Jian Wushuang’s life level had suddenly increased, surpassing one hundred thousand times from ten thousand, nearly forcing him to kneel on the spot.","But then, the life aura suddenly disappeared.","Xue Yang, however, felt it was quite normal and mocked Jiu Chen, “Old man, haven’t you experienced nine worlds already? Why don’t you tell us what level Brother Wushuang is at? If Brother Wushuang hadn’t suppressed this place just now, you’d likely be kneeling too!”","Of the three, only he had witnessed Jian Wushuang’s prowess in the past.","Even though it was just a clone, he had the power of a Seven-Star Universe God.","That level of strength was something the natives of this world could never comprehend.","Jiu Chen found himself at a loss for words and, not wanting to engage with Xue Yang, kept silent.","Jiang Ni, on the other hand, grew even more curious about Jian Wushuang’s identity.","Inside the Ancient Demon’s Palace.","Jian Wushuang ignored the few people from the Nine Prison Pagoda and instead looked at Elder Tian Can and Fairy Ziyu.","The most surprised by his appearance was Fairy Ziyu.","At that moment, she opened her mouth to ask a question, but before she could, the oppressive force she felt disappeared, and she let out a long breath.","That oppressive force was far more terrifying than facing a Dao Master.","When facing a Dao Master, she felt as if she were confronting a scorching star, utterly powerless. But in front of Jian Wushuang, it was as if she were facing her natural master, an innate sense of submission.","If Jian Wushuang had ordered her to die just then, she might not have even hesitated.","“Fairy Ziyu, we meet again!” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly.","Fairy Ziyu dared not act prideful and hurriedly bowed, saying, “Earlier, I was ignorant. Please, senior, do not take offense!”","“No need to call me senior, for I am merely an ordinary cultivator in the Mahayana stage, without even possessing the power of immortality. You are all my seniors!” Jian Wushuang waved his hand, releasing everyone from the oppressive force.","Once Elder Tian Can regained his senses, he first looked at Jian Wushuang in terror, then quickly knelt and pleaded, “Senior, please save me. For the sake of our previous cooperation, please take me away from the Twin-Faced God Palace!”","“Naturally,” Jian Wushuang nodded.","The elder had mentioned foreign world experts earlier, and Jian Wushuang just happened to want to learn more about other great worlds.","Taking an undying immortal out was too easy for him.","Upon seeing Jian Wushuang agree, Elder Tian Can kowtowed repeatedly, expressing his endless gratitude.","Little did he know, he was about to enter another cycle of reincarnation, and it might not be better than following the Twin-Faced Buddha.","Jian Wushuang dismissed the first two people, then turned his gaze to Guardian Yunhai, asking, “Aren’t there any words from the two of you?”","“Huh?” Guardian Yunhai was the first to lower his head, replying respectfully, “If Senior has any questions, please ask. I will cooperate fully!”","Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “Good. Let’s start with the battle between the foreign expert and your Dual-Faced Lord.”","Guardian Yunhai certainly hadn’t expected him to ask about that, but after a moment of thought, he realized it made sense. Jian Wushuang had infiltrated the Dual-Faced Divine Mansion under a false identity, likely to investigate this matter.","Now, facing Jian Wushuang, a powerhouse even more intimidating than their Lord, Guardian Yunhai had no intention of hiding anything and immediately spilled all the details.","It turned out that three hundred years ago, the Dual-Faced Buddha had clashed with a mysterious cultivator in the chaotic void and returned gravely injured.","Upon his return, most believed it was Yang Dingtian who had done it, so no one dared to reveal the truth. Only a select few knew that the real reason behind the battle was a foreign expert.","As for the reason they fought, only Guardian Yunhai knew the truth because he had been present at the time.","The scenes from that day still made him tremble whenever he recalled them. The foreign expert had been piloting a cosmic flying vessel, an artifact surpassing the value of most supreme treasures, classified among the ranks of Universe Treasures.","Such a vessel could move at speeds a thousand times faster than ordinary emperors, especially when traversing chaos, where its speed could increase to ten thousand times faster, depending on the fuel used.","If the energy source was divine power from an emperor, the speed could rival that of a Tribulation realm expert. If the fuel was immortal power, then it could only match the peak strength of an emperor.","However, the vessel’s defensive capabilities were equally overwhelming, comparable to the might of a Universe Treasure. Its value was also on par with those rare treasures, and naturally, its owner’s strength was extraordinary.","Yet, the expert within the cosmic flying vessel had sustained grievous injuries—his divine body had been destroyed, leaving only a physical body and a damaged consciousness.","The Dual-Faced Buddha, hoping to seize an opportunity, launched an attack. But he had underestimated the cosmic vessel, and its passive defense alone severely wounded him.","Still, he could sense that the energy within the vessel was nearly depleted. He attempted to follow the vessel from behind, hoping to strike once its energy ran out.","But the vessel kept drifting toward the Ancient Realm, and fearing discovery by the emperors within, the Buddha launched a deliberate attack, forcing the vessel to change course and head deeper into the chaos.","Once again, the Buddha was severely injured by the vessel’s defense, to the point where surviving in the chaotic void became impossible. He had no choice but to retreat with Guardian Yunhai and his men to the Dual-Faced Divine Mansion.","Upon returning to their base, the Buddha immediately began recovering his strength, sparing no effort or cost until he regained eighty percent of his power. Then, he ventured back into the void in search of the vessel, but he never found it again.","For decades, he searched tirelessly. For reasons unknown, he eventually withdrew and gave up.","Even Guardian Yunhai did not know why.","“That’s it?” Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow.","Guardian Yunhai quickly nodded, saying, “Senior, I swear it’s all true. After the Lord failed to find it, he secluded himself in the mansion and hasn’t emerged in the last three hundred years.”","“Tian Can, it’s your turn now!”","Seeing that Guardian Yunhai truly knew nothing more, Jian Wushuang turned the questioning to the old man, Tian Can.","This man had claimed to know the foreign expert’s hiding place, but after listening to Guardian Yunhai’s story, even he realized that things might not be so simple.","Three hundred years had passed, and the Dual-Faced Buddha hadn’t left the mansion, nor had he ventured into the void again to search for the cosmic flying vessel."]},{"number":6405,"title":"Chapter 6405: Battle Begins!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6405: Battle Begins!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","There was certainly a problem among them.","Now, it all depended on what Tian Can had to say. If the otherworldly expert he had met was the same one seen by the Twin-faced Buddha, he might still have a chance to take advantage of the situation.","The treasures in the Ancient Domain held some value for Immortal Jiu Chen, Xue Yang, and Jiang Ni, but they were of little use to him.","What he needed right now was an epiphany.","To seek a new path for his Origin Source, he required a moment of enlightenment.","But the Ancient Domain was too small; it offered neither the opportunity nor the chance for such an epiphany.","This universe was vast, and he needed to explore it step by step, constantly moving forward.","It was like being in the Crimson Eyes Realm.","He had to head toward the center.","He would glance at the practitioners in each place, and observe the wonders of the universe.","Or perhaps he would encounter some special treasures.","Like the Nine Prison Pagoda or the Gray Jar, treasures that were of great use to him.","This time in the Ancient Domain, he had certainly harvested a top-tier fortune, but unfortunately, it was only an auxiliary treasure for enlightenment.","For True Immortals and Emperors, it had some value, but for him, even if he crushed it into powder and made tea with it, it wouldn’t do much good.","So, he casually threw it to Jiang Ni and Immortal Jiu Chen, as the two of them needed it more.","As for the other treasures that were useful for the body and Origin Source, naturally, he kept those for himself.","Although he hadn’t yet developed a new Origin Source, both the Sword Dao Origin and the Ultimate Dao Origin still needed maintenance.","These were his current sources of strength. Aside from his physical body, he only had these two major Origins to rely on.","But the help they provided was minimal.","Now, all that remained was to see how Tian Can would explain things.","Tian Can was always someone who swayed with the wind. Hearing the question, he quickly replied, “In response to the senior, the otherworldly expert I encountered is indeed in the chaotic void, but... I didn’t see any flying boat!”","The moment Tian Can said this, Jian Wushuang understood.","The treasure had most likely already fallen into the hands of the Twin-faced Buddha. That guy was just being cautious and hadn’t told anyone.","But there was one thing Jian Wushuang couldn’t quite figure out—why would Guardian Yunhai, who wasn’t particularly loyal, spill everything the moment he opened his mouth, and yet the Twin-faced Buddha kept him around?","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s curious gaze, Guardian Yunhai understood and immediately explained, “I’m actually the brother-in-law of the palace lord, so he spared me. But everyone else... they’re all dead!”","Jian Wushuang finally nodded in satisfaction.","After asking the questions he wanted, it was time to take action.","Just as he was about to let Guardian Yunhai and the others lead the way, a sudden, strong fluctuation came from the distance.","Everyone present could feel this fluctuation.","“Not good, it’s Yang Dingtian coming!”","Guardian Yunhai and Guardian Qifeng were very familiar with that strong aura.","Xue He, the Old Ancestor, was slightly surprised and said, “That’s strange. Although Yang Dingtian tends to be protective, he’s never been this reckless.”","“Let’s stop worrying about it. We’ll find out if we go over together, won’t we?” Jian Wushuang spread his hands, and a light gate appeared. Then, he turned to Ziyu Immortal and said, “Fellow Daoist Ziyu, I hope you won’t mind bearing with us for a bit.”","Ziyu Immortal was flattered and quickly responded, “You honor me, Senior!”","Swish!","Her figure flashed and entered the light gate.","On the other side, naturally, was the Nine Prison Pagoda.","Old Man Tian Can opened his mouth, wanting to say something. He too wished he could enter.","But since he had already played all his cards, he no longer had the qualifications.","However, that wasn’t entirely true.","Jian Wushuang simply felt that Ziyu Immortal had once saved him, a cultivator in the Great Ascension Stage, and it was appropriate to give her some benefits, such as access to the Deep Sea Pearl.","As for Old Man Tian Can, he had always been a fickle opportunist with insufficient strength. Now that he had revealed all he knew, he was of no further use.","Still, there was no need to kill him. Jian Wushuang erased his memories related to the otherworldly expert and threw him into the Ancient Demon Palace.","On the ground, materials worth billions of immortal crystals remained, so it wasn’t as if Tian Can had been mistreated.","With his memories scrambled, Old Man Tian Can gazed at the departing figures of Jian Wushuang and his companions, calling out, “Thank you, Senior! Safe travels, Senior!”","Once everyone had left, Old Man Tian Can immediately began digging for the materials on the ground. Without the formation controlling them, they were practically free for the taking.","However, one thing still puzzled him: why had Jian Wushuang given him such a great opportunity?","Moreover, why had he been left behind alone?","In this trip to the Ancient Demon Palace, the survivors had all made significant gains.","Of course, that excluded the powerful figures from the Double-Faced Divine Mansion.","Jian Wushuang’s group had lost a few people, but there were only three survivors. Old Man Tian Can had collected special materials worth billions of immortal crystals, and now he just needed to follow the same path back out.","Getting out was simple now.","Yang Dingtian had led his people to attack Double-Faced Mountain.","All the Immortal experts had been deployed to Double-Faced Mountain.","The only ones left were in the Great Ascension Stage. Even if there were some weaker Immortals, they were no match for Old Man Tian Can’s return path.","Ziyu Immortal, on the other hand, didn’t need to worry at all, as her treatment was the same as that of the other three, including Immortal Jiu Chen.","It was worth noting that Immortal Jiu Chen was only involved because of the Lord of Divine Fire. Jian Wushuang wanted to rely on him to find the Lord of Divine Fire after his recovery. Xiang Yang was included due to their shared journey, but Jiang Ni was treated differently. Jian Wushuang regarded him as a personal disciple.","Particularly in swordsmanship, Jiang Ni had made remarkable progress over the past century, all due to Jian Wushuang’s personal guidance.","Jian Wushuang had imparted everything he knew about the sword, hoping Jiang Ni could grasp the Origin Source of the Ultimate Sword Dao.","Unfortunately, this could not be forced; it depended on Jiang Ni’s own fate.","The only flaw Jian Wushuang saw in her now was her lack of ruthlessness.","The Sword Dao demanded a strong sense of ruthlessness. Without it, how could one comprehend the Origin Source of the Ultimate Sword Dao?","Inside the Nine Prison Pagoda.","Ziyu Immortal, who had suddenly appeared, felt a little uneasy. Although everyone here was at the peak of the Great Ascension Stage, she recalled that Jian Wushuang was also at the peak of the Great Ascension Stage and humbly addressed herself as a junior.","The attitudes of the three others were unclear.","Xiang Yang, who had accompanied Jian Wushuang since the beginning when they were weak, understood Jian Wushuang’s grateful nature and treated her with respect, showing the most courtesy.","Immortal Jiu Chen was different, having only begun interacting with Jian Wushuang after his ascension. He even suspected that Jian Wushuang had ulterior motives toward Ziyu Immortal.","Jiang Ni felt something similar.","She couldn’t help but feel a sense of loss in her heart.","“Could it be that Senior Wushuang no longer intends to pursue my mother?”","She had never met her biological father, so the concept of “father” was vague to her.","Ever since she followed Jian Wushuang, whether in cultivation or in facing problems, he had always been like a towering mountain of strength.","In her heart, her father should be like him, unrelated to bloodline.","Thus, she wished for Jian Wushuang to become her father, with the prerequisite that he would pursue her mother.","That way, she and Jian Wushuang would share the same goal.","No!","Now, they did share the same goal, which was to find her mother.","But now, she felt that Senior Wushuang seemed to be getting closer to Ziyu Immortal, and her heart harbored jealousy for her mother’s sake. She kept a cold face while inwardly wondering whether Jian Wushuang had a preference for women like Ziyu Immortal.","After all, her mother was the same type.","Swish!","A thought from Jian Wushuang entered the Nine Prison Pagoda, finally interrupting Jiang Ni’s train of thought."]},{"number":6406,"title":"Chapter 6406: Big Misunderstanding","paragraphs":["Chapter 6406: Big Misunderstanding","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Seeing Jiang Ni standing obediently to the side, Jian Wushuang inwardly shook his head.","A practitioner of the Sword Dao should not be obedient but sharp and fierce.","Originally, Jiang Ni was a sharp little girl, but ever since she started following him, her edge seemed to have dulled.","This might have been related to the long period of seclusion, which was why Jian Wushuang had decided to take her and the others out for some experience this time.","However, he had no idea what Jiang Ni truly thought of him. If he did, he would probably feel so embarrassed that he’d want to dig a hole and hide in it.","“Daoist Ziyu, how are you adjusting?” Jian Wushuang began with a friendly greeting.","This only made Jiang Ni more convinced that he had feelings for Fairy Ziyu, and she felt uncomfortable about it. She immediately interjected, “Senior Wushuang, you haven’t introduced this lady yet. How should we address her?”","“Huh?” Jian Wushuang’s mouth fell open in surprise. “Haven’t you all been watching the whole time?”","It suddenly dawned on him—Jiang Ni was jealous.","But he couldn’t quite figure it out. Jealous of whom?","Could it be that she was jealous of him?","That wouldn’t do! If so, their hierarchy would be thrown into disarray.","If Hui Qing knew about this, she would chop him to pieces.","Right now, he was atoning for his mistakes, not adding more sins!","Thinking of this, he adopted a stricter tone and reprimanded, “Jiang Ni, how dare you speak to your elders like this?”","After speaking, he turned his gaze toward Fairy Ziyu.","Her expression wasn’t great, but after seeing Jian Wushuang’s serious attitude, she seemed to feel less embarrassed and softly said, “Senior Wushuang, it’s just a title. There’s no need to be so harsh on the younger ones!”","“Hmph, you’re only a few years older than me!” Jiang Ni retorted defiantly.","Jian Wushuang slapped his forehead, feeling a headache coming on.","Not wanting to stay in this awkward situation any longer, he quickly got to the point.","“Are we heading out for some training?”","Xue Yang, Immortal Jiu Chen, and Jiang Ni’s eyes lit up.","Jian Wushuang calmly replied, “Yes, we’ll be within the boundaries of the Twin Gods’ Mansion. The strongest being I’ve detected within a billion miles is a six-step True Immortal. His background is unusual, and it’s likely that his real combat power is on par with a seven-step True Immortal. He will be your greatest threat.”","“Don’t worry, my thought power is strong. If we encounter him, I’ll just grab you all and run!” Xue Yang patted his chest confidently.","Jiu Chen and Jiang Ni had been here for over a hundred years, frequently sparring with each other. They all knew that Xue Yang was the strongest.","Both Jiu Chen and Jiang Ni were far weaker by comparison.","Even though Xue Yang had yet to grasp the Origin Source Dao, he already had the combat strength of a six-step True Immortal.","But Jiang Ni and Jiu Chen were only at the level of three-step True Immortals.","There was no helping it. Xue Yang’s experience far surpassed both Jiu Chen and Jiang Ni.","However, Jiu Chen and Xue Yang both relied heavily on experience. After all, one was a true spirit created by a Universe Master, and the other was the reincarnation of a Universe Master.","Jiang Ni, on the other hand, relied purely on talent.","At the Great Perfection stage, she already possessed the combat strength of a three-step True Immortal, which was quite impressive.","Her talent was truly extraordinary.","After all, the gap between the Great Perfection stage and the True Immortal stage was vast.","Jian Wushuang remained calm, his gaze steady. “What you’re lacking is an Origin Source.”","The true leap forward would only come once they mastered the Origin Source.","So, these three needed to put in more effort—they couldn’t just sit around in the Nine Prison Pagoda, waiting to be fed.","To push them, Jian Wushuang had laid out a series of requirements.","“This time, your training isn’t for fun!” he declared.","“First, Jiang Ni and Immortal Jiu Chen must kill at least one Three-Step True Immortal. That’s the minimum. You are not allowed to target those at the Grand Ascension stage, and you can’t touch the weak. Only True Immortals—kill as many as you can. Afterward, you can exchange the number of True Immortals you’ve slain for treasures from me. From now on, you’ll only be able to obtain treasures through your own abilities.”","“Second, Xiang Yang, you must eliminate the Six-Step True Immortal. If you fail, forget about using the Deep Sea Pearl!”","“Third, I’m giving you only three days!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and concluded, “That’s it for now.”","“Wait!” Xiang Yang interrupted him. “Wushuang, give me a couple of handy supreme treasures first. I don’t feel confident without proper weapons!”","Jian Wushuang glanced at Xiang Yang’s childlike expression and teased, “I already gave you one. The Six-Step True Immortal you’re targeting has a set of supreme treasures—go claim them yourself!”","With that, Jian Wushuang’s figure vanished from the Nine Prison Pagoda.","Before the three could even react, they were teleported thousands of miles away.","*Whoosh!!!*","The three of them fell straight into a mist-covered swamp.","Their adventure was about to begin.","Although they didn’t have supreme treasures, they did possess immortal weapons.","Jian Wushuang, like a worried father, had fretted over them.","Each of them had a set of top-tier immortal weapons, nearly as valuable as ordinary supreme treasures.","If they couldn’t complete the tasks he had set for them with those, they were fit only to blend into the ancient world.","And they could forget about joining him in exploring other realms or even other universes.","Returning to reality, Jian Wushuang was now traveling with Guardian Yunhai and Old Ancestor Xue He, heading toward the Twin-Faced God Mountain.","None of the three had volunteered to go, but the Twin-Faced Buddha had already commanded them to rush to the formation outside Twin-Faced God Mountain and teleport there.","This was because Yang Dingtian had already surrounded the entire mountain with a massive force and was actively dismantling the formation.","Deafening sonic booms echoed as the formation was torn apart.","The trio, with Jian Wushuang in tow, soon found the hidden teleportation array that would take them to Twin-Faced God Mountain.","For now, entering the mountain directly was impossible, as it was entirely surrounded by Yang Dingtian’s forces.","“We’ve been discovered!” Old Ancestor Xue He shouted, alarmed. Even without his warning, Jian Wushuang had already sensed it.","Two Dao Lords were sweeping the area with thought power, and they had found the group.","Jian Wushuang hadn’t bothered to block the thought power. He simply felt these people weren’t capable of stopping him.","“Damn it, it’s that old hag Yinhua! She’s joined Yang Dingtian’s side?”","“Not just her,” said Guardian Yunhai, his face darkening. “The people on Twin-Faced God Mountain just sent me a message—City Lord Tian Tan is here too. This time, Yang Dingtian came fully prepared.”","Guardian Yunhai’s expression turned grave. “Could Yang Dingtian have rallied everyone to the Ancient Court? Why else would so many be helping him against our lord?”","Though the three seemed unconcerned with Jian Wushuang, their words were meant for his ears.","Standing behind them, Jian Wushuang said calmly, “Just focus on entering the teleportation array. I’ll deal with those two.”","“Then we’ll leave it to you, Senior!” Guardian Qifeng bowed with a slight smile.","Both Guardian Yunhai and Old Ancestor Xue He had their own thoughts swirling in their minds.","Earlier, Jian Wushuang had promised them significant rewards in exchange for leading him into Twin-Faced God Mountain. He had also assured them of their safety afterward and promised to escort them out of the Sea-Covering Ancient Domain.","They couldn’t help but think about how Jian Wushuang had treated Elder Tian Can earlier. They were tempted.","But they also feared that Jian Wushuang might betray them after using them.","The treasures involved were too important.","At that moment, the three were weighing whether to sell Jian Wushuang out.","However, with Yang Dingtian now leading such a large force to besiege Twin-Faced God Mountain, offending Jian Wushuang would mean they’d be caught between two enemies—both Jian Wushuang and their own lord."]},{"number":6407,"title":"Chapter 6407: One Breath for Ten Thousand Miles","paragraphs":["Chapter 6407: One Breath for Ten Thousand Miles","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","They definitely couldn’t hold on, and by then, they would also be finished.","At the moment, they could only place their trust in Jian Wushuang.","However, Jian Wushuang himself felt a bit uncertain. He wasn’t sure what realm the powerful outsider with the Universe Boat belonged to.","It was impossible for him to be a Universe Master, but judging by the intensity that Guardian Yunhai had described, he might not even be an Emperor Lord!","After all, Emperor Lords weren’t usually that strong.","It was possible that he was a peak expert, or perhaps someone at the Tribulation Realm who had not yet fully grasped the universe.","His wealth was immeasurable.","He might even be able to directly help the Twin-faced Buddha achieve harmony with the Dao.","Three hundred years should be enough to reach that harmony.","Even if the Twin-faced Buddha hadn’t fully harmonized by now, he had likely absorbed quite a few benefits, and his trump cards were surely abundant.","Unfortunately, the Twin-faced Sacred Mountain was protected by an Emperor Lord-level array, so Jian Wushuang’s Thought power couldn’t penetrate directly. He could only sense that the Twin-faced Buddha was inside the mountain, and his aura was anything but ordinary, with barely the battle strength of a first-grade Origin Source Dao Lord.","But once he burned his immortal power, that could change.","If he obtained a large number of treasures, he could even condense his divine body in advance.","If he could condense both his physical and divine bodies, and if his divine power exceeded ten thousand, then he would be able to sweep across all the Dao Lords in the Ancient World.","Jian Wushuang’s current battle strength was hard to define, and killing his opponent wasn’t a problem, but he worried about unexpected developments.","If he acted, he would have to be certain of victory.","Otherwise, it might be better to sit back and watch the show, letting Yang Dingtian test what trump cards the Twin-faced Buddha had, and he could reap the rewards afterward.","There would be no need for him to personally take action—how convenient would that be?","“You three go in first!” he waved, signaling the three to step into the teleportation array.","Xue He, the old ancestor, blinked and glanced at the two beside him. He knew these two wouldn’t dare betray Jian Wushuang, so he wisely kept silent, not daring to say much more.","He stood there, in the center of the array, watching Jian Wushuang perform.","As soon as the two Dao Lords noticed their movements, they immediately called for reinforcements and charged toward them.","Leading them was Silver Flower Granny, whose battle strength ranked in the top twenty of the Covering Sea Ancient World.","She was the first to make a move, and three thousand silver threads instantly surrounded them.","From a distance of two thousand miles, she launched her attack without hesitation, her strength indeed formidable.","Jian Wushuang merely stood still, and as the silver threads approached, he took a deep breath.","His entire body swelled up.","“Beast God’s Roar!”","“Roar!”","A roar from ancient times echoed out, causing the entire Twin-faced Divine Mansion to tremble.","Jian Wushuang surged forward with an unstoppable force, instantly overwhelming Silver Flower Grandmother and the Dao Lord beside her.","“That was satisfying!”","He wasn’t trying to intimidate anyone; he just wanted to shout it out. If he did so without a reason, others might think something was wrong with him. But now, he seized the opportunity.","He shouted to release himself—just a single breath of exhilaration!","However, for the three people facing Xue He, it was a shocking experience. In one breath, Jian Wushuang had crushed two Dao Lords, one of whom was Silver Flower Grandmother, whose strength ranked within the top twenty. His power was immense, so much so that they didn’t even dare to breathe heavily in his presence.","Jian Wushuang swiftly moved into the teleportation array and frowned. “What are you standing around for? Start the teleportation!”","“Yes, yes, I’ll begin immediately!” Xue He, flustered, quickly channeled his immortal power to activate the teleportation array.","*Buzz!*","The array activated, and a shimmering multi-colored halo flickered, accompanied by a heavy sense of oppression. In the next moment, as they reopened their eyes, they found themselves at the Twin-Faced Divine Mountain.","“Senior, you’ll have to bear with following behind us for now,” one of them said.","Jian Wushuang didn’t mind and didn’t respond. After entering the Twin-Faced Divine Mountain, the three led him directly toward the Twin-Faced Divine Hall, which was where the Twin-Faced Buddha often meditated.","At that moment, tens of thousands of True Immortals were present on the mountain, and more kept arriving via teleportation. Since two of the Guardians had come together, it naturally attracted attention, and many came over to greet them. After all, within the Twin-Faced Divine Palace, the four Guardians were second only to the Twin-Faced Buddha.","However, Dao Lords weren’t limited to just the four Guardians. Jian Wushuang could sense more than twenty Dao Lords, and many more were deep within the mountain. This must be the Twin-Faced Buddha’s elite forces.","Given Jian Wushuang’s assumptions, the Twin-Faced Buddha had acquired many treasures, and it was clear that he had cultivated some subordinates. Without them, he wouldn’t be able to hold onto those treasures securely.","If he didn’t run away, it was likely because he feared arousing suspicion. Thus, he had stayed at the Twin-Faced Divine Palace, claiming to be in seclusion, while he was secretly absorbing the treasures of a powerful being from another realm.","Now that they had entered the mountain, Jian Wushuang compared the aura of Yang Dingtian with that of the Twin-Faced Buddha. It became evident that the gap between the two was vast.","It wasn’t that the Twin-Faced Buddha was overly powerful; rather, he was extremely weak. Compared to Yang Dingtian, the difference was laughable. Outside the mountain, Jian Wushuang had sensed that Yang Dingtian’s strength was equivalent to a top-tier Origin Source Dao Lord. There were rumors that Yang Dingtian had only mastered the first sequence of the God Eye technique, and while he had perfected it, he hadn’t progressed to the second technique. Thus, when he burned his immortal power, his strength could rival that of a peak Origin Source Dao cultivator.","But now, after sensing the Twin-Faced Buddha’s aura, Jian Wushuang realized he had been deceived. The Twin-Faced Buddha’s aura was supported by some sort of treasure. Even with it, his strength didn’t surpass that of a top-tier Origin Source Dao cultivator, and even if he burned his immortal power, he’d only match the power of a top-tier cultivator.","“This guy is probably pulling a golden cicada shedding its shell trick,” Jian Wushuang thought, furrowing his brow.","If that were the case, then Yang Dingtian might succeed in his revenge, while Jian Wushuang would gain nothing. He needed to calm his racing heart.","Luckily, he hadn’t charged straight into the Twin-Faced Divine Mountain. If he had killed the Twin-Faced Buddha, he might not have obtained the treasures of the foreign realm’s powerful being.","“Sure enough, this guy has more than one trick up his sleeve!”","Jian Wushuang’s thought power enveloped the entire Twin-Faced Divine Mountain, carefully scanning everything. Once he had a clear picture of the situation, he could come up with a plan. By this time, the three had brought him to the entrance of the Twin-Faced Divine Hall.","Two Dao Lords stood guard outside, which was quite an impressive display. From the expressions on the faces of the two Guardians, it was clear that these Dao Lords were unfamiliar faces.","Even the two Guardians didn’t know who they were.","Although somewhat surprised, the Guardians didn’t say much and prepared to lead Jian Wushuang inside the Divine Hall.","Unexpectedly, one of the guarding Dao Lords blocked them.","“The two Guardians and Xue He may enter, but no one else!” the guard said coldly, leaving no room for negotiation.","Guardian Yunhai’s face immediately darkened. He shouted angrily, “Audacious! Don’t you know who I am?”","The guard smirked slightly and replied, “It doesn’t matter who you are. This is an order from the Palace Master!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t push further, knowing it would raise suspicion.","“You go ahead. I’ll wait outside,” he sent a mental message to the three.","He didn’t mention that he had already attached his thought power to the three of them. His aura shielded everything, making it impossible for the Twin-Faced Buddha to detect it.","Even though there was a top-tier formation outside the hall, it couldn’t sense his presence.","Guardian Yunhai breathed a sigh of relief after hearing Jian Wushuang’s message. He had been worried that Jian Wushuang might act rashly inside the hall, so it was a relief that he chose to stay outside."]},{"number":6408,"title":"Chapter 6408: Decision","paragraphs":["Chapter 6408: Decision","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, he still put on a face of consideration for his reputation, snorted coldly at the two guards, and walked into the hall.","Jian Wushuang, on the other hand, waited outside the hall.","There were quite a few people like him.","These were the attendants of powerful True Immortals and Dao Lords.","But none of them were weak.","Jian Wushuang, to avoid suspicion, deliberately disguised himself as an Immortal, though his level was only around a Five-step True Immortal.","Compared to the attendants of Seven-step or even Eight-step True Immortals nearby, he was far inferior.","Those people had their own small circles and were discussing matters of the outside world.","One sharp-eyed Eight-step True Immortal, having just seen Jian Wushuang with Guardian Yunhai, approached and said, “Fellow Daoist, you seem unfamiliar!”","“It’s my first time following Guardian Yunhai into the Divine Mountain,” Jian Wushuang replied with composure.","From that alone, people immediately felt that his background was not simple, and a few proactively came forward to strike up a conversation.","They were all trying to probe for information about Yang Dingtian’s siege on the Two-faced Divine Mountain.","After all, since it was their side being besieged, everyone was a bit anxious.","They feared the great formation might not hold against Yang Dingtian.","That concern was valid, as the formation could indeed be breached.","Yang Dingtian, by burning his Immortal power, could break the great formation outside the mountain. But there was another formation outside the temple at the mountain’s peak, which was much more difficult to break.","Until now, Yang Dingtian had not attacked the formation. Instead, he was sweeping through the outskirts, intercepting any True Immortals from gathering within the Two-faced Divine Palace.","“It seems Yang Dingtian is serious this time, intending to take everything in one go!” Jian Wushuang chuckled inwardly.","He hadn’t expected this guy to be so protective.","For the sake of his brother, he actually came to kill, intending to wipe out the entire Two-faced Divine Palace in one fell swoop.","He was a ruthless man.","Just as Jian Wushuang was judging Yang Dingtian, the Two-faced Buddha inside the temple also began to show his ruthlessness.","Inside the hall, all the Dao Lords and Nine-step True Immortals had gathered.","There were at least a hundred of them.","Among them, more than twenty were Dao Lords, and over seventy were Nine-step True Immortals.","This was twice as powerful as the publicly known strength of the Two-faced Divine Palace.","In the outside world, it was believed that the Two-faced Divine Palace had no more than ten Dao Lords.","There were no more than thirty Nine-Step True Immortals.","Yet at this moment, so many powerful figures had gathered here.","The additional strong figures stood on one side, while the old faction stood on the other.","The old faction kept staring at the newly arrived group of powerhouses, their hearts filled with mixed emotions.","Sitting at the head, the Dual-Faced Buddha appeared calm, though his earlier words had been anything but.","This battle must be fought!","And clearly stated—it was a fight to the death.","Either drive away Yang Dingtian, or everyone would perish together.","Those were the only two choices they had.","Although the current Dual-Faced Divine Palace was powerful, twice as strong as before, outside there were sixty or so Dao Lords gathered.","Among them were some exceptionally powerful Dao Lords, like Granny Yinhua and the Lord of Tiantan City.","Even Yang Dingtian’s companion was among the top twenty in combat power.","If it came to a fight to the death, they wouldn’t be able to win.","Being able to rely on their great formation to defend the mountain would already be an achievement.","The Dual-Faced Buddha kept his joyful face turned toward everyone, so he remained composed, speaking gently, “I know all of you are a little scared, thinking we don’t have much hope, and maybe it would be better to charge out together!”","When he finished speaking, no one dared to raise their head.","Don’t be fooled by the joyful expression of the Dual-Faced Buddha; it was because he was showing his joyful face.","He was called the Dual-Faced Buddha because he had two faces.","Normally, he would show his joyful face to people, but during battle, his ferocious face would appear.","It was a face that struck terror in anyone who saw it.","It was known as the Face of Slaughter.","In the Buddhist path, the two faces were joy and sorrow.","However, the Dual-Faced Buddha felt no sorrow. He only knew joy and slaughter.","Or rather, slaughter brought him joy.","The two faces complemented each other.","Slaughter brought him joy, and his joyful face aided him in comprehending the Dao.","The secret technique of Dual-Faced Buddhism had been refined, creating a supreme powerhouse.","Facing his joyful side, no one dared to contradict him, let alone face his slaughtering side.","The Dual-Faced Buddha didn’t look at the expressions of the crowd and continued, “The reason I advocate staying is not to send you to your deaths, but because I have a plan!”","Upon hearing that the Dual-Faced Buddha had a plan, the old faction showed excitement.","“We knew all along that the Palace Lord must have a backup plan, otherwise why would he have gathered so many Immortal beings?” Guardian Yunhai didn’t miss the chance to flatter him.","After all, he still had his brother-in-law status.","The Dual-Faced Buddha ignored him and casually took out a mustard seed and tossed it to Guardian Qifeng.","“Within this mustard seed are ten Boundless Five Immortal Arrays. Five Nine-Step True Immortals and five hundred True Immortals above the Seven-Step are needed to operate them. The core is powered by divine power, and your own immortal power can be burned to amplify the formation. Even without burning your immortal power, just using the divine power within will be enough to rival a Dao Lord like the Lord of Tiantan!”","These words left everyone astonished!","This kind of formation was unheard of.","If what the Dual-Faced Buddha said was true, its value would be immense.","Five Nine-Step True Immortals and five hundred Seven-Step True Immortals—if there weren’t enough Seven-Step True Immortals, they could substitute Eight-Step True Immortals, with one Eight-Step True Immortal equal to ten Seven-Step True Immortals. By this calculation, fifty-five individuals could operate the formation.","With the Boundless Five Immortal Array, they could rival even the top twenty Dao Lords of the Ancient Sea Domain.","No!","Not just rival, but match and even suppress!","Hidden in the shadows, Jian Wushuang’s thought power overheard this and he was delighted.","It was now undeniable that the other side had acquired treasures from that foreign powerhouse.","This could be considered a gain!","Although there had been many guesses before, the only observable evidence had been the Dual-Faced Buddha’s fluctuating strength.","Now, upon closer inspection, not only was his strength fluctuating, but even his life force seemed weak.","“Something’s wrong!” Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows.","Just as doubts arose in his heart, another uproar erupted within the hall.","“Another formation!”","The Dual-Faced Buddha took out yet another formation.","“The Emperor’s Annihilation Array!”","Holding up the array, the Dual-Faced Buddha explained patiently, “This formation is even more miraculous, designed for Dao Lords to resist an Emperor!”","The gathered Dao Lords gasped in shock.","Yet, the Dao Lords with unfamiliar faces all remained indifferent.","Or rather, they appeared somewhat numb.","Others couldn’t tell, but Jian Wushuang could sense that these people’s souls were flawed.","Flawed souls would either become dull or fall into a slumber.","These people, however, had formidable auras, suggesting they were likely being controlled.","In simple terms, they were enslaved.","And the only person in the hall capable of enslaving so many Dao Lords and Nine-Step True Immortals was the Dual-Faced Buddha.","At this moment, the Dual-Faced Buddha spoke again, “Zhuyin, this Emperor’s Annihilation Array will be yours to wield. You will be responsible for dealing with Yang Dingtian!”","“Yes!”","From the unfamiliar faces, a beautiful yet eerie woman stepped forward without hesitation. She immediately refined the array with skilled hands.","This formation required nine Dao Lords to assist in its operation."]},{"number":6409,"title":"Chapter 6409: Array Formation","paragraphs":["Chapter 6409: Array Formation","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The nine individuals selected by Zhuyin were all unfamiliar Dao Lords.","Not a single one from the newly established Imperial Lords was chosen.","The same went for the Five Immortals Formation.","The nine-step True Immortals in the primary positions were all unfamiliar faces, while those assisting were a mix of old and powerful figures.","Xue He, the Old Ancestor, had initially thought he could claim a spot in one of the Five Immortals Formations. To his surprise, even his elder brother, Chu Xiong, was left out, leaving them both to watch helplessly.","The old faction members, who weren’t assigned to any formation, started to panic.","One by one, they looked expectantly at the Two-Faced Buddha, hoping he might produce more formations.","“With these eleven great formations, along with everyone’s combined skills, I believe we can defend Twin-Faced Mountain!” The Two-Faced Buddha gazed at the crowd.","Those commanding the eleven formations shouted with enthusiasm, their confidence sky-high.","The Dao Lords and True Immortals who weren’t chosen for the formations felt dissatisfied but had no choice but to accept it begrudgingly.","It was disheartening. Even the universally acknowledged Ten Great True Immortals and the Four Guardians weren’t assigned a single formation.","Suddenly, a group of unfamiliar powerful figures had reaped all the benefits.","Sensing the discontent of his old subordinates, the Two-Faced Buddha gestured to Guardian Qifeng, signaling him to announce: “The Palace Lord still has a puppet, which requires four Dao Lords and ten True Immortals. So, Brother Chu and several of Xue He’s old friends will stay behind, while the rest may disperse!”","These words were like a balm to the concerns of the old faction.","After all, some of the old True Immortals were included in the formations.","Now that the Four Guardians and Ten Great True Immortals were all tasked with controlling the puppet, they no longer feared that the newcomers would abandon them in battle.","They grudgingly accepted their roles.","The eleven formations were the first to gather outside the hall.","Jian Wushuang’s true body blended into the crowd.","With a shift in his aura, he transformed from a Five-Step True Immortal into a Seven-Step Peak True Immortal.","One of the operators of the Five Immortals Formation, noticing Jian Wushuang’s impressive strength, selected him to join the formation.","Initially, Jian Wushuang had intended to watch the fight between both sides from the sidelines.","However, he realized that the Two-Faced Buddha might have left behind just a clone while secretly enslaving many powerful figures, alongside the current formations.","He feared that when the time came, Yang Dingtian and the others wouldn’t be able to hold the line and would be forced into retreat, which would spell disaster.","Thus, he decided to lend them a hand.","The Five Immortals Formation was indeed formidable, certainly not something that could have been created by the Ancient Domain World.","It required five Nine-Step True Immortals and five hundred Seven-Step True Immortals to operate together.","However, the power they were controlling was led by a Nine-Step True Immortal called “Daoist Shangya.”","He had already been enslaved, but the other four Nine-Step True Immortals by his side were all from the old faction.","After all, there were only thirty or so new True Immortals, not enough to ensure that every formation could be made up entirely of the new group.","Jian Wushuang saw an opportunity here. When the moment was right, he could eliminate Daoist Shangya and seize control of the formation, turning it against their enemies.","It wasn’t that he needed to rely on the formation’s power, but rather, he borrowed the formation’s authority.","He couldn’t let the Two-Faced Buddha grow suspicious.","This way, the opponent wouldn’t flee right away.","His true form followed the formation down the mountain, ready to strike at any moment.","At the same time, the Thought power attached to Guardian Yunhai and others scouted the first-hand situation inside the temple.","The puppet the Two-Faced Buddha summoned wasn’t particularly strong.","It was far inferior to the Five Immortal Formation and the Emperor Destruction Formation in terms of mystery, but it still possessed considerable strength.","“A Universe Crystal?”","Jian Wushuang’s heart stirred as his Thought power easily detected a black Universe Crystal embedded in the puppet’s core.","It was a Universe Crystal of the Destruction Origin Source.","This puppet wasn’t impressive, but its power was undeniably violent.","With ten True Immortals assisting and four Guardians leading the charge, their combined might was overwhelming, comparable to the Emperor Destruction Formation in a life-and-death battle.","“Yunhai, you will command the God-Destruction Soldiers and head down the mountain to assemble all our forces. Prepare for battle!”","Guardian Yunhai was excited at this moment and shouted, “Yes!”","Buzz!","The God-Destruction Soldiers took a single step forward and arrived at the foot of the mountain.","There, towering ancient trees formed a dense forest.","Over ten thousand people lay in ambush, awaiting the signal to attack.","Guardian Yunhai, commanding the God-Destruction Soldiers, stood imposingly in the center of the crowd.","Beside him was the Emperor Destruction Formation.","The formation had condensed into a humanoid shape, though it didn’t resemble a person, but rather a humanoid war beast.","“A Qisha God!”","The formation had transformed into the likeness of a divine beast, albeit humanoid in form.","The Five Immortal Formation, on the other hand, took the form of a humanoid face, with its only distinguishing feature from ordinary cultivators being its size, magnified a hundredfold.","Beyond them stood a group of Dao Lords and Nine-Step True Immortals.","They had no formations and were in the most unfortunate position at this moment.","There was no other choice but to rely on these powerful formations to withstand the onslaught.","As the Two-Faced Buddha gave the order, Guardian Yunhai, controlling the God-Destruction Soldiers, roared furiously and directed the puppet to press a single hand against the ground.","Buzz!","A massive totem instantly appeared.","It was the Space Beast God!","With his vast knowledge, Jian Wushuang recognized it at once.","It was the shadow of the Gold Beast God.","For there to be Beast Gods in this universe was quite normal.","“It seems that this foreign powerhouse’s identity isn’t simple at all—Universe Flying Boat, Beast God Totem!”","None of these were treasures that an ordinary Emperor or even a peak-level powerhouse could obtain.","As the totem rose, the ten thousand True Immortals were instantly teleported away.","In the sky above.","The True Immortals who had been on alert suddenly noticed an unknown beast-shaped totem appear above their heads. Before they had time to react, they saw an army of immortals descending from the sky.","“Damn! How did we land in the enemy’s stronghold?!”","Guardian Yunhai’s quick reflexes allowed him to control the God-Destruction Soldiers to land steadily in Yang Dingtian’s temporary base. He immediately activated the Destruction power within the Universe Crystal and began a massacre.","In an instant, the massive palace halls were shattered into pieces.","These halls, which had been prepared for the crusade against the Two-Faced Buddha, were reduced to ruins in the blink of an eye.","Yang Dingtian, the top powerhouse, was the first to strike. He soared into the air and punched the God-Destruction Soldiers out of his faction’s formation.","But no sooner had one been knocked out than another took its place.","And this time, it was the even more powerful Emperor Destruction Formation.","“Yang Dingtian, how dare you invade the Two-Faced God Palace! Today, I will make sure you stay!”","A prehistoric beast, condensed from the Emperor Destruction Formation, charged directly at him.","Yang Dingtian didn’t dare be careless. His Origin Source Dao burst forth, and the two sides engaged in close combat.","The battle was fierce, shaking the heavens and the earth.","Yang Dingtian’s side couldn’t determine the victor for the moment, but the situation wasn’t looking good for the others.","This time, the battle to exterminate the Two-Faced Buddha had been organized by several top-tier Dao Lords on Yang Dingtian’s side.","Even the ten great Five Immortal Formations could only hold back most of the top Dao Lords, while the remaining ones had to be dealt with by the God-Destruction Soldiers and the older Dao Lords from the Two-Faced God Palace.","Fortunately, with the God-Destruction Soldiers as a powerful weapon, they managed to hold off three top Dao Lords on their own.","Among them were Silver Flower Granny and the Lord of Sky Altar City, as well as a black-robed elder, whose strength wasn’t ordinary and ranked within the top twenty.","The battle between the two sides erupted in an instant, and some had already fallen in the blink of an eye.","Due to the surprise attack, the Five Immortal Formation had slaughtered the most True Immortals. In just an instant, hundreds of True Immortals had fallen from the sky, plummeting to their deaths.","The brutality of this battle was unprecedented in the Ancient Sea Territory."]},{"number":6410,"title":"Chapter 6410: Battle","paragraphs":["Chapter 6410: Battle","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","No one expected the Twin-faced Buddha to unleash such an array of strange formations, catching them off guard. Fortunately, their own strength was formidable, and they quickly stabilized the situation.","“Brother Xue Yang, leave that puppet to me. You focus on dealing with that strange beast!” A white-clad figure, sword in hand, charged forward.","With a single strike, they blocked the God-Slaying War Soldier.","Grandmother Yinhua’s face lit up with joy. “Lord Rainhua, you arrived just in time!”","The white-clad woman was none other than Rainhua Tianjun, who harbored admiration for Yang Dingtian. Her combat power ranked in the top ten of the Ancient Ocean Domain.","She was a top-tier Dao Lord, on par with a first-grade Origin Source Dao Lord. If she ignited her immortal power, she could fight toe-to-toe with a first-grade Origin Source Dao Lord.","“Grandmother Yinhua, you and Tiantan go assist the others. I can handle things here!” Rainhua Tianjun held her sword with one hand, her brow brimming with sword energy, and a powerful aura surged around her.","The atmosphere was filled with sharp sword energy. Rainhua Tianjun was a master of the Origin Source of Sword Dao, specifically the second-grade Origin Source Sword Dao, having mastered the three sword paths of Rainwater Sword.","Her killing intent was terrifying.","Sensing the aura around them drop, Grandmother Yinhua didn’t waste time. She immediately led her people away to assist the others.","After all, the combat strength of the three of them could handle a Five Immortals Formation alone, and engaging the God-Slaying War Soldier here was indeed a bit of a loss.","As they left, the God-Slaying War Soldier didn’t attempt to stop them but instead turned its attention to Rainhua Tianjun.","“Tsk tsk, if this had been before, we might have feared you. But now, with the God-Slaying War Soldier, you, Rainhua, are not necessarily our match!” The one who spoke was Guardian Yunhai.","He seemed particularly excited at this moment because Jian Wushuang had given him a promise—that he would not perish.","No matter who won or lost, he would not die.","With that assurance, he controlled the God-Slaying War Soldier and prepared for battle, not caring about victory or defeat, but for the sheer thrill of combat!","Buzz!","Both sides instantly increased their power.","However, Rainhua Tianjun ignited her immortal power.","The God-Slaying War Soldier, on the other hand, was fueled by the destructive divine power of Universe Crystals.","The disparity in strength was immediately evident.","Before Rainhua Tianjun could fully unleash her power, the God-Slaying War Soldier abruptly attacked.","“Soul-Snatching Gorge!”","The God-Slaying War Soldier roared, its voice mingling with the cries of dozens, as it charged violently toward Rainhua Tianjun.","Dressed in white, as pure as snow, Rainhua Tianjun was somewhat surprised by the divine power within the God-Slaying War Soldier, but she wasn’t yet fearful. She raised her sword, ready to deflect the attack.","However, as she swung her sword, the force of destruction was already upon her.","The destruction didn’t just threaten her strength and body—it caused her soul and Origin Source to tremble.","This was the gap between immortal power and divine power.","Bang!","In just a brief exchange, Rainhua Tianjun had already suffered a silent loss.","Nevertheless, the two sides still seemed evenly matched in battle.","At the same time, Yang Dingtian also entered a true life-and-death struggle.","Having refrained from using his God Eye Secret Technique earlier, Yang Dingtian now began to employ it, igniting his immortal power as he fought fiercely against the Imperial Annihilation Formation.","After using the Secret Art of Divine Eye, Yang Dingtian seemed like a completely different person. His battle strength had risen directly to a level that surpassed the Emperor Annihilation Formation.","He was utterly suppressing the Emperor Annihilation Formation in combat.","It seemed like it wouldn’t take more than a few rounds for him to completely break through the formation.","Jian Wushuang, who was hidden within one of the Five Immortal Formations, noticed this and restrained his desire to turn against them.","If Yang Dingtian could solve the problem himself, that would be ideal.","That way, he wouldn’t need to intervene.","At the moment, besides Yang Dingtian, the situation on both sides wasn’t very clear.","The ten Five Immortal Formations had completely locked down the enemy’s top-tier combat forces.","The remaining Dao Lords, even the veteran Dao Lords of the Dual-faced God Palace, were evenly matched, clearly not the decisive factor in the battle.","At this point, it all depended on whether the God Annihilation War Weapon or Yang Dingtian would defeat their opponent first.","If the God Annihilation War Weapon managed to kill Yu Hua Tianjun or break through the formation, it could go and help the Emperor Annihilation Formation encircle Yang Dingtian.","At that point, the final outcome would be uncertain.","If that happened, Jian Wushuang would certainly have to take action.","That would be the best way to pressure the Dual-faced Buddha.","As the battle continued for a quarter of an hour, the Emperor Annihilation Formation was the first to falter.","It was on the verge of collapse.","This was the perfect opportunity, and Yang Dingtian didn’t hold back at all. He unleashed one powerful move after another, causing the Emperor Annihilation Formation to teeter on the brink of destruction.","Although Yu Hua Tianjun wasn’t having an easy time either, he had at least managed to withstand the attacks by burning his immortal power, and it seemed he could hold on for the duration of an incense stick.","There was ample time for Yang Dingtian, but he didn’t dare to be complacent.","Though he was constantly engaging with the Emperor Annihilation Formation, he was also keeping an eye on Yu Hua Tianjun’s situation.","For years, the two of them had been inseparable. Though they hadn’t publicly expressed their feelings, everyone understood that the two would eventually be together.","Their strength was close, and their personalities were similar.","They were a match made in heaven!","In the future, their story would surely be a legendary tale in the Ancient Domain of Overturned Seas.","Yang Dingtian’s obsession was to merge with the Dao and become an Emperor.","Yu Hua Tianjun’s obsession was Yang Dingtian.","Both were waiting.","Waiting for the day when they could succeed, and both would be fulfilled.","Now that Yang Dingtian had lost his only family, he didn’t want to see his beloved fall as well.","“Ah!”","Yang Dingtian roared, and the aura around him surged once again. His immortal power churned violently.","He increased his battle strength once more and charged at the Emperor Annihilation Formation.","This time, he intended to end it in a single strike.","“Blazing Sun!”","“Rise!”","Buzz!","A blazing sun appeared in his hands. As he clasped his hands together, the immense power made the sky around him boil.","“It’s over!”","Yang Dingtian raised the blazing sun high and hurled it toward the Emperor Annihilation Formation.","This was his strongest move at the moment.","It was enough to guarantee the annihilation of the Emperor Annihilation Formation.","Facing the scorching fireball, the Dao Lords within the Emperor Annihilation Formation showed no signs of panic.","While they remained calm, everyone else was anxious.","No one was foolish enough to believe that if the Emperor Annihilation Formation were destroyed, they wouldn’t soon be picked off by Yang Dingtian, one by one.","For a moment, all eyes were on the blazing fireball.","Jian Wushuang, too, was watching. From his perspective, this strike would definitely crush the Emperor Annihilation Formation.","But if the enemy had a hidden card, things could change.","The Dual-faced Buddha had acquired the treasure of a mysterious expert from another world. Such powerful treasures and trump cards couldn’t possibly be limited to these formations.","There had to be something more.","Otherwise, perhaps they were planning to abandon this mountain gate entirely!","Could they be using the “golden cicada shedding its shell” technique, faking death to escape?","If that were the case, Jian Wushuang would need to intervene, helping the Dual-faced Buddha block Yang Dingtian before finding a way to control him.","Such a turn of events would waste far too much time.","It wasn’t a scenario Jian Wushuang wanted to see.","In his heart, he silently rooted for the Emperor Annihilation Formation.","“It’s time to show your trump card, isn’t it?”","Everyone was waiting.","Waiting to see whether the Emperor Annihilation Formation would survive after the sun exploded.","The scorching sun fell from the sky, directly striking the Emperor Annihilation Formation.","Boom!","A deafening sound echoed, causing the entire Dual-faced God Mountain to tremble.","The scorching flames of the blazing sun consumed everything in their path."]},{"number":6411,"title":"Chapter 6411: Yang Dingtian’s Trump Card","paragraphs":["Chapter 6411: Yang Dingtian’s Trump Card","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Imperial Annihilation Formation...","Still stood within the sea of fire.","At this moment, the strongmen on the side of the Dual-faced Buddha’s faction breathed a sigh of relief.","Jian Wushuang also relaxed.","What he needed now was balance.","And then, he would apply pressure to both sides.","He didn’t expect much from Yang Dingtian’s side, but from the Dual-faced Buddha’s side, they would need to bring out a bit more.","Only then could he judge the Dual-faced Buddha’s resolve.","He was also waiting for a flaw from his opponent. He wanted to see whether the body on the Twin-faced Mountain was the true form of the Dual-faced Buddha.","If he couldn’t probe it, he wouldn’t act rashly to stir things up.","Within the Imperial Annihilation Formation.","The Nine Great Dao Masters simultaneously closed their eyes.","A terrifying aura rose from their bodies.","The others couldn’t tell, but Jian Wushuang could see that the core of the Imperial Annihilation Formation had been replaced.","It had been replaced by the same power as the Extinguishing God War Weapon.","That was divine power.","Inside, there was a Universe Crystal, holding the power of the universe.","It wasn’t the pure divine power from a divine body.","There was a difference.","The divine power from a divine body came from an Emperor. Even a heaven-defying Dao Master could grasp it.","Then there was the divine power of a Universe Master, which came from the Origin Source of the universe.","The power of the Origin Source and divine power condensed together, far surpassing ordinary divine power in strength.","Simply put, divine power was divided into ordinary, universe-level, space-time-level, and Starry Sky-level.","Jian Wushuang had already passed through this, even mastering the power of disorder.","That was a power beyond the Starry Sky.","However, this power consumed too much energy and wasn’t suitable for him to use in his prime.","Usually, he still used universe-level divine power.","Most Universe Gods did the same, as using universe-level divine power was simpler and easier to control.","Unless using a space-time level secret technique—like Jian Wushuang’s Eternal Ancient Transformation, a Starry Sky-level secret technique—it required the power of the Starry Sky.","Even the power of Chaos was at play.","Of course, this was on the Realm God Continent. In the Starry Sky, most powerful beings still used the power of the Starry Sky.","This also depended on the location.","And it was also related to their realm.","If a Time-Space God didn’t use the power of time and space, but instead used the divine power of a Universe God, that would be truly amusing.","Just like now, the Imperial Annihilation Formation, which had the combat strength of a Dao Lord, abandoned the simplest power of immortality and instead used the divine power of the universe.","This power was far more violent than ordinary divine power.","The God-Slaying Battle Weapon had been fighting for so long, only using a small amount of power, yet it had forced Yu Hua Heavenly Lord into a purely defensive position.","The main issue was that the God-Slaying Battle Weapon hadn’t been fully controlled. They hadn’t even studied the puppet’s secret techniques, let alone used them. By merely using the divine power within the puppet, they had already unleashed such a powerful force.","According to Jian Wushuang’s estimation, fully controlling the God-Slaying Battle Weapon would require at least one Emperor, who could manipulate divine power freely, and an enormous number of Dao Lords—likely at least a thousand.","Only then could the God-Slaying Battle Weapon’s maximum combat strength be unleashed, reaching a power of at least fifty thousand units of divine power.","Jian Wushuang had deduced this based on the cosmic crystals inside the weapon.","He didn’t typically craft puppets, but back in Qishen Temple, the Xuanwu Hall specialized in puppet crafting, preparing for future uprisings. Unfortunately, they never had the chance to enter battle.","Those puppets were also intricately designed, with power levels comparable to the God-Slaying Battle Weapon.","This level of craftsmanship could only be achieved by Universe Master-level factions producing in mass quantities.","Its value far surpassed the Imperial Annihilation Formation.","At this moment, the Imperial Annihilation Formation had begun burning divine power. The violent force seemed to threaten the structure of the formation itself. Clearly, using divine power was straining the formation.","However, as long as it could defeat Yang Dingtian, it was a small price to pay. As long as the formation didn’t collapse entirely, it was sufficient.","“So, this is your trump card?” Jian Wushuang felt a bit disappointed.","It wasn’t anything new, after all. He could even see that when Yang Dingtian sensed the divine power, a mysterious force had surged within him.","It was also divine power.","The upcoming battle would be more interesting.","The Imperial Annihilation Formation was reborn, now empowered by divine power, and its combat strength had instantly surpassed Yang Dingtian’s.","The battle situation flipped in an instant.","Yang Dingtian was forced out of the battlefield by the Imperial Annihilation Formation, and the two sides clashed fiercely in a distant marsh. Yang Dingtian’s immortal power was like a child’s toy in front of divine power, leaving him utterly defenseless.","On the main battlefield, the God-Slaying Battle Weapon was about to finish off Yu Hua Heavenly Lord, and the situation looked extremely favorable.","In that moment, the coalition forces lost their will to fight.","After all, they weren’t a single force but had banded together to take down the Twin-faced Buddha and reap personal benefits.","Of course, there were many hidden motives that remained unknown.","Now, with the tide turning against them, many began to waver.","With their leader Yang Dingtian being overwhelmed, and Yu Hua Heavenly Lord on the verge of defeat, the God-Slaying Battle Weapon paired with the Five Immortals Formation would soon sweep them away.","The situation had taken a drastic turn for the worse. At this point, they either had to hope Yang Dingtian could make a desperate counterattack and lead them in retreat, or Jian Wushuang had to take action himself.","However, the thought power Jian Wushuang had left in the temple still hadn’t fully investigated whether the Twin-faced Buddha present was the true body or merely a clone.","For the moment, the pressure fell on him.","“This won’t do. There’s no time to hesitate. If I don’t act now and Yu Hua Heavenly Lord dies, the coalition will almost certainly collapse!” Jian Wushuang contemplated whether to make his move now.","If he acted, he wouldn’t use an overwhelming amount of power, but it would be enough to make his opponent lose to him.","His goal was to be the straw that broke the camel’s back, ensuring the Twin-faced Buddha wouldn’t flee.","Who knew what tricks the Twin-faced Buddha had up his sleeve? If this was merely a clone confusing the crowd, then Jian Wushuang would suffer a huge loss.","At his current strength, it wasn’t an issue for him to defeat all of these people. But capturing them alive and soul-searching each one would be a difficult task.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have gone through so much trouble to wait.","The issue was that he hadn’t mastered the Origin Source yet.","He only had access to his previous Origin Source and hadn’t used any treasures to enhance it. His combat power primarily came from his physical body.","This kind of power was too crude, and many of his secret techniques couldn’t be used.","Pure physical strength was useful for hand-to-hand combat, but using various secret techniques was far more difficult.","“What to do?”","“Wait or not?”","Jian Wushuang hesitated.","This was an excellent opportunity.","If he could obtain a cosmic boat, he could explore various worlds, and perhaps even break through and master a new Origin Source.","Although he could travel without a boat, it would be much slower, and the journey would be fraught with dangers.","A cosmic boat was crucial for him.","If he had returned to his peak strength, he wouldn’t even care about such a treasure. But now, at his current realm, obtaining a cosmic boat would allow him to soar to new heights.","Without it, he would waste a long time wandering the Ancient Domain.","While he was still hesitating, Yu Hua Heavenly Lord, who had been locked in battle with the God-Slaying Battle Weapon, was completely defeated. His immortal power had burned halfway, but he ultimately fell.","Using the last of his strength, he summoned a blood shield.","Jian Wushuang had assumed he was trying to flee, but to his surprise, Yu Hua Heavenly Lord chose to use his final ounce of strength to charge at the Imperial Annihilation Formation.","It was a streak of blood-red flying sword."]},{"number":6412,"title":"Chapter 6412: Golden Sun Fruit","paragraphs":["Chapter 6412: Golden Sun Fruit","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang’s sword pierced through the fabric of space, heading directly for the Imperial Annihilation Formation.","Thud!","The blood-colored flying sword sliced through the Imperial Annihilation Formation, halting right in front of Yang Dingtian. The sword’s shape dissolved into a mist, revealing the last appearance of Rain Empress Tianjun.","Then, it shattered.","Before it broke apart, her crimson lips slightly parted as if she were about to say something. But when she opened her mouth, no sound emerged.","Staring at the fading blood-colored figure and the enraged Imperial Annihilation Formation after the sneak attack, Yang Dingtian felt a sharp pain surge through his head. The unbearable feeling ripped through his entire body, and the anger he had been suppressing for so long finally erupted.","“No!”","His heart-wrenching roar shook the heavens, draining the world of its colors.","His younger brother had died in the Twin-Faced Deity Palace, and he had come seeking vengeance. His beloved had risked everything, gathering everyone to destroy Twin-Faced God Mountain.","But within just an hour of the battle, Rain Empress Tianjun had fallen before his very eyes.","Regret and unwillingness welled up in his heart, swirling into a tempest of emotions. Yang Dingtian’s gaze changed.","The transformation happened in an instant, but it had been building up for a long time.","It wasn’t just his gaze that shifted—his power did too.","A golden fruit inside him shattered, and the energy from the fruit surged through his body.","Yang Dingtian ripped off his hair tie, letting his long hair flow wildly. Wiping away the blood from the corner of his mouth, he caught a strand of blood-red silk floating down from the sky.","He held the blood-colored silk carefully, tying it around his forehead.","At that moment, the aura surrounding him surged uncontrollably.","The immense power shocked everyone present.","Even the long-slumbering Twin-Faced Buddha in the temple opened his eyes.","“Golden Sun Fruit!”","Twin-Faced Buddha’s expression froze, a sense of shock rising within him. “He actually has the Golden Sun Fruit. It seems he’s had some fortuitous encounters, but this could be trouble for me!”","He let out a soft sigh, raising a hand to point. Three silver puppets appeared before him.","The moment these three puppets emerged, they seemed to possess consciousness.","“Greetings, Master!”","The three silver puppets resembled the God-Slaying Battle Soldiers but were far more powerful.","Moreover, within these puppets was a broken, lingering soul.","They weren’t like ordinary puppets created by forging. Instead, they seemed more like some sort of sacrificial monsters, half-human, half-puppet.","“I didn’t intend to use the three of you, but that troublesome fellow outside must be dealt with. Capture him quickly. Do not engage in prolonged battle, and do not drain his power!”","The three silver puppets lowered their heads in unison. “Understood!”","With that, they transformed into streaks of light, shooting out of the cave.","Jian Wushuang’s thought power, lingering in this place, caught a glimpse of a shocking secret in Twin-Faced Buddha’s eyes.","“Interesting!”","Outside, the sudden outburst from Yang Dingtian managed to salvage the gloomy atmosphere caused by the fall of Yuhua Tianjun. The horn of counterattack blew at that moment. Leading the charge, Yang Dingtian tore through the Imperial Annihilation Formation with one hand, heading straight for the God-Slaying Battle Puppet.","Guardian Yunhai felt a sinking feeling in his heart, nearly shouting for help. With a single hand, Yang Dingtian shredded the already wounded Imperial Annihilation Formation. His terrifying strength could easily destroy the God-Slaying Battle Puppet in just two moves. Although total destruction might be impossible, shattering the cultivators inside was a simple task.","“Run!” Yang Dingtian roared, “Let’s see where you’ll escape to!”","The God-Slaying Battle Puppet charged toward the Twin-Faced Divine Mountain, completely ignoring Yang Dingtian’s threats. Inside the puppet, Guardian Yunhai was on the verge of panic.","“Yunhai, what are you doing?” A young man with blue hair, one of the Four Great Guardians, asked disdainfully. “Even if we can’t win, you don’t have to flee like this! Aren’t you afraid of the Palace Master’s punishment?”","Guardian Yunhai paid him no mind, just like Guardian Qifeng. They had Jian Wushuang’s protection and had no intention of staying at Twin-Faced Divine Mountain any longer. Who cared about the future consequences now? Escaping from danger was the only sensible move.","After all, it was Jian Wushuang who came up with the terrible idea of killing Yuhua Tianjun. Naturally, it was time to run now. Jian Wushuang had instructed Guardian Yunhai to kill Yuhua Tianjun to provoke Yang Dingtian. Otherwise, Yang Dingtian would have continued to hide, leaving Jian Wushuang in a passive position. Now that all the cards were on the table, Jian Wushuang emerged as the biggest winner. He had uncovered the secret of the Twin-Faced Buddha.","There was no need to rush now. Soon, Jian Wushuang would help Yang Dingtian level the Twin-Faced Divine Mountain and directly confront the Twin-Faced Buddha. By then, a little pressure could be applied, and Jian Wushuang wasn’t worried about the Buddha escaping anymore. If the Twin-Faced Buddha could have fled, he would have done so long ago. Now, with the Buddha still defending the mountain and continuously using trump cards to resist Yang Dingtian, it was clear there was no escape.","However, the Twin-Faced Buddha still had quite a few tricks up his sleeve. In Jian Wushuang’s eyes, this Buddha was no longer just an ordinary Dao Lord. Everything depended on the next moves.","The God-Slaying Battle Puppet was fleeing, and Yang Dingtian was in pursuit. At that moment, three beams of light joined the battlefield. Upon seeing the reinforcements, the God-Slaying Battle Puppet breathed a sigh of relief. Initially, it had sought help from Jian Wushuang, but Jian Wushuang had said that the Twin-Faced Buddha had more cards to play. Guardian Yunhai was almost driven mad, thinking Jian Wushuang was deceiving him, but unexpectedly, backup had truly arrived.","Three silver puppets appeared. Their appearance was similar to the God-Slaying Battle Puppet, likely from the same series. However, their power levels differed. The God-Slaying Battle Puppet was entirely black and incredibly durable. In terms of materials and strength, the silver puppets were far less powerful. After all, the God-Slaying Battle Puppet had been forged through a life-sacrificing ritual, making its power incomparable. However, the God-Slaying Battle Puppet had not even utilized one percent of its true strength, which was why it was performing so poorly now.","Seeing the God-Slaying Battle Puppet being chased down by a Dao Lord, the faces of the three silver puppets turned dark. “How could the Lord entrust the God-Slaying Battle Puppet to such a useless individual?” one of them grumbled.","“I don’t know!” replied another. “This is an insult to the God-Slaying Battle Puppet. Its power should be enough to kill the Grandmaster of the God-Eye Clan!”","Though they complained, the three silver puppets still intercepted Yang Dingtian. Faced with the sudden appearance of the silver puppets, Yang Dingtian showed no hesitation. Anyone who stood in his way had to be defeated—or killed.","“Get out of my way!” Yang Dingtian roared, clenching his fist and punching, but the blow was effortlessly caught by the three silver puppets.","“His divine power has reached around five thousand. Impressive,” one of the silver puppets calmly remarked. Each of the silver puppets possessed at least ten thousand units of divine power at their peak. However, after years without replenishing their power, their strength had dropped significantly, and they were now only half as strong. Still, capturing Yang Dingtian was no difficult task.","The defense of the silver puppets was comparable to that of a supreme treasure. They needed no additional weapons or techniques, relying solely on their innate divine power to battle. Now, the three silver puppets surrounded Yang Dingtian, and although his divine power was terrifying, Yang Dingtian, with his unsteady mental state, was struggling against them."]},{"number":6413,"title":"Chapter 6413: One of Our Own","paragraphs":["Chapter 6413: One of Our Own","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Without the threat of the God-destroying War Soldiers, they initially planned to assist others, but Jian Wushuang stopped them, telling them to stand back and watch from afar.","Jian Wushuang was about to make his move.","On the main battlefield, the ten Great Immortal Formations clashed fiercely with the ten top Dao Lords, with neither side able to gain the upper hand.","An hour passed, and neither side suffered any injuries.","This was quite absurd.","There was no helping it—those Dao Lords were not burning their Immortal Power; they were merely defending.","If they encountered weaker opponents, they would defend without engaging, unwilling to waste their Immortal Power.","Most of them were just here to reap the benefits; none were willing to burn their Immortal Power and risk their lives.","Once Immortal Power started burning, it could become addictive. If more than half of it was consumed, it could easily damage the foundation of their Origin Source, and achieving harmony in the future would be out of the question.","Even though they followed the God Eye path and weren’t afraid of burning it, they still took great care to protect their Origin Source.","After all, this was the only path to becoming an Emperor.","Even the weakest of Emperors was still an Emperor!","Although the Emperors of the Holy Land were powerful, after so many years, there were only four Emperors in total.","Their power was immense, but the chances of successfully achieving harmony were ridiculously low.","More and more Dao Lords were unwilling to pursue such a perilous path to its bitter end.","The downfall of the Holy Land’s Daoist tradition was near, though it wouldn’t be completely eradicated.","Even if it didn’t become mainstream, it would remain a unique path.","A path comparable to the Ultimate Way.","Moreover, compared to the Ultimate Way, the God Eye secret technique was quite decent.","It wasn’t as difficult as the Ultimate Way, yet its combat strength was nearly equivalent.","Its only drawback was that the upper limit wasn’t as high as the Ultimate Way.","The mindset of these Dao Lords reflected the reality of the entire Ancient Domain.","At this moment, they were all attacking Twin-Faced God Mountain together, showing no regard for the face of the Holy Land. This spoke volumes.","Even the City Lord of Tiantan, who also hailed from the Holy Land, was the same.","One could imagine that the Holy Land was already unstable internally.","For a faction to grow, it required a strong core.","What use was the strength of the top powerhouses if they didn’t belong to oneself?","Currently, the core strength of the Holy Land was still the Dao Lords, while in the Ancient Court, the Emperors were no longer considered top combat power. The top combat power was the Lord of the Ancient Court, while the other Emperors had become part of the core strength.","Who wouldn’t want to become an Emperor?","This siege of Twin-Faced God Mountain was a clear attitude—there was even a chance some were using this as an opportunity to defect.","The reason they were willing to take this risk was precisely because of that.","It was, after all, Rain-Transcending Heavenly Lord’s idea, but now that he had fallen, many sighed, and their will to fight had waned.","Despite Yang Dingtian’s immense strength.","Just when the Dao Lords in the allied forces began to falter in their resolve, a powerful surge of energy suddenly reinvigorated them, providing a huge boost to their morale.","Suddenly, a figure within the Five Immortal Formation changed its appearance, transforming from an old man into a young face.","His body also shifted. From using talisman techniques, he instantly switched to a decisive sword formation.","“Kill!”","With just that single word, killing intent swept across the entire battlefield.","But this was the Five Immortal Formation, a force from Shuangmian Divine Mountain, so why did it excite the coalition army?","It was because this formation suddenly drew out a divine sword eight hundred zhang long and instantly shattered another nearby Five Immortal Formation.","One sword obliterated a formation comparable to a top-tier Daoist Lord.","“This... this is one of us!”","Someone among the coalition army shouted, and the others quickly realized.","With one less Five Immortal Formation, the tide of battle shifted rapidly. The powerful figures of Shuangmian Divine Mountain began to fall one after another.","The top-tier Daoist Lord who had been dealing with the Five Immortal Formation manipulated by Jian Wushuang now began assisting other Daoist Lords.","Jian Wushuang did the same. Although his first sword strike had been mighty, he then maintained his power at a relatively normal level, comparable to a Rain-True Immortal but stronger than an ordinary Five Immortal Formation.","The True Immortals inside the formations were now utterly confused, rendered useless.","Jian Wushuang had successfully turned these forces to his side, though they themselves probably didn’t even know what had just happened.","Jian Wushuang had no intention of explaining. He teamed up with a Daoist Lord from the coalition army to help another Daoist Lord fight the Five Immortal Formation.","With each Five Immortal Formation that broke, hundreds of True Immortals were slaughtered.","What had once been an evenly matched battle shifted to a one-sided massacre in the span of just a few breaths.","On Yang Dingtian’s side, they hadn’t even noticed this change, while the three silver puppets remained indifferent.","The two sides continued to fight fiercely.","Originally, Shuangmian Buddha had intended for a quick victory, but the longer the battle dragged on, the harder it became.","From initially suppressing Yang Dingtian, the battle had now evened out in just a few breaths.","In other words, in those few breaths, Yang Dingtian’s divine power had increased significantly.","“His divine power has surpassed six thousand!”","One of the silver puppets exclaimed in shock after being pushed back by Yang Dingtian.","They couldn’t stop him anymore.","Sensing that something was wrong, the Destroyer War Weapon began retreating.","At the same time, Guardian Yunhai, who was controlling the Destroyer War Weapon, noticed the Five Immortal Sword Formation, which had turned against them and was now slaughtering everything in its path.","“This is definitely Jian Wushuang’s doing. What is he up to?”","At this point, Guardian Qifeng, Guardian Yunhai, and Xue He Ancestor were all at a loss.","Jian Wushuang was helping both sides, like a disruptive force in the battle.","They simply couldn’t figure out what Jian Wushuang’s intentions were.","If he was targeting the otherworldly invaders, he should have gone after Shuangmian Buddha!","But instead, Jian Wushuang had drawn them into killing Rain-True Lord, causing Yang Dingtian to erupt in power.","Then, after Yang Dingtian’s outburst, Jian Wushuang used a Five Immortal Formation to begin crushing Shuangmian Divine Mountain’s experts.","Others might not understand, but those three certainly couldn’t make sense of it.","“Stop overthinking it. We’re in this together now. We just killed Yang Dingtian’s lover and betrayed the Palace Master. If we don’t follow Jian Wushuang wholeheartedly, there’s no way we’ll survive in this world!” Guardian Qifeng, the most perceptive of the three, remarked.","He knew they had no choice but to follow this path, at least Jian Wushuang wasn’t as ruthless as Shuangmian Buddha. They still had a chance of survival.","“Do you think if we switch sides now, Yang Dingtian will spare us?”","“Ask Jian Wushuang!”","“Good idea!”","Guardian Yunhai sent a mental transmission to Jian Wushuang, asking what their next step should be.","Jian Wushuang, who was fighting alongside the coalition army’s Daoist Lords with great satisfaction, responded to Yunhai’s question directly: “Return to Shuangmian Divine Mountain. Shuangmian Buddha is nothing but a paper tiger now. Don’t worry, just wait for Yang Dingtian to break through!”","“Got it!”","Receiving the confirmation, Guardian Yunhai immediately controlled the Destroyer War Weapon to retreat.","Shuangmian Buddha, who had been watching the battle all this time, furrowed his brow slightly.","He wasn’t surprised by Yunhai’s actions, not because he understood Guardian Yunhai, but because the Destroyer War Weapon wasn’t useful at this point.","If Yang Dingtian somehow got his hands on it, the consequences would be disastrous.","After all, the Destroyer War Weapon didn’t require a master. Its internal structure was complex, yet its operation was simple.","If Yang Dingtian controlled it on his own, he could probably rival an Emperor.","Currently, Yang Dingtian’s combat strength was far below the level of an Emperor, not even matching the weakest of them."]},{"number":6414,"title":"Chapter 6414: I Haven’t Gone in Yet?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6414: I Haven’t Gone in Yet?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Top-tier Dao Lords, like the Four Great Guardians, were stronger than ordinary Dao Lords by a notch.","Then there were the supreme Dao Lords, such as Grandmother Yinhua, who could rank in the top twenty within the Ancient Region of Overturning Seas.","Above them were the pinnacle Dao Lords.","In the entire Ancient Region of Overturning Seas, there were only three.","One of them was Heavenly Lord Yuhua, whose combat power barely reached the level of a pinnacle Dao Lord.","The other two were the Two-faced Buddha and Yang Dingtian.","Both of them were pinnacle Dao Lords.","At this moment, Yang Dingtian had already reached the level of an extreme Dao Lord, and with continuous growth, he was approaching the consummate Dao Lord level.","Beyond the consummate level was the defying Dao Lord, a being capable of fighting an Emperor.","Such Dao Lords were rare, even in the Sacred Land.","Each of them possessed terrifying power.","Once they merged their Dao to become an Emperor, they could rival the Lord of the Ancient Court. After further growth, they would surpass the Lord of the Ancient Court and reach the level of the Sacred Lord.","The Two-faced Buddha carefully considered the situation and knew that the people outside couldn’t be relied upon anymore. So, he sent a message to recall the three silver puppets.","He also retracted the God-slaying war weapon into the formation.","This maneuver left the others dumbfounded.","“I haven’t even gone inside yet?”","The few remaining people within the Five Immortal Formation, along with several Dao Lords, were stunned.","The Palace Lord didn’t care about their lives anymore.","They swiftly surrendered without hesitation.","Although some people within the Five Immortal Formation wanted to surrender, the Nine-step True Immortals controlling the formation had long been enslaved by the Two-faced Buddha.","Without the Two-faced Buddha’s command, they continued to resist, even though they knew their fate. Despite their awareness, they didn’t stop.","Yang Dingtian rushed to the edge of the formation and smashed it with a single punch.","The formation trembled in response.","After testing the strength of the formation, Yang Dingtian was confident that he could break through the outer formation within ten punches.","He glanced at the main battlefield, where his followers and brothers were still fighting.","Though fury filled his heart, he turned around to first assist the coalition in exterminating all resistance from the Five Immortal Formation.","When they finally gathered all the surviving experts and took stock, his heart bled.","More than half of his trusted subordinates had died.","Now, only a few Dao Lords and fewer than a hundred True Immortals remained.","“Forgive me, everyone!” Yang Dingtian said, preparing to kneel.","The others, upon seeing this, rushed forward to stop him.","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang had disbanded the Five Immortal Formation and concealed himself within the coalition’s ranks, silently observing everything.","Yang Dingtian’s actions didn’t seem staged at all. It was clear that he was overly sentimental.","This was a flaw. Although he had decent talent, achieving Dao Unity would be difficult for him.","He recalled how, back when he was on the verge of Dao Unity, he had slaughtered gods and destroyed buddhas—no one could stop him.","He ventured into the Lower Realm, wreaking havoc in Da Xia.","He was almost devoid of emotion.","In the end, he barely succeeded in achieving Dao Unity.","He had firsthand experience of the challenges of Dao Unity.","But now, in his second life, he no longer needed to worry about such things.","Yang Dingtian’s eyes were bloodshot. Glancing at the familiar faces in the allied forces, he gritted his teeth and declared, “Thank you all for your trust. This time, I, Yang, will forever remember the debt of gratitude for attacking the Two-Faced God Mountain!”","“Brother Yang, no need to be so polite. We all share the same goal of eliminating this scourge. With you leading the charge, it’s only fitting. There’s no need for thanks; we all have the same target!” The city lord of Tiantan City spoke with grand confidence.","Yet it was a sentiment that everyone appreciated.","Yang Dingtian took a deep breath. “Very well, I won’t stand on ceremony. Next, I need everyone’s help to break this formation!”","“No problem!”","Everyone readily agreed, after all, victory was in sight.","Soon, they would be able to divide up the treasures of the Two-Faced God’s estate.","Many of Yang Dingtian’s people had already perished, so there wouldn’t be any leftovers to just sip soup—everyone could feast on the spoils.","However, Yang Dingtian was blinded by hatred. He was focused solely on revenge and had no interest in treasures.","“Everyone, follow my command!”","A hum rang out!","A powerful aura began to gather.","Everyone held their breath, ready to launch a coordinated attack on the formation.","But just as they were about to strike, the formation suddenly shattered.","Before their attack even landed, the formation was already gone.","Their combined attack, however, shot straight toward the Two-Faced God Mountain.","Its target was the peak.","At first, everyone was overjoyed, but what followed made every single person tremble.","The Two-Faced God Mountain had suddenly vanished.","Or rather, its peak had disappeared.","The midsection of the mountain remained intact.","The base of the mountain was still there.","But the peak was gone.","In place of the peak was a group of people, all looking equally surprised.","The more they looked, the more familiar those people seemed.","After blinking a few times, everyone finally realized—the people they were seeing were themselves!","Just as they grasped the situation, a terrifyingly familiar aura surged toward them.","“This is... an innate treasure!”","Before they could fully react, a familiar and powerful energy came crashing down upon them.","Yang Dingtian’s face changed dramatically, and he roared, “Get out of the way!”","At that moment, the others also realized that the figures across from them were their own reflections. The terrifying aura was none other than their own combined attack.","Atop the mountain was an ancient treasure—a mirror capable of reflecting everything.","It not only reflected the group but also sent their combined attack right back at them.","The more effort they had put into their initial strike, the more chaotic their retreat now became.","It was a pitiful sight.","Yang Dingtian was the first to escape the range of the attack, but he couldn’t bear to watch the Dao Masters who had followed him fall. He turned back and started rescuing them one by one.","But those Nine-Step True Immortals weren’t as lucky. The power of the combined strike was enough to kill them all.","In the blink of an eye, over a thousand Nine-Step True Immortals had perished.","There were only just over a thousand Nine-Step True Immortals in the entire Overturning Sea Ancient Domain.","With the previous casualties combined, the number of Nine-Step True Immortals left in the Overturning Sea Ancient Domain was now negligible.","As the bodies continued to fall, Yang Dingtian clenched his teeth, tightened his fists, and forcibly pushed his divine power to its limit. He charged headlong into the oncoming strike.","“Brother Yang!!!”","“Yang Dingtian!”","The Dao Masters who had been rescued gazed at his retreating figure, their eyes filled with shock.","Although Yang Dingtian had certainly walked the righteous path, no one could believe that, at this moment, he was risking his life to save unfamiliar Nine-Step True Immortals.","Even though they had united to attack the Two-Faced God’s estate, the Nine-Step True Immortals had all volunteered.","Even if Yang Dingtian didn’t save them or simply ignored the situation, no one would have said anything.","But to their surprise, Yang Dingtian was indeed righteous to the core!","“The righteous path is never lonely!”","One white-haired Dao Master couldn’t help but sigh.","It had been so many years since the Ascendant Era had ended, and the Dao system had shifted to competing with the Holy Land.","The line between good and evil had long blurred.","Everyone had become rather neutral, all seekers of the Dao. Who divided between right and wrong anymore?","Someone like the Two-Faced Buddha, if he had existed in the Ascendant Era, would have surely been a demonic cultivator, never able to control such a vast territory.","He certainly wouldn’t have become a saint of a great power.","Yet because of the ongoing struggle between the Holy Land and the Ancient Court, the boundary between right and wrong had disappeared.","The Overturning Sea Ancient Domain was somewhat different. Yang Dingtian and the Two-Faced Buddha had always been at odds due to their differing views on good and evil.","Now, Yang Dingtian was risking his life to save those True Immortals."]},{"number":6415,"title":"Chapter 6415: I Was So Strong Back Then!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6415: I Was So Strong Back Then!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It appeared especially grand.","Everyone was filled with deep emotion, reminiscing about the era of the Ascendants.","The righteous path still remained!","The light of the righteous path still shone!","Yang Dingtian stood alone, his divine body expanding to tens of thousands of feet, blocking all attacks. Behind him were hundreds of True Immortals, as well as a few Dao Lords.","Buzz!","The powerful attacks washed over his divine body.","From eight thousand times, his divine power surged to ten thousand times before barely managing to withstand the onslaught.","This was Yang Dingtian’s limit.","A divine power of ten thousand times—this already placed him in the realm of the Dao Lords, a level of strength capable of battling Emperors.","“Ten thousand times divine power, and Yang Dingtian hasn’t even practiced two sequences of the Divine Eye techniques, yet he can still burn his divine power to this level. How strong must his base divine power be?”","“Our Ancient Region of Overturning Seas is about to produce a great figure!”","Everyone wore expressions of astonishment.","No one expected Yang Dingtian to be this powerful, willing to sacrifice his life to save those True Immortals.","However, once his divine power reached ten thousand times, the incoming attacks became insignificant.","Only Jian Wushuang knew that inside Yang Dingtian’s body was a certain fruit that allowed him to elevate his power for a brief period. Once that fruit was fully consumed, the backlash would likely cause Yang Dingtian to fall immediately.","Thus, Yang Dingtian didn’t have much time. He couldn’t wait until the fruit was entirely exhausted; he had to leave a third of its power to sustain his divine body.","He would then completely forsake the power of immortality, converting everything into divine power.","On the foundation of his physical body, he was forging a ten-thousandfold divine body.","Once successful, Yang Dingtian’s combat strength would be fixed at ten thousand times divine power.","“What a pity!” Jian Wushuang shook his head in secret.","He lamented the waste of that fruit.","Using it in this way was simply too wasteful.","Because that was the supreme treasure of the Dao of Gold.","Even an Emperor couldn’t afford it.","Yet its utility was mainly for Dao Lords, and most Emperors didn’t need it.","However, for those who didn’t major in the Origin Source of Space but sought to grasp the Tribulations of the Universe, they needed it desperately.","A single Gold Fruit could at least exchange for a cosmic flying boat.","It was comparable to a cosmic treasure.","Far more powerful than an innate treasure.","“This Ancient Region of Overturning Seas may not be large, but it sure has plenty of treasures!”","Although Jian Wushuang felt regret, he wasn’t about to fight for a Gold Fruit that had already been crushed.","If he made a move to take Yang Dingtian down, with his refining methods, he could extract two-thirds of the Gold Fruit’s power.","However, it couldn’t last long.","Because even now, he still struggled with the power of all things. Trying to condense a large amount of life force was too difficult.","Moreover, such a vast amount of life force was definitely more valuable than the power of the Golden Fruit.","This was a losing deal.","Of course, he could also directly use the power of the Golden Fruit.","It would be of immense help to a Dao Master, even more so than to someone in the Tribulation Realm.","Especially for a True Immortal who had mastered the Origin Source of Space—it was an absolutely heaven-defying treasure.","The Origin Source contained within space was vast. At least nine-tenths of the cultivators present followed the path of the Space Origin Source.","If they knew that attacking Yang Dingtian now would bring benefits far beyond those of the treasure from the Dual-Faced Buddha, who knew if they would change sides.","At this moment, Yang Dingtian had blocked all the attacks. As he slowly turned around, he seemed like the only true god between heaven and earth.","This was the brilliance of a ten-thousandfold divine body.","Even Jian Wushuang, standing under this brilliance, couldn’t help but reveal a look of astonishment.","“So, I was this strong back then!!!”","Back when he was a Dao Master, he had reached a divine body ten thousand times stronger.","It was the most perfect Dao Master’s divine body, surpassing even the power of the cosmic laws.","It was the strongest that time and space had ever nurtured.","And he had been a postnatal divine body.","The innate ones didn’t count; those were innate lives nurtured by the entirety of time and space.","But as a postnatal life within the universe, to have nurtured a perfect Dao Master’s divine body that was ten thousand times stronger was no exaggeration when he claimed to look down upon time and space.","Only, back then, he truly hadn’t felt how strong he was.","Even after merging with the Dao, it felt similar.","This was the power of perception.","It was also a matter of vision.","If he hadn’t encountered Qishen Temple back then, he would have thought even a thousandfold divine power was impressive and remarkable.","Just like those cultivators now, watching Yang Dingtian with envy.","A divine body a thousand times stronger!","A perfect divine body among the Universe Dao Masters.","The pinnacle of special life forms within the universe.","But the Golden Fruit was too rare.","Without it, Yang Dingtian wouldn’t have been able to condense his divine body so quickly.","Even so, it wasn’t yet stable.","The current divine power was merely explosive divine power. For his base divine power to reach a thousandfold, he would still need to calm down and absorb the Golden Fruit’s power.","But for now, it seemed he didn’t have that time.","Facing the incomparably powerful Yang Dingtian, even the Dual-Faced Buddha within the Dual-Faced Temple seemed to have expected this.","“Lord, this Yang Dingtian’s power is too strange; he must have used some kind of forbidden technique!” Guardian Yunhai remarked.","The Dual-Faced Buddha remained silent, lifting his eyelids before sighing. “Then we’ll wait!”","Wait!","Indeed, this was a decent strategy.","Wait until Yang Dingtian could no longer hold on.","However, it was equally possible that the formations of the Dual-Faced Temple wouldn’t hold on either.","The four guardians and ten True Immortals inside the temple were becoming anxious.","They knew Yang Dingtian’s strength; he had always been more powerful than their lord.","But none of them had expected him to be this powerful.","The critical point was that the Dual-Faced Buddha hadn’t taken any action yet. He had only brought out some treasures they couldn’t even comprehend.","Originally, they thought their lord would act at a crucial moment. Even if he didn’t, he should have revealed some hidden cards. But it turned out the final card was simply to wait.","To drag Yang Dingtian to death.","But Yang Dingtian wasn’t a fool!","This left many of them disappointed in the Dual-Faced Buddha.","The once slaughter-hardened face of the Buddha seemed to have vanished!","In its place was a coward.","If he couldn’t resist, he should at least fight his way out!","But to just wait here—if their defenses were broken, they would all be finished.","Yet, since the Dual-Faced Buddha had spoken, none of them dared to refute him.","They could only watch silently.","Jian Wushuang’s Thought power had naturally caught onto the Dual-Faced Buddha’s intent, and now he too felt anxious.","“What is he planning? If it really is just an avatar, it shouldn’t be like this!”","He had already sensed something was off with the Dual-Faced Buddha earlier. Now, he was almost certain of it.","To be able to deploy so many formations and puppets, and possess such innate treasures, surely he would have plenty of life-saving means.","It didn’t make sense for him to just watch as Yang Dingtian expended the power of the Golden Fruit.","“Could it be that he doesn’t care about the Golden Fruit?”","Jian Wushuang squinted slightly, looking at Yang Dingtian’s back and shaking his head.","The value of the Golden Fruit was immense.","The Dual-Faced Buddha certainly knew about the Golden Fruit. Logically, even if it was just an avatar, he wouldn’t sit back and let Yang Dingtian waste it outside.","He should have informed his true form by now. With the treasures he had obtained, taking down Yang Dingtian would be no problem at all.","But he hadn’t done so.","“The one inside isn’t an avatar. It must be his true form!”"]},{"number":6416,"title":"Chapter 6416: Deciphering the Chaotic Treasure","paragraphs":["Chapter 6416: Deciphering the Chaotic Treasure","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath, a smile forming on his lips.","He had decided to help Yang Dingtian one more time, and in doing so, he would also probe the true strength of the Two-faced Buddha.","At this moment, Yang Dingtian was still studying the mirror in front of him.","To attack the formation of the Two-faced Temple, he needed to first unravel the mysteries of this mirror treasure.","An innate treasure.","Such items were usually used by Emperors.","During the Ancient Demon era, the entire Ancient Sea Domain had only nurtured three innate treasures.","These were the Ancient Demon Banner, the Ancient Demon Eye, and the Ancient Demon Hammer.","None of them were mirror-shaped innate treasures.","That left only one possibility — the Two-faced Buddha had obtained this chaotic treasure from the Chaos.","It was also an innate treasure.","However, the Origin Source of this treasure was somewhat different.","But for a Daoist’s use, it made almost no difference.","Because in order to fully unleash the power of an innate treasure, what was needed was divine power.","At this moment, the Two-faced Buddha also had divine power, but it wasn’t as strong as Yang Dingtian’s.","Still, with that limited divine power, he couldn’t fully unleash the power of the chaotic treasure.","Even Yang Dingtian couldn’t do it.","If an innate treasure were to be revealed, it would shock the entire Ancient Domain World.","At that time, Emperors would come to fight over it.","This place was close to the Ancient Court.","It would definitely attract a large number of Emperors.","The Holy Land had a more predictable situation.","There were only four Emperors in total, and each one possessed a chaotic treasure.","In fact, the three major innate treasures nurtured in the Ancient Domain World were all in the hands of the Holy Master.","However, the Holy Master rarely used any treasure in battle, so most of these treasures were held by the other three Emperors.","On the side of the Ancient Court, there were many more Emperors. Their battle power was weaker, and most of the treasures they possessed were peak-grade treasure sets. The Emperors with chaotic treasures were either ancient Elders of the Ancient Court or previous rulers of the Court.","Rising stars who wanted to obtain innate treasures had to risk their lives in the Chaos Void.","The areas of the Chaos Void close to the Ancient Domain World had long since nurtured innate treasures, so it was difficult for new chaotic treasures to appear there. The only option was to venture deeper into the Chaos Void.","Or, they could head to newly-formed great worlds to search for innate treasures.","However, such freshly-nurtured worlds were usually shielded by the laws of the universe, making them impossible for Emperors to locate.","The great worlds that could be found usually had Emperors of their own.","At the very least, these worlds would have a single Emperor, and the first native to become Emperor in such a world was often immensely powerful, with an incredibly strong divine body.","Combined with an innate treasure, seizing such a treasure would require the strength of a third-tier peak Emperor at the very least.","There were very few Emperors within the Ancient Court who had that level of strength.","Heading to the alternate world for an adventure wasn’t worth it.","To fight for survival in the chaotic void required luck. But now, a chaotic supreme treasure had appeared within the Ancient Domain World, and it was in the hands of a Dao Lord. The location wasn’t far from the Ancient Court either.","Once this news spread, it would instantly attract a large number of Emperors, and even the Lord of the Ancient Court might come to oversee the situation. Naturally, forces from the Holy Land would also come to intercept. Time was running out for both sides.","At this moment, if Jian Wushuang didn’t help, he would just have to watch helplessly when those Emperors arrived. He wasn’t invincible enough to sweep through all the Emperors yet!","Realizing that the last trump card of the Two-Faced Buddha was merely a delaying tactic, he had no more reservations. If he helped Yang Dingtian break through the chaotic treasure, he could then deal with the Two-Faced Buddha in the inner hall and take the treasure. It wouldn’t be too late to escape afterward.","With this in mind, Jian Wushuang began to approach the mirror surface.","Someone nearby noticed his movement and immediately cautioned him, “Friend, don’t cause trouble at this moment!”","“What is a mere Nine-Step True Immortal doing here? Is he looking to die?”","For a moment, many turned to look at him.","They noticed that Jian Wushuang seemed familiar, but couldn’t quite place him. His form was shapeless and indistinct, ever-changing. To each person’s eyes, Jian Wushuang appeared differently.","To them, Jian Wushuang seemed like a fellow cultivator who was both familiar and unfamiliar.","Jian Wushuang paid no attention to these people. He glanced at the mirror and immediately recognized it as a domain-type chaotic supreme treasure. The Origin Source within it seemed to be a Transformative Dao Origin Source.","The figure from earlier was also a transformation, not a reflection. And the attack—it too had been formed by transformation.","Otherwise, this chaotic supreme treasure would have been invincible, capable of reflecting anything.","In fact, with each transformation, the Origin Source within was heavily consumed. To break this mirror, one would have to break the Origin Source within.","For Jian Wushuang, that wasn’t a problem.","Standing before the mirror, Yang Dingtian was carefully examining it, unaware of Jian Wushuang’s presence.","Obviously, he was attempting to figure out how to break it.","Jian Wushuang paid no attention to the primary figure involved. He raised his hand and clenched his fist, causing a vortex to suddenly rise.","The airflow condensed—it was the aura of Origin Source.","Though Jian Wushuang had yet to comprehend a new Origin Source, keeping his realm stuck at the peak of Great Success, his mastery of the Sword Dao Origin Source came effortlessly.","“Gathering the myriad paths!”","“With the sword as the master!”","The Origin Source he had just condensed came from the heavens and earth around him. Gathering all the Origin Sources together, this was the path of extremity.","He then channeled this power into the Sword Dao, forming the ultimate Sword Dao.","A sword aura appeared in his hand, and with a single point, it shot toward the mirror.","This scene stunned everyone watching.","“Is he mad?”","“That mirror can reflect attacks, and he’s attacking it directly? And from such close range?”","“But I must admit, this guy’s sword aura is powerful—I can feel my soul trembling!” a Dao Lord muttered.","“Even if he has the power of a Dao Lord, it won’t be enough to break this kind of treasure!”","“Moreover, this will only cause trouble for Brother Yang!”","“With Brother Yang’s personality, he’ll definitely try to save this kid, which will waste even more time!”","The members of the allied army, though impressed by Jian Wushuang’s sword aura, were displeased by his actions.","Some were even preparing to step in and capture Jian Wushuang, feeling that he was simply causing unnecessary trouble.","At the moment the sword aura was unleashed, Yang Dingtian noticed Jian Wushuang and immediately shouted, “Get out of the way!”","Seeing Jian Wushuang standing there like a fool, Yang Dingtian kicked him without hesitation, intending to push him away.","But as his foot made contact, Jian Wushuang’s body was instantly shattered into pieces.","“What?”","Not only did his physical body disintegrate, but even his Origin Source and life aura disappeared completely.","The members of the allied army believed that Yang Dingtian had accidentally kicked Jian Wushuang to death.","However, Yang Dingtian knew that what he had kicked just now was not Jian Wushuang’s real body.","But neither was it a mere avatar or clone. The sensation was indescribable to him.","“Good kick, Brother Yang! That fool had no sense of the bigger picture. He was nothing but trouble, and it’s better that he’s dead. Don’t let this hold up our great endeavor!”","One of Yang Dingtian’s trusted followers led the chorus of praise, and the others quickly joined in, shouting their approval.","However, Yang Dingtian, being a man of pride, found the situation somewhat embarrassing."]},{"number":6417,"title":"Chapter 6417: You Don’t Even Have a Wife","paragraphs":["Chapter 6417: You Don’t Even Have a Wife","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Previously, he had acted like a savior, but now, with a single kick, he had killed someone in his way.","It made him seem somewhat hypocritical.","But there was no way to explain it.","Just as he was feeling conflicted, he noticed that the mirror didn’t reflect any sword energy.","Instead, what followed was the shattering of the mirror.","A majestic aura burst forth from within.","However, it wasn’t an attack, but a broken aura.","Boom!","The massive mirror shattered completely, leaving only a small mirror floating in mid-air.","Needless to say, that was the true body of the innate treasure.","What had just occurred was merely a domain.","“I didn’t do anything?” Yang Dingtian looked bewildered.","The crowd watching below was just as confused. No one knew what had happened; the mirror had suddenly shattered.","The hidden Guardian Yunhai within the temple was taken aback and abruptly opened his eyes.","For the first time, he lost his composure and seemed somewhat panicked.","“How is this possible?”","“How was the domain broken?”","“Who did this?”","Countless possibilities flashed through his mind.","But one by one, he dismissed them all.","“In this world, the only one capable of silently breaking the domain of a Chaos Supreme Treasure is that Holy Lord. Could he have discovered me?” The suddenly distressed Guardian Yunhai shook his head, thinking, “That’s unlikely. If he had noticed me, he would have appeared by now. Could it be that one of those people outside is a hidden power from another realm?”","His eyes widened in shock.","This scenario wasn’t entirely out of the question.","After a brief moment of surprise, those outside began to join forces to attack the formation around the temple.","Inside, the situation grew tense.","The four Guardians and the Ten True Immortals once again operated the Imperial Annihilation Formation.","“Master, if this doesn’t work, we should just go all out. We might have a chance to escape!” Guardian Yunhai appeared anxious.","But inwardly, he wasn’t worried at all.","He was only coveting the Divine Puppet of Annihilation.","At this moment, naturally, he had to show his loyalty.","But all Guardian Yunhai heard from those words was the mention of escape.","There was no mention of fighting to the death.","“Escape? Where to?” Guardian Yunhai sneered as he slowly stood up.","He had long lost any chance to run.","Even if he could remain in seclusion here for ten thousand or even a million years, there was no time to flee.","Although his eyes held a smile, there was also a trace of sorrow.","“I haven’t yet seen the return of my people. I haven’t yet witnessed true glory, and yet I am to fall here!”","Guardian Yunhai’s words left many present confused.","Especially the four Guardians.","They had followed their master for the longest time.","They had never heard anything about Guardian Yunhai’s tribe.","Weren’t they all human?","Moreover, in Guardian Yunhai’s early days, he had been just a small monk in a temple.","He had started with the body of a mortal, rising to the peak through slaughter and hypocrisy.","He had always been alone.","Where did this tribe come from?","Guardian Yunhai wanted to remind him.","“Master, you don’t even have parents or a wife. Where did this tribe come from?”","But he couldn’t say that out loud.","Because he didn’t dare to.","However, there was someone who did dare.","A faint surge of thought power suddenly began to rise.","It condensed from the white smoke and also stepped out from the white flames.","“Should I call you the Twin-Faced Buddha, or a powerful being from another realm?”","The figure bathed in white flames was formless and shapeless, only carrying the aura of the white flames, with no personal presence at all, as if it had never existed.","The figure was none other than Jian Wushuang. After breaking the domain, he had concentrated all his power onto the thought power within the hall.","Now fully revived, he appeared in front of the Twin-Faced Buddha.","No!","He appeared in front of the powerful being from another realm.","The Twin-Faced Buddha’s eyelids twitched, not surprised by Jian Wushuang’s appearance but shocked by his immense strength.","He wasn’t like those country bumpkins from the outside world.","He was a superpower who had traversed many great worlds. He had witnessed the destruction of countless worlds and the miracles of the universe.","So he could understand Jian Wushuang’s power.","Formless and invisible.","This was no longer just at the level of an Emperor. It was very likely that Jian Wushuang had become a Universe Master.","Because a Universe Master, in their own universe, could also become formless and invisible.","After all, their entire universe was their true form.","But Jian Wushuang was different. He was currently just a Grand Completion stage cultivator. However, due to his Realm Beast body, he could still maintain a formless and invisible state.","The only issue was that his current physical strength was still too weak. If he could increase his power by a factor of ten million, devouring the entire Ancient Domain World wouldn’t be a problem.","At that time, even if he were still at the Grand Completion stage, he wouldn’t fear any Emperor.","Even if a Universe Master came, they would have to retreat three paces.","Note, this wasn’t just Tribulation-level power; even a Universe Master wouldn’t stand a chance.","After all, what Realm Beasts loved most was devouring the Origin Source of the universe.","They didn’t care about the Origin Source of a large world like this.","If they were to devour something, it had to be the purest Origin Source.","Not the chaotic Origin Source of a world like this.","Their starting point had to be the Origin Source of a universe.","But now, Jian Wushuang was more interested in this powerful being from another realm, because from the other’s body, he felt a strange sense of excitement.","It was excitement from the Nine Prison Pagoda.","“Strong one from the Divine Eye Clan, I’m curious, when did you possess the Twin-Faced Buddha?” Jian Wushuang directly revealed the other’s identity.","This caused the Twin-Faced Buddha, who had yet to speak and was still harboring some hope, to have his eyes bulge in shock.","With just one sentence, Jian Wushuang had stripped him bare.","How could he even continue the conversation?","Simultaneously, countless thoughts raced through his mind.","Who was this person?","How did they know his identity?","Knowing that he came from another realm wasn’t a big deal.","That could be deduced from his aura.","But recognizing that he belonged to the Divine Eye Clan? Even the Holy Lord who had fused two great sequences couldn’t do that.","Because he was a true powerhouse of the Divine Eye Clan.","He had cultivated the complete Divine Eye secret technique from the very beginning, starting with the first cycle of practice. Now, he had reached the third cycle.","At his peak, he could even battle those at the Tribulation level.","He was, in fact, a supreme expert.","He didn’t take Emperors seriously at all.","And as a member of the prestigious Divine Eye Clan, he was invincible among those of the same level.","But now, someone had recognized his identity with just one glance. With all his experience, he couldn’t even detect the other’s aura or identity.","That was the most terrifying part.","The Divine Eye Clan had long since disappeared. Since his revival, he had traveled through most of the universe, but had not found a single one of his kin.","He had searched tirelessly, even venturing into dangerous regions.","But he had never found any of his clan, nor had anyone been able to recognize his identity.","Otherwise, he would have been captured and studied long ago.","He had searched half the universe without encountering a single member of his clan.","Now, he had come across someone who could recognize his identity as a Divine Eye Clan member.","He was utterly astonished.","In the depths of his heart, there was both excitement and fear.","Excitement because someone still remembered!","Someone still remembered the mighty Divine Eye Clan and could recognize that he was one of its members.","But also fear!","Fear of the Divine Eye Clan’s sudden demise back then.","They must have broken some kind of rule, wiped out by a superpower.","Now that he had encountered a mysterious expert who recognized him, he couldn’t help but worry about that very thing."]},{"number":6418,"title":"Chapter 6418: My Name Is Na Yiluan","paragraphs":["Chapter 6418: My Name Is Na Yiluan","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang wasn’t sure if this encounter with the stranger would be good or bad for him.","Instead of answering Jian Wushuang’s question, the man countered with his own: “You... you know me? You know about the Divine Eye Clan?”","There was a surge of emotion behind his words.","Jian Wushuang hadn’t expected the man to be so eager for a response.","Suddenly, his own question seemed less important.","“Alright then, let me ask a different question. Who injured you, and why did you flee here? And where are the other powerful warriors from your Divine Eye Clan?”","At this, the man’s expression changed, and he angrily shouted, “So, you are indeed here to destroy the Divine Eye Clan! I will never tell you anything! One day, the Divine Eye Clan will undoubtedly return to this world!”","His voice was filled with anguish.","But, he didn’t know the truth.","If he knew that it was their own creator who had annihilated their clan, would he still speak with such conviction?","Jian Wushuang knew that the man would remain stubborn and unyielding. Since he couldn’t get any useful information, he decided not to waste any more words and made his move.","The man’s energy was unstable, his life barely sustained by some sort of life-preserving treasure.","Jian Wushuang, relying on the strength of his physical body alone, forcefully broke through the protective shield the man had cast. In an instant, he tore apart the body of the two-faced Buddha.","The man’s true form was revealed.","It was a one-eyed humanoid beast, though still somewhat related to the human race.","“Powerful warrior of the Divine Eye Clan, you are about to fall. Won’t you at least tell me your name?” Jian Wushuang’s voice was proud.","He didn’t intend to kill the man.","If it weren’t for the Nine Prison Pagoda, he wouldn’t have even bothered to act.","But now that he had obtained the Nine Prison Pagoda, and considering that his senior brother and the Giant Eye were both pleading for him to deal with the Divine Eye Clan, he had no choice.","The secret techniques of the Divine Eye Clan were linked to the Realm Beasts.","Jian Wushuang was confident he could master them himself, but since there was an easier path, one that could also help prevent the extermination of the Divine Eye Clan, he was more than happy to play the hero.","For now, he just wanted to know the man’s name, so he threatened him slightly.","If the man refused to answer, there was no other option but to imprison him in the Nine Prison Pagoda and figure it out later.","“Remember my name! I am Nayi Luan, a proud warrior of the Divine Eye Clan! We will not tolerate the disdain of you humans!”","At that moment, Nayi Luan showed no fear of death and shouted loudly, as if he were trying to maintain the last vestiges of the Divine Eye Clan’s glory.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly and said, “Nayi Luan.”","Buzz!","He raised his hand, summoning the Nine Prison Pagoda. The immense power of the pagoda instantly enveloped Nayi Luan.","The power of the Nine Prison Pagoda was immense, especially when dealing with the warriors of the Divine Eye Clan. It had a natural advantage, specifically designed to suppress them.","“Enter!”","With a simple gesture, Jian Wushuang effortlessly suppressed Nayi Luan.","Just before he entered the Nine Prison Pagoda, Nayi Luan’s expression changed dramatically, as if he had recognized the pagoda. But before he could say anything more, he was completely suppressed within it.","Only a single space mustard seed remained at the scene.","Jian Wushuang didn’t hesitate; he casually touched his nose and tucked it away.","He didn’t bother with the changes in the Nine Prison Pagoda but instead turned his attention toward the Extinguishing God Weapon.","The Four Guardians and Ten True Immortals were completely terrified by now.","Guardian Yunhai and the others hurried forward, exclaiming, “Congratulations, Senior!”","Although they had only heard bits and pieces, they could tell that the Two-Faced Buddha had been possessed.","The one Jian Wushuang had just subdued was rumored to be a powerful member of the Divine Eye Clan.","Both were significant secrets.","If Jian Wushuang decided to kill them to silence them, they wouldn’t have had any complaints.","Thus, they all behaved with utmost respect, not daring to take any risks.","The possession of the Two-Faced Buddha was of little consequence to Jian Wushuang. As for the Divine Eye Clan, he cared even less.","Even if word got out that he had subdued a Divine Eye Clan powerhouse, who would dare seek revenge?","If anyone did come, it would likely be another member of the Divine Eye Clan. That would save Jian Wushuang the trouble of going after them himself.","He would capture each one, increasing his own strength—what a fortunate situation.","Therefore, he had no intention of harming the True Immortals or the Four Guardians. Rubbing his temples, he raised his head and said, “If you want to live, don’t resist. I’ll teleport us out shortly, and once we’ve left the Ancient Domain of Overturning Seas, I’ll let you go.”","“Of course!” Guardian Yunhai was the first to agree.","The others didn’t know who Jian Wushuang was, but seeing Guardian Yunhai, Guardian Qifeng, and even Patriarch Xue He behave as though they knew him, they didn’t dare doubt his words and all nodded in agreement.","Yang Dingtian was about to charge in. Not following Jian Wushuang would undoubtedly lead to death.","After bringing these people into the Nine Prison Pagoda, Jian Wushuang glanced once more at the spot where the Two-Faced Buddha had sat cross-legged.","“Yang Dingtian will be here any moment, and news of the innate supreme treasure will spread throughout the Ancient Domain. This event is going to cause quite the stir. I need to add something more to it, and that I-Luan didn’t say anything. The space mustard seed left behind didn’t contain the Universe Flying Ship. It must still be in the chaotic void. I need to leave something here to divert the attention of those Emperors so they don’t discover the Universe Flying Ship!”","As for the True Immortals and Dao Lords who knew the truth, they would be too busy fleeing to dare reveal it.","He immediately began setting up formations inside the hall.","From I-Luan’s ring, he found three silver puppets, the three Extinguishing God Puppets, but not a single formation remained.","There were also some bottles and jars, but the only useful thing was a certain silver liquid—about nineteen drops of it.","“It’s actually the divine blood of the Divine Eye Clan!” Jian Wushuang’s lips curled into a smile.","This stuff wasn’t of much use to cultivators, but it was quite dangerous.","It could be used in a sacrificial ritual.","For instance, with one drop of silver divine blood, a Dao Lord’s bloodline could be transformed.","They could become a pseudo-Emperor, which, in harsh terms, was essentially a counterfeit Divine Eye Clan powerhouse.","According to the history of the Divine Eye Clan, they had never created such monsters before.","Once transformed, their divine bodies would reach a maximum limit while also having an extremely high minimum threshold.","Five thousand times divine power was a very high baseline.","Even the peak of world-level special life forms only reached five thousand times divine power.","Once transformed by the Divine Eye Clan, their divine power would never fall below five thousand times.","No wonder so many powerhouses were once willing to work for the Divine Eye Clan.","Their maximum potential would be the peak of universe-level special life forms, at ten thousand times divine power.","Replenishing divine power for them was also a violent process, with no need for cultivation.","They could simply consume treasures that contained divine power.","For example, Origin Source of divine power.","The Origin Source of an Emperor’s divine power, or even that of an Immortal, could replenish their divine power.","Moreover, they could burn divine power, similar to the second transformation of the Divine Eye Clan’s secret technique.","After burning it, they could battle Emperors, and even among Emperors, they could stand out.","The three silver puppets from earlier had been dormant for too long, with no divine treasures to replenish them, so they were weak.","But even Yang Dingtian couldn’t destroy them.","With a divine power limit of ten thousand times, their divine bodies had ten thousand times the defense.","Even Yang Dingtian was helpless against these silver puppets.","“It’s a pity that this is only the lowest tier of silver divine blood, diluted countless times. If I had the pure cosmic blood essence of the Divine Eye Clan, I might be able to create a demigod-level powerhouse!” Jian Wushuang chuckled lightly."]},{"number":6419,"title":"Chapter 6419: Huze Mountain","paragraphs":["Chapter 6419: Huze Mountain","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang, a Universe God-level expert, was a supreme force no matter where he went.","Even among the Shenyan Clan, there weren’t many like him. Those creatures they encountered earlier, the ones that escaped from this world, were likely the remnants of the souls of powerful Shenyan Clan experts.","Unfortunately for them, they fled in the wrong direction.","Once outside, they would most likely be eliminated by the experts of the Realm God Continent.","If they had stayed, they might have slowly revived, just like the one Luán did.","Then, they would all be absorbed into the Nine Prison Pagoda by Jian Wushuang, becoming fuel to enhance his Shenyan Secret Technique.","No matter which path they chose, their fate was grim.","However, living was still better than falling.","Moreover, there was a chance that Senior Brother Guiyan might return. The Nine Prison Pagoda was only assisting Jian Wushuang’s Shenyan Secret Technique; it wasn’t truly his to keep.","Of course, he had never planned to keep it.","Once his Shenyan Secret Technique reached perfection, he would return the Nine Prison Pagoda to Senior Brother Guiyan.","Whether the Shenyan Clan would be freed or not after that, he didn’t mind either way.","Breaking the rules of the Starry Sky had nothing to do with him.","If anyone was to interfere, it would be the Star Spirit.","Still, he remembered the Shenyan Clan’s kindness and hoped they would find a good ending.","Jian Wushuang continued setting up within the temple, arranging as many hidden countermeasures as possible.","But no matter how he prepared, today, the fall of the Two-faced Buddha had to be announced to the world.","Thus, his preparations would not be enough to stop Yang Dingtian.","In the end, he created a mustard seed.","He placed within it his Destroyer War Weapon, three silver puppets, and several useless trinkets he no longer had any use for.","The only pity was that none of the Two-faced Buddha’s renowned treasures remained.","There was nothing else he could do, so he modified a few supreme treasures’ Origin Sources, infusing them with powerful Extreme Dao Origins, forcefully elevating their level to peak treasures.","For someone new to refining treasures, this was his limit.","After all this was done, there was only one thing left to do—becoming the Two-faced Buddha.","Jian Wushuang suddenly sat cross-legged in the spot where the Two-faced Buddha had sat earlier, his appearance slowly morphing into that of the Buddha himself.","Whoosh!","He took a deep breath and stood up again.","The one standing up was his true self, while the one disguised as the Two-faced Buddha became a clone.","His real body faded into the void, melding into the space around him.","The clone disguised as the Two-faced Buddha remained in the Twin-faced Divine Hall.","This was the final trick he left behind for the Twin-faced Divine Hall.","His true self stepped out from the void and appeared over the watery region of the Twin-faced Divine Hall.","Mist swirled around, the air was damp, and dark clouds loomed above. Beneath, in the dim lake, giant creatures moved.","Massive, ancient trees, devoid of life, lay dormant at the bottom of the mist-covered lake.","Enormous beasts swam in the depths, lurking and hunting.","This place was called Huze Mountain.","Jian Wushuang followed the aura of Jiang Ni and the others to this location.","Now, he was hiding atop the root of a massive tree floating on Huze.","The surroundings seemed quiet, but in reality, a hidden danger lurked.","In the misty fog, shadows flickered occasionally.","It was a blood-red figure.","That made it all the more noticeable.","Jian Wushuang did not use any blood-colored secret technique. He was simply heavily injured, causing his blood essence to spill out and make his entire aura appear crimson.","He fled cautiously, though his pace was not fast.","He leaped back and forth across the lake, moving with care.","He remained constantly vigilant.","Even when he passed by the tree root where Jian Wushuang was seated, he paused for a moment, waiting for the root to stabilize before leaping away again.","“Interesting,” Jian Wushuang remarked as he sat on the tree root, his fingers lightly tapping the surface of the lake.","A stream of invisible Thought power sank to the bottom of the lake.","The skies above were shrouded with dark clouds, and the water below was pitch black. Only vague shadows of large creatures could be seen moving beneath the surface.","However, none of these creatures gave off a strong aura.","At most, they were at the Great Realm King level in strength.","They were nothing more than a few strange beasts.","But far beyond those figures, a massive object, resembling an underwater mountain, suddenly trembled.","A mere subtle movement from this giant caused the enormous creatures hunting below to scatter in terror.","The mountain-sized object, seemingly stirred by some aura, suddenly awoke, causing the colossal creatures below to flee in all directions. Some even leaped out of the water in panic.","A crow perched on a branch above the water was unfortunate enough to be swallowed by one of the lake’s monstrous beasts.","The beast didn’t return to the depths, instead perching on a massive bush, trembling violently.","The reason was simple: the mountain at the bottom of the lake had started moving.","At the same time, the entire lake began to tremble.","The massive beast that had leaped onto the bush quickly fled.","Along with it, dozens of other huge wild beasts, each over a hundred meters in size, burst from the water.","They began fleeing for their lives!","Even the blood-colored figure running away was startled.","“What’s happening?”","Seeing the enormous wild beasts running alongside him, he was utterly dumbfounded.","Yet, it wasn’t a bad thing for him.","In fact, it was a blessing in disguise, as he could blend in with the wild beasts and escape alongside them.","Without further hesitation, he rushed forward, now leading the charge.","Meanwhile, on the other side of the lake, a group of three—a man and two women—was recklessly probing the auras below.","Sensing the countless wild beasts fleeing within the lake, they all frowned.","They descended, standing on the surface of the water, trying to investigate.","“Brother Jiu Chen, didn’t you say you sensed that kid fleeing here?” Xue Yang rubbed his temples in frustration.","Ever since they were sent here by Jian Wushuang, the three of them had been hunting True Immortals.","Now, only one six-step True Immortal remained, but after being heavily injured, he had fled to this area, and they had lost track of him.","Jiu Chen was the one leading the way.","This guy had many tricks up his sleeve, and his ability to sense auras was even more refined than Xue Yang’s.","Jiang Ni and Xue Yang had followed Jiu Chen’s lead.","Now, only one six-step True Immortal remained, and they had already severely injured him. Yet, as soon as they reached this place, he vanished.","With the lake now in chaos and countless wild beasts running rampant, it wasn’t good news for them.","The situation had become even more chaotic, making it difficult to track down the injured True Immortal’s aura.","“Stop interrupting me. I almost had his aura just now!” Jiu Chen snapped impatiently, his eyes closed and brows furrowed as he calculated with his fingers.","Xue Yang, seeing him like this, grew even more skeptical, thinking Jiu Chen was simply guessing.","Just as Xue Yang was about to voice his doubts, Jiu Chen’s eyes suddenly shot open. A joyful expression appeared on his face as he exclaimed, “I’ve found him! He’s at the bottom of the lake! Three thousand miles away—let’s go!”","Though Xue Yang was beginning to lose trust in the old man, he didn’t hesitate this time. They had no better leads, and he couldn’t find the heavily injured six-step True Immortal himself.","Hearing the location, Xue Yang was the first to move.","He moved swiftly, traveling a thousand miles in a single flash.","With his second step, he arrived three thousand miles away.","As he emerged, his full set of peak Immortal artifacts erupted with power. Even without Origin Source, he could wield the treasures with masterful skill.","Both Jiu Chen and Jiang Ni watched in envy.","Among the three of them, Xue Yang was undoubtedly the strongest, able to learn and master any skill at incredible speed."]},{"number":6420,"title":"Chapter 6420: You Tricked Me!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6420: You Tricked Me!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At this moment, he fully unleashed his strength.","His figure darted toward the bottom of the lake.","The long sword in his hand pierced straight toward the lakebed.","But when he reached the deepest part of the lake, not only did he fail to find the injured Six-Step True Immortal, but instead, he encountered a massive creature, easily ten thousand feet in size, moving slowly.","Startled, he trembled. As he prepared to flee, the enormous creature suddenly extended a tendril toward him.","Xue Yang didn’t have time to think, raising his sword to slash at it.","But the moment his immortal sword touched the tendril, it shattered instantly.","“Jiu Chen, you really screwed me over this time!”","Xue Yang cursed in his heart and immediately gave up resisting, fleeing for his life.","Because his rising speed was slow, he relied on the water currents, using them to escape.","The tendril of the massive creature only chased him for ten miles before it stopped.","After escaping the range, Xue Yang broke out in a cold sweat.","He now felt a lingering fear.","“Ten thousand feet in size, this body must be ten thousand times stronger, perhaps even more. Aren’t all the Dao Lords in the Twin-Faced God Mountain? How can there be a Dao Lord-level beast here in the Twin-Faced God’s palace?”","While he hesitated, two auras approached from afar—it was Jiang Ni and Jiu Chen.","As soon as Jiu Chen arrived, he asked, “What was that aura just now?”","“You dare to ask me? Wasn’t it the path you told me to take?” Xue Yang responded angrily.","As the tendril moved earlier, it emitted an ancient aura.","Ancient as it seemed, it wasn’t actually that old.","At most, it had existed for a hundred thousand years.","To Jian Wushuang and Xue Yang, that was just the blink of an eye.","Hardly ancient at all.","“I must have sensed it wrong, but it’s indeed the most powerful being in this lake. I thought the strongest creature here wouldn’t surpass the level of a True Immortal. I never expected there to be a Dao Lord-level being!” Jiu Chen took a deep breath.","Xue Yang, still frustrated, said, “Seems like we’re just unlucky. What now?”","Jiang Ni, standing before the two, had little say in the matter.","He left it to the two of them to decide.","Xue Yang was the strongest in battle but wasn’t the quickest thinker.","The burden of strategy still fell on Jiu Chen, who had lived for a long time, perhaps even longer than Xue Yang.","After all, the Lord of Divine Fire’s power was at the demi-god level, stronger than Xue Yang.","Jiu Chen was a true spirit created by the Lord of Divine Fire, and his existence spanned a long era.","Moreover, the Divine Fire Palace was prepared for Jian Wushuang, containing the bodies of realm beasts and the presence of the Grey Jar.","When Jiu Chen had been crafted, the Lord of Divine Fire had evidently poured much effort into him. In terms of consciousness, Jiu Chen was top-tier, no weaker than that of the human race in terms of awareness and comprehension.","Otherwise, how could he have become a cultivator in the Great Perfection stage in just a century?","Jiu Chen’s eyes twinkled, and a new idea emerged in his mind.","“What do you think would happen if we killed that Dao Lord beneath the lake? What treasure do you think Jian Wushuang would give us?” Jiu Chen asked, his tone carrying a hint of madness.","Xue Yang scoffed. “You want to go? Go ahead. That’s a Dao Lord! Unless I control the Origin Source, killing it is nothing short of a fantasy!”","Jiang Ni, uncertain of Jiu Chen’s intentions, added, “That giant beast at the bottom of the lake moves very slowly. Though its tendril didn’t extend beyond ten miles, within that range, it poses a great threat to us. And we can’t be sure that it only has one tendril. It’s far too difficult to deal with. Besides, its body is massive, its defenses must be incredibly strong. It’s beyond our ability to handle.”","“Don’t you want to know why the beast only attacks cultivators within ten miles?” Jiu Chen asked with a smirk.","Even with Xue Yang’s slow thinking, he finally understood and exclaimed in surprise, “You mean, the beast is trapped here?”","“Exactly!” Jiu Chen said smugly. “When I sensed its aura earlier, its strength was only at the level of a Six-Step True Immortal. And given its size and the fact that it only chased you for ten miles, I’m guessing it’s been trapped at the bottom of the lake, its power greatly diminished, with only one tendril left. Its strength is likely only that of a Seven-Step True Immortal. We have nothing to fear. If we kill it, we’ll be rich!”","A savage beast, tens of thousands of feet in size, was very likely a divine beast.","Its value was indeed immense.","They had also seen the divine beasts of the Beast Sect.","If they slaughtered it and refined it into a demon pill, it would certainly benefit them greatly.","More importantly, it could boost their battle achievements, giving them an excuse to ask Jian Wushuang for treasures.","Xue Yang lowered his eyes and sneered coldly, “If you’re after the essence blood and demon pill of this savage beast, I can only say you know nothing about divine beasts. If you’re trying to get some advantage from Brother Wushuang, let me tell you, that man doesn’t care about ordinary treasures. If you need something, he’ll give it to you. There’s no need to fake battle achievements to deceive him.”","“That’s harsh!” Immortal Jiu Chen frowned and said, “What do you mean by deceive? This is called a fight!”","As the two continued to bicker, a blood-red figure suddenly rushed towards them from a distant treetop.","Jiang Ni was the first to notice and shouted, “Stop arguing! I see Xiong Zhan’s figure!”","With that, he was the first to charge ahead.","Seeing this, Xue Yang also hurried forward. Jian Wushuang had specifically instructed him to look after Jiang Ni, and he couldn’t let anything happen to him.","Moreover, Xiong Zhan was a Six-Step True Immortal, and Jiang Ni was no match for him. Naturally, he had to go and help.","Immortal Jiu Chen was about to say something when the two people beside him had already dashed off.","“Wait...”","He sighed and could only follow suit.","Xiong Zhan seemed to ignore the three of them and charged straight toward them.","This scene left Jiang Ni and Xue Yang momentarily stunned, thinking that Xiong Zhan was desperate for a fight. They both prepared to block him.","“Idiots! Look behind me before you attack!” Xiong Zhan roared furiously.","Behind him was a giant serpent, with a diameter of a hundred feet and a length of tens of thousands of feet.","No!","Or rather, it was a giant flood dragon.","The moment Xue Yang saw the flood dragon, he suddenly realized that its tail looked oddly familiar.","At that moment, he connected it to the tentacle...","That wasn’t a tentacle at all—it was the tail of a giant flood dragon.","“My heavens! How are there two savage beasts, both tens of thousands of feet in size?” Xue Yang gasped deeply, ignoring Xiong Zhan’s cursing. He immediately turned around, grabbed Jiang Ni, and fled.","In the distance, Immortal Jiu Chen seemed to be waiting for them. Only when they had fled to his side did he follow them in retreat.","“I was just about to say, the aura behind Xiong Zhan is very similar to that of the savage beast you encountered earlier, but unfortunately, you didn’t listen!” Immortal Jiu Chen shook his head silently.","Xue Yang, gnashing his teeth in frustration, said, “What rotten luck! We encountered two savage beasts, each tens of thousands of feet in size. Didn’t the powerhouses of the Twin-Faced God Palace all go to Twin-Faced God Mountain? Why is there still a Dao Master here, and not just one, but two savage beasts at the Dao Master level? Does the Twin-Faced Buddha not care about these savage beasts?”","As he grumbled, Xiong Zhan, who was fleeing beside them, interjected, “You outsiders know nothing! This is a Qishen Serpent, and beneath it is a Qishen Tortoise. When the original Palace Master created this place, he sealed the tortoise and serpent here. Who would’ve thought that the restriction would break at this time, and they’d escape? My luck has truly run out!”"]},{"number":6421,"title":"Chapter 6421: Training Jiang Ni","paragraphs":["Chapter 6421: Training Jiang Ni","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Indeed, he was the unluckiest one here.","First, he was hunted down for no apparent reason, and then he fled to Lake Marsh Mountain.","This place was rumored to be where the divine beasts, the Turtle and the Serpent, were sealed.","They were once the overlords of the early Qishen Temple.","However, these rumors had been circulating for tens of thousands of years, and no one took them seriously.","Even if they were truly sealed here, they wouldn’t be able to break the restrictions of the Two-Faced Buddha.","He fled to this place, hoping to use the terrain to escape.","Halfway through his escape, he discovered that countless wild beasts were also fleeing. He thought his luck had finally turned, and that he could slip away amidst the chaos.","But before he could feel any relief, a giant flood dragon appeared in front of him.","Based on its appearance and the descriptions he had heard, he immediately recognized it as the Serpent of the Qishen Realm.","It was one of the two great overlords of the Qishen Temple.","Wherever the Serpent of the Qishen Realm was, the Turtle of the Qishen Realm wouldn’t be far behind.","The Turtle and the Serpent—these two divine beasts were beings that even ordinary Dao Lords couldn’t escape from.","Let alone this group of small fry.","Despair gripped them all. Fortunately, the Turtle and Serpent had only just broken free from their seals, so their strength wasn’t at its peak yet. At that moment, they were devouring the wild beasts while also hunting down this group of human cultivators.","Once they regained even half of their power, there would be no escape for them.","Upon hearing about the two divine beasts, Nine Dust and Jiang Ni turned pale as death.","This time, they were truly in danger.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t here, so the targets given to them weren’t that significant.","Even if they couldn’t win, they could at least run away.","But now that they had encountered Dao Lords, their chances of survival seemed slim.","Earlier, they had sensed the enormous disturbance erupting from the direction of the Two-Faced God Mountain and had thought Jian Wushuang definitely wouldn’t have the time to come and save them.","They could only rely on themselves now.","In an instant, everyone was desperately fleeing.","They were wildly squeezing out every bit of power from within.","Only Xue Yang appeared increasingly calm.","Although he was slow-witted, after spending years with Jian Wushuang, he had come to understand his nature.","If Jian Wushuang had placed them in this area, then this place didn’t pose any major threat.","The two divine beasts had been sealed for ages, and nothing had changed for tens of thousands of years.","But just as they were about to reach safety, the Turtle and Serpent broke free from their seals.","Someone was definitely behind this.","Only Jian Wushuang had both the strength and the time to do something like this.","If it were a stranger, there would be no need to act this way. Besides, an ordinary Dao Master couldn’t break through the restrictions set by the Dual-faced Buddha.","At this thought, Xue Yang cursed Jian Wushuang inwardly.","He didn’t voice his suspicions directly, knowing full well that Jian Wushuang was using this to train them—or more specifically, to train Jiang Ni.","Xue Yang himself was a Universe Master. Following his original path was enough. He would fill in any gaps wherever necessary.","The path of reconstruction left no room for regrets.","At this stage, what he needed wasn’t more tempering but treasures and the opportunity for enlightenment.","It wasn’t about that life-and-death experience.","As for Immortal Jiu Chen, Xue Yang figured that Jian Wushuang had probably obtained some treasure in the Divine Fire Hall and kept Jiu Chen by his side to repay a debt.","He guessed right on that one.","If Jian Wushuang knew this, he would definitely praise Xue Yang for his insight.","Finally, there was Jiang Ni.","She had been born into the mortal world.","In the past, both he and Jian Wushuang had fooled her into fleeing to the Eastern Lands, primarily to trick Jiang Ni.","Later, however, Xue Yang discovered that Jiang Ni’s mother might actually have some connection to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang was a supreme powerhouse among the Universe Gods and had quietly entered this realm.","It wouldn’t be surprising if he had some old acquaintances here.","This, too, didn’t surprise Xue Yang.","Jian Wushuang had created the situation with the turtle and the snake to nurture Jiang Ni.","He and Immortal Jiu Chen were merely background characters.","“No, I’m more like a protector!” Xue Yang’s eyes gleamed with a strange light.","While fleeing at high speed, he glanced back.","The snake from the Qishen Temple spat a stream of brown liquid. It moved incredibly fast, and although its power was average, it was laden with poison.","He couldn’t afford to be careless.","He adjusted his stance, holding Jiang Ni in one hand and Jiu Chen in the other. With a sudden burst of strength, he hurled them both tens of thousands of miles away.","Then, with another surge of energy, he caught up with them almost instantly.","Meanwhile, a six-step True Immortal named Xiong Zhan was battling fiercely, but someone had led him into the path of the brown liquid. Though most of it missed, a tiny bit splashed onto him, causing his body to disintegrate on the spot.","The poison not only corroded his body but also ate away at his Origin Source.","“Ahhhh!” Xiong Zhan’s agonizing screams echoed, but his survival instincts still pushed him to flee.","He ignited his blood essence, transforming into a streak of blood, burning ninety percent of his Origin Source to escape. In an instant, he disappeared from sight, surpassing Xue Yang and the others in speed.","However, the power he had burned was too much. Even if he managed to escape, it would take a long time for him to recover.","More importantly, the burst of speed was too brief. He hadn’t made it out of Lake Ze Mountain before his body, composed of condensed Origin Source, fell into the lakebed from a thicket.","On the other side.","Jiang Ni and Jiu Chen didn’t even have time to thank Xue Yang before they noticed that Xiong Zhan had vanished without a trace. Now, the Qishen Temple’s snake targeted only the three of them.","It no longer devoured the wild beasts.","Suddenly, the pressure of their escape intensified.","“Don’t look back! Just keep running!” Xue Yang shouted from behind them.","His combat experience far outstripped that of Jiu Chen and Jiang Ni.","He knew that the more they looked, the more terrified they’d become.","It would affect their state of mind.","Jiang Ni couldn’t help but worry. “Senior Xue Yang, are you alright from earlier?”","She had seen clearly how the brown liquid had corroded Xiong Zhan.","“I’m fine!” Xue Yang shook his head.","However, there was a brown mark on his arm.","Although the liquid hadn’t touched him directly, the toxic fumes had still corroded his arm.","Fortunately, it was only a flesh wound and didn’t affect his speed.","The three of them were so focused on fleeing that they failed to notice the massive figure chasing them from the depths of the water.","When the moment was right, and they were distracted, countless sharp bone spikes suddenly shot up from beneath the surface.","They moved so fast that even a six-step True Immortal would find it impossible to dodge.","Jiu Chen, with his heightened senses, was the first to feel the impending danger. He spun in midair, his face pointing downward, and caught sight of the deadly spikes.","“Watch out! Dodge!” he shouted as he pushed Jiang Ni away. A spike grazed his cheek, its icy sharpness slicing off half of his head.","The gruesome scene left Jiang Ni no time to process what had happened.","Before she could react, Xue Yang grabbed her arm and yanked her to the side.","Three more bone spikes shot up from where she had just been standing.","Jiang Ni had barely regained her composure when she saw yet another spike pierce through Jiu Chen’s chest.","Jiu Chen, having saved her moments earlier, didn’t have time to adjust his position. Already half of his head had been sheared off, and now, his slower reaction led to his body being impaled again.","His aura plummeted instantly.","“Senior Jiu Chen!”","Jiang Ni’s heart trembled.","Both Jiu Chen and Xue Yang had saved her.","They had been injured because of her.","“Go!” Xue Yang shouted, casting a glance at Jiu Chen, his eyes showing a hint of admiration."]},{"number":6422,"title":"Chapter 6422: Understanding Your Heart in Despair","paragraphs":["Chapter 6422: Understanding Your Heart in Despair","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang knew that Immortal Jiu Chen, being a true spirit, deeply desired to transform into a human and become a cultivator of the human race.","But now, in order to save Jiang Ni, he had plunged himself into a deadly situation without hesitation.","However, Jian Wushuang also knew that he wouldn’t allow Immortal Jiu Chen to perish.","He carried Jiang Ni and fled once again.","Jiang Ni struggled slightly; she wanted to do something. But when she saw that a part of Xue Yang’s sleeve had already become empty, her eyes instantly turned red.","Deep within her pupils, a green dot emerged.","Her entire body froze.","Sensing Jiang Ni’s change, Xue Yang’s lips curled into a faint smile before he suddenly vanished.","The Qijing Serpent, which had somehow appeared ahead of them, was the reason for his disappearance.","Behind them, hundreds of bone spikes were also hurtling through the air.","Xue Yang had no choice in that moment. He could only use one hand to push Jiang Ni out of the encirclement of the two forces.","In doing so, he lost his best chance to escape.","“Jiang Ni, live well! Escape!!”","At that moment, even though Xue Yang seemed to be acting a bit dramatic, he genuinely wanted to witness how this young girl, who had just come of age, would walk the path of a powerful cultivator, from the emperor of the mortal world to someone of true strength.","He hoped that this experience would help her elevate her state of mind and, after surviving this life-and-death ordeal, perhaps she would gain some insight into the Origin Source.","Though he knew that this was a crisis Jian Wushuang had orchestrated, if that day truly came, Xue Yang might do the same.","Risking everything to save someone.","It depended on who that someone was.","If it had been Xing Luo whom he pursued, he would have done it.","At that moment, a powerful aura surged from within Xue Yang. His entire being erupted, fists clenched, and with a furious roar, he charged straight at the Qijing Serpent.","As Jiang Ni watched Xue Yang charge forward without regard for his own life, the green dot in her eyes suddenly expanded.","It filled her entire gaze.","The green dot transformed into a sword.","At that moment, she stopped in her tracks, holding the divine sword in reverse, her body trembling.","A powerful energy enveloped her entire being.","She had never felt such a strong desire to become powerful.","It was an endless drive.","Only when a cultivator felt utterly powerless did the belief in their heart grow stronger.","This was Jiang Ni’s state at this moment.","Before, she had always followed the conventional path.","This time, after being thrown into the Twin Gods Palace by Jian Wushuang to hunt down a True Immortal, she had gone through battle after battle. Thanks to Xue Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen’s care, she hadn’t faced much pressure.","In her heart, she only thought about making up for her shortcomings in her next retreat.","She had never considered how far she wanted to go.","But now, she had a goal.","She wanted to become so powerful that nothing could threaten her.","As she felt Immortal Jiu Chen’s aura fade away, and watched Xue Yang sacrifice himself to cover their retreat, his body being corroded by the brown venom, his anguished cries of unbearable pain ignited the path to strength deep within her heart.","The sword in her hand, she didn’t know when it had turned green.","It was the breath of life.","The Sword of Life.","This was the swordsmanship that Jian Wushuang had passed down to Jiang Ni.","It contained the billionth part of the essence of his Life Sword.","Originally, according to Jiang Ni’s talent, it would have taken her a thousand years to comprehend, but now, within a hundred years, she had fully mastered it.","Don’t underestimate this billionth part—once she comprehended and mastered it, she would only be one step away from the ultimate swordsmanship.","The final step was also the simplest one, and Jian Wushuang could still guide her. Success wasn’t difficult at all.","The hard part was this Life Slash.","Mastering the essence was one thing, but slashing out its meaning was another.","Hidden among the tree roots, Jian Wushuang was shouting in his heart, “Slash it out, slash it out!”","Xue Yang, who was suffering from the torment of venom, was shouting too.","But he was just cursing Jian Wushuang.","Jiang Ni took a deep breath. She didn’t follow Xue Yang’s suggestion to flee but instead prepared to fight with all her might.","Back when Jian Wushuang taught her this strand of sword intent, he had said that once she mastered and unleashed this slash, it would be enough to kill a Dao Lord.","Because this was the Life Sword.","Jiang Ni’s body carried the bloodline of Jiang Shang, making her most sensitive to the power of life.","She also had the Root of Life within her.","Cultivating the Life Sword was the most suitable path for her.","As long as Jiang Ni continued on this path and reached its peak, although she didn’t possess Jian Wushuang’s Extreme Origin, she could rely on the ultimate swordsmanship Origin Source. By cultivating the Life Sword to perfection, she would still be able to slay Universe Gods below the Seven Stars.","Jian Wushuang’s Nine Swords of the Starry Sky wasn’t something anyone could learn.","The Life Sword required the power of life, the ultimate swordsmanship, and the Starry Sky Origin Source.","Jiang Ni had the first two, and it was already quite remarkable that she could unleash half of the Life Sword’s original power.","In Jian Wushuang’s view, the core of the Life Sword was life itself.","Swordsmanship was only secondary.","This was the greatest help to Jiang Ni.","Because her natural talent was in the Dao of Life.","Swordsmanship was something she learned later.","This was why Jian Wushuang had passed on this sword to her.","Now, it was up to Jiang Ni to see if she could slash it out.","When her trembling hands stopped shaking, and the sword in her hand no longer hummed.","The entire world seemed to quiet down. Jiang Ni’s eyes turned completely green, and in her gaze, the life of the entire world lay under her sword.","She swung it!","And slashed everything.","With the original belief she held, she no longer hesitated. Raising her hand, holding the sword, and slashing—it was all done in one fluid motion.","The mighty green sword energy swept across a million miles.","The power was so immense that if Jian Wushuang hadn’t blocked it, it would have alarmed Yang Dingtian and the others.","Jiang Ni had indeed slashed it out, and it had even exceeded Jian Wushuang’s expectations.","It was stronger than he had anticipated.","It had reached the point where it could kill a top-tier Dao Lord.","Although it couldn’t completely destroy the two divine beasts, it was enough to severely wound and repel them.","The sword energy spread, imbued with the true meaning of life, piercing through the two towering divine beasts.","Roar!","A miserable howl ended the battle.","Xue Yang’s body had already disappeared.","The two divine beasts sank into the depths of the lake.","The entire world fell silent, leaving only Jiang Ni standing there.","Her previously stern and sharp face suddenly shifted. At the moment she lost her opponents, a sense of emptiness welled up inside her.","She believed that both Xue Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen had perished.","They had both died to save her.","A deep sadness surged in her heart, the green in her eyes fading away, replaced by sorrow and crystal-clear tears.","At that moment, Jiang Ni was nothing more than a helpless little girl, crying her heart out.","She wanted to scream, to call for her mother, to call for Jian Wushuang.","To call for Immortal Jiu Chen and Xue Yang.","In the distance, three figures were watching Jiang Ni.","One of them, an elder in black robes with a stern face, looked worried and said, “Jian Wushuang, aren’t you being too harsh on her?”","“This little girl Jiang Ni has only lived for a little over a hundred years. She still has many shortcomings in her temperament!”","Xue Yang also felt that Jian Wushuang was being too severe and said, “Sometimes, when nurturing the younger generation, you can’t rush things!”","“She’s spent ninety percent of that hundred years in closed-door cultivation, lacking experience in the mortal world. This has caused her character to remain unchanged. If I didn’t make these arrangements, she’d suffer more in the future!” Jian Wushuang said calmly."]},{"number":6423,"title":"Chapter 6423: Your Own Path, Walk It Yourself","paragraphs":["Chapter 6423: Your Own Path, Walk It Yourself","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This time, Jian Wushuang pressured Jiang Ni to make her understand the path she needed to take.","It was the path of the strong.","The strong walk alone.","There could never always be someone by her side to protect her.","The last time she parted ways with family was with Jiang Shang.","But back then, Jiang Ni was too young to understand why they had to separate.","At its core, it was due to a lack of strength.","If her strength had been great enough, would Jiang Shang have left?","Although Jian Wushuang did not know why Jiang Shang left the Crimson Eyes Realm or why she had been separated from Jiang Ni for such a long time, even instructing her not to seek her out, he understood that it was because Jiang Shang was not powerful enough.","Jiang Ni’s cultivation and her Dao Heart had entirely depended on her mother, Jiang Shang.","It was like the driving force behind her progress.","But that wasn’t good.","One day, when she finally found Jiang Shang, her resolve would scatter.","Therefore, before Jiang Ni could reunite with Jiang Shang, her character had to be reshaped.","Rescuing her mother was just a side mission.","There were far more important tasks awaiting her.","At the beginning, familial ties did serve as a strong motivation for cultivation.","Jian Wushuang had been the same.","Even now, he still held onto the bond of master and disciple as a source of drive.","But the greater belief was in becoming the strongest!","To become the mightiest.","This was Jian Wushuang’s path.","He understood better than anyone how to cultivate the strong.","Now, in nurturing Jiang Ni, he merely applied his own understanding.","Although many might not understand why Jiang Ni was being burdened with so much, part of the reason stemmed from Jian Wushuang’s sense of guilt toward Jiang Shang.","Another part was because Jiang Ni would carry many burdens in the future.","Huì Qīng’s strength spoke for itself, and naturally, his daughter could not be a weakling.","The path of the strong was the right one.","The future of the world was unpredictable. Even Universe Gods could fall.","What hope would the weak have?","Thus, one must always strive for greater strength.","And as for Jiang Shang, even Jian Wushuang couldn’t discern her exact role in this world, clearly showing that she was entangled in some troubles of her own.","Jiang Ni had both her parents to look up to, so it was natural for her to work hard.","Rescuing her mother, breaking through this world, and heading toward the Realm God Continent to reunite her parents—this, too, was a source of motivation.","However, if this were told to Jiang Ni now, it could backfire.","After all, Jiang Ni had no real emotional connection with Huì Qīng; all that tied them together was their bloodline.","Thus, it couldn’t be revealed.","When the time was right, it would not be too late to speak of it.","Jiang Ni’s performance just now had greatly satisfied Jian Wushuang. Although her mind had been in turmoil, she had reached the point of touching the Origin Source due to the breakthrough she made in the face of danger.","She wasn’t far from the ultimate swordsmanship.","The rest would require his slow guidance.","“Alright, it’s time to go. I’ll leave a mark on Jiang Ni; she’ll be fine!”","After saying that, Jian Wushuang took Xue Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen and slowly disappeared into the void.","As for Jiang Ni!","She would have her own path to walk.","She shouldn’t follow him blindly.","Staying by his side would mean there was never any danger.","Moreover, if Jiang Ni discovered that Xue Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen hadn’t fallen, it wouldn’t restore her peace of mind. Instead, it would shatter it even further.","It was better to take this opportunity to leave Jiang Ni on her own to venture forth.","Secretly guiding her would be far better than keeping her by his side.","Because Jiang Ni had already passed the outburst period, what he needed now was enlightenment. Enlightenment wasn’t something that could be achieved with just a few pointers.","Moreover, even if enlightenment arrived, it would weaken one’s Thought power due to external influences.","Only constant stimulation could awaken a person’s true potential.","Xiang Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen were different. One was a super powerhouse among Universe Masters, and not far from becoming a Universe God. Furthermore, he was a prodigy from a noble family, with the most perfect path laid out for him.","As for Immortal Jiu Chen, he was a true spirit crafted by a semi-divine being. His peak Thought power wasn’t any weaker than a Special Life Form, and his physical body was made from the flesh of a peak-level Special Life Form in the universe.","He also carried the complete inheritance of the Master of Divine Fire in his mind.","Naturally, he didn’t need to take too many risks.","As long as they were given enough treasures, it wouldn’t be difficult for these two to cultivate all the way to the level of Universe Master.","This time, Jian Wushuang’s haul was substantial, and he had obtained a large number of treasures, most of which were given to his physical body.","At the Mahāparinirvāṇa Realm, the peak level of life was around two million times that of an ordinary lifeform.","Further improvement wasn’t possible.","It wasn’t that his soul couldn’t bear it, but rather that this realm couldn’t bear it.","To go higher, he needed the support of powerful Origin Source.","In other words, Jian Wushuang needed to become an Immortal True Immortal before his physical body could fully surpass the two-millionfold threshold.","At that time, he wouldn’t just have temporary bursts of strength, but rather permanent power.","If his physical body level exceeded five millionfold, he would need the augmentation of a Divine Body.","These were specific requirements.","They couldn’t be altered.","No matter how many more treasures were invested, it was impossible to increase further.","So, he stayed at that level.","The remaining treasures were given to Xiang Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen, to help them reach the immortal level sooner.","At that point, with the help of the treasures, they could be directly pushed to Dao Master Perfection.","As for becoming Unified Dao, that was beyond his control.","At that point, it would depend on their own fortunes.","It wasn’t that Jian Wushuang feared they would fail, but he worried that the time required would be too long.","“Forget it, it’s not time to worry about them; I’m stuck myself!” Jian Wushuang shook his head helplessly.","His speed as he traversed the void was extremely fast.","Within a quarter of an hour, he had left the Two-Faced God’s Mansion.","After leaving, he didn’t immediately leave the Ancient Sea Domain, but instead headed to Temple City.","He captured a strong expert from the Divine Eye Clan, one who had cultivated the Divine Eye Technique to its third transformation. He needed to study it carefully.","As soon as he entered Temple City, he sensed several strong auras in the city’s teleportation array.","Originally, he had planned to retreat and cultivate in Temple City for a while, but upon arriving, he realized that two forces had already descended.","One side belonged to the powerhouses from the Sacred Lands, while the other side consisted of experts from the Ancient Court.","Outside the teleportation array.","The two forces met. Other than releasing their auras, neither side spoke.","They merely exchanged glances before rushing together toward the Two-Faced God’s Mansion.","Clearly, they were after that piece of Chaos Supreme Treasure.","Jian Wushuang hadn’t taken that treasure.","He had left it on Two-Faced God Mountain.","He didn’t care much for that kind of treasure.","Aside from the Universe Ark, he no longer cared about such trivial items.","After all, his harvest this time had been substantial.","He had collected quite a few valuable treasures.","After the two forces of experts had left, Jian Wushuang visited a Treasure Pavilion, where he sold off some useless trinkets.","He exchanged them for thirty billion Immortal Crystals and also obtained a batch of Origin Source.","These were for Xiang Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen.","He also acquired two sets of peak-level Supreme Treasures.","Once these two reached Dao Master Perfection, with the help of these treasures and the complete Divine Eye Inheritance he had passed down, their combat power wouldn’t be any weaker than an Ultimate Dao Master.","In the future, no matter what troubles they encountered, they would be able to help him.","After finishing all this, Jian Wushuang made his way to God Mountain.","This time, he changed his appearance and aura.","Though his looks remained similar to before, his aura now matched that of a Nine-Step True Immortal.","Thus, the person receiving him was also a Seven-Step True Immortal from the mountain’s peak."]},{"number":6424,"title":"Chapter 6424: That Luan’s Fury","paragraphs":["Chapter 6424: That Luan’s Fury","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Senior, the mountaintop is divided into...” A young-looking female immortal with formidable strength stepped forward and began to explain proactively.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand and interrupted, “Reserve a Jiazi-numbered cave mansion for me. Here are ten Jiazi worth of immortal crystals!”","After speaking, he casually tossed the crystals to her, his demeanor cold, clearly not welcoming any further conversation.","The female immortal, having encountered many like him, understood that this type of person disliked idle chatter. Without hesitation, she led Jian Wushuang to a cave mansion situated along a cliff.","Jian Wushuang was satisfied. With a flicker of his figure, he entered the cave mansion.","The moment he stepped inside, the door of the cave mansion slammed shut with a booming sound.","The lamps within the cave mansion instantly lit up.","He exhaled a long breath and slowly closed his eyes.","At the same time, a wave of thought power entered the Nine Prison Pagoda.","The first level.","It was divided into two worlds.","One was a cave world he had created, meant for Xue Yang and the others to train in.","At that moment, the cave world was bustling with activity.","The ten True Immortals and four Guardians under the command of the Twin-Faced Buddha had all gathered.","To be cautious, Jian Wushuang had not immediately released these individuals but had left them in the cave world instead.","Along the way, they could also provide some entertainment for Xue Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen.","But the “entertainment” he referred to wasn’t for them to play games with the two.","Instead, it was for these True Immortals to suppress their powers and take turns sparring with the two, helping them grasp the Origin Source more quickly.","After sorting that out, Jian Wushuang entered the main world of the first level.","There, the slumbering Luan was still present.","Jian Wushuang’s figure floated over, and with a thought, the suppressive force dissipated. The moment it did, Luan, who had been sealed and asleep, immediately regained consciousness.","Realizing he was in an entirely unfamiliar world, Luan lifted his head and stared at Jian Wushuang in surprise.","“Who exactly are you? Why are you targeting my Divine Eye Clan?” Luan asked angrily.","To him, Jian Wushuang was undoubtedly a sworn enemy of the Divine Eye Clan.","Furthermore, the fact that Jian Wushuang had suppressed him here clearly indicated malicious intent.","He had already made up his mind: he would rather die than speak!","Seeing his intense reaction, Jian Wushuang raised his hand slightly and said calmly, “Luan, would you like to hear a story?”","“Hmph, say whatever you want, but I won’t tell you anything!” Luan turned his head away in defiance.","Jian Wushuang found his response amusing and proceeded to recount the story that the Giant God’s Eye had told him, though he embellished the details slightly for effect.","It was a story filled with helplessness.","The protagonist of the story had no choice but to make agonizing decisions in a situation akin to a trial by fire.","In the end, to save more lives, the protagonist abandoned his own clan.","After listening, Luan’s expression began to change.","Jian Wushuang had been very clear.","The reason the Divine Eye Clan was wiped out wasn’t due to the strength of their enemies.","In the Starry Sky, the Star Spirits were the true rulers.","The Divine Eye Clan had been the pinnacle race created by the Star Spirits—who would dare to annihilate them?","It could only have been the Star Spirits themselves.","Jian Wushuang faced the creation of the Star Spirit.","Speaking of the Star Spirit might confuse Yi Luan, so Jian Wushuang directly referred to the creator of the Divine Eye Clan.","“That’s impossible. You’re lying to me! You made up this story just to probe the secrets of my Divine Eye Clan!” Yi Luan retorted angrily.","Jian Wushuang didn’t bother explaining further. He flipped his hand and pulled out a token, upon which a massive eye was carved.","Casually, he tossed the token to Yi Luan.","“Take a look for yourself. This is the complete Nine Transformation Secret Technique of your Divine Eye Clan. Now think, who in the entire Divine Eye Clan has the right to possess such a token?” Jian Wushuang crossed his arms, completely unhurried.","Yi Luan grabbed the token, sensing the familiar yet awe-inspiring aura from it. His entire being trembled.","That aura stirred up his memories.","It brought him back to the era that belonged to the Divine Eye Clan.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang’s thought power activated, and the aura of the Nine Prison Pagoda silently descended.","The rules of the first layer began to function.","At this point, Jian Wushuang could connect with Yi Luan’s consciousness, including his thoughts and memories, as well as the Divine Eye Secret Technique he had cultivated.","At that moment, everything about Yi Luan was laid bare before Jian Wushuang.","In truth, Jian Wushuang didn’t need to tell Yi Luan any story at all. He only felt pity for him and a bit of guilt, so he decided to tell him the truth.","He urged them not to waste their time here but to try and continue cultivating.","Perhaps, one day, they might be able to escape.","After absorbing Yi Luan’s consciousness, Jian Wushuang no longer paid attention to him.","The first three transformations of the Divine Eye Secret Technique now clearly manifested in his mind, changing from a hazy concept to one of complete clarity.","This Divine Eye Secret Technique was truly worthy of being called the greatest forbidden technique in the Starry Sky.","The first three transformations could amplify one’s immortal power by a hundredfold.","If an ordinary Dao Master fully mastered the first three transformations, by burning their immortal power, they could instantly unleash a hundredfold increase in combat power.","In an instant, they could elevate themselves to become a peak Dao Master.","However, the first three transformations were extremely difficult to cultivate.","In the entire Ancient Domain World, the number of Dao Masters who could fuse two of the transformations of the Divine Eye Secret Technique could be counted on one hand.","However, those who succeeded were immensely powerful.","Their combat prowess was already extraordinary, and they were peak experts among Dao Masters. After burning the Divine Eye Secret Technique, they could erupt with ten to twenty times their usual power.","How could that not be overwhelming?","But burning immortal power ultimately consumed one’s Origin Source of immortality. Only after becoming an Emperor could one avoid depleting their Origin Source.","Because an Emperor’s Origin Source had already reached the level of controlling the Heavenly Dao.","Naturally, they wouldn’t be affected by such depletion.","Thus, the Holy Lord of the Ancient Domain World had walked down the wrong path of cultivation.","In fact, the Holy Lord should have understood when the Divine Eye Secret Technique could be the main focus of cultivation and when it should only be supplementary.","Yet, he had misguided cultivators, encouraging them to excessively cultivate the Divine Eye Secret Technique.","When Dao Masters fused two different inheritances, they could achieve the combat power of an extraordinary Emperor after reaching the Dao Fusion stage.","In truth, even after becoming an Emperor, cultivating the Divine Eye Secret Technique would still enhance combat power.","However, there was one thing the Holy Lord was right about.","At the True Immortal stage, cultivators had just grasped the Origin Source, gaining a significant boost in comprehension.","At this stage, cultivating the Divine Eye Secret Technique was indeed the fastest.","After becoming an Emperor, comprehension stagnated since their mastery was still limited to world-level Origin Sources, and their understanding was no longer as sharp as it had been at the True Immortal level.","To reach the next breakthrough, one would need to comprehend the Origin Source of the Universe.","So, while the Holy Lord’s argument held some merit, Jian Wushuang couldn’t fully agree.","He still believed there should be a proper order of cultivation.","Moreover, ordinary cultivators didn’t need to rush when cultivating the Divine Eye Secret Technique.","The nine transformations of the Divine Eye Secret Technique could make someone as powerful as a World Beast, capable of disregarding sheer power.","But at the very least, one needed the willpower and physical body of a World Beast to make it work.","Ordinary cultivators certainly didn’t have such conditions.","However, Jian Wushuang did, which allowed him to cultivate the Divine Eye Secret Technique ahead of time.","He didn’t even need to cultivate it personally. As long as he captured enough powerful members of the Divine Eye Clan, he could absorb more Divine Eye Secret Techniques from them.","He could progress to the ninth transformation effortlessly.","But to reach the ninth transformation of the Divine Eye Secret Technique, Jian Wushuang himself would at least need to become a Universe God.","Right now, it was beyond his reach.","His capture of Yi Luan this time was purely due to luck.","Yi Luan had ventured into dangerous territory, suffered serious injuries, and fled to the Ancient Domain World, where fate had led him into Jian Wushuang’s grasp."]},{"number":6425,"title":"Chapter 6425: A Waste of Time","paragraphs":["Chapter 6425: A Waste of Time","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","If that luan hadn’t been injured, Jian Wushuang wouldn’t have stood a chance against it.","At its peak, that luan had been an absolute powerhouse, a supreme being with a hundredfold combat power. It was far stronger than most at the Tribulation Realm, and Jian Wushuang naturally wasn’t its opponent.","Let alone capturing it, he wouldn’t even have had time to escape.","This time, thanks to catching the luan, his Divine Eye Secret Technique had advanced directly to the third level, and he had also unlocked the first three layers of the Nine Prison Pagoda in one go.","After comprehending the Divine Eye Secret Technique, he moved in a flash and went to the third layer, eager to see what the world there looked like.","When he entered, he was stunned to find that this place was practically a sacred land for cultivation. The energy was incredibly abundant, and its vastness could rival a cosmic secret realm. Even a whole race living here wouldn’t feel crowded.","“It seems Senior Brother Ghost Eye truly values his kin!”","Even though they were imprisoned, they were given a place where they could survive.","Jian Wushuang ventured into the depths of the Origin Source of the third layer, where cultivation was a million times more effective than in the outside world. The first layer had been a world deprived of resources, with a size comparable to a large world. He hadn’t yet explored the second layer, but it was bound to be much better than the first.","The third layer, however, directly rivaled a cosmic secret realm. He couldn’t even imagine what lay beyond this.","It was simply too extravagant.","No wonder a giant like the Star Spirit had assisted in refining the Nine Prison Pagoda back then.","He guessed that the world on the ninth layer might even compare to the Realm God Continent!","As this thought crossed his mind, Jian Wushuang shook his head abruptly. “No, I’m falling into a stacking logic here. The ninth layer corresponds to the ninth level of the Divine Eye Secret Technique. Even among the Divine Eye Clan, there probably aren’t more than a handful of people who can cultivate the technique to the ninth level, right? That layer doesn’t need to be as vast as the Realm God Continent, just a river of spacetime capable of accommodating Universe Gods and a universe-sized domain would be enough.”","He couldn’t help but chuckle at his own thoughts.","The world on the third layer was so vast likely because it housed the most people.","Almost every expert of the Divine Eye Clan could cultivate the Divine Eye Secret Technique to the third level, making it relatively easy for them. Hence, the third layer was vast.","With that thought, he prepared to take a look at the second layer as well.","Just as he turned to leave, a strange metal plate floated out from the depths of the Origin Source on the third layer.","Jian Wushuang frowned slightly and, with a gesture, grabbed the metal plate in his hand.","“Could this be something Senior Brother Ghost Eye left for me?” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","Looking at the metal plate in his hand, he noticed that it was covered with peculiar patterns and various lines.","It was profound, yet he had no clue what it meant.","Though Jian Wushuang’s current realm wasn’t particularly high, his knowledge and insight were far from lacking. Even with the will of the Realm Beast within him, he couldn’t make sense of the lines on the plate.","For a moment, he doubted his own judgment.","With just a single thought, his mind dove into the metal plate, and the lines on it seemed to latch onto his consciousness tightly.","It was a strange feeling, like being in a state of enlightenment. Time flowed rapidly around him.","If it hadn’t been for the person in charge of the Divine Mountain reminding him to renew his lease, he wouldn’t have even realized that a thousand years had passed.","The flow of time became clearer as he progressed, and after spending three thousand years, he finally understood the meaning behind the lines on the metal plate.","It was the life structure diagram of the Realm Beast.","Or rather, it was a construction blueprint for the Realm Beast.","He had only deciphered the life structure diagram, as well as the Origin Source diagram.","Yet, a crucial part of the life structure diagram seemed to be missing.","“Damn, I should have gone through the layers one by one. This metal plate from the third layer isn’t the first one!” He sighed, feeling frustrated.","He had wasted three thousand years for nothing.","Without hesitation, he flashed to the first layer. Sure enough, within the faint traces of the world’s Origin Source, another identical metal plate emerged.","After taking the metal plate, Jian Wushuang began studying the three patterns on it.","Life, soul, and Origin Source.","This time, he didn’t find it as exhausting.","In just three days, he completely comprehended them.","Upon finishing his study of the first complete metal plate, a small dark golden sphere appeared within his sea of consciousness.","On it was the image of an infant.","“Could this represent my age?” Jian Wushuang felt a bit surprised.","After comprehending the first metal plate, he didn’t feel significantly stronger.","However, his understanding of the Realm Beasts had deepened, and his progress in Origin Source had advanced rapidly.","The increase in his combat strength seemed negligible, but his comprehension ability had greatly improved.","“Time to get the second one!” Jian Wushuang’s eyes gleamed with joy.","He immediately set out for the second layer of the world.","The power here wasn’t as intense as the third layer, but the scope was far broader, like a broken universe.","He didn’t have time to admire the scenery.","In that dilapidated Origin Source, he acquired the metal plate and immediately immersed himself in comprehending it.","He accidentally began studying the third metal plate, and somehow managed to comprehend the life diagram on it.","This took him the longest, and there were still the soul and Origin Source diagrams left.","The soul diagram was easier; he had the will of the Realm Beast, making it not too difficult to comprehend.","But it still took him 3,000 years.","The Origin Source diagram, however, was troublesome. He had no clue where to begin. Even with his extraordinary comprehension, it might take tens of millions of years.","There was no helping it; he hadn’t yet grasped the chaotic Origin Source.","That Origin Source transcended the Starry Sky.","It was naturally difficult.","This second metal plate had three main diagrams.","He fully comprehended the life and soul diagrams within a year, but he got stuck on the Origin Source.","He remained stuck for 300 years.","“So that’s how it is! That’s how it is!”","Jian Wushuang, who had been sitting cross-legged in a desolate land, suddenly stood up. On this day, he had finally comprehended the Origin Source diagram on the second metal plate.","“Chaos is not truly chaos!”","Jian Wushuang closed his eyes slightly, feeling the satisfaction brought by the diagram.","“Chaos seems to go from existence to nothingness, and then from nothingness to existence again. To truly reach the highest realm of chaos, one must first abandon their original Origin Source!”","In that moment, Jian Wushuang broke through countless bottlenecks.","Now, he had finally gained some understanding of the chaotic Origin Source.","This could be considered the beginning.","He had not yet gained the recognition of the chaotic Origin Source.","But he could already wield the power of chaos, and his speed in comprehending it would be much faster from here on out.","After fully understanding the two metal plates, he began to focus on the third one.","The life diagram was already comprehended, leaving only the soul and Origin Source.","He chose the soul diagram.","If he hadn’t accumulated experience from the first two diagrams, it would have taken him at least 3,000 years to comprehend the soul diagram on the third metal plate.","But now, it only took him a little over a hundred years.","Had he not previously comprehended the life diagram on the third metal plate, it might have taken him around a hundred years as well.","From this, it was clear that in the domains of soul, life, and Origin Source, his weakest understanding was in Origin Source."]},{"number":6426,"title":"Chapter 6426: Sacrificial Dao","paragraphs":["Chapter 6426: Sacrificial Dao","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“The third Origin Source pattern is too profound. If I force myself to comprehend it, who knows how many years it will take. This is too time-consuming! Simply understanding it through continuous efforts won’t be enough; I must take the initiative myself!”","Jian Wushuang put away the metal board and began to comprehend the Origin Source.","After once again reflecting on his Ultimate Origin Source and the Ultimate Sword Dao Origin Source, he exhaled a long breath.","Next, he was going to make a bold move.","Sacrifice the Dao!","He intended to sacrifice his original Origin Source.","Then, he would carve out a new path—a path of Chaos Origin Source.","Originally, he had been reluctant to part with his Ultimate Dao and Sword Dao.","The Ultimate Dao encompassed the myriad paths, and the Sword Dao was the first among them.","If he were to sacrifice both, it would be like cutting off his own arms and legs.","If he failed to comprehend a satisfactory Chaos Origin Source by then, it would be akin to cutting off his own power, rendering his combat strength useless.","But Jian Wushuang had absolute confidence in himself.","That’s why he dared to be so bold.","“Let’s begin!”","Buzz!","Two Origin Source seedlings rose from within him.","These two Origin Sources had accompanied him for so long, and now, he was about to sacrifice them. A deep reluctance stirred within his heart.","But if the old doesn’t go, the new won’t come.","“Who would’ve thought that I’d also face such a trial of the Shura field, forced to make such a choice?” Jian Wushuang chuckled bitterly.","This choice, however, did not affect his Dao heart.","As the thought arose, the dark golden sphere within his Sea of Consciousness suddenly trembled.","The pattern of the infant above it began to shift as well.","Boom!","In the next moment, a mighty force instantly destroyed both the Ultimate Dao and the Sword Dao Origin Sources.","Jian Wushuang passed out on the spot.","The two Origin Sources, which had originally been a part of him, shattered completely and were subsequently absorbed by the dark golden sphere. In the end, not a trace of Origin Source energy remained in Jian Wushuang’s body.","The life, all things, death, space, time, and even the Starry Sky power encompassed by the Ultimate Dao—gone.","The same applied to the Sword Dao.","Now, only his original sword techniques remained in his mind, devoid of the Sword Intent they once carried.","Everything was gone.","He had sacrificed it all.","Jian Wushuang felt as if his heart was being torn apart, but he gritted his teeth and endured it.","Dizzy and light-headed, the dark golden sphere in his Sea of Consciousness became exceedingly active.","This signified his heightened sensitivity to the Chaos Origin Source.","The cultivation that would follow was now the most crucial moment.","He had to tread cautiously in his exploration of the Chaos Origin Source.","Over the next ten years following the sacrifice of his Dao, he finally gained the approval of the Chaos Origin Source.","By then, he had also comprehended the power of Chaos from within the Chaos itself.","This power was no longer the same as the previous Chaos power.","It was the true power from the Chaos realm.","Back then, when he used Chaos power within the Starry Sky, it had actually still been derived from the Starry Sky.","It was not from the Chaos realm itself.","This was akin to using Starry Sky power within the space-time continuum.","In fact, that power came from the Starry Sky forces that were intertwined with space-time.","That power was ultimately impure.","This was also why Universe Gods didn’t use space-time power.","Because Universe Gods were not space-time gods.","Universe Gods could unleash Universe power to its most perfect level.","The same applied to space-time gods.","If they were to swap powers or both cultivate the strongest Starry Sky power, the combat strength they exhibited wouldn’t increase because of it. On the contrary, it would weaken.","This was one of the reasons for sacrificing his Origin Source.","If Jian Wushuang had followed the original path, he could have reached the pinnacle of the Starry Sky.","He could have become a superpower within the Starry Sky.","But in the end, how far could he really go?","Reaching the level of a Star Spirit Messenger would have already been quite impressive.","The God of Time and Space was a major obstacle.","Even if he could surpass the Starry Sky God, he would still be at the limits of the Starry Sky.","He would never be able to surpass the Star Spirits or that God King.","Ultimately, he would never be the strongest.","The old path was fine for others.","But for someone like him, chosen by Teacher Xuan Yi, it was the wrong path.","He needed to forge a stronger path.","A path beyond the Starry Sky.","His limits were not merely the Star Spirits. He needed to become powerful enough to carve out his own Starry Sky.","That was what it meant to be truly strong.","“My Origin Source has reached a bottleneck again. I should start comprehending the third Origin Source diagram!” Jian Wushuang thought to himself and immediately summoned the third Origin Source diagram.","This time, he felt no pressure while comprehending it.","Although it wasn’t as profound as the diagrams of life and soul, his speed was significantly faster than before.","It only took him five thousand years to fully comprehend it.","This was beyond his expectations.","After all, he had yet to fully master the Chaotic Origin Source, so being able to comprehend the third diagram in five thousand years was already impressive.","After fully understanding the three metal plates, he finally had the time to study the material of the plates and their connections.","These items were the most precious things he possessed.","Without the metal plates, who knew how long it would have taken him to master the Chaotic Origin Source?","He had been searching everywhere for opportunities, only to find that the opportunity was right by his side all along.","Hidden in plain sight.","It was his carelessness back then that cost him so much time.","If he had obtained the first metal plate earlier, he wouldn’t have wasted so much time.","This time, his retreat had lasted over ten thousand years.","Thankfully, when it came time to extend his stay in the cave, he had directly thrown down a billion Immortal Crystals to buy the cave residence outright.","At that time, he hadn’t even asked for the price. He just threw the money at them, securing a permanent residence.","During these ten thousand years, he had comprehended the three metal plates and mastered a new form of Chaotic Power.","It was equivalent to being recognized by the Chaotic Origin Source, and now he just needed to fully grasp it.","Only by mastering the Chaotic Origin Source could he wield infinite Chaotic Power.","For the next stage, he split his consciousness into two parts—one part focused on studying the three metal plates, and the other continued to comprehend the Chaotic Origin Source.","From nothing to mastery, ten thousand years was already fast.","After a hundred more years of seclusion, he once again encountered a bottleneck on the path of mastering the Chaotic Origin Source.","However, he made a significant breakthrough with the metal plates.","The two streams of consciousness fused into one.","Before him floated the three metal plates, and Jian Wushuang couldn’t hide the joy on his face.","In these hundred years, he had thoroughly examined the plates, not even missing damage as small as a particle.","At last, he had made a new discovery.","Though, in hindsight, this discovery seemed almost obvious.","When the three metal plates were stacked together, the overlapping and chaotic lines revealed the unique script of the God Eye Clan.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but curse his Ghost Eye Senior Brother. He was truly too crafty.","To think he had hidden it this deeply.","If Jian Wushuang hadn’t absorbed the memories of Yi Luan and learned all the scripts of the God Eye Clan, including the ancient language of the first generation, he wouldn’t have noticed it at all.","After translating all the characters, Jian Wushuang’s mind began to work rapidly. After reviewing it over a billion times in just one day, and confirming that there were no errors in the hidden script, he finally started to savor the message that his Ghost Eye Senior Brother had left for him."]},{"number":6427,"title":"Chapter 6427: Proud Senior Brother","paragraphs":["Chapter 6427: Proud Senior Brother","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Junior brother, by the time you see this letter, I assume you’ve already comprehended the Origin Source of Disorder. First, let me congratulate you, junior brother. Understanding the Origin Source of Disorder is the first step forward, and I’m already looking forward to our meeting in the future!”","The first few lines stirred something bittersweet in Jian Wushuang’s heart. He thought of how his senior brother had schemed within the clan to help him. Yet, he hadn’t comprehended the Origin Source of Disorder, leaving him feeling guilty toward Ghost Eye Senior Brother.","The second part of the letter read: “I’m not sure what level of Origin Source you’ve comprehended, but most likely you realized it while studying the third piece of the Xuan Yi Codex. In that case, the Origin Source you’ve grasped is probably of a high-level Realm Beast. Although it falls just short of mine, I’m certain with your extraordinary talent, you’ll make up for it in the future!”","This line came across as a bit arrogant, making Jian Wushuang’s initial feelings of guilt vanish.","“I didn’t expect my senior brother to be so full of himself!” Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but let a slight smile creep onto his face. His mood lightened.","The third part of the letter explained the hierarchy of the Origin Source, as Ghost Eye Senior Brother outlined its ranks.","It was quite similar to those within the Starry Sky.","No!","It was the Starry Sky that mirrored the hierarchy of the Realm Beast’s Origin Source.","The categorization of Origin Sources in the Land of Disorder was straightforward and brutal.","Elementary, Intermediate, Advanced, Pinnacle, Supreme, and Sovereign.","An elementary Realm Beast’s Origin Source was the weakest.","In the Land of Disorder, even the weakest Realm Beasts, who controlled the Origin Source of Disorder, wielded the elementary Origin Source.","Though these Realm Beasts could still stir up storms in the Land of Disorder and summon their paths at will—creating whatever they desired within their domain—the gap between them and a master of the high-level Realm Beast Origin Source was vast.","For example, take two Realm Beasts.","One possessed the elementary Origin Source, while the other wielded the high-level Origin Source.","The sword dao they condensed would differ in essence.","A Realm Beast with an elementary Origin Source might only be able to summon a fifth-grade sword dao.","However, a Realm Beast with a high-level Origin Source could summon a third-grade or even a second-grade sword dao.","The disparity manifested in this fundamental difference.","When Ghost Eye Senior Brother claimed he was slightly stronger, he was likely referring to the pinnacle-level Realm Beast Origin Source.","Based on Jian Wushuang’s understanding of Moluo Sa’s Origin Source, he deduced that Moluo Sa’s was a high-level Origin Source.","Even with just a high-level Origin Source, Moluo Sa’s power could devour pinnacle-level Space-Time Gods and even pose a threat to Starry Sky Gods.","A Realm Beast with a pinnacle Origin Source could likely rival a Star Spirit.","From this, Jian Wushuang inferred that Ghost Eye Senior Brother’s strength should be at the level of a Star Spirit.","Combined with the immense power of Master Xuan Yi and the treasures he held, Jian Wushuang felt more confident in Ghost Eye Senior Brother’s abilities compared to that of a Star Spirit.","“So, does that mean, in the future, I’ll have at least the battle power of a Star Spirit?” Jian Wushuang licked his lips in anticipation.","Jian Wushuang felt an inexplicable excitement deep in his heart.","The power of the Star Spirits had always been something he yearned for.","If he could reach the level of a Star Spirit, while he wouldn’t say he would be fully satisfied, he would certainly be thrilled.","There was also the matter of the *Xuanyi Scripture*.","The metal plate was called the *Xuanyi Scripture*, and judging by the title, it was most likely something left behind by Master Xuanyi.","It was probably a unique treasure.","Apart from some boasting about the Chaos Land, Senior Brother Ghost Eye had instructed him to improve his strength as quickly as possible.","Finally, he had reminded him to treat the Divine Eye Clan kindly.","That was something Jian Wushuang took to heart.","If he didn’t have to kill, he wouldn’t.","As long as they weren’t utterly evil, he wouldn’t strike them down.","Besides, he still needed to bring the Divine Eye Clan into his fold and open higher levels.","At that time, there would be more *Xuanyi Scripture* to enhance his understanding of the *Origin Source*.","The *Xuanyi Scripture* consisted of three initial volumes.","Comprehending the first volume was equivalent to grasping the fundamentals of the *Origin Source*.","Comprehending the second volume was equivalent to understanding the intermediate *Origin Source*.","And if one could grasp the third volume, it would mean they had mastered the *Origin Source of Chaos*, which was the highest form of *Origin Source*.","At present, Jian Wushuang hadn’t yet comprehended any *Origin Source*.","He had initially been quite anxious about this.","But now, he wasn’t in such a hurry anymore.","The fourth volume of the *Xuanyi Scripture* corresponded to the *Origin Source* of a top-tier Realm Beast.","The fifth volume corresponded to the *Origin Source* of a peak Realm Beast.","The sixth volume corresponded to the *Origin Source* of a Realm Beast King.","Obviously, the further one progressed, the stronger the comprehension became.","But it also grew increasingly difficult.","He held deep admiration for Senior Brother Ghost Eye.","Back then, no one had given Ghost Eye the *Nine Prison Pagoda*. Even with the complete *Xuanyi Scripture*, without the assistance of the Divine Eye Secret Technique, it would have been much harder to comprehend the *Origin Source* of a top-tier Realm Beast.","In that era, Ghost Eye must have painstakingly cultivated the *Xuanyi Scripture*, mastering the fourth volume and comprehending the *Origin Source of Chaos*.","He continued to cultivate through the ninth volume, becoming a supreme existence and later creating the great *Divine Eye Secret Technique*.","This was because the *Divine Eye Secret Technique* was essentially an abbreviated version of the *Xuanyi Scripture*.","Jian Wushuang, having the *Divine Eye Secret Technique*, didn’t even need the *Nine Prison Pagoda*. He could progress step by step through cultivation, then study the *Xuanyi Scripture*. His current cultivation environment was far superior to that of Senior Brother Ghost Eye.","Not to mention, he didn’t need to spend time cultivating the *Divine Eye Secret Technique*. He could directly comprehend the *Xuanyi Scripture*.","Without the *Divine Eye Secret Technique*, it would have taken him hundreds of years just to comprehend the first volume of the *Xuanyi Scripture*. The later stages would have been even more daunting.","At this thought, Jian Wushuang couldn’t even begin to imagine how Senior Brother Ghost Eye had managed to cultivate back then.","The pain and difficulty must have been beyond imagination.","Jian Wushuang felt more like a cultivator reaping the fruits of someone else’s labor.","Although the road ahead seemed like it required his own steps, in reality, it had all been paved by others.","How to walk, and which path to take, had been carefully considered for him. And now, with the help of the *Divine Eye Secret Technique*, he could cultivate the *Xuanyi Scripture*.","One could say it was an ideal start.","“Strangely, now that I have a direction, I feel a bit of disappointment!” Jian Wushuang sighed helplessly.","Before, when he had no clue where to begin, he had been more anxious than anyone, constantly seeking an entry point.","Now, having gained recognition from the *Origin Source* of the Realm Beasts, according to his calculations, the fourth or fifth volume of the *Xuanyi Scripture* would enable him to master the *Origin Source of Chaos*.","And it would be a top-tier Realm Beast *Origin Source*.","If he could master the *Origin Source of Chaos* with the fifth volume of the *Xuanyi Scripture*, that would be the peak Realm Beast *Origin Source*.","Should he complete the first six volumes of the *Xuanyi Scripture*, he would be able to master the *Origin Source* of a Realm Beast King.","At the moment, Jian Wushuang knew next to nothing about the Realm Beast Kings.","But judging from the twelve Star Spirits in the Starry Sky and the Divine King, he could infer their power.","First, the high-tier Realm Beast *Origin Source* of Morasa was no match for the Star Spirits.","Perhaps a top-tier Realm Beast *Origin Source* could rival a Star Spirit, but even then, it might not be a true match.","From Jian Wushuang’s deduction, the *Origin Source* of the Star Spirits came from the Starry Sky itself.","When the Starry Sky was first established, countless Realm Beasts had fused with it.","Among them, the Divine King was the most powerful.","He was likely a super Realm Beast who had mastered the *Origin Source* of a Realm Beast King.","Next was the Great Priest, whose *Origin Source* likely matched the peak Realm Beast *Origin Source*.","As for the remaining eleven Star Spirits, their *Origin Sources* were on par with top-tier *Origin Sources*.","The words of the Titan Star Spirit revealed a sense of guilt toward Ghost Eye, as well as a hint of pride.","It was clear that Ghost Eye had either matched or even surpassed the Titan Star Spirit.","Otherwise, the Titan wouldn’t have held him in such high regard."]},{"number":6428,"title":"Chapter 6428: The Origin of the God King","paragraphs":["Chapter 6428: The Origin of the God King","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Based on his speculation, the God King had mastered the Origin Source of the King of Realm Beasts.","If he wanted to become the first in the Starry Sky, he had to first master the Origin Source of the King of Realm Beasts.","“That battle back then... although my memory was erased, I saw the scene of defeat!”","Jian Wushuang clenched his fist, his eyes filled with determination as he said, “No matter what, I will win next time!”","Entering this world to rebuild himself felt like he was re-cultivating in the Starry Sky after failing in the Land of Disorder.","There was an unspeakable connection between the two.","But he would seize the perfect opportunity.","He was determined to become the strongest.","The Origin Source of a higher-level Realm Beast?","It was indeed powerful, and upon mastering it and reaching the pinnacle, one could become an existence like Morosa.","However, Jian Wushuang had witnessed beings even more powerful than Morosa, so he naturally did not care for that.","The Star Spirits were not his goal, nor was the God King.","What he aimed for was to surpass everything.","He even sought to surpass his own master, Xuan Yi.","Only by doing so could he win it all.","“Now that I’ve comprehended the third volume of the Xuan Yi Scripture, I’m just a step away from mastering the Origin Source of Disorder. When I delve into the Xuan Yi Scripture next time, I might unknowingly grasp it!”","He began to worry about cultivating the fourth volume of the Xuan Yi Scripture.","If, by chance, he comprehended the Origin Source of a top-tier Realm Beast during an epiphany, it would be a great loss.","Therefore, he had to prepare in advance.","When it came to controlling his level, he had experience.","If one wanted to grow stronger, they had to be ruthless.","To suppress himself, he first had to cripple himself.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath. He had never been afraid of being ruthless.","Without any hesitation, he immediately obliterated the strand of disorderly power he had painstakingly mastered.","He sacrificed it completely.","Of course, that was far from enough. Being ruthless didn’t necessarily mean becoming stronger.","Besides obliterating his mastered disorderly power, he also began to comprehend each rule within the disorder.","In meticulous detail.","From one main path, countless branches diverged.","The difficulty of mastering the Origin Source instantly increased by several levels.","After completing all this, he finally felt at ease.","He exhaled deeply, but suddenly sensed something was wrong.","He was still far from unlocking the fourth layer!","As for the fourth transformation of the Divine Eye Technique, relying on his own insight to comprehend it would take a million, even tens of millions of years.","Because of the Nine Prison Pagoda, he didn’t need to comprehend the Divine Eye Technique.","However, he still had to capture a powerful expert from the Divine Eye Clan!","To unlock the fourth layer, he needed an expert from the Divine Eye Clan who had cultivated the Divine Eye Technique to the fourth transformation.","But he had also found two other paths through his senior brother, Ghost Eye’s words.","The first was still to capture an expert from the Divine Eye Clan, but the requirements were lower. To unlock the fourth layer, suppressing a hundred Divine Eye Clan cultivators who had perfected the Divine Eye Technique would also work.","In other words, he had to suppress a hundred experts like Yiluan, a Divine Eye Clan expert.","When he saw this requirement, he realized there wasn’t much hope.","With his current strength, it was simply impossible.","Moreover, he had just sacrificed his disorderly power.","That was his only strong combat method in the early stages.","He had sacrificed it to control his level.","It wasn’t a big deal, since it was for the sake of becoming stronger.","But there was no need to sacrifice it so early!","It would have been better to wait until he unlocked the fourth layer before sacrificing his disorderly power.","Jian Wushuang felt a wave of regret.","Now that he no longer had disorderly power, he could still handle emperors, but against someone like the Holy Lord or the Ancient Court Master, he was definitely no match.","After all, he was only at the peak of the Great Completion stage. If he still had the power of Disorder, he might still stand a chance in battle.","But now that the power of Disorder was gone, at most, he could only match the strength of a fourth-tier Emperor.","Great Completion stage, equivalent to a fourth-tier Emperor.","If anyone heard that, they definitely wouldn’t believe it.","But for Jian Wushuang now, that strength was far too weak.","“Dealing with the Divine Eye Clan is a bit unrealistic, and I can’t even find any other members of the Divine Eye Clan. Without a cosmic boat, relying solely on my speed, I can’t even leave the Ancient Domain World, let alone travel across the universe.”","Jian Wushuang shook his head.","In truth, he still had one more option, and that was to build his own force.","To cultivate a force specifically aimed at the Divine Eye Clan.","Or, to cultivate an organization that focused solely on dealing with practitioners of the Divine Eye Secret Technique.","The second path that Senior Brother Ghost Eye had left for him was to suppress those strong individuals who cultivated the Divine Eye Secret Technique.","But he would need to capture more.","Because the people who practiced the Divine Eye Secret Technique were not pure practitioners.","The first five stages were acceptable.","Most worlds could cultivate them completely.","Except for the Ancient Domain World, after all, only one holy ground there transmitted the complete first five stages.","Many claimed to have learned the Divine Eye Secret Technique from inherited sequences.","It was too chaotic.","Who knew how many strong cultivators practicing the Divine Eye Secret Technique he would need to capture?","At least in the entire Ancient Domain World, there were only four Emperors who had cultivated the second stage of the Divine Eye Secret Technique.","Of those, three were only halfway there.","Even if you included the Dao Masters, packing up the entire Ancient Domain World wouldn’t be enough to match a single Na’Yiluan.","This path could wait until he roamed the universe and visited myriad worlds.","For now, he still needed to pry some information out of Na’Yiluan, at least to gain some direction.","Or learn more about the internal situation of the Divine Eye Clan.","He had to be prepared for something.","Lastly, there was his own issue.","His strength wasn’t enough. To grasp the Origin of the Realm Beast King, he needed to open the sixth level of the Nine Prison Pagoda before mastering the Origin.","And that meant he needed a Divine Eye Clan expert who had cultivated the sixth stage of the Divine Eye Secret Technique.","Not to mention the sixth stage, even now, he couldn’t defeat a practitioner who had mastered the third stage of the Divine Eye Secret Technique.","No!","He couldn’t even defeat a second-stage practitioner.","The only reason he had gained an advantage was because of Na’Yiluan, who had allowed him to make a windfall.","The Divine Eye Clan, with their secret method, were far stronger than ordinary clans. The first stage alone was invincible among Dao Masters, comparable to the strongest Ultimate Dao Masters.","A practitioner who had completed the second stage was among the strongest Emperors, with the weakest possessing the strength of a fourth-tier, and the strongest reaching the level of a sixth-tier Emperor.","A third-stage practitioner was a supreme expert, and Na’Yiluan belonged to this level.","A fourth-stage practitioner corresponded to the Tribulation Realm.","A fifth-stage practitioner was at the level of a Universe Master.","The sixth stage likely corresponded to a six-tribulation Universe Master.","Yet Jian Wushuang was just someone in the Great Completion stage who hadn’t even grasped the Origin. How could he possibly fight against a six-tribulation Universe Master from the Divine Eye Clan?","Jian Wushuang lowered his head, contemplating his resources.","He had the Nine Prison Pagoda, a weapon to suppress the Divine Eye Clan.","If his strength were on par with theirs, he could use the Nine Prison Pagoda to completely crush any Divine Eye Clan expert.","But the gap in power was too great now, nullifying any advantage from the Nine Prison Pagoda.","Aside from the Nine Prison Pagoda, he had his Realm Lord’s physical body and the soul and will of the Realm Beast.","These were also shaky advantages.","He could easily sweep through Dao Masters, but facing Emperors below the fourth tier was already a challenge.","With some time on his hands, he needed to carefully re-plan how to enhance his combat strength.","At present, he didn’t have many treasures left. He had already sacrificed both his Sword Dao and Extreme Dao.","The power of Disorder was also gone.","He was left with only the advantages of his physical body and his soul and willpower.","“My body!” Jian Wushuang blinked.","That was mortal strength, and no matter how powerful it became, it would be useless.","In the end, it was still necessary to aid the Divine Body for it to become truly valuable.","As for his soul and willpower..."]},{"number":6429,"title":"Chapter 6429: Testing","paragraphs":["Chapter 6429: Testing","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was indeed intriguing.","“My soul power is far stronger than that of an Emperor or even a Universe Master. I can create a soul secret technique and, while I’m at it, forge a soul-related innate treasure that could at least unleash the power of a top-tier Emperor!”","Jian Wushuang immediately began searching for the soul secret techniques he had cultivated in the past.","Since none were suitable for his current needs, he split off a portion of his mind to create a Universe-level soul secret technique.","He was determined to showcase all his strengths.","Having cultivated three volumes of the Xuan Yi Sutra, not only had his Origin Source grown stronger, but his physical body and soul had also been fortified.","Now, there was still the matter of further enhancing his body.","At that moment, he thought of the divine blood he had obtained.","He pulled out a drop of silver divine blood.","Connecting it to his ability of being formless and shapeless, which allowed him to change his form at will, he realized he could transform into a powerful member of the Divine Eye Clan.","“Transform!”","With a flicker, he morphed into a member of the Divine Eye Clan.","The Divine Eye Clan indeed resembled the World Beasts in a way—they both had a single eye.","Reflecting on the appearance of the Titan Star Spirit, it looked remarkably similar to the single-eyed World Beast.","It wasn’t surprising that the Divine Eye Clan’s creator had fashioned them in this way. The appearance and abilities of the Divine Eye Clan were clearly custom-designed based on the creator’s own image.","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly.","He then began to study the silver blood.","“What exactly is hidden within this blood?”","Jian Wushuang pondered over it for quite some time, but he couldn’t make out any clues.","Just then, a voice transmission from the First Layer World reached him, prompting him to pause.","“Has this guy finally come to his senses?” Jian Wushuang smiled calmly.","After leaving the other party hanging for so long, he wondered what kind of surprises awaited him.","In the First Layer World, at the center of a barren land, that one-eyed creature leaned against a damaged treasure, nurturing his body.","Upon entering this place, he had discovered that his injuries were slowly healing.","However, his combat strength remained suppressed.","The sensation was indescribable, much like the words Jian Wushuang had spoken to him earlier.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang’s figure appeared in the distance and approached with steady steps.","As he drew near, Jian Wushuang tilted his head, glancing at the damaged treasure hovering behind the one-eyed creature, and remarked in surprise, “A damaged Universe treasure? You’ve certainly got quite a collection of rare items on you!”","“You?” The one-eyed creature was utterly shocked at Jian Wushuang’s sudden appearance, his eyes wide with disbelief.","Jian Wushuang didn’t immediately realize what the issue was and took a quick look around the area.","“What’s wrong with you? Weren’t you the one who called me here?”","The one-eyed creature stared at him in terror, stammering, “You... you’re also from the Divine Eye Clan!!!”","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but laugh.","It was only then that he remembered he had transformed into a member of the Divine Eye Clan and had forgotten to revert back.","Having spent the last ten thousand years focused entirely on cultivation, he hadn’t paid much attention to his appearance, sometimes even training in the form of a World Beast.","Realizing his mistake, Jian Wushuang decided to roll with it. “Heh, I know all the secrets of the Divine Eye Clan. If I weren’t one of them, wouldn’t that be even more shocking?”","“But why would you suppress your own kind? Are you... are you the creator of our Divine Eye Clan?” The one-eyed creature seemed to have stumbled upon an earth-shattering secret of his race.","Jian Wushuang pretended to be solemn as he said, “I’m not like him!”","After speaking, he shook his head and sat quietly to the side, not initiating any further conversation.","“By the way, why did you call me here?” he asked.","“I was just testing to see if you were still here!” Yiluan forced a bitter smile.","Hearing that there was nothing wrong, Jian Wushuang turned around, pretending to leave.","This time, Yiluan panicked a little. He was now more curious about his own tribe than Jian Wushuang was.","“Wait!”","Jian Wushuang’s lips curled into a smile. He slowly turned around and said, “What? Do you think I have time to waste on your nonsense?”","“Don’t you want to know the whereabouts of the other Divine Eye Clan members?” Yiluan probed.","This time, Jian Wushuang’s interest was piqued.","He truly did want to know. Even if they were not his opponents, it was still important to be aware of where the Divine Eye Clan’s experts were, what their strength was, and what their internal structure looked like.","“Speak, what do you want in exchange?” Jian Wushuang stopped, found a place to sit, and assumed a posture as if he were ready to negotiate.","Yiluan’s eyes darted around for a moment before he spoke. “I want to know your identity. Why are you suppressing the Divine Eye Clan? Could it really be that you violated the Supreme Rules?”","“You guessed right. I did indeed violate the Supreme Rules,” Jian Wushuang admitted without any hesitation, nodding his head.","This left Yiluan at a loss for words. He clearly didn’t believe it.","Before Yiluan could speak again, Jian Wushuang cut him off. “Now it’s your turn to answer my question. Where did you encounter the Divine Eye Clan’s experts?”","“You haven’t told me your identity yet!” Yiluan retorted.","“My name is Jian Wushuang. I specialize in suppressing the Divine Eye Clan as the divine emissary. If you don’t believe me, there’s nothing I can do.”","This time, Yiluan didn’t argue. Instead, he nodded and said, “I believe you.”","He had no choice but to believe it now because, after mulling over what Jian Wushuang had said earlier, Yiluan felt that it might actually be possible.","Moreover, after Jian Wushuang had suppressed him, he hadn’t killed him or asked any further questions about the Divine Eye Clan.","During the tens of thousands of years that had passed, Yiluan had no idea what Jian Wushuang had been doing. He couldn’t help but send him a telepathic message.","Seeing that Yiluan had taken the bait, Jian Wushuang was in no hurry. He leisurely said, “Your strength is quite impressive. You have peak combat power, and your Divine Eye secret technique has reached the third transformation in its perfected form. If it weren’t for your serious injuries, you would’ve had a great chance of becoming a Tribulation-level expert.”","“Your Excellency flatters me. I know my limits well. Before the Great Destruction, I had already reached the peak, but after so many years of recovery, I’ve made no progress. With this injury, I’ve long lost all hope,” Yiluan said with a bitter smile, shaking his head.","Indeed, his talent was quite average.","His combat power relied on his clan’s innate abilities and the Divine Eye secret technique.","Otherwise, among the human race, he would at most be a fourth-stage Emperor. On the Realm God Continent, he would be as common as dirt.","Jian Wushuang, however, gave him hope. “If you were out in the world, you really wouldn’t have any hope. But here, you still have a chance. Not only can you recover from your injuries, but you also have the opportunity to take that crucial next step!”","“You must be joking!” Yiluan scoffed.","Seeing his disbelief, Jian Wushuang immediately shifted the space around them.","From the first layer, they directly entered the third layer.","Moreover, it was the Origin Source within the third layer.","The power and Origin Source here were incredibly abundant, a million times more potent than the outside world.","One could say this was the very core of the entire universe.","At first, Yiluan was astonished by Jian Wushuang’s strength, as he could easily shift between spaces. He was also shocked by this treasure, which was specifically designed to suppress their Divine Eye Clan, and its ability to shift locations at will.","However, when he sensed the power here, his entire being instantly became invigorated.","Jian Wushuang didn’t hide anything from him and revealed some of the specific functions of the Nine Prison Pagoda.","This time, Yiluan remained silent."]},{"number":6430,"title":"Chapter 6430: Nash Universe","paragraphs":["Chapter 6430: Nash Universe","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He sat cross-legged in the depths of the Origin Source, not uttering a single word.","Jian Wushuang knew the other was deep in thought.","Thus, he wasn’t in a hurry to threaten or entice him.","He didn’t even bring up the previous topic again.","After an hour had passed, Jian Wushuang took out a teapot, brewing tea by himself. Finally having some rare free time, he naturally wanted to make the most of it.","When YiNa Yiluan opened his eyes, he turned and glanced mockingly at Jian Wushuang, saying, “What’s the point of just drinking tea?”","“How about some wine?”","Hearing his tone, Jian Wushuang immediately knew this guy was about to relent.","“Sure, it’s been a while since I’ve had any. I wonder if you have some good wine?” YiNa Yiluan teased.","Jian Wushuang really didn’t have any wine.","The tea set was something he had obtained from the hands of slain cultivators.","But the wine had long been discarded.","He thought it took up too much space.","Without hesitation, he reached out with his thoughts and contacted the Four Guardians of the Dual-faced Buddha.","He managed to obtain two pots of fine wine.","Casually tossing one pot to YiNa Yiluan, he watched as the other removed the cork, took a sniff, and then chuckled, “Let’s stick with tea!”","Clearly, YiNa Yiluan wasn’t impressed with the wine Jian Wushuang had given him.","Truthfully, even Jian Wushuang wasn’t satisfied with it.","Back in the day, what kind of wine had he been drinking?","A single pot of wine could rival the value of an entire Universe, and it was even possible to brew wine using the resources of a Universe.","Now drinking this stuff was simply adding to his frustration.","Tea, on the other hand, was fine. The more mundane it was, the more one could appreciate its subtleties.","As they sipped tea, the two chatted leisurely.","It was as though they were old friends who had known each other for years.","This time, neither of them held anything back.","Jian Wushuang only omitted information about his identity in the outside world and his cultivation path. Other than that, he concealed nothing.","YiNa Yiluan, on the other hand, shared a great deal, holding back the least.","This guy could really talk.","Starting from his birth, he talked for three whole days and nights.","The first two days were spent talking about himself, and on the last day, he finally spoke of the Divine Eye Clan.","From the mouth of a peak-level cultivator, Jian Wushuang seemed to glimpse a glimpse of that once-great civilization.","The Divine Eye Clan.","They had spread throughout the Starry Sky, the dimensions of time and space, and the Realm God Continent.","YiNa Yiluan was a member of a branch of the Divine Eye Clan located on the Realm God Continent.","He hadn’t lived for too long.","Shortly after his birth, having reached the peak for less than ten thousand years, he encountered the Great Catastrophe.","This was the source of the Divine Eye Clan’s extinction.","The Realm God Continent shattered.","Nearly all of the Divine Eye Clan perished.","Because most of the clan’s strongest members resided on the Realm God Continent.","Thus, the Realm God Continent became the most heavily drained region at the time.","Even if it hadn’t been broken by the Realm Beasts, it would have been difficult to repair later on, and it still would have collapsed.","After the Realm God Continent shattered, the surviving members of the Divine Eye Clan, as well as the deceased cultivators of the clan, were all sealed within this world.","YiNa Yiluan didn’t know the name of this place.","He only knew that, after accidentally awakening, he had wandered aimlessly through countless worlds, entering this Universe and exploring tens of thousands of realms.","After encountering countless powerful figures, Jian Wushuang stood before the sight of what was called the Nash Universe.","The current universe was known as Nash Universe, and it housed the presence of a Universe Master. However, the Universe Master did not control this universe directly; instead, they commanded a universe-level secret realm. Jian Wushuang wasn’t surprised by this.","A Universe Master did not necessarily need to govern a universe; controlling a secret realm of the universe worked just as well. This was because the Origin Source of a secret realm and that of a universe were essentially the same—the only difference lay in the spatial range. Once one mastered a universe’s secret realm, they could freely absorb its Origin Source. That was the key.","Normally, a Universe Master who controlled a universe couldn’t relocate it or absorb it into their body. Such feats were only possible after reaching the Seventh Tribulation Realm. Still, there were some individuals who could accomplish this in advance, especially if they inherited a powerful legacy.","In the past, the top ten powerhouses of Qishen Temple had each been able to compress a universe into themselves. This was all thanks to the Realm King. Jian Wushuang guessed that in this world, such techniques didn’t yet exist, except perhaps within the Divine Eye Clan.","With this newfound understanding of the Nash Universe, Jian Wushuang formed a rough idea of the world. Universes were scattered across this realm, much like the flow of time and space. However, this world was completely cut off from the outside, making it an isolated dimension without a clear origin. In other words, it had been left behind after the fall of a Time God.","This dimension had given birth to thousands upon thousands of universes. As these universes shattered and cycled through reincarnation, they formed the Sea of Universes. On the other side of this Sea of Universes lay the source of this dimension, the remnant of the fallen Time God, referred to as Heaven.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes narrowed slightly as he considered this.","“Heaven must be the Heaven of the Wanliu World, and the Wanliu Divine Tree likely exists within this world. With Heaven positioned at the origin of time, and the Wanliu Divine Tree being a Life Tree, its life force—though inferior to the World Tree—would still be incredibly powerful. Vise left it behind and placed it at the source of this dead time-space dimension. It should easily be enough to revive the Divine Eye Clan. But... could they also be attempting to revive the fallen Time God?”","Jian Wushuang silently speculated. But for now, such concerns were still far off.","Getting out of the Ancient Domain World was trouble enough. The history of the Divine Eye Clan was vague even to Na Yiluan. Before the Great Cataclysm, she only knew that their sacred land was located in the Giant Star District of the Starry Sky. Beyond that, her knowledge was limited.","In the Realm God Continent, the Divine Eye Clan had many branches. Nine of these were the most powerful bloodlines, each one of them headed by an ancestor who was a Universe God. Of course, these weren’t just any Universe Gods—they were among the strongest, likely possessing the strength of at least seven stars, since each had mastered the eighth transformation of the Divine Eye Secret Technique.","The Divine Eye Secret Technique was a condensed version of the Mysterious Yi Sutra, but with the additional ability to burn one’s divine power, an act so defiant of the heavens that it had become a revered and eternal legacy. Every time Jian Wushuang thought about it, he couldn’t help but admire his Ghost Eye Senior Brother once again.","Back to the topic at hand.","Besides the nine peak bloodlines, Na Yiluan mentioned there were many branches of the Divine Eye Clan, all established by Universe Gods. She herself came from one of the nine peak bloodlines, the “Femo” lineage.","Femo was the powerful Universe God who had founded this bloodline. Although Femo had fallen, there was still a chance of resurrection.","According to Jian Wushuang’s theory, universes beneath Heaven couldn’t birth Universe Gods, nor could they withstand one. It was highly likely that the Divine Eye Clan’s Universe Gods were all residing in Heaven.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t in a rush. By the time he had to deal with these figures, he would have already mastered the Origin Source. Would he fear them then?","Once he mastered the Origin Source, he could ascend to Dao Lord in one step. Afterward, he would begin preparing for the Dao Fusion. The issue of Dao Fusion wasn’t difficult for him. He could skip the Emperor level entirely.","Once he reached the ultimate pinnacle, all he would need was his Gray Jar to continuously devour universes. He would keep consuming them until he reached the Ninth Tribulation Realm. By then, when he regained his peak strength, he could shatter this entire world with a single punch.","He thought optimistically, though not overly so, since no one could predict what unforeseen events might happen. Even among the Divine Eye Clan’s branches, some Universe Gods were still formidable."]},{"number":6431,"title":"Chapter 6431: You Can’t Be at the Grand Completion Stage!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6431: You Can’t Be at the Grand Completion Stage!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was now the stage of the Universe Masters.","These guys were likely beneath the heavens.","Jian Wushuang had to be cautious of this.","Na Yiluan had also mentioned a lot about the Universe Masters within the clan.","Unfortunately, he hadn’t encountered any of them.","The Universe Masters in the clan, along with the Emperors, were all assessed based on their strength in the Secret Technique of the Divine Eye.","Jian Wushuang found this interesting.","“You said, is there anyone in the Divine Eye Clan who, at the Dao Master level, has cultivated the Secret Technique of the Divine Eye to the fourth turn?”","Upon hearing this, Na Yiluan immediately shook his head and said, “How could that be possible? The fourth turn is for Emperors. Even among Emperors, those who cultivate to the fourth turn are considered geniuses. The geniuses among Dao Masters can only reach up to the third turn at most!”","“Are you that certain?” Jian Wushuang feigned disbelief.","Although he had relied on luck in some instances, if he hadn’t, he would have been able to perfect the second turn during his Grand Completion stage and could likely have achieved the third turn through his own comprehension.","Besides, there were many ordinary people in the Ancient Domain who had fully cultivated the first turn.","He really didn’t think it was that difficult.","Na Yiluan’s eyes lit up as he said, “Don’t say that! I have heard of a genius in the Divine Eye Clan who perfected the third turn of the Secret Technique of the Divine Eye during their mundane phase, but there hasn’t been any news of them since!”","“Hah, you’ve just never been to the Sacred Land of the Starry Sky. Who knows, maybe there’s a Dao Master there who’s already cultivated the Secret Technique of the Divine Eye to the fifth turn!” Jian Wushuang teased.","Unexpectedly, Na Yiluan became anxious and said, “Although you carry the aura of the Divine Eye Clan, you clearly don’t understand them, nor do you understand the Secret Technique of the Divine Eye. Most of the cultivators you’re comparing to are from the human race. They’ve cultivated one of the first five turns, which indeed seems simple. But have you seen how hard it is for them to fuse these techniques? In the entire Ancient Domain, only the Holy Lord has successfully fused two techniques and begun cultivating the third sequence. This triggered the descent of a Universe Master’s legacy within our clan, allowing him to receive the complete inheritance of the first five turns. But have you noticed? All these years, that Holy Lord still hasn’t completed the third turn!”","“That makes sense. The first turn is the easiest. Or, to put it differently, any one of the first five turns is simple when taken individually, but combining them increases the difficulty exponentially!” Jian Wushuang nodded in agreement.","After all, he couldn’t compare himself to others.","What he spoke of was purely theoretical, as he hadn’t cultivated the technique himself.","But he still needed to give it a try.","He couldn’t solely rely on capturing Divine Eye Clan cultivators to open the Nine Prison Pagoda.","They were too hard to find.","As for capturing powerful individuals who had mastered the Secret Technique of the Divine Eye, his own limited strength made that difficult as well.","He might as well attempt to cultivate the fourth turn of the Secret Technique of the Divine Eye himself.","Perhaps by doing so, he could unlock the fourth level of the Nine Prison Pagoda on his own.","Jian Wushuang chatted with Na Yiluan for a long time.","Besides some general information, there were two key pieces of information that were useful to him.","First, there was a potential lead about the Divine Eye Clan.","This was related to Na Yiluan’s injuries. He had heard that within a secret realm of the universe, a Sacred Land of the Divine Eye Clan had appeared.","He had also heard that there was life inside.","Believing that powerful members of the Divine Eye Clan had shown up, he had ventured into that secret realm of the universe.","However, before he could enter the sacred land, he was ambushed by a group of mysterious experts on the outskirts. He barely managed to escape with his life.","He wasn’t sure what had happened afterward, as he fled through thousands of worlds before finally stopping in the Ancient Domain.","The second matter was about the Universe Flying Boat.","Back then, he had seized the body of the Two-faced Buddha and threw a large amount of his treasures into a dangerous place within the chaos void.","That dangerous place was very close to the Ancient Domain World.","If a Dao Master hurried, they could reach it within a hundred years.","However, that dangerous place was renowned across dozens of great worlds in the vicinity. Even Emperors who entered it were prone to falling.","As for Dao Masters, very few dared to venture inside.","Therefore, he threw his treasures into the core of that dangerous place, planning to retrieve them once he had stabilized and regained his strength.","These two pieces of information were indeed very useful to him.","But each one was extremely difficult.","So, he didn’t rush into action immediately but instead asked some questions regarding self-sacrifice.","At the moment, he was researching this matter.","When Yiluan heard that he was studying divine blood, she felt an urge to mock him but hesitated, unsure if it would be appropriate. However, she couldn’t completely hold her tongue.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang raised his hand and signaled, “Go ahead and say what you want.”","“You’re delusional!” she sneered.","Jian Wushuang: “...”","“Jian Wushuang, who do you think you are? You even dare covet divine blood? Let me tell you, even the simplest silver divine blood comes from Universe Gods. Though it’s been diluted many times over, it’s not something that a mere... Wait, what realm are you in now?” Yiluan’s expression stiffened.","Earlier, Jian Wushuang had only referred to himself as one of the chosen, which hadn’t deceived her.","Therefore, Yiluan had assumed he was just a prodigy of the Divine Eye Clan who had inherited some kind of legacy.","She had no idea how powerful he had been at his peak.","It was no wonder she mocked him so openly.","Jian Wushuang, unfazed by the ridicule, calmly replied, “I’m currently in the Mahayana stage, at the third transformation of the Mystical Art.”","“Rip!” Yiluan’s eyes widened, and she gasped in disbelief. “You can’t possibly be only in the Mahayana stage?”","Seeing her doubt, Jian Wushuang directly revealed his true form.","A one-eyed Realm Beast, exuding an aura of destruction and evil.","His aura was entirely different from the rules of heaven and earth.","Even the rules within his aura were different.","However, there was no sign of any Origin Source.","There wasn’t even the slightest hint of Origin Source’s aura.","As for his strength, it was best left unsaid.","Without an Origin Source, he was just a Mahayana-stage cultivator.","Yiluan first marveled at how terrifying Jian Wushuang’s true form was. Her expression then changed drastically as she exclaimed, “You really are in the Mahayana stage! You don’t have an Origin Source? Then what was the Origin Source from before?”","“Naturally, I was deceiving you, but I do indeed have some connection with the Divine Eye Clan!” Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow. He wasn’t lying; his relationship with the Divine Eye Clan was quite significant.","In terms of seniority, it wouldn’t be an exaggeration for Yiluan to call him granduncle.","“Despicable!” Yiluan cursed when she realized she’d been fooled, unable to hold back her anger.","However, she had already said everything she needed to, and knowing that some of Jian Wushuang’s words were true, she wasn’t genuinely angry.","“Now can you tell me more about the divine blood?” Jian Wushuang asked calmly. “I’ve already researched quite a bit, and I’ve discovered that the life level of this silver divine blood is very low, only at the cosmic level. There must be stronger divine blood above it, right?”","Yiluan nodded and replied, “That’s right. Divine blood is divided into nine levels. Silver is the second tier, with a peak divine power of ten thousand times. A lower-tier black divine blood has only five thousand times divine power. There’s also the golden divine blood, used by Emperors, which has fifty thousand times divine power. However, all these are remnants left by the Universe Gods, mainly to reward the servants who pledged allegiance to the Divine Eye Clan!”","As she said this, Yiluan proudly raised her head, showcasing the former glory of the Divine Eye Clan.","“I think I understand,” Jian Wushuang nodded.","Yiluan was surprised, “What do you understand?”"]},{"number":6432,"title":"Chapter 6432: Training","paragraphs":["Chapter 6432: Training","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He had just finished speaking when Jian Wushuang’s figure suddenly transformed into that of a strong expert from the Divine Eye Clan. His aura surged, and he actually transformed into a Universe God.","However, he wasn’t a true Universe God, just someone whose life level resembled that of a Universe God.","But that was enough.","Jian Wushuang took out a drop of silver blood and directly dropped it onto his forehead.","“You’re insane!” Na Yiluan exclaimed in shock. “After sacrificing your body, you’ll lose all potential for advancement, and your path of cultivation will be destroyed!”","Yet Jian Wushuang ignored him and proceeded with the sacrifice.","His figure immediately transformed into a silver puppet.","The life level of a Universe God began to amplify.","The color of his body instantly turned golden.","“Haha, it worked!” Jian Wushuang laughed heartily and said, “Now my life level has reached that of a third-grade golden puppet. I have five million units of divine power. Although it’s borrowed divine power, it’s enough for me to use!”","Na Yiluan, standing nearby, was dumbfounded when he saw Jian Wushuang using silver divine blood to turn into a golden puppet.","The shock Jian Wushuang had given him was too overwhelming to process all at once.","Jian Wushuang paid no further attention to Na Yiluan.","He compared the nine kinds of divine blood.","At present, he could only use third-grade divine blood to become a golden puppet.","A golden puppet possessed five million times the divine power.","Beyond that, the power was measured by the number of eyes.","A three-eyed golden puppet could wield ten million times the divine power.","Such a being could stand invincible before emperors.","His physical body level was naturally no issue, but the Universe God form he had evolved could not be further enhanced.","To ascend to the three-eyed puppet stage, he would need a drop of golden divine blood.","At that time, he wouldn’t even need to grasp the Origin Source to stand invincible before emperors.","Moreover, he still had the leaves from the World Tree.","“Transform!”","The leaves covered his entire body, instantly morphing into a set of black armor.","On his arm, there was also an additional layer of green vine armor.","“Now, I can look down upon the emperors!” Jian Wushuang’s heart was filled with confidence.","His strength had arrived!","The universe flying boat.","Wandering across all realms was no longer far away.","Soon, he could even explore the cosmic secret realm Na Yiluan had mentioned.","His ten thousand years of seclusion had finally yielded its greatest harvest today.","Now, he could take the first step toward action.","After ten thousand years of isolation, he had no idea what had become of the outside world.","“Na Yiluan, you can stay here and continue cultivating. Others might come in eventually, and I’ll need your help in training them!”","“Training?” Na Yiluan was confused.","How could he have known that Jian Wushuang intended to recruit a group of followers? They would enter this place to cultivate, and through divine blood sacrifice, they would become his subordinates—an important force to suppress the Divine Eye Clan.","To kill someone was one thing, but to destroy their spirit was another.","After this period of seclusion, Jian Wushuang had maximized all possible enhancements.","It was time to venture out once again.","Before leaving, he visited the Cave Heaven World on the first level.","After ten thousand years of absence, the people there had been anxiously waiting for him.","The moment he appeared, everyone surrounded him.","The first to approach were Jiu Chen and Xiang Yang.","In these ten thousand years, both of them had become Dao Lords.","Truth be told, the treasures Jian Wushuang had given them in the past were abundant. In ten thousand years, it was entirely possible to become emperors, let alone Dao Lords.","“Brother Wushuang, you’re finally back! Do you have any idea how I’ve spent these ten thousand years? I became a Dao Lord within the first three hundred years, and I’ve been waiting for you to give me a Harmony treasure for nine thousand seven hundred years!” Xiang Yang wailed.","Jiu Chen, on the other hand, remained composed and said calmly, “It’s only been ten thousand years. Just a brief nap.”","Both of their auras were now extraordinary.","They had grown far stronger than the subordinates of the Twin-faced Buddha from the past.","At the same time, the others also envied Jiu Chen and Xiang Yang. In just ten thousand years, they had surpassed the Twin-faced Buddha’s former subordinates. Now, with their divine bodies and divine power reaching ten thousand times, they had achieved the level of cosmic perfection.","Moreover, they were on the verge of merging with the Dao.","The key point was that neither of them had cultivated the Secret Art of the Divine Eye.","In their view, without the drag of the Divine Eye Secret Art, merging with the Dao would be simple.","In fact, this was not the case. Even without cultivating the Secret Art of the Divine Eye, if one’s grasp of the level of Origin Dao was too high, it would still be difficult to succeed in merging with the Dao.","Xue Yang had mastered the Ultimate Origin, while Immortal Jiu Chen had chosen the Path of Myriad Origins.","This was essentially the divine power route.","However, it was all more or less the same—merging with the Dao was difficult, but once successful, their combat strength would skyrocket several times over.","Seeing the strength of the two had become so formidable, Jian Wushuang was pleased.","It wasn’t a waste that he had spent so many treasures.","“Alright, here I am, and soon I’ll be heading out. By that time, I’ll prepare treasures for both of you to help with merging with the Dao!” Jian Wushuang reassured the two of them before turning to look at the others.","Fairy Ziyu, after ten thousand years, looked even younger, and her strength had also grown; she had already become a Nine-step True Immortal.","After all, the Deep Sea Pearl had boosted her progress.","At this point, Jian Wushuang felt like an old hen going out to find food to feed these people.","“Ten thousand years have passed, Brother Wushuang, how much have you recovered? Have you grasped the Origin Source of the Universe? Or have you already reached the level of a Universe God?” Xue Yang asked curiously.","In his view, Jian Wushuang must have recovered his strength the fastest.","He himself had already reached the verge of merging with the Dao. Once successful, he could venture out on his own and become a Tribulation-level expert in no time.","As for Jian Wushuang, there was no need to mention it—he must have advanced even faster.","Immortal Jiu Chen, on the other hand, didn’t quite understand what they were talking about regarding strength recovery, but he was well aware of Jian Wushuang’s terrifying power, especially the invisible and formless aura that made him feel as though he was staring into the void.","Seeing the two of them waiting expectantly, Jian Wushuang felt a bit awkward. He coughed lightly and said in a low voice, “Just a small step forward, nothing too impressive!”","“Your small step is my giant leap!” Xue Yang seemed very satisfied with this answer, as it meant he could now rely on Jian Wushuang’s power.","Little did he know, Jian Wushuang was already considering relying on both of them for support.","Not wanting to dwell on this topic, Jian Wushuang quickly changed the subject: “By the way, I’ve recently opened up a new world that contains the Origin Source of the Universe. You can go there to cultivate!”","“The Origin Source of the Universe?!” Immortal Jiu Chen exclaimed in shock.","Xue Yang, however, gestured with his hand, indicating calmness, and said indifferently, “Keep it low-key. It’s no big deal!”","At this moment, he was even more convinced that Jian Wushuang had already become a Universe Master.","Otherwise, how could he have opened up the Origin Source of the Universe?","Jian Wushuang couldn’t be bothered to explain further and directly teleported everyone into the third layer of the world, within the Origin Source of the Universe.","As soon as they arrived, they were overwhelmed by a suffocating force.","That force surged wildly, flooding into their bodies.","At first, it was uncomfortable, but after they adjusted, it felt like bathing in cool water on a hot summer day. Their spirits were instantly revitalized, as they luxuriated in the Origin Source, feeling as though they were favored by the very essence of the Universe itself.","“My heavens, it’s truly the Origin Source of the Universe! Cultivating here is a thousand times faster than in the most elite training grounds of the Ancient Domain World!” Guardian Yunhai exclaimed in awe.","Guardian Qifeng, dragging his plump body, swam through the Origin Source, basking in its vast power."]},{"number":6433,"title":"Chapter 6433: Ten Thousand Years of Changes","paragraphs":["Chapter 6433: Ten Thousand Years of Changes","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“How extraordinary, how truly extraordinary! No auxiliary treasure can compare to this place. If I stay here, I may very well become an Emperor!”","Ziyu Immortal appeared calm on the surface, but deep inside, she was immensely astonished.","“Origin Source of the Universe?”","“What kind of existence is Jian Wushuang?”","For a moment, everyone was lost in their beautiful fantasies.","Jian Wushuang glanced at the group, and seeing that the timing was right, he spoke up, “Everyone, I once promised that I would set you free after leaving the Ancient Sea Overturning Domain. However, due to some personal matters, I have delayed for ten thousand years. But rest assured, I am now able to leave the Ancient Sea Overturning Domain, and you will soon regain your freedom!”","Freedom?","At that moment, the Ten True Immortals and the Four Guardians were all stunned.","At first, they did indeed want to leave, and deep down, they felt a bit anxious, fearing that Jian Wushuang might go back on his word. After all, ten thousand years had passed, and he had not appeared once, leaving them confined in that celestial cave.","Although they could still cultivate in the celestial world, they were frustrated by the lack of opportunities for adventure and growth.","However, Jiu Chen and Xiang Yang had both cultivated from the Great Perfection stage all the way to the verge of Dao integration, leaving the others in awe.","This only made them more eager to leave and venture out to grow stronger.","So much so that the moment Jian Wushuang appeared, they had made up their minds: once he gave the word, they would leave immediately.","But after entering the Origin Source of the Universe, they had all changed their minds.","They had even forgotten about leaving.","Now, all they wanted was to stay and cultivate in this place.","They thought of nothing else.","Even if they had to be Jian Wushuang’s dogs, they would still choose to stay.","To possess a legendary divine object like the Origin Source of the Universe, Jian Wushuang must be an immensely powerful figure, and they would naturally want to cling to him.","Guardian Yunhai, ever the opportunist, was the first to step forward, saying, “Senior Wushuang, what are you talking about? Aren’t we all on the same side? Who cares about freedom or not—surely everyone here is already free?”","“Exactly, Yunhai is right. We’ve always followed others wherever we went. Being able to follow Senior Wushuang is an honor. We never even thought about leaving!” Guardian Qifeng quickly chimed in.","Seeing this, the others rushed to show their loyalty.","The Four Guardians—Yunhai, Qifeng, Lanhai, and Youshang—all knelt on one knee, pledging to follow Jian Wushuang’s lead.","The Ten True Immortals did the same, with Chu Xiong and Old Ancestor Xue He leading the way.","Ziyu Immortal stood to the side, watching these once-great figures kneel before Jian Wushuang. She was quite satisfied with her earlier decision.","It was clear as day—following Jian Wushuang would bring great prospects in the future.","What did the Ancient Domain World have to offer?","The Lord of the Ancient Court?","The Lord of the Holy Land?","None of them had the Origin Source of the Universe.","Jiu Chen glanced at the group and added, “Jian Wushuang, these people aren’t weak. Over the years, they’ve sparred with Xiang Yang and me quite a bit. Why not take them in? They could at least run errands in the future.”","“It’s not like this place isn’t big enough for a few more people!” Xiang Yang didn’t seem to mind.","After hearing everyone’s persuasion, Jian Wushuang finally gave a reluctant sigh, “Well, since everyone is saying this, it would be hard for me to refuse. However, following me will inevitably come with great danger, so make sure you think it through. Of course, danger also brings rewards. As long as you perform well, I will not be stingy!”","“Senior Wushuang, what are you saying? We’re more than willing to serve you. Even if we have to face knives and flames, we’ll never hesitate!”","“Haha, if that’s the case, then we’re all on the same side now. For the time being, feel free to cultivate here. If anyone ever feels bored, just let me know, and we can all go out together!” Jian Wushuang said with a wave of his hand.","Everyone shook their heads in unison.","None of them wanted to leave.","All they wanted was to stay and cultivate in this place.","At this point, Jian Wushuang didn’t want to dampen their spirits.","Indeed, the cultivation speed here was incredibly fast, but the Origin Source had its limits.","When they eventually hit a bottleneck, no matter how fast the cultivation speed was, they would still need to venture out for experience.","When the time came, he would move on to the next step of his plan.","The others had already begun their seclusion.","Jian Wushuang took Immortal Jiu Chen and Xue Yang with him and left the Nine Prison Pagoda.","Within the cave mansion atop the Divine Mountain.","At the moment he opened his eyes, the cave mansion lit up instantly.","Two figures appeared beside him.","One was old, the other young.","They were Xue Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen.","“Let’s go!”","Jian Wushuang stood up and led the two out of the cave mansion.","The moment they stepped outside, the first breath they took was filled with the scent of blood.","The world before them made all three frown.","At this moment, the entire Sky Altar City reeked of blood.","As far as the eye could see, the number of cultivators in the city had multiplied a hundredfold compared to before.","Just the presence of Dao Lords could be felt from hundreds of individuals.","There were over a hundred thousand True Immortals.","Among them, there were even two great Emperors.","“Ten thousand years... The changes in the outside world are truly shocking!” Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but marvel internally.","As soon as the three of them appeared on the mountaintop, a streak of brown light rushed toward them.","“Sir, you must be Senior Jian Wushuang from Jia One Cave Mansion, correct?”","The brown light stopped in front of Jian Wushuang, revealing a young woman dressed in a yellow Daoist robe. Her power was modest, at most a Seven-Step True Immortal.","However, judging by the aura surrounding her, her background seemed far from ordinary.","This was because she possessed a supreme treasure within her.","The aura Jian Wushuang currently emitted was that of a peak Dao Lord.","Immortal Jiu Chen and Xue Yang were the same.","Both were at the edge of becoming Dao Lords, and such strength was feared across any ancient domain.","“That’s right!” Jian Wushuang nodded in acknowledgment.","The young woman in yellow smiled faintly and explained, “Senior, you’ve been in seclusion for ten thousand years, so you may not know. The Overturning Sea Ancient Domain, along with seven surrounding ancient domains, has now been conquered by the Ancient Court. Naturally, the Divine Mountain is also under the jurisdiction of the Ancient Court. Therefore, your cave mansion requires certain procedures to be officially transferred to us. But don’t worry, senior, the cave mansion will still be your personal property.”","“Your Ancient Court moves swiftly, to have conquered seven ancient domains in one go!” Jian Wushuang remarked in surprise.","This time, his exit from seclusion was not to linger in the ancient domains. He intended to leave.","He planned to venture to the dangerous land that Yiluan had mentioned in search of the Cosmic Flying Boat.","As for the permanent cave mansion, he no longer had any use for it.","He didn’t have the time to sell it off either, so with a playful tone, he said, “Daoist friend, why don’t you tell me what has happened over the past ten thousand years? I probably won’t need that cave mansion anymore, so I’ll give it to you for now.”","The young woman in yellow kept her expression steady, though she was somewhat curious and slightly amused inside.","Although Jian Wushuang was evidently a powerful Dao Lord, her own background was exceptionally strong.","Otherwise, she wouldn’t have been tasked with managing the Divine Mountain.","Naturally, a Jia Number Cave Mansion meant little to her.","However, she remembered that the Overturning Sea Ancient Domain had been quite turbulent lately, and her father was recruiting a group of Dao Lords for an important mission. Her brows relaxed, and she smiled warmly. “Senior, there’s no need to be so polite. If there’s anything you’d like to know, I’ll answer truthfully!”","“He’s not being polite, and you, little girl, shouldn’t refuse. If he’s giving you a cave mansion, why not accept it for free?” Immortal Jiu Chen teased from the side."]},{"number":6434,"title":"Chapter 6434: Cliff of Reflection","paragraphs":["Chapter 6434: Cliff of Reflection","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The woman in yellow only smiled slightly and raised her hand, saying, “Senior, please follow me. Let’s have a chat at the Cliff of Reflection!”","After speaking, she personally led the way to the mountain’s peak.","The Cliff of Reflection was originally a place where strong cultivators, upon reaching a bottleneck, would come to meditate and gain insight.","However, due to the war between the Ancient Court and the Holy Land, the place was no longer peaceful and had lost its original purpose for reflection.","As a result, it had been transformed into a teahouse.","The woman in yellow led Jian Wushuang and his two companions to a pavilion by the cliff’s edge. She instructed a maid to bring over a tea set and personally brewed and served the tea for the three of them.","“Allow me to introduce myself, seniors. You may call me Huang Yue’er. I come from the Moon Shadow Pavilion of the Ancient Court. My father is Emperor Yue Ying, the master of the pavilion. I am here because my father went to the Ancient Sea Region, and I was tasked with handling some logistics. However, I visited the Ancient Sea Region ten thousand years ago, back when it wasn’t under the control of the Divine Mountain, so you haven’t seen me before.”","Huang Yue’er’s manner was respectful and poised, but her words carried a natural air of pride.","Jian Wushuang took a sip of tea, contemplating the information he had about the world of the Ancient Domain in his mind.","Emperor Yue Ying was one of the top ten Dao Lords in the Ancient Court.","The Moon Shadow Pavilion, which he established, had produced two powerful Dao Lords.","“No wonder this young girl is so calm and collected when dealing with us. She comes from such a prominent background!” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","He didn’t waste any time on small talk and directly asked about the great battle that took place ten thousand years ago.","Huang Yue’er, in an orderly manner, recounted the details of that battle from ten thousand years ago.","The ultimate battle of that time wasn’t actually fought between Jian Wushuang and Yang Dingtian.","Instead, it involved a great clash between the Dao Lords.","A Dao Lord from the Holy Land descended upon the Twin-Faced God Mansion to seize a Chaos Supreme Treasure.","Little did they know, the Ancient Court had laid an ambush of six powerful Dao Lords within the mansion.","Each of these Dao Lords was a top-tier, third-stage powerhouse.","Among them was Huang Yue’er’s father.","The Dao Lord from the Holy Land was caught off guard by the ambush, severely injured in an instant, and tried to escape, only to realize that an ancient formation was hidden within the Twin-Faced God Mansion.","The six Dao Lords of the Ancient Court activated the formation, instantly suppressing the Dao Lord from the Holy Land.","The Holy Land, which already had few Dao Lords, suffered a massive blow in strength in an instant.","The Ancient Court, however, continued to observe the situation, looking for an opportunity to test the strength of the Holy Lord.","Then, they received word from an unknown source that the Holy Lord was trapped in a perilous location and wouldn’t be able to emerge for some time.","Upon hearing this, the Ancient Court immediately mobilized its army, crushing seventeen Ancient Domains in one fell swoop.","They successfully took seven of these domains.","The remaining ten were still resisting.","Among those resisting was the Ancient Sea Domain.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows slightly and asked in surprise, “You mean there are still forces resisting in the Ancient Sea Domain?”","“That’s right!” Huang Yue’er smiled faintly and said, “Senior, you should also know that the Ancient Sea Domain was once home to two major powers. After the Twin-Faced Buddha was killed by Yang Dingtian, only Yang Dingtian remained. When six Dao Lords of the Ancient Court descended upon the Ancient Sea Domain, they wiped out many powerful cultivators. However, they did not target Yang Dingtian, hoping instead to persuade him to join the Ancient Court. But who would have thought that Yang Dingtian would refuse to comply and even attack the Dao Lords? In the end, he was severely wounded and fled from the Ancient Sea Domain. Over the past thousand years, he has returned with people to the Ancient Sea Domain, still plotting to destroy the formation within the Twin-Faced God Mansion and release the suppressed Dao Lord. This is why the Ancient Sea Domain remains unrestful!”","Jian Wushuang was quite shocked.","Yang Dingtian was not a cultivator who followed the path of divine eye techniques.","Why would he resist?","It didn’t make sense to him.","Yang Dingtian had no reason not to surrender.","Or rather, it wouldn’t even be considered surrender. After killing the Twin-Faced Buddha and offending the Holy Land, Yang Dingtian wouldn’t need anyone from the Ancient Court to persuade him—he would have naturally joined their side. Why would he still resist and even dare to attack Dao Lords?","Wasn’t that courting death?","He looked at Huang Yue’er without showing any surprise on his face, though a different guess had already formed in his mind.","“By the way, you mentioned the appearance of a Chaos Supreme Treasure. Who ended up obtaining it?” Jian Wushuang asked curiously.","Huang Yue’er’s face darkened as she replied indignantly, “It was taken by that scoundrel Yang Dingtian! He ambushed the Dao Lord and stole the Chaos Supreme Treasure. Otherwise, it would have been my father’s!”","“Is that so!”","Jian Wushuang let out a cold laugh in his heart.","That Chaos Supreme Treasure had indeed fallen into the hands of Yang Dingtian.","There must be some deep enmity between them.","It was highly likely that the Dao Lord of the Ancient Court had ambushed Yang Dingtian in an attempt to seize the treasure, but Yang Dingtian had managed to escape.","However, his followers were not as fortunate.","To escape from a Dao Lord, one would at least need to be at the level of an Extreme Daoist.","Other than Yang Dingtian, no one in the Ancient Sea Region possessed such strength.","As for the current trouble in the Ancient Sea Region, it was most likely an act of revenge.","Based on what the other party had said, Yang Dingtian should have absorbed the power of the Golden Sun Fruit, stabilizing his position as a Heaven-defying Daoist with divine power of ten thousandfold.","He was now powerful enough to contend with a Tier Three Dao Lord.","It could be said that, below the Dao Lord level, he was virtually invincible.","The war from ten thousand years ago had started with Yang Dingtian and the Two-faced Buddha.","The events that followed were quite clear: one Holy Master from the Holy Land and three Dao Lords.","The Holy Master was trapped, and although the three Dao Lords together could stand against the Ancient Court, one of them was suppressed, leaving the remaining two unable to guard all thirty-six regions of the Ancient Realm.","Seven regions were lost, and ten were frequently contested, with no stability.","This was already the limit for the Holy Land.","If not for the extraordinary strength of the two remaining Dao Lords, the Holy Land might have been overrun by now.","Jian Wushuang was merely curious about all this.","His current goal was to find Jiang Ni and see how she was doing.","She had solidified her Dao Heart ten thousand years ago, so by now she should have become a Daoist.","With that thought, Jian Wushuang asked, “By the way, in the past ten thousand years, has there been a female sword immortal who has risen to prominence? Her strength should be around the level of a True Immortal or a Daoist.”","“A female sword immortal?” Huang Yue’er’s eyes widened in surprise upon hearing the question.","Seeing her shock, Jian Wushuang quickly explained, “Before I went into seclusion, I was already searching for her. Her mother had a grudge against me, and I failed to eliminate her entirely back then. The reason I emerged this time is because of this matter.”","Hearing this explanation, Huang Yue’er breathed a sigh of relief.","“The person you speak of, senior, I’m not certain, but there may be someone like that. Over the past ten thousand years, seven female sword immortals have risen. Four of them were cultivators below the level of a Seven-step True Immortal, with decent talent but not powerful enough to be considered strong. As for the other three, two of them are Nine-step True Immortals, both disciples of the Sword Pavilion within the Ancient Court, with clean backgrounds, so they can’t possibly be your enemies. Only one matches the description you’ve given. Her identity is unknown, and no one even knows her name. People outside refer to her as the Quasi-Immortal Emperor. She has the bearing of a Daoist capable of battling Dao Lords, even stronger than Yang Dingtian!”","As Huang Yue’er spoke, her eyes were filled with jealousy and resentment.","The jealousy stemmed from the fact that several of the senior disciples she admired were deeply infatuated with this woman.","The resentment came from the fact that this Quasi-Immortal Sovereign had always been at odds with the Ancient Court and had even attacked her father once."]},{"number":6435,"title":"Chapter 6435: Quasi-Immortal Emperor","paragraphs":["Chapter 6435: Quasi-Immortal Emperor","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Recently, Yang Dingtian had even teamed up with Xue Yang to make a move against the formation within the Shuangmian God Palace.","Upon hearing her description, Jian Wushuang’s heart stirred, and he was certain it was Jiang Ni herself.","“Quasi-Immortal Emperor?” Jian Wushuang’s lips curled into a faint smile. “It seems that back then, I left behind a hidden danger! I didn’t expect that even after closing myself off for ten thousand years, I still couldn’t eliminate it completely!”","Xiang Yang interrupted mindlessly, “You’re not talking about little Jiang Ni, are you?”","“Ahem!” Jian Wushuang coughed lightly and glared, “Why are you calling her so affectionately, is she your wife?”","“Uh, wasn’t she just a kid back then?” Xiang Yang felt a little wronged.","He didn’t understand what Jian Wushuang was up to.","Why not just go and find Jiang Ni directly instead of wasting time gossiping with this little girl?","Jian Wushuang, however, acted as though he was heartbroken.","It was unclear if he was pretending or genuinely distressed.","Seeing this, Huang Yue’er felt a spark of joy in her heart and hurriedly extended an olive branch.","“Senior, all is not lost. That Quasi-Immortal Emperor is currently in the Ancient Territory of Overturning Sea, and our Ancient Court is gathering strong cultivators to capture her in one swoop. If Senior seeks revenge, why not join our Ancient Court’s forces and participate in the siege?” Huang Yue’er suggested excitedly.","Jian Wushuang, however, appeared troubled. His eyes showed a trace of fear as he politely declined, “Friend, you’ve said it yourself, she is a Quasi-Immortal Emperor, capable of battling a Dao Lord. If a small figure like me goes, I’m afraid I’ll be cut down by her in one strike!”","“Senior, you need not worry. She was recently ambushed by my father and two other Dao Lords, and she’s already injured. Moreover, my father has a method to locate her hiding place. Right now, they are gathering forces to launch the assault, and Yang Dingtian and his group are with her!” Huang Yue’er said with enthusiasm.","She was thrilled because not only could she effortlessly recruit three Dao Lords, but she didn’t even have to promise them any benefits.","Once her father and senior brother found out, they would surely reward her.","However, seeing the fear in Jian Wushuang’s eyes, she secretly sneered, thinking that Jian Wushuang’s earlier arrogant demeanor was all just an act.","The moment he heard of the Quasi-Immortal Emperor, he instantly became too scared to speak.","After some hesitation, Jian Wushuang finally said, “Alright, then I’ll trouble you to guide me. However, I must clarify in advance, though I’ve just emerged from seclusion, I’m still injured and cannot take the lead in the battle. I hope you’ll understand.”","“No problem!” At this point, Huang Yue’er had lost all respect.","She felt that she had seen through Jian Wushuang, seeing his fear of death as a Dao Lord.","She even mocked him in her heart several times.","After arranging Jian Wushuang and his two companions at the top of the Divine Mountain in the temple, Huang Yue’er left for the temple where her father resided, ready to report this matter to him.","Just as she approached her father’s temple, a furious roar echoed from within.","“A bunch of useless fools, utterly useless! I asked you to find a few Dao Lords, and you couldn’t even do that. Do you expect me to beg the Ancient Court for reinforcements?”","The subordinates inside all wore miserable expressions, not daring to refute.","There was nothing they could do. The Ancient Court’s battlefront was stretched very thin.","Of the seventeen ancient territories, seven had been completely secured, with only one ordinary Dao Lord needed to maintain order. Three to five Dao Lords would suffice as support.","Most of the forces stationed there were local powerhouses, and even they had been recruited into the Ancient Court.","A majority of the elite forces had been deployed to the two ancient territories at the forefront of the war, where the true slaughterhouses were located.","The Ancient Territory of Overturning Sea, being at the rear, was theoretically the safest place.","But this territory also contained the sealed Dao Lord of the Sacred Land, requiring Emperor Yue Ying, a third-tier Dao Lord, to remain stationed here.","Things had been fine for the past few millennia, but recently, two troublesome individuals had appeared.","Though neither were Dao Lords, they were more challenging to deal with than Dao Lords.","It was driving him to the brink.","In Tian Tan City, the two Dao Lords had split their responsibilities—one guarded the sealing formation of the Dao Lord, while the other defended Tian Tan City.","Emperor Yue Ying was tasked with eliminating the Sacred Land cultivators who were causing trouble.","The three Dao Lords worked in tandem.","The other two had relatively easier tasks, but Yue Ying’s was the most difficult.","The Ancient Territory of Overturning Sea was vast. If the formation sealing the Dao Lord were to be destroyed, the Ancient Court’s efforts might all be in vain.","Thus, the situation had to be stabilized, and the Sacred Land’s cultivators eradicated.","Certainly! Here’s the English translation of the passage, using past tense narration with the standardized terms you’ve provided:","—","But right now, there simply weren’t enough people.","He could only recruit more himself.","Many of his Dao Lords had died in battle.","Now, only six remained.","Some of the Dao Lords were stationed at the Ancient Court or even further on the front lines.","They were guarding key fortresses and couldn’t be deployed.","The only remaining option was to mobilize the Dao Lords from the Ancient Court.","But what reason could he use to justify their deployment?","To annihilate a Dao Lord?","He, a Dao Lord himself, couldn’t handle it?","This was an utter humiliation.","To destroy a Dao Lord, he, a Dao Lord, couldn’t accomplish it and still needed reinforcements.","How would the Ancient Court see him after this?","He, Emperor Yue Ying, was ranked among the top ten in the Ancient Court.","In fact, if he could obtain a Chaos Supreme Treasure, he could even rank in the top five.","Currently, the Ancient Court was under the rule of the third-generation Lord of the Ancient Court, “Emperor Jiantian.”","The difference in strength between him and Emperor Jiantian wasn’t too large, so he also harbored ambitions of becoming the Lord of the Ancient Court.","So, ten thousand years ago, he had proactively gone to the Palace of the Twin-faced God.","As a result, not only did he fail to obtain the Chaos Supreme Treasure, but he was even wounded by a mere Dao Lord.","Thus, he remained stationed at the Overturning Sea Ancient Domain.","At first, everything was going well. He was planning to expand his territory.","After all, the lands he conquered needed someone to guard them.","He was stationed at the central hub of the frontlines, the Overturning Sea Ancient Domain, and was poised to become the number one figure leading the assault on the Sacred Land.","But due to the appearance of Yang Dingtian and that Quasi-Immortal Emperor, he was forcibly trapped in the Overturning Sea Ancient Domain, assigned a position to eradicate internal strife.","The title of the primary leader for the Sacred Land campaign had gone to “Lord Long,” a Dao Lord who had achieved his position during the Ancient Demon Era.","He was not pleased.","After all, the opponent had been alive for hundreds of thousands of years, yet his strength hadn’t improved at all. Like him, Lord Long was also a peak third-tier Dao Lord.","But there was one thing that set him apart—he was still young and had the potential to become a fourth-tier Dao Lord in the future.","In the entire Ancient Court, there were only two fourth-tier Dao Lords.","The first was the Lord of Yuan Zheng.","The other was the Immortal Emperor of Three Talents.","The strength of these two was on par with the Dao Lord they had subdued.","They were all fourth-tier Dao Lords.","Back then, the Sacred Land boasted that even without their Sacred Lord, their three Dao Lords could stand against all the Dao Lords of the Ancient Court.","It wasn’t just idle talk—they truly could achieve it.","Only the strength of the Sacred Lord surpassed them by a margin.","No one could shake him, but now that the Sacred Lord was gone, people began to have other ideas.","To win the battle for orthodoxy, this was the belief of everyone in the Ancient Court.","But now, before the great task was even completed, he had been driven to the brink by two Dao Lords.","Emperor Yue Ying sat in the main seat, looking extremely fatigued.","At this moment, seeing his daughter walk in, he forced a faint smile and gently said, “Yue’er, what brings you here?”","“Father!” Huang Yue’er glanced at her several senior brothers and quickly said, “I heard Father is recruiting Dao Lords. I happen to have a few candidates in mind!”"]},{"number":6436,"title":"Chapter 6436: Emperor Yue Ying","paragraphs":["Chapter 6436: Emperor Yue Ying","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Upon hearing these words, several disciples of Emperor Yue Ying lifted their heads to look at their junior sister.","Although she was rather plain-looking and had a peculiar personality, at this moment, she seemed like their savior.","“Oh?” Emperor Yue Ying was surprised. “You have someone in mind?”","“Yes, father appointed me to manage the Divine Mountain, and just now, three Dao Lords emerged from their secluded cultivation within the mountain. They are all powerful figures who went into seclusion ten thousand years ago and have only just come out!” Huang Yue’er answered truthfully.","However, Emperor Yue Ying appeared somewhat cautious and asked, “Can these people be trusted?”","Even though he was eager to recruit people, he wasn’t going to accept just anyone.","If these individuals had ties to the Holy Land, it would be akin to laying a trap for himself.","Huang Yue’er was confident as she replied, “There’s no problem with them. All three have deep grudges against a certain Quasi-Immortal Emperor, and their hatred runs as deep as a sea of blood!”","She then recounted Jian Wushuang’s earlier words without changing a single detail.","After listening, Emperor Yue Ying’s face lit up with joy. He praised her, saying, “Yue’er, this time you’ve done an excellent job, far better than your useless senior brothers. Quickly, invite those three Dao Lords here. If we can make use of them, you will have made a great contribution, and you’ll no longer need to watch over the Divine Mountain. You can start working in the City Lord’s mansion!”","“Thank you, father!” Huang Yue’er exclaimed excitedly.","She promptly left the temple and headed to the place where Jian Wushuang and his companions were staying.","Jian Wushuang and the others had barely settled down when they heard Huang Yue’er’s voice.","“Senior Wushuang, my father has invited you all over!” Huang Yue’er’s voice was filled with excitement.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang immediately stood up and asked, “Emperor Yue Ying wants to see us?”","“Yes!” Huang Yue’er nodded. “My father is waiting in the temple. Let’s hurry!” She led Jian Wushuang and the others back to the temple.","Upon entering the temple, Emperor Yue Ying sat with an imposing air, scrutinizing Jian Wushuang and his group.","Naturally, there was nothing suspicious about Jian Wushuang and his companions.","Although the three of them had all cultivated the Secret Art of the Divine Eye, it was only before Emperor Yue Ying had entered seclusion that he had passed on the complete version of this secret art to two of them.","In ten thousand years, they had managed to cultivate it to the second stage, though it had not yet reached perfection.","The first stage was the easiest, often completed within a few decades, but the second stage required ten thousand times more effort.","This wasn’t much related to talent or insight.","Only Immortal Jiu Chen, who had some prior understanding of the technique, had progressed relatively quickly in his cultivation.","On the other hand, Xiang Yang had struggled, as it was his first time encountering such a secret art. His cultivation was arduous.","Fortunately, they had all reached the second stage, and when fully activated, their strength wasn’t inferior to the famed Jiang Ni.","Of course, no one would reveal their true strength.","Just like now, the power they showed was only at the peak Dao Lord level.","After a brief inquiry about their identities, Jian Wushuang answered with the pre-prepared story of being Void Wanderers.","The name itself was simple.","It referred to cultivators who practiced in the void, seldom appearing in the ancient world.","Naturally, few people knew of them.","It was the safest method.","This also avoided any slip-ups when questioned further.","Aside from their backgrounds, Emperor Yue Ying was most concerned with their enmity toward Jiang Ni.","“Your Majesty, I crossed paths with her mother in the void. Back then, we competed for treasures in a perilous area, and I had no choice but to kill her mother’s elder brother. Later, a close friend of mine killed her mother, leaving only her alive. Unable to find her, I went into seclusion, but upon emerging, I discovered she had become a Quasi-Immortal Emperor!” Jian Wushuang said, his face showing a complex, indescribable expression.","Xiang Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen were both confused, thinking that Jian Wushuang was being excessively cautious. Even his fabricated story was crafted with such finesse.","After all, he was dealing with just a Dao Lord; there was no need for such elaborate deception.","Wouldn’t it be easier to simply confront Jiang Ni?","Why go through so much trouble?","The only possible explanation was that he was still testing Jiang Ni.","And indeed, this was exactly Jian Wushuang’s plan.","Among them, Jiang Ni was the only one with enough talent to potentially become a supreme being in the future. With the right nurturing, she could one day reach the pinnacle, her divine power multiplied ten thousand times, enough to help him contend with the powerful Divine Eye Clan experts who had cultivated the Secret Art of the Divine Eye to its fourth stage.","Emperor Yue Ying listened to his explanation. Though he found it incredible, he believed it without question.","He immediately expressed that this time, he would help them eliminate their enemies once and for all.","As for any treasures, there were no promises made.","Like father, like daughter—they both knew how to calculate their moves.","They knew Jian Wushuang and his companions were seeking revenge, so their relationship was purely one of cooperation.","A date was set: they would depart in a month to hunt down Yang Dingtian and Jiang Ni.","Jian Wushuang agreed without hesitation.","He then left the Qishen Temple with Immortal Jiu Chen and Xue Yang.","The three of them didn’t stay on the sacred mountain. Instead, they went to an inn within Tian Tan City.","The city was filled with all kinds of people, making it the best place to gather information about Jiang Ni.","The rumors they heard were largely consistent with what Huang Yue’er had told them.","The only difference was that Huang Yue’er was more aligned with the Ancient Court.","Most of the cultivators in the inn, however, were more objective.","From their tone, Jian Wushuang could tell that Jiang Ni had a good reputation.","She wasn’t known for slaughtering the innocent—she only fought against the strong ones from the Ancient Court.","Jian Wushuang was curious: Why was Jiang Ni opposing the Ancient Court?","He had originally thought that she would have joined one of the factions, but after asking around, it seemed that Jiang Ni had not aligned herself with any side.","She had only partnered with Yang Dingtian to—","“Could it be that during the past ten thousand years, she found a lover? And was then killed by the Ancient Court?” Jian Wushuang speculated in his heart.","Of course, the reason they entered Tian Tan City wasn’t just to inquire about Jiang Ni.","They were also looking for treasures related to the Path of Unity.","Right now, they lacked nothing but such treasures.","From Huang Yue’er, they learned that there would be an auction in Tian Tan City soon.","It was to be hosted by an emperor from the Ancient Court.","This emperor was bringing with him a large number of treasures.","Originally, this kind of auction would only take place within the Ancient Court’s thirty-six original ancient domains.","But due to the intensity of the frontline battles, many Dao Lords, having faced life-and-death situations, were in desperate need of treasures to replenish themselves.","Jian Wushuang still had some miscellaneous treasures on him.","He had enough capital to help Immortal Jiu Chen and Xue Yang look for something suitable.","Thus, he took them to an inn in Tian Tan City, where they would wait for the auction to begin.","A few days later.","Huang Yue’er personally came to escort them to the largest auction hosted by the Ancient Court.","The venue was set within the City Lord’s mansion.","Because of the auction, thousands of Dao Lords had gathered in Tian Tan City over the past few days.","All were here for the auction.","“I’ve heard that there will be quite a few treasures to assist in the Path of Unity, including one item that demonstrates the process of unification!” Huang Yue’er said as they walked.","Before long, they arrived at the City Lord’s mansion.","Outside, people were coming and going.","They were all Dao Lords.","That was the minimum requirement to attend.","Even a True Immortal couldn’t afford to bid here.","But Huang Yue’er was an exception.","This time, the auction was being hosted by her senior brother.","He was also a disciple of Emperor Yue Ying.","The host was the Treasure Emperor.","His strength was mediocre—just a second-tier emperor—but he possessed a vast array of treasures."]},{"number":6437,"title":"Chapter 6437: Treasure Emperor","paragraphs":["Chapter 6437: Treasure Emperor","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This wasn’t something he obtained by risking his life; instead, it was earned by profiting from auctioning off items.","Some of the items were also purchased at low prices.","His wealth was no less than that of a peak third-stage Emperor.","“This guy must have a heart of seven apertures!” Jian Wushuang silently admired him.","He then followed Huang Yue’er into the City Lord’s Mansion.","The mansion was enormous.","However, the original City Lord was no longer there.","The current City Lord was an Emperor.","But that Emperor did not appear.","Everything was arranged by the Duo Bao Emperor.","Huang Yue’er led them into a small courtyard, which connected to a pocket dimension.","Upon entering the courtyard, they stepped into a small world.","The world was tiny.","Its layout resembled that of a colosseum.","Rows of massive thrones surrounded the stage in the center.","At that moment, thousands of Dao Lords had already gathered.","Huang Yue’er led the three of them forward. She spoke a few words to a cold-faced Dao Lord, who suddenly broke into a smile and waved at Jian Wushuang and the others, saying, “You three, come to the front row, there are still a few seats left!”","“Thank you!” Jian Wushuang politely replied and proceeded with Jiu Chen and Xiang Yang.","After Huang Yue’er finished speaking with the cold-faced Dao Lord, she followed them.","Xiang Yang couldn’t help but sigh, “Connections really make a difference! I just saw a few Dao Lords without even a seat, hahaha!”","“Short-sighted!” Jiu Chen retorted with a snarky comment.","Jian Wushuang remained silent, instead using his thought power to investigate the surroundings.","Only then did he realize that the Duo Bao Emperor had yet to arrive.","He didn’t want to waste any time. Once the Emperor showed up, he would immediately examine the treasures in his possession.","At that point, he would know everything about the treasures with just a glance—whether they were of use or not.","If none were suitable, he would take Jiu Chen and Xiang Yang and leave.","The venue was chaotic.","You could hear all sorts of talk about the frontline battles.","“There are still quite a few Sacred Land cultivators in the Ancient Domain of Red Leaf. These guys are really persistent, resisting for thousands of years and still not being completely wiped out!”","“Hmph! You don’t know what it’s like near the Sacred Land, in the Mortal Dust Ancient Domain. Now, that place is a real hellhole! Many Sacred Land cultivators went there for reinforcement. If it weren’t for the Emperors holding the line, the Mortal Dust Ancient Domain would have fallen again by now!”","The crowd chatted idly, expressing their sighs.","Back then, they had boldly claimed they would conquer the entire Ancient Domain under the Sacred Land’s control.","But now, they were struggling after conquering only half, and it was starting to feel overwhelming.","Even though they had a slight advantage in top-tier strength, in terms of mid-level power, the Ancient Court’s individual combat power was far inferior to that of the Sacred Land.","In the Sacred Land, peak Dao Lords were as common as clouds, with one Sacred Land Dao Lord able to take on ten Ancient Court Dao Lords.","How could they possibly hold out?","If it weren’t for the Emperors leading the charge, they wouldn’t be able to fight back.","In fact, by now, many people understood that this wasn’t a life-and-death battle between the two sides, but rather a mutual integration.","The Sacred Land had its advantages, and so did the Ancient Court.","The Sacred Land’s strength lay in its complete God’s Eye inheritance, allowing cultivators to train from the first transformation and quickly move to the second.","Thus, most of the Sacred Land’s Dao Lords were at the peak because of this complete inheritance.","However, it was also very difficult for them to merge their Dao, which was why there were few Emperors.","As for the Ancient Court, they mainly focused on mastering the Origin Source at the True Immortal stage and then worked on merging their Dao after becoming Dao Lords.","What happened after becoming an Emperor was unclear to them.","But from the battles involving the Emperors, it became evident that even the Emperors were cultivating the God’s Eye technique.","Jian Wushuang, seated below, listened silently to the discussion around him and nodded slightly in agreement. The group talked about the cultivation paths, starting from the First Sequence, which was the first transformation. The appearance of the Holy Land had long been known to the Emperors. Only by cultivating from the First Transformation could one hope to proceed to the Second Transformation.","Once the Second Transformation was perfected, they could rival the Holy Lord. The strength of the Holy Lord was so formidable because he was already cultivating the Third Transformation. If he succeeded in completing the Third Transformation, he would be an unparalleled powerhouse. That Yi Luan was at this very level.","At this moment, the Holy Lord was absent, making it the ideal opportunity. Jian Wushuang even suspected that the Holy Lord was intentionally avoiding the scene, allowing the Ancient Court to merge with the thirty-six Ancient Domains of the Holy Land. Only through this fusion would the world of the Ancient Domains become stronger.","If his guess was correct, it would only show that the Holy Lord’s ambitions far exceeded those of the Emperors. Of course, this was only speculation, and Jian Wushuang couldn’t guarantee that the Holy Lord’s ambitions were truly this vast, letting his carefully cultivated power be seized by the Ancient Court.","Those who valued their doctrines would never be indifferent to their power being taken. Perhaps the Holy Lord had other plans.","Jian Wushuang pondered in his heart.","At that moment, a figure bathed in a radiant light descended from the sky. The entire venue immediately fell silent. The figure within the radiance was a middle-aged man with a smile that made others feel as if they were basking in the warmth of spring. Everyone who saw him instinctively felt a sense of trust.","This man was none other than Emperor Duobao.","He landed steadily on the high platform and raised his hand in greeting, saying, “Welcome, fellow Daoists, to the Duobao Auction House!”","At this, all the Dao Lords present rose in unison.","“Greetings, Emperor Duobao!” they all responded in orderly fashion.","After some formalities, the atmosphere on the floor became lively again.","“The auction begins now. As usual, there are three stages. The base price for the first stage treasures starts at one billion Immortal Crystals!” Emperor Duobao announced, and with a wave of his hand, he presented a long array of treasures, each marked with a number.","“The first item, an ancient scroll, contains the insights of a primordial demon on the physical body. The starting price is one billion Immortal Crystals!” he shouted loudly.","This was more of an appetizer. The ancient scroll was not considered a particularly valuable treasure, but it could be purchased to help cultivate younger generations in a family, making it a worthwhile acquisition.","Soon, many Dao Lords who came from families began bidding.","Jian Wushuang, however, had no interest in it. He used his thought power to inspect the treasures on Emperor Duobao’s body.","“This guy actually has an innate supreme treasure!” Jian Wushuang was shocked.","Not only that, but the man’s strength was vastly underestimated by the outside world. He was far from an ordinary second-tier Emperor. In fact, he was a bona fide fourth-tier Emperor, and he possessed an innate supreme treasure.","It wasn’t just a chaotic supreme treasure; it was an innate treasure from the Ancient Domain World.","“Wasn’t it said that all the innate treasures were in the hands of the Holy Lord? Looks like this guy has some connection to the Holy Lord!” Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","Indeed, the Holy Lord was far more complicated than he had imagined. His hidden hands had even reached the level of the Emperors. It seemed everything in the outside world was just a facade.","There was no way the Ancient Court had just one backup plan.","Faced with this internal power struggle, Jian Wushuang could only admire them. He had no other thoughts. He continued to examine the treasures on Emperor Duobao’s body."]},{"number":6438,"title":"Chapter 6438: Sold","paragraphs":["Chapter 6438: Sold","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Among the treasures available for auction, there were twenty-seven types of treasures used for merging paths.","Immortal Jiu Chen followed the Myriad Dao stream, while Xue Yang pursued the Ultimate Path.","One required a large number of treasures, of any type.","The other focused on a single type.","Of these twenty-seven types of treasures, he needed to secure at least eighty percent.","Among the eighty percent of treasures, only thirty percent would be useful for Xue Yang, while the remaining fifty percent were meant for Immortal Jiu Chen.","Once they secured these treasures, their chances of successfully merging paths would increase significantly.","If the two of them became Emperors, their initial strength would be that of a fourth-stage Emperor.","With further cultivation, reaching the absolute peak wouldn’t be an issue.","They would definitely become a great asset.","Jian Wushuang felt it was worth spending money to nurture them.","The issue was, he didn’t have much money on him right now.","He had about two hundred billion Immortal Crystals, which was far from enough.","So, he had to sell some treasures.","For example, the Deep Sea Relic Pearl, which was a heaven-defying treasure for Dao Lords, and its price would definitely exceed five hundred billion.","He also had a few sets of peak supreme treasures.","They could be sold for quite a bit.","But it still wouldn’t be enough.","Because half of the path-merging treasures were in the second phase, where the starting bid was ten billion Immortal Crystals, and the final price was hard to predict—it could easily exceed a hundred billion.","Jian Wushuang’s mind raced.","He had many valuable treasures, but most were not for sale.","For instance, the mini universes inside the gray jar and the World Tree leaves.","If he tried to sell these, even the Universe Gods would fight over them.","The key was, they couldn’t be sold in this world, and even if they could, he wouldn’t sell them.","The World Tree leaves were currently his major source of power enhancement, as they could be used for both defense and attack.","Moreover, they were a life form that could be cultivated.","They would have immense use in the future.","“Looks like I’ll have to fleece someone!” Jian Wushuang sighed.","But this had always been part of the plan.","Sooner or later, he had to deal with Guardian Yunhai and the others, so the timing didn’t matter.","Without delay, he took out a mustard seed and handed it to Immortal Jiu Chen.","“Buy all the path-merging treasures. If the money is insufficient, sell the treasures inside. I’ll send my Thought Power to the Nine Prison Pagoda. You two stay here and keep watch!” Jian Wushuang transmitted his voice.","When Immortal Jiu Chen and Xue Yang saw that he had begun selling treasures, their expressions turned slightly awkward.","Before they could speak, Jian Wushuang had already closed his eyes.","Inside the Nine Prison Pagoda, on the third layer of the world.","At the core of the Origin Source.","At some point, a large area of temples had already been established here.","Each temple had its own title inscribed above it.","For instance, Guardian Yunhai had placed a plaque that read “Yunhai Temple.”","Jian Wushuang found this amusing.","It seemed these people had truly made this place their home, claiming the area in advance to avoid it being seized by others later.","Aside from their temples, there was also a grand pavilion here.","The Sword Pavilion!","There was no need to ask—it had been prepared for Jian Wushuang.","Without any reservations, he entered the Sword Pavilion and transmitted his voice to the Four Great Guardians.","And also to Chu Xiong, who was nearly invincible among True Immortals.","Summoning the five of them wasn’t for any other reason than treasures.","These five definitely had considerable wealth.","The net worth of a typical True Immortal wasn’t high. With their personal treasures included, three billion was considered impressive.","But Chu Xiong was different. He had several rare treasures on him, which Jian Wushuang had sensed earlier, each valued at billions.","The net worth of the four Guardians, when combined, exceeded billions.","All of it had to be put to use.","There were also three silver puppets and a God-destroying war weapon.","These things would prove useful in the future.","If he took them out, people would recognize them, and it would be difficult to explain.","So, he could only reach into the pockets of others.","As he summoned five people to come over, he took out the three silver puppets.","At this moment, the divine power of the three puppets was a thousandfold.","They possessed the combat strength of an Emperor.","When the five arrived, Jian Wushuang unintentionally glanced at the silver puppets.","Guardian Yunhai and the others were curious as to why Jian Wushuang sought them out only a few days after leaving.","At that moment, they all worried whether Jian Wushuang intended to dismiss them, and each was eager to prove their loyalty.","After all, cultivating here for just a few days was faster than a hundred years of training in the outside world.","There was certainly hope of becoming an Emperor.","The Emperor’s position was their long-coveted dream.","Looking at the five people with their own thoughts, Jian Wushuang spoke: “Everyone, how has your cultivation been recently? Have you touched upon the opportunity to merge with the Dao?”","Hearing Jian Wushuang ask about their training, Guardian Yunhai immediately responded:","“Reporting to the Lord, this subordinate has made great strides these days, and there is hope for becoming a Great Emperor!”","“Cultivating here is like bathing in the spring breeze. I often comprehend the profound workings of the Universe. Regarding the Emperor’s throne, I have a deep understanding. I believe, given time, I will be able to assist the Lord in commanding the entire Ancient Domain World. Traveling the myriad worlds will no longer be a dream!”","Guardian Yunhai’s skill in flattery was truly top-notch.","No wonder the Two-Faced Buddha had arranged for him to be by Jian Wushuang’s side, even sending his own sister to Yunhai as well.","Seeing this, the others quickly chimed in, “Same with me!”","Jian Wushuang, however, couldn’t help but sigh: “Too slow. I’m afraid I can’t wait for all of you to ascend to the position of Great Emperor!”","He first shook his head with a sigh and then pointed forward, causing the three silver puppets to float over.","The three puppets erupted with divine power simultaneously.","A powerful force swept across the room.","It was so strong that Guardian Yunhai and the others couldn’t lift their heads.","Feeling that immense power, the five couldn’t help but marvel.","“Ten thousandfold divine power! This silver puppet is comparable to Yang Dingtian at his peak, maybe even stronger!”","“With such puppets in the Lord’s hands, our usefulness may be greatly diminished!” Guardian Yunhai thought to himself.","Seeing that the others were starting to waver, Jian Wushuang continued, “It’s not that I look down on you, but these silver puppets were transformed by the Sky-Eye Clan’s legendary technique. Do you know what they were before?”","Everyone remained silent, clearly unaware.","After all, when it came to the Sky-Eye Clan, they only knew about the Sky-Eye secret techniques and nothing more.","“They were once Dao Masters!” Jian Wushuang didn’t beat around the bush and revealed the truth directly.","When they heard that the silver puppets were once Dao Masters, a trace of astonishment flashed through everyone’s eyes.","It was akin to a ritual, sacrificing oneself to become a puppet.","But they all knew the consequences—once they became puppets, there was no hope of advancement.","Now that Jian Wushuang was telling them this, could it be that he wanted them to sacrifice themselves to become puppets?","They were all murmuring in their hearts.","If they turned into puppets, what would be the point of cultivating here?","Hadn’t they clung to Jian Wushuang all this time just to cultivate here?","Without the purpose of training, there would be no reason to follow Jian Wushuang anymore.","Ten thousandfold divine power, transcendent Dao Masters.","They were indeed powerful, far stronger than they were now.","But they wouldn’t abandon their path of cultivation for this.","Jian Wushuang observed them, fully aware of what they were thinking.","He wasn’t about to force them to sacrifice themselves—it would defeat the purpose. He needed them to willingly depend on him.","He could have sought others from the outside world, but he wasn’t confident they would be loyal.","These subordinates of the Two-Faced Buddha had nowhere to go, no background.","They knew each other well, making them the easiest to control.","That’s why he chose these people.","Gaining control over a force wasn’t just about strength!"]},{"number":6439,"title":"Chapter 6439: Sacrifice","paragraphs":["Chapter 6439: Sacrifice","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","More importantly, it was about the method.","Jian Wushuang rubbed his chin as he watched them, one by one, tense up as if they were struggling with some internal conflict.","Especially Guardian Yunhai—his talent was mediocre.","At this moment, he was debating whether to play dumb or to directly agree with Jian Wushuang.","If he played dumb, he couldn’t be sure whether Jian Wushuang would make a move against them.","If he agreed with Jian Wushuang, he was certain that Jian Wushuang would help him undergo the sacrifice, allowing him to soar and become a Heaven-defying Dao Master. In the entire Ancient Domain World, he would even be able to contend with an Emperor.","But he was still hesitating.","Because the stakes were too high.","Who would willingly cut off their own future?","At this moment, Jian Wushuang spoke, “The reason I called you all here today is to find an ordinary True Immortal. Someone who has no hope of progressing further but wants to quickly improve their strength. I can help him undergo the sacrifice successfully, and he will follow me from now on and assist me with tasks!”","Upon hearing this, everyone let out a sigh of relief.","“It seems that the Lord doesn’t want to force us. This is good. In that case, we should recommend someone.”","They all thought about it in their hearts.","At the same time, they discussed it among themselves.","“Lord, I happen to have someone in mind!” Guardian Yunhai was once again the first to speak.","Jian Wushuang said indifferently, “Go on.”","“Xue He!” Guardian Yunhai responded, “Lord, you know him as well. This guy has no hope of further advancement. Even if he were to reach the Dao Master level, it would be mediocre at best. At most, he would become a top-tier Dao Master, which wouldn’t be much help to you. It’s better to let him undergo the sacrifice and become a silver puppet. That would also be a reward for him!”","The previously silent Chu Xiong also chimed in, “Xue He is indeed a good choice. His disposition is solid, and his strength is not weak. He is more than capable of fulfilling the role!”","“Very well, let him come here!” Jian Wushuang waved his hand.","The group was overjoyed and quickly sent a message to Xue He.","This guy had no idea that while he was quietly cultivating, his future had already been decided by the others.","When he arrived, he was completely bewildered.","It was Chu Xiong who explained everything to him.","Upon hearing about this opportunity, Xue He immediately agreed.","He knew exactly how much potential he had.","The chance to effortlessly become a Heaven-defying Dao Master was nothing short of a dream come true.","Without hesitation, he knelt before Jian Wushuang and swore his lifelong allegiance to him.","Jian Wushuang was not surprised. He pressed his hand down and said, “I’ll help you become a Dao Master first. Now, tell me about the bottleneck in your Origin Source that is preventing you from breaking through.”","“.....” Xue He poured out all of his bottlenecks in one breath.","In fact, he was very close to becoming a Dao Master, but he was stuck at a point he couldn’t break through.","Cultivating here in this place of insight might speed up the process, but it would still take him a hundred thousand years to completely break through.","After breaking through, his next goal would be to become an Emperor, but for him, that seemed so distant it was incalculable.","Even reaching the peak of the Dao Master level could take him a million years.","That was longer than the time it took for the Ancient Domain World to come into existence.","There was nothing he could do about it. His talent was limited, and his Origin Source had long been fixed.","No one could change that.","The only way was through post-natal modification.","Jian Wushuang, upon hearing the words, had a bright light shoot out from the center of his brow.","That was his Thought power, the stream of light entering Xue He’s body.","It transformed into a phantom image of himself, beginning to guide Xue He.","Relying on his guidance, in just a single day, Xue He would evolve into a Dao Master.","At the same time, Jian Wushuang accelerated the flow of time.","This place was deep within the Origin Source of the universe, and using the Nine Prison Pagoda, he could accelerate the time here.","To the outside world, it was but a moment, but in that instant, Xue He’s Origin Source became complete, and he ascended to become a Dao Master.","“Thank you for your guidance, Lord!” Xue He, overwhelmed with excitement, knelt and expressed his gratitude.","Guardian Yunhai and the others were equally astonished as they discovered that Xue He had already become a Dao Master. In their hearts, they were all shaken by Jian Wushuang’s ability to help Xue He reach Dao Master level so quickly.","It was terrifying.","If Jian Wushuang desired, he could recruit countless True Immortals and help them ascend to become Dao Masters. That would make him the most powerful force in the entire Ancient Domain, far surpassing any sacred land or ancient court.","It would drive people mad.","At the same time, they began to wonder just how powerful Jian Wushuang truly was.","He must be at the level of an Emperor, and even more powerful than the Holy Lord. It was only due to some reason that his current realm had regressed. By helping Jian Wushuang achieve his great revival, they would surely become his trusted followers.","At that moment, they all made a decision — to serve Jian Wushuang until he returned to his former glory.","Jian Wushuang waved his hand nonchalantly and said, “No need to thank me. First, hand over all the treasures you possess. These things will interfere with the self-sacrifice ceremony!”","“Yes!” Without hesitation, Xue He handed over all the items he had to Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t particularly interested in Xue He’s meager treasures, but it was mainly to show the others.","“Now, I will help you sacrifice yourself and become a silver puppet.”","With that, Jian Wushuang deliberately refined the treasures Xue He handed over, then took out a drop of silver liquid and placed it on Xue He’s brow.","In an instant, Xue He’s entire body turned silver.","“Ahhhh!!!”","A powerful energy surged through Xue He’s Origin Source. In the blink of an eye, his Origin Source was filled with silver blood. From inside out, his entire being turned silver.","Even his eyes became silver.","At the same time, his Immortal power completely disappeared, replaced by divine power.","Divine power surged tenfold.","In one breath, it grew a hundredfold.","In two breaths, it grew a thousandfold.","In three breaths, it grew ten thousandfold.","It simultaneously reached its peak.","“Phew!” Xue He exhaled, feeling the incredible strength within his body. Although this power had no roots, he could now absorb treasures to restore his divine power.","In reality, there wasn’t much of a difference.","A cultivator was like a flowing wellspring of water, but after the self-sacrifice, they turned into a dead well.","The logic was simple.","But executing it was very difficult.","Xue He clenched his fist and felt an unprecedented sense of fulfillment. After expressing his gratitude to Jian Wushuang, he glanced at Guardian Yunhai and the others.","When he unleashed his ten-thousandfold divine power, it gave everyone a fright.","“This opportunity I received is all thanks to your recommendations. I, Xue He, am deeply grateful!”","Though Xue He appeared humble, the confidence in his words far surpassed anything from before.","Guardian Yunhai and the others no longer dared to underestimate Xue He.","“Brother Xue, it’s truly a case of long-awaited success. Of course, we should thank our Lord for bestowing this upon you!” Guardian Qifeng responded politely.","Chuxiong, on the other hand, was feeling a bit conflicted. He had once looked down on Xue He, but now Xue He had surpassed him in an instant.","Although he had some hope of surpassing Xue He in the future, it would take an extremely long time!","“Haha, of course I know this is all thanks to our Lord. That’s why I will strive to serve him before any of you!” Xue He’s tone grew increasingly assertive after his polite words.","Seeing their hidden competition, Jian Wushuang smiled inwardly. This was the result he had wanted all along."]},{"number":6440,"title":"Chapter 6440: The Light of the Blood River","paragraphs":["Chapter 6440: The Light of the Blood River","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Don’t celebrate too soon, the Xue He Sacrifice Ritual hasn’t been completed yet!” Jian Wushuang said, feigning sternness.","Hearing this, Xue He was a bit surprised and responded, “Yes, Lord!”","Though somewhat confused, he lowered his head respectfully and stood quietly to the side.","Jian Wushuang stood with his hands behind his back and explained, “The silver puppet is merely the weakest form of the Sacrifice Ritual. I have even stronger versions that I haven’t used yet. Now, I will begin the second sacrifice!”","“Second sacrifice?” Xue He widened his eyes in disbelief.","The others were equally astonished.","They hadn’t anticipated there being a second form of sacrifice.","What kind of power would that entail?","The silver puppet already wielded divine power 1,000-fold.","Beyond that... could it possibly reach the power of an Emperor?","None of them could quite believe it, including Xue He.","However, he was the most excited of them all. Being able to grow stronger was, of course, an immense benefit to him.","Even the three puppets standing behind Jian Wushuang showed expressions of surprise.","They knew their current master could perform the Sacrifice Ritual for a golden puppet.","“Are you ready?” Jian Wushuang raised his hand.","“I’m ready!” Xue He responded respectfully.","No sooner had the words left his mouth than Jian Wushuang made his move, transforming instantly into a Universe God of the God-Eye Clan.","Focusing all his divine power, Jian Wushuang condensed a drop of golden blood, combining it with his silver divine blood. The process caused his aura to tremble and diminish slightly.","But that drop of golden blood landed on Xue He.","Because the divine blood originated from Jian Wushuang, once Xue He became a golden puppet, he would instinctively develop a sense of loyalty toward Jian Wushuang.","This loyalty wasn’t born of gratitude or the strength of Jian Wushuang’s power.","It was the recognition from the enslavement by Jian Wushuang.","Xue He would now regard Jian Wushuang as his master.","Everything would be in service to Jian Wushuang’s interests.","Even if it meant sacrificing his life, he would obey without question.","Xue He’s entire body, which had been silver, turned golden, just as it had felt moments before.","But now his divine power had increased 4-fold.","His divine power now stood at 50,000-fold.","He had surpassed the strength of an Emperor.","For a peak expert, possessing divine power of 50,000-fold was exceptional.","At that moment, Xue He clenched his fists and lifted his head, his eyes erupting with a powerful pressure.","This pressure stunned everyone present.","Except for Jian Wushuang, of course.","Guardian Yunhai and the others, who had once regarded Xue He as an equal, now looked at him with deference.","Xue He had become far too powerful for them to match.","“Xue He, take your time to familiarize yourself with your new power. Controlling 50,000-fold divine power isn’t easy!” Jian Wushuang reminded him with a calm voice.","His words were meant for the others as well.","But the rest had already been scared speechless.","Regret washed over them, their faces pale with dismay. If an intense aura struck them now, they might faint from the shock.","“Regret!”","“I regret it so much! Why wasn’t I the one to perform the sacrifice?”","“If I had only taken a step forward, I’d be the one with 50,000-fold divine power now!”","“Is it still too late?”","At this moment, Guardian Yunhai and the others were filled with regret. Earlier, Jian Wushuang had asked for volunteers, and if they had stepped forward, they could have become the golden puppet themselves.","No one regretted it more than Chu Xiong.","His talent was the highest among them, but even so, the chances of him becoming an Emperor were slim.","Even if he trained to the peak of Dao Fusion, how easy would it be to actually achieve Dao Fusion?","And even if he succeeded, how strong would he become?","A first-stage Emperor’s divine power would only reach five thousandfold. However, most Emperors could enhance their power to the second stage by mastering the God-Eye techniques.","In this world, the God-Eye techniques were far more powerful than the Dao techniques from Qishen Temple.","A second-stage Emperor possessed divine power of 10,000-fold.","This was on par with Heaven-defying Dao Lords.","Many of the Emperors in the Ancient Court held this level of power.","Next came the third-stage Emperors. The peak of third-stage Emperors, with the help of the God-Eye techniques, could unleash divine power of twenty thousandfold.","Fourth-stage and fifth-stage Emperors wielded divine power of 30,000-fold.","A sixth-stage Emperor had divine power of forty thousandfold.","The pinnacle, absolute peak, had divine power of 50,000-fold.","However, 50,000-fold divine power was just the starting point in this world.","Take, for example, the powerful Yiluan, who had cultivated the third transformation of the God-Eye technique. It was estimated that his divine power could erupt to eighty thousandfold, easily comparable to the power of a Tribulation expert.","Even though human cultivators were not as powerful as those of the God Eye Clan, they could still exert a divine power of sixty to seventy thousand.","The 5-fold divine power of the golden puppet wasn’t the strongest among the absolute peaks, but it could easily crush any Emperor, effortlessly.","Xue He Old Ancestor had grown from a True Immortal to an absolute peak warrior.","It took less than the time it took to drink a cup of tea.","From obscurity to being revered by tens of thousands.","When Xue He Old Ancestor looked again at Guardian Yunhai and the others, a trace of disdain flashed in his eyes.","Jian Wushuang was very satisfied with this.","The effect he wanted had arrived.","Actually, this time it wasn’t all for those treasures, but rather to have these people offer their lives.","When the time came, it would be time to head to that secret realm mentioned by the one-luan and search for the Universe Flying Boat.","He would also need some helpers by his side.","He couldn’t do everything by himself.","“Xue He, make your preparations here. From now on, follow me closely!”","Xue He Old Ancestor responded with utmost reverence, “Yes!”","“Alright, for now, that will do. You can go ask the other True Immortals. If anyone else wants to offer their lives, let me know. There are still plenty of spots available now, but once the numbers grow, there might not be any left!” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly, adding a reminder, “Oh, and Yunhai, don’t relax. Since you’ve chosen the path of cultivation, you must work hard. Don’t disappoint my expectations. Become an Emperor soon and help me with tasks; the benefits will be endless!”","After saying that, he turned around, ready to leave.","Guardian Yunhai could no longer hold back. He crawled to Jian Wushuang’s feet, pleading, “Lord, I am willing to offer my life. Please grant me this favor!”","“Lord, I no longer wish to put in effort either!” Guardian Qifeng hurried over as well.","Seeing this, Chu Xiong and the other two guardians couldn’t maintain their composure any longer. They immediately knelt and requested to offer their lives as well.","Watching as everyone was so willing to sacrifice themselves, Jian Wushuang was very pleased.","“Are you all certain?”","“We are certain! We will not hesitate in the slightest!”","Everyone nodded in agreement.","At the same time, they brought out all their treasures, waiting for Jian Wushuang to refine them and transform them into puppets with divine blood.","“Since you no longer wish to put in effort, I will grant your wish!”","Jian Wushuang took out five drops of silver blood and placed them on the foreheads of the group.","In an instant, the five had successfully offered their lives.","“Golden divine blood requires my power to condense. Do not worry, in a few days, I will help you offer your lives with golden blood!” After speaking, Jian Wushuang’s true form had already departed.","Only his avatar remained.","After thanking him once again, the group also appeared somewhat anxious.","After all, Xue He Old Ancestor had already become a golden puppet.","5-fold divine power!","...","Outside, in the auction house.","At this point, the treasures of the first stage had all been auctioned off.","Jiu Chen had handed over all the treasures he brought to Huang Yue’er, who would later present them to Emperor Duobao for auctioning, one by one."]},{"number":6441,"title":"Chapter 6441: Raising the Price","paragraphs":["Chapter 6441: Raising the Price","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Of course, after the sale, a portion would be given to Emperor Duobao.","However, due to Huang Yue’er, the handling fee was waived directly.","Jian Wushuang returned to his true form.","Just then, Huang Yue’er also returned.","“Fellow Daoist Yue’er, I need to trouble you once again!” Jian Wushuang smiled slightly and handed over a mustard seed.","Inside were various precious treasures.","The less valuable ones had already been refined by him into Immortal Crystals.","Seeing this, Huang Yue’er sighed and said, “Next time, just give me everything all at once!”","Even so, she was still quite surprised by the treasures Jian Wushuang and his companions possessed.","The last mustard seed he had given her, when appraised by Brother Duobao, was valued at two trillion Immortal Crystals.","Now, yet another mustard seed was handed over, containing several pinnacle treasures.","There were also some extremely rare and valuable curiosities.","After agreeing, Huang Yue’er left once more.","“These are for all of you!” Jian Wushuang turned and handed another mustard seed to Immortal Jiu Chen, which contained two hundred billion Immortal Crystals.","Immortal Jiu Chen swallowed hard and, clearly moved, said, “Jian Wushuang, I don’t know how to thank you this time, but rest assured, if you ever need my help, I, Immortal Jiu Chen, will have no hesitation.”","“Stop being so polite. It’d be strange if Wushuang cared about your strength!” Xue Yang still wore his casual, indifferent expression.","However, this time Jian Wushuang patted his shoulder and said, “Brother Xue Yang, this time I truly will need your help, but that will have to wait until you’ve reached the pinnacle or even become a Universe Master!”","“Understood!” Xue Yang’s expression became serious, and he nodded.","The second phase of the auction began on time.","Huang Yue’er also returned to her seat.","The treasures in this phase were hotly contested.","Jian Wushuang and the others were in no rush to place their bids.","They were all waiting for the treasures related to merging with the Dao.","“The nineteenth item up for auction: the Dao-Merging Spring, a rare treasure from the Chaotic Void. A single drop can enlighten the heart; two drops can trigger an epiphany, and three drops can bring one to the understanding of Dao-Merging.”","After Emperor Duobao finished speaking, everyone in the audience gasped.","“This time, three portions will be auctioned. Each portion contains three drops. The final price offered by the top three bidders will determine who gets one portion. If the same person holds the top three bids, they will take it all!”","“The starting bid is ten billion Immortal Crystals. The auction begins now!” As soon as Emperor Duobao finished his sentence, every Dao Master in the hall placed their bids at the same time.","Fortunately, Duobao was an Emperor; otherwise, he wouldn’t have been able to keep up with all the prices.","From the initial bid of ten billion Immortal Crystals, in just three breaths, the price had soared past one hundred billion.","The top three bids were all over one hundred eighty billion.","The further it went, the more intense the bidding became.","After a stick of incense’s time, only seven or eight people were still bidding.","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly, and Immortal Jiu Chen started to bid.","“Two hundred billion, two hundred one billion, two hundred two billion!”","Immortal Jiu Chen called out three bids in a row.","Many people in the hall glanced over.","When they saw he was seated with Huang Yue’er, they understood that Immortal Jiu Chen had an extraordinary background.","Several people were indeed frightened off.","However, there were still bidders continuing to raise the price.","The bid leaped from 20 billion to 30 billion in a single increment.","But this bidder only offered one price, clearly indicating they only wanted a single portion.","Immortal Jiu Chen kept bidding, still offering the price for three portions.","In the end, the total for the three portions surpassed 100 billion.","That was how they secured the three shares of spirit spring.","“Goodness, that wiped out all the Immortal Crystals!” Xue Yang sighed with emotion.","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brow.","He hadn’t expected money to vanish this quickly.","The treasures they auctioned off had only raised half the amount—about one trillion five hundred billion Immortal Crystals—which Huang Yue’er had just delivered.","Otherwise, they wouldn’t have been able to afford the next round of treasures.","There were still half of the treasures remaining, roughly equivalent to another one trillion five hundred billion.","Altogether, they had three trillion Immortal Crystals, not including the Deep Sea Pearl.","That item had been reserved for the third phase.","But the Dao-comprehending treasures in that phase were even more extraordinary.","They might exceed trillions.","Jian Wushuang would have to sell more treasures.","But now, even the supreme treasures on Jiu Chen and Xue Yang had been sold.","There was nothing left to sell.","“It seems... I’ll have to sell my blood!” Jian Wushuang rubbed his temples.","If it were Ancient Demon Blood, they could have an endless supply.","However, Ancient Demon Blood was highly valuable to mortals but not as useful to True Immortals, and even less so to Dao Lords.","So, it wasn’t worth much.","That meant he’d have to sell his own blood.","But now that he’d condensed his God Eye Clan lineage, the blood he produced was diluted divine blood, meant for self-sacrifice.","Selling it would be a waste.","“I’ll sell divine power then!” Jian Wushuang closed his eyes slightly.","Since he had already sacrificed himself to become a golden puppet, his 50,000-fold divine power could condense into five billion divine crystals.","Five billion divine crystals were equivalent to five trillion Immortal Crystals.","After condensing it, his golden puppet body would be drained of power, but fortunately, he could go to the third layer of the Universe Origin to replenish it.","Of course, only he could absorb the Origin, as Old Ancestor Xue He could not.","However, Jian Wushuang couldn’t absorb too much. This Universe Origin had been given by Senior Brother Ghost Eye to his clansmen.","He couldn’t help but feel a bit guilty for taking more than his share.","This time, in order to help Jiu Chen and Xue Yang, he’d set aside his pride entirely.","The remaining Dao-comprehending treasures in the second phase were almost all secured by them.","This naturally drew a lot of attention.","Of course, they had nearly exhausted their funds as well.","They had spent a total of six trillion Immortal Crystals.","Ordinary Emperors only possessed wealth of that level.","“Wushuang, that should be enough. With the experience from my past life, I just need some assistance, and it will be sufficient!” Xue Yang could tell that Jian Wushuang was genuinely running out of Immortal Crystals.","Jiu Chen also hurriedly reassured him, “I also have the Dao-comprehending experience left by my former master, so I don’t need any more treasures!”","Seeing that both of them spoke this way, Jian Wushuang then said, “There’s still a Flower of Life, a crucial Dao-comprehending treasure. I want to buy it for Jiang Ni. How many Immortal Crystals do we have left?”","“Hmm, I have six hundred billion left!”","“I have eight hundred billion, so that’s one trillion four hundred billion, plus a Deep Sea Pearl. That should be enough!” Jian Wushuang calculated in his heart.","Soon, the third phase began.","The third phase consisted entirely of high-level treasures.","The first item was the Deep Sea Pearl. As soon as it appeared, the Dao Lords were stunned.","This treasure was somewhat beyond expectations.","After all, it was a legendary item.","The starting bid was already one trillion Immortal Crystals.","“I can’t believe there’s a Deep Sea Pearl. Why didn’t I hear about this earlier? Unfortunately, I didn’t prepare enough Immortal Crystals this time, so I can’t bid!”","“Deep Sea Pearl!”","“Notify the family patriarch!”","Many Dao Lords began to gather funds.","The Deep Sea Pearl could serve as a family treasure, a priceless heirloom.","It had immense value, even greater than the Dao-comprehending treasures.","Some Dao Lords, realizing their own strength was insufficient for Dao-comprehension, gave up bidding on those treasures and immediately aimed for the Deep Sea Pearl instead.","The starting price of one trillion rapidly soared to one and a half trillion."]},{"number":6442,"title":"Chapter 6442: Flower of Life","paragraphs":["Chapter 6442: Flower of Life","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang glanced at the soaring price and felt a sense of relief in his heart.","This was significantly higher than he had anticipated.","Soon, the price of the Deep Sea Pearl reached the two trillion mark.","Xue Yang excitedly said, “This should be more than enough. With the immortal crystals we already have, over three trillion, purchasing that Life Flower will be easy!”","“Indeed,” Jian Wushuang nodded in agreement.","The Deep Sea Pearl was now being fiercely contested by two major families.","Both of these families were Emperor families within the Ancient Court.","After receiving instructions from their ancestors, they were told to sell their treasures to raise funds. As long as they secured the Deep Sea Pearl, the family would buy back the treasures they sold and reward them further.","Naturally, they were willing to go to any lengths, even borrowing money to win the bid.","Treasures from the third stage of the auction were not something everyone could afford, and many had already left the venue.","Both families reached out to friends among the departing crowd to borrow more money.","Ultimately, a burly Dao Lord won the bid, with the final price coming to 2.4 trillion immortal crystals.","Once the Deep Sea Pearl was handed over, Jian Wushuang also received 2.4 trillion immortal crystals.","Adding what he already had, his total amounted to 3.8 trillion.","“This can be considered a little meeting gift for that girl, Jiang Ni,” Jian Wushuang mused, fiddling with the storage ring.","Now, they awaited the appearance of the Life Flower.","The third stage of the auction had a total of ten treasures, and the Life Flower was the final one.","The three of them waited idly for the last treasure to be revealed.","After an hour had passed.","The auction entered its final stage, and the Life Flower was introduced.","The starting price was set at one trillion immortal crystals.","Once the Life Flower appeared, many who were about to leave returned to the venue.","They didn’t know what treasures would follow this one.","Only Jian Wushuang and Emperor Duobao were aware.","When the Life Flower was announced, many people lamented their poor timing.","They had already spent all their money.","However, a few wealthy individuals, who had the foresight to prepare in advance, had conserved a large amount of immortal crystals just for such a treasure.","At this point, the price for the Life Flower quickly soared to two trillion.","But there were only a few bidders.","Just three.","These three were all peak Dao Lords.","Though they weren’t as powerful as Yang Dingtian with his ten thousand times divine power, their talent wasn’t lacking.","They were all at the cusp of achieving the Dao.","Moreover, they had only cultivated a single Divine Eye technique.","With the assistance of the Life Flower, they had a high chance of successfully merging with the Dao and becoming Emperors.","Their paths were not weak either—if they succeeded, they would immediately become second-rank Emperors and, with a little cultivation, could ascend to the third rank.","Given their strong backgrounds, they also had the wealth to support this endeavor.","As the price continued to climb, Jian Wushuang calmly raised his hand and said, “3.8 trillion!”","He remained composed. This was all of his immortal crystals, and if anyone bid higher, he would have no choice but to sell some of his divine power.","Once that price was declared, the entire venue fell silent.","After a long pause, just as Emperor Duobao was about to begin the countdown, someone placed another bid.","“Four trillion!”","The person who spoke seemed to have staked everything, as if this bid was their last breath.","Jian Wushuang observed the remaining immortal crystals in his opponent’s storage, then calmly raised his hand and said, “I bid four trillion, three hundred and eighty billion!”","Hearing this price, the Daoist’s expression turned to one of surprise. The new bid surpassed theirs by only thirty billion immortal crystals. But that additional thirty billion was enough to crush their hopes. They had already borrowed more than they could handle, and borrowing again seemed impossible—especially since the other party could just keep borrowing too.","The cost was simply too high.","After all, the auxiliary treasure for reaching the Dao could only assist the process. It wasn’t something that would directly make someone an Emperor. There was a huge risk involved, and if the process failed, they might not only lose their life but be crippled, all while still being in debt. The pressure was overwhelming.","In the end, they gave up on the bidding.","Jian Wushuang successfully won the Dao Flower.","The auction, too, came to a conclusion as the voice of Emperor Duobao announced its end.","Afterward, Jian Wushuang decided to stay in the residence arranged by Huang Yue’er since there wasn’t much else to do in Tian Tan City. He had purchased the necessary treasures and gathered all the information he needed. There was no point in wandering the city aimlessly anymore.","Once he entered the temple that Huang Yue’er had prepared, Jian Wushuang began researching soul-secret techniques. His goal was to further enhance his combat power. With his current strength of fifty thousand units of divine power, it wasn’t enough—especially since even his subordinates had reached the same level of divine power.","During these few days, apart from his own cultivation, Jian Wushuang also assisted the four Guardians in performing the self-sacrifice ritual, helping them become golden puppets. With this, he now had five supreme battle forces by his side. In addition, he transformed the remaining nine True Immortals, including Fairy Ziyu, into silver puppets.","However, Jian Wushuang wasn’t omnipotent. As he hadn’t yet recovered his status as a Universe God, he could only manage the creation of five golden puppets. The primary issue was the lack of additional silver divine arts. If there had been more, he could have continued enhancing his forces. Furthermore, once his divine power surpassed one hundred thousand units, he would even be able to help Guardian Yunhai and the others increase their power.","After completing these tasks, the appointed day finally arrived.","Emperor Yue Ying had already gathered everyone in the main hall. Aside from Jian Wushuang and his two companions, there were nine Daoists present. These individuals weren’t disciples of Emperor Yue Ying but rather unfamiliar faces with distinct auras. It seemed they were Daoists who ventured through the chaotic void in search of adventure.","Why Emperor Yue Ying hadn’t used his own disciples remained a mystery.","Once everyone was assembled, Emperor Yue Ying began to speak, “I’ve located Yang Dingtian and that Sword Immortal. I’ll initiate the spatial transmission, and in an instant, we’ll arrive near them. I’ll conceal your auras, and once we’re close, wait for my command before taking action!”","“Yes!” Everyone responded in unison.","Emperor Yue Ying nodded and began activating the formation.","Spatial transmission wasn’t true teleportation, as Emperor Yue Ying couldn’t achieve such a feat. He had to rely on the teleportation array, though this particular formation was a mobile one, which made it almost as efficient as teleportation. The only downside was that it was a bit more cumbersome.","Buzz!","As the formation activated, everyone instantly disappeared from their original location.","They arrived at the Ancient Region of Fuhai.","The name “Fuhai” was derived from the ancient figure known as Saint Fuhai, an ancient demon whose name gave the region its title. This was a well-known fact, though why Saint Fuhai chose this name remained unclear to most. It was said he named himself after the hidden ocean beneath the land. The ocean lay deep underground, invisible from the surface, hence the name “Fuhai”—meaning “buried sea.”","There were many entrances to Fuhai, but without using those pathways, it was impossible to enter. Of course, teleportation could bypass the terrain since Fuhai only isolated the physical geography, not space itself.","Ordinary cultivators who ventured into Fuhai were mostly in the Nascent Soul or Great Dao stages, and while the region appeared mysterious, it held few treasures. Most who entered were there to hunt the demon tribes within Fuhai. It was rumored these demons possessed ancient demon bloodlines, and by absorbing their essence, one could strengthen their body, which attracted many mortal cultivators.","Without this allure, even fewer people would risk entering Fuhai, as the subterranean environment held little promise for treasure or a conducive place to cultivate.","Yang Dingtian and Jiang Ni had chosen this place to hide. With its many passageways, it was difficult to be surrounded, making it an excellent stronghold.","At that moment, deep within Fuhai, on a coral-covered island, there was a small, sunlit hill. Sitting atop the hill was a figure, with an ink-green sword stabbed into the ground nearby. A turtle shell and a skinned stone snake were hanging from the sword, strung together like a mortal’s trinket.","The owner of the sword, dressed in a flowing white robe, had their long hair neatly tied into a crown, exuding an air of heroism. Despite this, the sword’s owner was a woman—Jiang Ni, who hadn’t seen Jian Wushuang for many years.","Over the millennia, she had relied on her own strength, mastering the ultimate swordsmanship, and had now reached the threshold of becoming a Daoist.","In the ancient world, she had gained tremendous renown and earned the title of Quasi-Emperor, a Sword Immortal capable of fighting against Emperors, and even wounding Daoists. Her brilliance overshadowed even Yang Dingtian and most Daoists in the ancient world. The Emperors of the Ancient Court treated her as an equal, though for reasons unknown, Jiang Ni harbored deep enmity toward the Ancient Court. Several attempts at reconciliation had been thwarted by her ruthless swordsmanship.","She opened her eyes suddenly.","“Hmm?”","She frowned slightly and sent a message to Yang Dingtian.","“An Emperor has arrived. Be cautious.”","“What? An Emperor?” Yang Dingtian jumped in surprise, quickly exiting his cave and rushing toward the hilltop.","“Jiang, which Emperor is it?”","Jiang Ni remained calm, her voice indifferent. “I don’t know, and I don’t care.”"]},{"number":6443,"title":"Chapter 6443: Three Ultimate Daos","paragraphs":["Chapter 6443: Three Ultimate Daos","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Facing Yang Dingtian’s inquiry, Jiang Ni’s expression became significantly more solemn.","At the same time, her mind drifted back to the moment when she unleashed that sword during her deepest despair.","In a flash, memories unraveled.","From her perspective, Jian Wushuang had arranged for her to go on a training mission with Xiang Yang and others. Then, during their expedition in the Lake Marsh Mountains, they encountered a battle that delivered the most devastating blow to her life.","She helplessly watched as Immortal Jiu Chen and Xiang Yang fell one after the other, sacrificing themselves to save her. Powerless to intervene, she finally unleashed the sword technique Jian Wushuang had passed on to her.","Even after escaping with her life, she felt no joy.","She began frantically searching for Jian Wushuang.","Because he was the only outlet left for her to vent her pain.","However, no matter how hard she tried to inquire, she couldn’t find any trace of Jian Wushuang.","Even the communication token he left her had gone silent.","Soon after, an earth-shattering battle erupted within the Dual-faced Divine Mansion.","The Dual-faced Buddha had perished.","Yang Dingtian had slaughtered all the strongmen of the Dual-faced Divine Mansion.","Hoping to gather information, she set out to find Yang Dingtian, but before she could even reach the Dual-faced Divine Mountain, a powerful aura isolated her from advancing further.","Later, the Ancient Court launched its offensive against the Sea Covering Ancient Domain.","Information became blocked off.","She couldn’t find anything.","In a daze, she followed the flow of people and left the Sea Covering Ancient Domain.","This departure lasted nine thousand years.","After leaving the Sea Covering Ancient Domain, she threw herself into rigorous training.","Because Jian Wushuang had once said to her, “If there comes a day when you no longer have anyone to rely on, that is the day you become your own support.”","It was these words that drove Jiang Ni to train relentlessly.","Her mind contained the legacy of swordsmanship left by Jian Wushuang.","She didn’t need to seek out a teacher or guidance.","As for resources, since every major ancient domain was embroiled in war, she joined the battles between the experts of the Holy Land and the Ancient Court.","She accumulated military merit, which she exchanged for vast amounts of treasures, using war to fuel her cultivation.","Though she comprehended the Ultimate Sword of Life, her sword intent also carried a hint of death.","The Path of Death wasn’t something Jian Wushuang had passed on to her. She had comprehended it herself through the endless slaughter that weighed upon her heart.","The Ultimate Sword of Life and Death!","It contained three ultimate paths.","Life, Death, and the Way of the Sword.","The fusion of these three swords made her a standout on the battlefield.","Through countless battles, she gradually accumulated experience.","It took her three thousand years to complete all nine steps of the True Immortal realm.","Once she became a Dao Master, she withdrew from the battlefield.","She entered seclusion.","Only after perfecting her mastery as a Dao Master, reaching the brink of merging with the Dao, did she emerge.","Upon her return, she earned the title of Quasi-Immortal Emperor through her combat prowess.","Though merely a “Quasi-Immortal Emperor,” she could single-handedly fight against three Emperors.","Her strength came entirely from the power of the Dao.","She hadn’t cultivated any divine eye secret techniques, nor did she possess any innate treasures or a divine body. Her physical body had a strength multiplier of five thousand, and she still used immortal power rather than divine power.","In contrast, her opponents had ten-thousandfold divine bodies, powerful peak treasure sets, divine power, and had mastered divine eye secret techniques.","Divine eye secret techniques weren’t forbidden in the Ancient Court. Below the rank of Emperor, one could only cultivate the first stage.","Once reaching the rank of Emperor, they were free to cultivate it further.","Thus, the three Emperors of the Ancient Court all possessed peak-level third-stage power.","Yet, none of them could do anything against Jiang Ni.","This level of strength was enough to make her stand out among all the Dao Masters of the ancient domain world.","Even ordinary Emperors had to bow their heads in her presence.","She feared nothing.","Her only fear was that Jian Wushuang had also perished.","Thus, when she gained enough power, the first person she sought was Yang Dingtian, asking him for details about that battle.","Of course, Yang Dingtian couldn’t be expected to tell her the truth so easily.","A bit of force was required.","This was the advantage of power.","It allowed others to speak to you respectfully, or even to pay their respects properly.","From Yang Dingtian’s mouth, she didn’t learn much.","However, the disappearance of Guardian Qifeng and others gave her a glimmer of hope.","At that time, Yang Dingtian wasn’t entirely truthful, but he indirectly told her that the person she was looking for might have been sealed within the Dual-faced Divine Mansion.","So, for thousands of years, Jiang Ni had remained in the Sea Covering Ancient Domain, all for the sake of breaking through that grand formation.","Jian Wushuang was only here to check whether or not he had been trapped inside the great formation.","In her eyes, Jian Wushuang had always been incredibly powerful. He was the kind of person who, despite hardly training, could easily surpass her, Xue Yang, and others every time.","His strength advanced by leaps and bounds, to an almost absurd degree.","Back in the mortal world, Jian Wushuang had once said that his cultivation had regressed.","At the time, she thought Jian Wushuang was probably in the Nascent Soul stage, or maybe even in the Divine Image stage.","It wasn’t until after ascending that she started to believe Jian Wushuang might be a True Immortal.","But when they reached the Twin-faced God Mansion, Jian Wushuang effortlessly suppressed a Dao Master with just a flick of his hand.","He wielded the power of an Emperor.","She had cultivated for ten thousand years and had only just managed to suppress an Emperor herself.","If Jian Wushuang was still alive, she believed he would be far stronger than she was now.","After reminiscing about the past, she looked up at Yang Dingtian without answering his earlier question. Instead, she rose calmly.","“They’re here!”","“Hmm?” Yang Dingtian immediately became alert.","Yet he sensed nothing.","When he saw the figures in the distance, the attack had already come crashing down like a tidal wave.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","“This is bad, it’s the Stone Scatter Formation!”","Yang Dingtian let out a furious roar, and his divine shield exploded into action.","A massive golden bell descended, protecting both him and Jiang Ni.","“Haha! Just because you have a ten-thousandfold divine body, do you think you can withstand my Stone Scatter Formation?”","A wild laugh echoed out as Emperor Yue Ying slowly descended, holding a crescent-shaped blade.","There were several figures surrounding him.","Each one was a powerhouse among Dao Masters.","“Tsk tsk, last time the three of you couldn’t handle it, and now only two of you have come!”","Jiang Ni pointed her finger casually.","She revealed an Emperor hidden in the void behind them, forcing the opponent to reveal themselves.","“Not bad, for a quasi-Immortal Emperor. Your sword aura has grown much stronger!”","The figure that appeared in the void smiled faintly.","His aura was similar to Emperor Yue Ying’s, both at the third tier.","His strength was overwhelming.","Although he couldn’t rank in the top ten within the Ancient Court, he could still cling to the edge of the rankings.","He was only slightly weaker than Emperor Yue Ying.","“Brother Can Jiu, stop wasting words with her. Let’s make our move!” Emperor Yue Ying could barely contain his impatience.","Jiang Ni had been a thorn in his side for far too long. He couldn’t breathe easy until she was dealt with.","Hearing this, Can Jiu didn’t waste any more words and attacked immediately.","“Break!”","Swish!","Emperor Yue Ying charged forward as well, sending a voice transmission to Jian Wushuang and the others: “You go and trap Yang Dingtian. He’s full of tricks and incredibly cunning. You must not let him escape. Hold him down until I finish off the quasi-Immortal Emperor, and then I’ll deal with him!”","“Understood!”","The group dispersed, surrounding the entire island.","Jian Wushuang was among them.","He kept his eyes on Jiang Ni the entire time.","But she couldn’t sense his presence at all.","“This little girl is impressive. She’s mastered the Ultimate Sword Dao, and yet she’s standing strong against two third-tier Emperors without faltering!” Xue Yang couldn’t help but praise her.","Immortal Jiu Chen smiled bitterly and said, “I’m starting to think the Ultimate Dao has become somewhat cheap. Both you and this little girl have mastered the Ultimate Dao, though you tread different paths. While your strength is similar now, walking the Ultimate Dao will be purer. In the future, the path for both of you will be much smoother!”"]},{"number":6444,"title":"Chapter 6444: Terrifying Talent","paragraphs":["Chapter 6444: Terrifying Talent","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Talent plays a role in these things. It’s not something to envy!” Xue Yang raised his head with a smile.","Jian Wushuang remained silent.","Xue Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen only noticed Jiang Ni’s mastery of the Ultimate Sword Dao.","Although they had known this for a long time, seeing it still left them astonished by Jiang Ni’s battle prowess.","However, Jian Wushuang was the only one who realized that Jiang Ni’s abilities were not limited to just the Ultimate Sword Dao.","Initially, Jian Wushuang thought Jiang Ni had merely mastered the Ultimate Life Sword, where life and sword had fused to form the Ultimate Dao.","But to his surprise, Jiang Ni had comprehended the complete Life Dao, as well as the complete Ultimate Sword Dao.","These were two Ultimate Daos.","And that wasn’t the end of it.","Jiang Ni had also comprehended the Dao of Death, another Ultimate Dao.","With all three combined, Jiang Ni had already reached the edge of merging Daos.","Comprehending three Ultimate Daos at once had far exceeded Jian Wushuang’s expectations.","He had traversed the Realm God Continent for many years.","In his time, he had encountered many prodigies.","Take Hui Qing, for instance, who had comprehended the Zen Dao, which was particularly unique among the Ultimate Daos.","There was also Shang, who had also mastered an Ultimate Dao.","In the span of time, prodigies who could comprehend two Ultimate Daos were rare, though some older generation figures had done it.","In fact, the elderly Tian Cang had mastered two Ultimate Daos.","He was the most talented individual Jian Wushuang had ever met in the Northern Space-time.","Of course, excluding himself.","After millions of eras traveling the Realm God Continent, he encountered even more prodigies.","Ultimate Daos had become commonplace, no longer anything special.","After all, someone like Xue Yang, a scion of a prestigious family, had also mastered an Ultimate Dao. Yet, even within his family, this was not considered a major achievement; he still had to rely on his own efforts to secure matching resources.","In the Realm God Continent, the Ultimate Dao was seen as merely a stepping stone for prodigies, a prerequisite to becoming a true powerhouse.","But a prodigy who could comprehend two Ultimate Daos was different.","Such individuals were truly rare.","In a high-level world, it would already be quite fortunate to have a single practitioner of the Ultimate Dao.","In an entire universe, if its foundation was solid, there might be thousands of Ultimate Dao practitioners.","As for Emperors, that was harder to predict. Some universes didn’t even have a single Ultimate Emperor.","The Realm God Continent boasted relatively higher qualifications.","Certain alternate universes, though they had existed for countless years, naturally possessed many more Ultimate Daos.","But even then, they only had one or two times more than ordinary universes.","In the same era, a universe would typically have around a thousand practitioners of the Ultimate Dao.","However, among these thousand Ultimate Dao practitioners, the odds of a cultivator comprehending two Ultimate Daos were almost zero.","Among thousands of universes, one or two individuals might emerge.","On the Realm God Continent, it would be considered impressive if a thousand practitioners of the Ultimate Dao in the same era could comprehend two Ultimate Daos.","Of course, accumulated over countless years, there were likely many powerhouses with dual Ultimate Daos above the level of Dao Lords.","Even so, once someone comprehended two Ultimate Daos, they would inevitably be taken as a direct disciple by a Universe God.","They would be granted the most powerful Dao-merging treasures.","Additionally, they would be arranged to enter the Universe God’s own universe to attempt Dao-merging.","And if they failed, they would be resurrected.","Reviving a Dao Lord was an easy task for a Universe God, but reviving an Ultimate Dao Lord was difficult.","Resurrecting someone who had mastered one Ultimate Dao would severely injure a Universe Master.","Resurrecting someone who had mastered two Ultimate Daos was beyond the capability of a Universe Master.","Even a Universe God would need to expend a vast amount of divine power to revive such a person.","The amount of divine power consumed could, if converted to resources, be enough to cultivate a Seventh Tribulation Universe Master.","Such massive resources were dedicated solely to a Dao Lord.","This was the value of mastering two Ultimate Daos.","However, the resurrection wasn’t infinite—two attempts at most. If both failed, then there would be no more hope.","There were rumors that a Seven-Star Universe God once helped a younger family member, a Dao Lord, in merging their Daos, reviving them nineteen times. In the end, the Dao Lord felt so embarrassed that they shattered their own consciousness and destroyed themselves.","The Dao Lords who had mastered two Ultimate Daos were already so impressive.","As for those who mastered three Ultimate Daos, once they appeared, Universe Gods on the Realm God Continent would compete to take them as disciples.","This was because, on the entire Realm God Continent, among the Dao Lords of the same generation, at most two or three could comprehend the three Ultimate Daos.","Jian Wushuang had encountered one before. It was in a secret realm of time and space in the southeastern region of the Realm God Continent.","His talent was the strongest Jian Wushuang had ever seen.","Even when compared to his past self, Jian Wushuang had to admit admiration.","This was because, when this Dao Lord was on the verge of merging with the Dao, his divine body had already reached ten thousand times the strength of an ordinary body.","His battle power alone could rival that of a Tribulation-level expert.","He carried numerous opportunities with him, including several chances tied to Universe Gods.","He was also a direct descendant of a Universe God family. After mastering three Ultimate Daos, he was directly recommended by his family’s Universe God to an incredibly powerful Eight-Star Universe God, becoming the personal disciple of this Universe God.","Back then, when Jian Wushuang passed through the territory of this Universe God, he took the initiative to forge a relationship because the other was an Eight-Star Universe God. That was how he met this peerless genius.","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but feel admiration.","Although his own path of extremity was extraordinarily unique, it only grew stronger with time, with its greatest benefits manifesting in the later stages.","The Ultimate Dao, however, was different.","It was already part of the ultimate series, the strongest Dao.","Thus, battle power naturally grew at a rapid pace.","Now, seeing Jiang Ni master three Ultimate Daos, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but feel happy for her.","Her talent wasn’t weaker than Jiang Shang’s or the goddess of Gu Yue’s time and space.","She was even stronger than Hui Qing.","Although Hui Qing was already a Universe God, the road ahead would likely be difficult for him.","At first, Hui Qing could keep pace with him, but as time went on, the effort required would grow.","Becoming a Seven-Star Universe God was already his peak. Reaching the final chapter of the Universe God realm would be his limit.","Becoming a God of Time and Space!","That was a bottleneck far more transformative than merging with the Dao.","For a cultivator on the Realm God Continent, breaking through this bottleneck was almost impossibly difficult.","Except for those born as Universe Masters or even Universe Gods, for those who started weak and cultivated their way up, becoming a God of Time and Space was as hard as a mortal ascending to heaven.","Hui Qing’s chances were slim, but his daughter Jiang Ni had great potential.","The three Ultimate Daos complemented one another.","As long as she succeeded in merging with the Dao, the foundation of her divine body nurtured by an Emperor was something that could be enhanced with treasures.","Afterward, when becoming a Universe Master, the primary challenge would be the Divine Tribulation.","Tribulations within the universe were not too difficult for cultivators of the Ultimate Dao.","Moreover, Jiang Ni was a master of three Ultimate Daos.","Her greatest challenge would undoubtedly be the Divine Tribulation.","In this regard, she was very much like Jian Wushuang.","Both were destined to face the Divine Tribulation.","“Jiang Ni, let me personally test your current strength!”","Jian Wushuang prepared to strike.","At that moment, the surrounding sky suddenly fluctuated and began to change.","“A supreme treasure has descended!”","Everyone was stunned and quickly retreated.","But the flickering light enveloped an area spanning billions of miles, and it would take time to escape.","“What’s happening?” Emperor Yue Ying exclaimed in surprise. “Is it a Chaos Supreme Treasure?”","Before they could react, a massive light illuminated the heavens and earth."]},{"number":6445,"title":"Chapter 6445: Trial","paragraphs":["Chapter 6445: Trial","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A massive light gate appeared in the void.","Rumbling sounds echoed from within the gate.","The presence of the gate left everyone in awe.","Seeing the gate, Jian Ni’s lips curled into a slight smile.","“He’s here!”","Yang Dingtian, still unaware of who was arriving, exclaimed, “Is this someone you arranged?”","He hadn’t expected that Jian Ni, who had been hiding here all this time, had managed to contact external help.","And not just any help—it was an Emperor.","It was well-known that the Emperors of the Sacred Land were stationed in various ancient domain worlds at this time.","It was impossible for them to come here.","In the entire ancient domain world, apart from the Emperors of the Sacred Land, only the Emperors from the Ancient Court remained.","Yang Dingtian instantly understood—Jian Ni had drawn an Emperor from the Ancient Court to their side.","Tian Can and Emperor Yue Ying quickly caught on as well.","The Emperor within the ancient gate was, in all likelihood, an Emperor from the Ancient Court.","Of course, there was a small chance it could be an Emperor from another universe, but that was highly unlikely.","The ancient domain world was so poor that no Emperor would bother coming here.","Even the Dao Lords of the ancient domain world left to explore the wider universe—no one cared about the affairs within the ancient domain world.","Only the Ancient Court and the Sacred Land vied for the Dao heritage here.","“Quit putting on a show!”","Emperor Yue Ying took the initiative, his Moon Blade spinning wildly in his hand as he charged toward the glowing ancient gate.","“I’ll see who you really are!”","Within the Ancient Court, there were ten Emperors in total.","Among them, only a few were at the pinnacle of third-tier combat power.","None were known to possess an innate treasure of the highest order.","But it couldn’t be ruled out that someone might have obtained such a treasure and kept it secret.","If it was a third-tier Emperor with an innate treasure, their power would increase significantly, but only to a certain limit.","It wouldn’t allow them to surpass their tier.","If it were indeed a third-tier Emperor, they could likely elevate themselves to the peak of the third tier.","Thus, Emperor Yue Ying was unafraid. He rushed forward, wielding his Moon Blade, and slashed at the gate.","Boundless divine power swept across the surroundings.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The clash between the Moon Blade and the ancient gate produced an earth-shattering sound.","The impact caused Emperor Yue Ying’s divine body to tremble, yet the ancient gate remained completely unscathed.","Not only did it not break, but it didn’t even budge.","Emperor Yue Ying muttered to himself, “As expected of an innate treasure. It’s as steady as a mountain. No matter how much I attack, I can’t shake it!”","However, the power within the ancient gate continued to suppress both him and Tian Can.","“Forget about it, focus on that sword immortal!”","After all, the one inside the gate wasn’t coming out, and at most, they were using their treasure to suppress their strength.","It wasn’t a huge threat.","If the person inside did show themselves, all the better.","Even if they couldn’t capture the quasi-immortal Emperor, they could at least expose the identity of a traitor.","No matter how they looked at it, they wouldn’t lose out.","But what none of them had expected was that the radiant gate suddenly shook for a moment, and a silver beast emerged from within.","In just a moment, the beast trembled again and split into two.","The aura emanating from it resembled the puppets of those who sacrificed themselves for divine blood.","In no time, the number of beasts doubled again.","From one, they became a hundred.","A hundred divine power puppets, each possessing more than ten thousand times the strength of an ordinary Universe Master.","This scene left everyone dumbfounded.","“My heavens, what kind of place does this ancient gate connect to?”","“All of them are at the Dao Master’s peak, comparable to the strength of an Emperor?”","Even Jiang Ni couldn’t help but raise an eyebrow and say, “This guy really has some tricks up his sleeve, summoning so many silver beasts!”","Yang Dingtian, on the other hand, was completely stunned.","Each puppet’s strength was nearly the same as his own, making him feel utterly redundant.","Roar!","The beasts howled and charged toward Can Jiu and Emperor Yue Ying.","The Dao Masters that Emperor Yue Ying had brought with him scattered in every direction.","The hundred divine power puppets—none of them could stand against such overwhelming strength.","Now, the puppets had trapped both Can Jiu and Emperor Yue Ying.","With that, the Quasi-Immortal Emperor had his hands freed.","If they made a move against them at this point, there would be no chance of survival.","After all, this was someone ruthless enough to contend with a third-tier Emperor.","All the other Dao Masters had fled, except for Jian Wushuang and his two companions, who remained standing in place.","“Brother Wushuang, let me go first and give it a try!” Xue Yang rolled his wrists, brimming with excitement. “I’ve been bullying Guardian Yunhai inside the Nine Prison Pagoda every day without any challenge. Now’s the perfect time to test Jiang Ni, see how strong this little girl is!”","“Alright,” Jian Wushuang agreed, not in any rush.","He knew well that Xue Yang’s strength was no match for Jiang Ni.","On the surface, Jiang Ni’s strength was already at the peak of the third tier, and she likely had hidden techniques.","Though Xue Yang was also a master of the Ultimate Dao, with a formidable divine body and powerful divine strength, further enhanced by his inheritance from his past life and self-created universe-level secret techniques, he only wielded a single Ultimate Dao.","Though both he and Jiang Ni practiced the Ultimate Sword Dao, the difference lay in the gap between life and death.","“Be careful. Jiang Ni is really strong; don’t let her kill you,” Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but remind him.","Although his strength had increased greatly, it still wasn’t enough to save someone from Jiang Ni in the blink of an eye.","Xue Yang’s eyebrow twitched, feeling a bit defiant. “You underestimate me!”","With that, he drew his sword and dashed forward.","His divine power surged, amplifying from ten thousand times to thirty thousand times in an instant.","His secret technique, the Divine Eye, had already reached perfection in its first stage.","Combined with his self-created universe-level secret arts, his divine power tripled in potency.","It was immensely powerful.","With thirty thousand times the divine power and the Ultimate Sword Dao, few in the third-tier Emperor realm could rival him.","Jiang Ni, noticing the sudden burst of strength from this mysterious expert, rose to meet him head-on.","But as soon as they clashed, she couldn’t help but be surprised.","“This person’s strength is on par with mine... He’s a Dao Master too!”","That was what shocked Jiang Ni the most.","Among her peers, it was rare to find anyone who could take even a single strike from her, let alone someone who could match her strength.","Suddenly facing a Dao Master whose battle power was nearly equal to her own was truly shocking.","Up in the sky, where Can Jiu and Emperor Yue Ying were still battling the silver beasts, they too noticed the eruption of power from Xue Yang and couldn’t help but cheer.","Though they didn’t understand how Xue Yang had grown so strong, it was certainly better than letting Jiang Ni escape.","Boom!","The two exchanged blows, each sustaining significant injuries.","Xue Yang was astonished. He hadn’t realized Jiang Ni had mastered three types of Ultimate Dao.","If he had known, he wouldn’t have been so eager for a fight.","“I clearly gave it my all, yet only managed to lightly wound her. This is absurd!”","He thought back to the days when Jiang Ni, still in the Grand Perfection stage, couldn’t withstand even a single move from him.","But now, they were evenly matched.","The key difference was that he was struggling, while Jiang Ni, though not relaxed, certainly wasn’t feeling the same level of pressure.","Watching the fight from the sidelines, Immortal Jiu Chen couldn’t resist a mocking comment. “What’s wrong with you? Getting pressed this hard by a little girl?”","“At this rate, you should forget about merging with the Dao and just retire to the mortal world to get married and live as a commoner!”","Already slightly disadvantaged, Xue Yang was irritated by Jiu Chen’s taunts and shot back, “You old fossil, why don’t you come down and try? Let’s see how many of my strikes you can withstand!”","Seeing the two brawling, Jiu Chen’s hands had already started itching for a fight.","Without hesitation, his figure descended onto the mountain peak.","“Let’s try then!”","With those words, he unleashed a palm strike, utilizing his Emperor-tier secret technique.","The force was terrifying."]},{"number":6446,"title":"Chapter 6446: Lord Long","paragraphs":["Chapter 6446: Lord Long","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang stood afar in the sky, watching everything unfold, without the slightest trace of surprise.","After all, Jian Wushuang knew very well that Jiang Ni was hiding her true strength. Her power was far beyond that of a mere tier 3 Emperor.","She had mastered three Ultimate Paths, and once they were cultivated to perfection, reaching the verge of unification, she could rival those in the Tribulation Realm, even without a divine body or divine power. The sheer force of her Origin Source alone would be enough to compare.","Unless Jiang Ni hadn’t fully comprehended life and death, and had only perfected her Sword Dao. Even so, with the combination of life and death, she could still wield tier 4 power.","As Jian Wushuang watched Jiang Ni, fighting two opponents at once, she began to change.","Her sword intent now carried the meaning of death. The aura of death surged, instantly suppressing both Immortal Jiu Chen and Xue Yang.","Jiang Ni’s strength surged to the Fourth Tier, shocking everyone who witnessed the scene, including the Emperor hidden within the ancient gate.","“She... she was still hiding her strength. tier 4 Emperor power... and she still came to me for help!” Emperor Yue Ying’s voice trembled.","Even Yue Ying and Tian Can felt their hearts quake. They had been fighting off the strange beasts without much pressure. At first, Xue Yang’s burst of power had given them hope, and then Immortal Jiu Chen’s surge made them think they would have a chance to pick up the spoils.","But to their shock, this genius, near-Immortal Emperor, had been concealing her strength. When she erupted with tier 4 Emperor power, she swept through both Immortal Jiu Chen and Xue Yang effortlessly.","Once Jiang Ni was free, they knew she would turn her attention to them. Coupled with the silver beasts, they would surely perish here.","Realizing this, Emperor Yue Ying quickly pulled out a token. “Lord Long, save me!”","Without any hesitation, he sent a message through the token.","In the next moment, the eyes of an ancient Emperor guarding the Twin-Faced God Palace snapped open.","The palace was situated on a mountain that had no roots, known in the past as the Twin-Faced God Mountain.","At the peak of the mountain sat an elder with fiery red hair and two dragon horns sprouting from his head. His eyes burned with endless battle intent. Every movement he made was enough to make the heavens and earth bow before him.","This place was guarded by a tier 4 Emperor at his peak. The ancient court had dispatched an unparalleled force to guard this realm, and that force was Lord Long.","Aside from the three Immortal Kings of the ancient court, Lord Long was the strongest.","The ancient court’s first generation Immortal King, Yuan Zheng Immortal Sovereign, was the first Emperor of the human race and the first tier 4 Emperor. He had ended the Ancient Demon Era and ushered in the era of the Ascendants, becoming a giant among Immortal Kings.","Lord Long had also risen during this time. In fact, his rise predated that of Yuan Zheng Immortal Sovereign by quite some time. Back then, there had been no Heavenly Court, only a unified human race.","Lord Long hailed from the Dragon People, an ancestor of his kind. He had joined the Heavenly Court in its early days when Yuan Zheng Immortal Sovereign was only a Nine-Step True Immortal, while Lord Long was already a Daoist Lord, making him the earliest and strongest fighter in the Heavenly Court.","Though Yuan Zheng Immortal Sovereign later rose to prominence, becoming an Emperor, Lord Long’s strength remained unmatched. However, Yuan Zheng Immortal Sovereign’s brilliance overshadowed Lord Long.","The next two Immortal Kings of the Heavenly Court were both disciples of Lord Long. Whether it was the True Immortal of Three Talents or the current ruler of the ancient court, both owed him the title of master.","For the ancient court to send such a figure to guard this place was no disgrace to Lord Long’s name.","“Ling Xiao, I’m heading out. Watch over the formation well!” Lord Long’s voice was filled with authority.","At the core of the formation, a child-like figure nodded respectfully. “Rest assured, Lord Long, I will take care of everything!”","Lord Long nodded calmly and took a single step, instantly leaving the Twin-Faced God Palace.","Yet, the moment Lord Long left, a sly smile crept onto the face of the child-like figure, Ling Xiao.","On the other side.","Within the Sea of Overturning.","Jiang Ni killed two True Immortals with a single sword.","She beat Xue Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen so badly that they couldn’t lift their heads.","Jian Wushuang shook his head with a bitter smile and prepared to strike again.","But once again, someone interrupted.","A terrifying aura surged from the horizon.","A thick red mist descended in an instant, rushing directly toward the ancient gate.","The mist immediately enveloped the ancient gate, and the silver puppets were instantly shattered.","Emperor Yue Ying and Tian Can were pulled up from the fray.","From the red mist emerged a towering figure—an imposing old man.","This was none other than Lord Long of the Ancient Court.","A figure so revered that all the cultivators in the Ancient Domain would call him ‘Old Ancestor.’","Because when he was born, he was the same age as the Ancient Demon.","“Greetings, Lord Long!”","Emperor Yue Ying and Tian Can bowed respectfully.","Despite Emperor Yue Ying’s factional influence within the Ancient Court, which had earned him the title of one of the Ten Great Emperors, his power was nothing compared to Lord Long.","Lord Long glanced at the two of them and said calmly, “This time, it’s not your fault. A remarkable individual has emerged from the Ancient Domain, and there’s no way you could have stopped him.”","After saying this, his figure descended.","The Emperor within the ancient gate wanted to stop him, but he didn’t have the guts.","Even if he showed up, the power of the ancient gate was no match for Lord Long.","Not to mention, Emperor Yue Ying and Tian Can, two tier 3 Emperors, were beside him and would easily stop any interference.","Seeing the sudden appearance of the red-haired elder, both Immortal Jiu Chen and Xue Yang immediately understood that this was a powerful figure from the Ancient Court.","“Hey, old man! This has nothing to do with you! You better scram!” Xue Yang shouted, unafraid.","Lord Long ignored him and, with a casual strike, sent Xue Yang flying.","His gaze then fell on Jiang Ni.","“Fellow Daoist, I can see that you hold no deep hatred toward the Ancient Court, so why are you obstructing its grand plan?”","Jiang Ni, holding her divine sword, floated in mid-air, her eyes cold and distant.","“This has nothing to do with the Ancient Court. I just want to break the Imperial Annihilation Formation of the Two-faced God’s Mansion!”","Lord Long’s brow twitched, and he asked in confusion, “May I ask for a reason?”","“I’m looking for someone.”","“Is it that simple?”","“It’s very important to me,” Jiang Ni replied firmly.","Lord Long laughed.","The normally stern and domineering elder smiled and waved his hand, saying, “This is simple for me. I can help you!”","“Lord Long, this...!” Emperor Yue Ying was startled.","Both of them wanted to stop him.","But a single look from Lord Long froze them in place.","“But you must agree to one condition!”","Jiang Ni asked calmly, “What condition?”","“Join the Ancient Court and help the Ancient Domain complete the final chapter of the Dao Orthodoxy!”","Dao Orthodoxy!","This was critical.","If the two current Dao Orthodoxies couldn’t determine which was right, it would affect the foundation of the Ancient Domain.","The sooner the Dao Orthodoxy was unified, the faster the number of strong cultivators would increase.","The current Holy Land Dao Orthodoxy was clearly flawed.","It had to be changed.","Lord Long didn’t care about right or wrong. He only wanted the Ancient Domain to become stronger.","After all, there was no life-changing opportunity in the Ancient Domain worth fighting to the death for."]},{"number":6447,"title":"Chapter 6447: Defeat Me!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6447: Defeat Me!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As for those experts from other realms, upon seeing the cultivation methods in the Ancient Domain, they could only smile bitterly and shake their heads.","If the Sacred Land occupied the entire Ancient Domain, there would only be a few powerful figures that could emerge. It would be incredibly difficult for anyone below the level of Emperor to make a name for themselves.","The Ancient Court needed to change this situation.","What Lord Long spoke of as the “great undertaking” referred precisely to this.","Jiang Ni, having seen much in her life, listened carefully to Lord Long’s explanation.","It reminded her of Wei Jiuxian, whom she had met in the Human Realm.","He was very similar to Lord Long.","At that time, Jiang Ni could only look up to figures like Wei Jiuxian.","Now that she had gained strength, she encountered a Wei Jiuxian of the Ancient Domain.","Without hesitation, she agreed.","Upon hearing this, Lord Long smiled and said, “Then let’s proceed. I will now open the formation of the Bifaced Deity’s Palace, and let you enter alone!”","Allowing Jiang Ni into the formation was nothing, and even if he were to hand over the Ancient Court to her, Lord Long would be willing.","Because in this world, power belonged to the strong.","Jiang Ni, as a Dao Lord, was not weaker than he was.","Once she fully mastered the Dao, she would undoubtedly surpass the Sacred Lord in strength.","By then, the entire Ancient Domain would belong to Jiang Ni.","The Ancient Court was merely keeping it temporarily.","An agreement was reached between them.","They ignored the others.","In fact, there weren’t many others around.","Yang Dingtian appeared like a clown, while the Emperor within the Ancient Gate remained silent.","Xiang Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen were communicating with Jian Wushuang through secret transmissions.","Jian Wushuang stood in the void, pointing a finger, and the seawater within the entire Covering Sea began to surge.","He was about to make his move.","As for the “great undertaking” of the Ancient Domain, he didn’t care.","But Jiang Ni was different.","He wanted to personally test Jiang Ni’s strength.","Noticing something was amiss, Lord Long immediately turned to look at Jian Wushuang.","This was a person even he couldn’t fully comprehend.","“Courting death!”","Lord Long instantly made his move.","Jian Wushuang grinned. Facing the massive shadow of Lord Long’s fist, his body shifted, transforming into a golden puppet.","Fifty thousand times divine power surged forth. With just a single finger, he suppressed Lord Long.","Emperor Yue Ying was dumbfounded. Just as he was about to speak, Jian Wushuang suppressed him as well.","Even the crippled Emperor Tian Can and the Emperor within the Ancient Gate were all suppressed.","A golden divine body.","Among the crowd present, aside from Immortal Jiu Chen and Xiang Yang, who knew Jian Wushuang’s true nature, there was one more who recognized the identity of this golden puppet.","It was the Emperor within the Ancient Gate.","“A golden puppet!”","“He actually sacrificed his body to become a golden puppet. Could there be a God-Eye clan expert in the Ancient Domain?”","The Emperor within the Ancient Gate exclaimed in shock.","But it was too late. He had been completely suppressed and couldn’t move.","Jian Wushuang, having transformed into the golden puppet, wielded fifty thousand times divine power.","However, when he landed before Jiang Ni, a dark red battle armor appeared on his body.","It was formed from a leaf of the World Tree.","Although the leaf had been plucked from the World Tree, it contained an individual life form.","It belonged to the plant-type life forms.","It was akin to the Ten Thousand Willows Divine Wood.","However, the current World Tree leaf was still too weak, with only ten thousand times divine power.","It barely compared to an innate treasure, but its combat power was definitely at the level of a tier 4 Emperor.","This was because its life level was too high.","The life level of the World Tree was on par with that of the Realm Beasts.","The life level contained in a single leaf was naturally far beyond anything in the Starry Sky.","“Who are you?”","Jiang Ni was dumbfounded.","She didn’t even know when she had offended such a powerful figure.","With a single hand, he had suppressed Lord Long.","At least a tier 4 peak, or even a tier 5 Emperor.","Could he be the Sacred Lord?","Only the Sacred Lord might possess such power.","“Don’t worry about who I am. Defeat me first!”","Jian Wushuang even altered his voice.","However, this explanation seemed somewhat far-fetched.","He spoke again:","“Don’t you want to save your mother? Defeat me, and you’ll find her!”","Indeed, words needed to strike where it hurt most.","Upon hearing this, Jiang Ni was initially stunned, then her Origin Source surged violently.","Even her life imprint trembled.","Her three Origin Sources were completely exposed.","For a moment, her power seemed on the verge of breaking through the tier 5 Emperor level.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t surprised.","It still wasn’t enough.","Far from it.","Boom!","Jiang Ni, without uttering a word, raised her hand, slashing through the void with a single strike.","Swoosh!","Jian Wushuang didn’t dodge. Instead, he crushed the sword’s energy with a mere grip, sneering, “Too weak. With just this level of strength, you think you can save your mother? Utterly delusional!”","After speaking, he kicked out, sending Jiang Ni flying backwards, crashing into the dark waters below.","Moments later, she emerged once again from the depths.","But Jian Wushuang didn’t give her any time to recover. He attacked again, unleashing divine power at fifty thousand times the normal strength—this was peak level might.","He was utterly overpowering Jiang Ni.","Yet her Origin Source grew stronger and stronger.","She broke through the tier 5 Emperor level, now reaching tier 6.","Still not enough.","She needed to be even stronger.","With trembling hands, Jiang Ni gripped her now-shattered divine sword, drawing strength from the thought of her mother.","Buzz!","She raised the divine sword, positioning it in front of her.","“Life and death, forging reincarnation!”","“With my sword’s path, witness my true heart!”","“Reincarnation Sword!”","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang felt a surge of memories and intense battle intent rising from within.","This was his ultimate skill!","The Sword of Life.","The Sword of Death.","The Sword of Reincarnation.","Now, Jiang Ni had perfectly replicated it.","And he was the one who had to face it.","Jian Wushuang found the sensation rather peculiar.","Pressing his palms together, he too responded to the moment.","“Unbeatable Golden Body!”","This was a technique Hu Qing once used at the Emperor level.","With a mere lowering of his brow, he became an invincible diamond.","“Kill!” Jiang Ni shouted angrily.","“Suppress!” Jian Wushuang roared in response.","Each unleashed their respective techniques, the ones that originally belonged to them.","A sword clashed against a Buddha’s form.","The two collided.","Heaven and earth lost their color.","The entire Nine Heavens of Overturned Seas shattered under the blows.","From then on, it was no longer the Overturned Seas.","It had truly become an endless ocean.","The ancient domain of the Overturned Seas was completely obliterated.","Boom!","In the collapsing world.","Jian Wushuang’s figure vanished.","Along with him, both Immortal Jiu Chen and Xiang Yang left as well.","The ancient gate, now freed from suppression, fled immediately.","Long Gong carried the unconscious Jiang Ni and the others as they left the Overturned Seas.","Three days later.","News of the destruction of the ancient Overturned Seas domain spread across the ancient domain worlds.","At the same time, the Emperor suppressed within the Twin Gods Palace was also released.","Lingxiao Boy betrayed them.","The Emperor who had been imprisoned returned to the Sacred Land, bringing Lingxiao Boy along.","But Lingxiao Boy felt some regret.","He could’ve used the world’s collapse to let that Emperor escape, then return to the Ancient Court himself.","He could’ve continued being an undercover agent.","Now, he had exposed himself for nothing.","Of the original 108 ancient domains, thirty-six had been destroyed by the Ancient Demon.","And now, another one had fallen apart.","However, this time, the Ancient Court found its savior.","Jiang Ni!","An extraordinary being.","Even though the Emperor from the Sacred Land had escaped, it didn’t matter.","This time, the Ancient Court still emerged victorious.","Long Gong once again became a great hero of the Ancient Court.","As for Jian Wushuang and the other two.","They didn’t immediately reunite with Jiang Ni.","Instead, they followed the ancient gate to an ancient domain belonging to the Sacred Land.","The Abyssal Ancient Domain.","As the name suggests, this ancient domain lay within an abyss.","But it wasn’t at the bottom of the abyss.","It was carved into the surrounding walls of the abyss, forming long corridors within it.","Stretching billions of miles in length, and a million miles wide.","It rose to ninety thousand miles in height.","Though it felt somewhat oppressive, the power within the abyss was incredibly dense.","It was an ideal place for cultivators to train."]},{"number":6448,"title":"Chapter 6448: Ancient Abyss Realm","paragraphs":["Chapter 6448: Ancient Abyss Realm","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Abyssal Realm had thus become the most unique place in the entire Ancient Domain.","Jian Wushuang and his two companions secretly followed the ancient gate into the abyss, without immediately contacting Jiang Ni.","Because now, Jiang Ni had the strength to protect herself.","In fact, she could roam freely throughout the Ancient Domain.","Whether they recognized each other sooner or later, it didn’t matter.","However, Jian Wushuang was particularly anxious about the Emperor within the ancient gate.","The silver puppets that the Emperor had summoned were exactly the same as the ones left behind by the Divine Eye Clan.","It wasn’t that they looked the same, but they had identical powers.","This person was definitely connected to the Divine Eye Clan.","Either he had obtained the inheritance of the Divine Eye Clan, or someone from the Divine Eye Clan was supporting him.","What Jian Wushuang currently lacked the most were powerful warriors from the Divine Eye Clan.","If he could secure another one, his strength would increase once again.","They had now reached the ninety-ninth level of the Abyssal Realm.","This corridor lay at the deepest part of the Abyssal Realm.","It was the place where the energy was densest and also the most dangerous.","Most practitioners could only reach this level, but the abyss was far deeper than that.","There was a tale of someone throwing a Dao Master servant down, and after months of descent, the servant still hadn’t reached the bottom, but their consciousness and Origin Source were destroyed by an overwhelming force from the abyss below.","Ultimately, they perished.","Many had attempted to enter the abyss, but they all fell.","Even now, some still believed that treasures existed within the abyss.","But many more thought that a terrifying being resided in its depths.","Standing at the edge of the abyssal corridor, Jian Wushuang and his two companions leaned on the railing, gazing down into the abyss.","“Brother Wushuang, you’ve seen much in your travels. Tell me, could this abyss be the Abyss of the Universe?” Xue Yang asked.","The Abyss of the Universe that Xue Yang referred to was something Jian Wushuang had heard of but never encountered.","He had seen the Abyss of Time and Space.","It was the abyss connected to the River of Time and Space, and he had even ventured to its bottom.","But it wasn’t particularly special.","He hadn’t expected that the Ancient Domain would contain such an abyss.","Moreover, monsters occasionally flew out from this abyss.","However, their strength was weak.","These creatures were strange, growing weaker the closer they were to the abyss’s mouth.","The most powerful monsters appearing at the ninety-ninth level were only at the Dao Master level.","And the energy they wielded wasn’t divine power but a destructive force.","It equated to around five thousand times the power of divine energy.","A Holy Land Dao Master, whose strength rivaled that of an Emperor, could easily crush them with a single hand.","If an Emperor were stationed here, they could even open up a new corridor.","Jian Wushuang stared down into the abyss. It was different from the abyss he had seen before.","If this were the Abyss of Time and Space, there wouldn’t be any strong beings living nearby.","As for the Universe Abyss, he had heard of it but knew it didn’t possess this kind of dark magic. An Emperor could generally explore such a place with ease.","But this abyss, even a Holy Lord couldn’t deal with.","Clearly, it wasn’t the Universe Abyss.","“I’m not sure. It looks strange and is quite different from the abyss I encountered in the past!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Hearing this, Xue Yang’s excitement grew. “If even you haven’t seen this before, doesn’t that mean this abyss might not exist in the outside Realm? If we come back here after becoming an Emperor or Universe Master, there’s bound to be great treasures waiting for us!”","“Haha, you’re too naive!” Immortal Jiu Chen sneered. “Based on what I know, this abyss is likely a passage.”","“A passage?” Jian Wushuang was stunned.","Xue Yang scoffed at Jiu Chen’s claim, dismissing it. “You’re full of it. What does a mere Universe Master’s soul fragment know?”","“I’ve told you countless times, the Master of Divine Fire is a Demigod—a Demigod, with the potential to become a Universe God, someone capable of ascending to the heavens!!!”","Jian Wushuang interrupted the two men’s argument and said, “Stop arguing. Tell me about this abyss, or the passage you mentioned!”","Immortal Jiu Chen, upon hearing this, adopted a haughty demeanor and slowly began to speak:","“I also learned of this from the memories of the Lord of Divine Fire. This passage likely leads to a place of inheritance for the Divine Eye Clan.”","“Don’t mistake it for those inheritances in the Ancient Domain. Those are trash. Though they were also established by a Universe Master of the Divine Eye Clan, they can only impart the first five transformations. While the first five transformations can allow a Universe Master to dominate, the Lord of Divine Fire once accidentally entered an abyss, where he discovered a true inheritance site of the Divine Eye Clan. There, he obtained the Nine-Eye Inheritance, which contains the complete Nine Transformations Secret Art of the Divine Eye. From then on, his rise was meteoric. Becoming a Universe God would have been an easy task for him, but unfortunately, he suddenly perished for reasons unknown.”","After finishing, Immortal Jiu Chen sighed with some regret.","If the Lord of Divine Fire hadn’t fallen, there would have been no opportunity for him. Yet, his fall still evoked a sense of pity.","After all, it was the perfect inheritance of the Nine Transformations!","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was surprised and said, “It seems that the inheritance the Lord of Divine Fire stumbled upon back then is the holy ground of the entire Divine Eye Clan!”","The Nine Transformations Inheritance was something only Senior Brother Guiyan had.","It must have been left behind by Senior Brother Guiyan, which was why the Lord of Divine Fire had called him ‘Martial Uncle.’","Since he had obtained Senior Brother Guiyan’s inheritance, he naturally became his disciple.","“So, there must be a great treasure down there!” Jian Wushuang smiled faintly. “You could say that!”","However, entering it likely required a high standard.","Without another word, and to the astonishment of the two men, Jian Wushuang leaped into the abyss.","This scene left both Xue Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen dumbfounded.","Some of the powerful cultivators observing the abyss also gasped in shock when they saw Jian Wushuang jump in.","Although people occasionally jumped into the abyss, not many had seen it happen with their own eyes.","“Look! Another fool has jumped in!”","“He seems fairly strong,” an elder commented calmly.","A younger cultivator sneered, “What good is strength? Even an Emperor would perish down there. He’s probably just another bored cultivator seeking death!”","“What a shame.”","Several others echoed similar sentiments.","But it only stirred some brief excitement.","Before long, everyone returned to their meditation and resumed cultivating.","Meanwhile, Jian Wushuang plunged deeper into the abyss.","He had already mastered the first three transformations of the Nine Transformations Secret Art.","The power within the abyss could not harm him.","However, the further down he went, the more intense the mental assaults became.","Jian Wushuang, possessing the consciousness of a Realm Beast, barely felt the assaults—it was nothing more than an itch to him.","Even though the mental impact had reached a level capable of annihilating peak experts, it still didn’t affect him.","However, he dared not descend any further.","The reason was that the number of monsters around him had increased dramatically.","Each of them was at the peak level.","Although Jian Wushuang had divine power equivalent to fifty thousand times the strength of an ordinary Universe God, aided by the leaves of the Realm Tree and the secret mental techniques, even he found it strenuous to deal with so many monsters.","In short, his mental resilience was sufficient.","His mastery of the Divine Eye Secret Art, however, was lacking.","And in terms of combat strength, he was far behind.","He had no choice but to fly back up.","As long as his mind wasn’t under threat, Jian Wushuang could fly back out of the abyss.","Other cultivators, however, had their consciousness overwhelmed, preventing them from moving. They were forced to fall deeper into the abyss.","The fortunate ones avoided monsters and were ultimately destroyed by the mental assaults.","The unlucky ones encountered the monsters and were devoured on the spot."]},{"number":6449,"title":"Chapter 6449: Lingxiao Boy","paragraphs":["Chapter 6449: Lingxiao Boy","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang returned to the surface without alerting anyone.","He simply reminded Immortal Jiu Chen and Xue Yang, who were watching the abyss, and led them away from its edge.","The corridor was wide.","They entered the main city of the ninety-ninth floor corridor and temporarily settled there, waiting for the person they were tracking to appear.","The man from the ancient gate was someone all three of them had met before.","It was none other than Emperor Duobao, the one who had hosted the auction.","He was also a disciple of Emperor Yue Ying.","Yet, he had unclear ties with the Holy Land.","Of course, he didn’t have any direct affiliation with the Holy Land.","The reason he came here was to meet someone.","Lingxiao Boy.","After betraying his faction, Lingxiao Boy entered the Holy Land.","A few days later, under the guise of visiting the abyss, he met Emperor Duobao at the ninety-ninth-floor corridor of the abyss world.","Jian Wushuang observed all of this.","However, he had no idea what they discussed.","When they met, the two of them entered the ancient gate.","Jian Wushuang could sense the auras within the gate but couldn’t discern what they were saying.","It was clear that they had shielded the time and space around them.","Such an ability to block time and space wasn’t something the ancient gate could achieve on its own. There was likely another treasure inside that Jian Wushuang wasn’t aware of.","Based on Lingxiao Boy’s respectful attitude during their meeting, it was evident that Emperor Duobao held a higher status.","He also possessed the most treasures.","To avoid startling the enemy, Jian Wushuang didn’t act immediately.","Instead, after the meeting, he secretly followed Lingxiao Boy back to his residence.","Late at night.","Inside the grand hall where Lingxiao Boy resided, the atmosphere was dark and dense with power.","Tap!","Jian Wushuang made no attempt to conceal himself as he walked directly toward Lingxiao Boy.","Lingxiao Boy immediately noticed and quickly stood up.","“Who are you?”","“Who I am doesn’t matter. Who you are is what’s important to me!”","With that, Jian Wushuang raised his hand and suppressed the space around them.","Not only did he block Lingxiao Boy’s escape route, but he also sealed off all methods of communication using Thought power.","In other words, there was no way for Lingxiao Boy to call for help—not even Emperor Duobao would be alerted.","“What do you want? I’m warning you, you better not act recklessly, or you’ll surely die! No one will be able to save you!” Lingxiao Boy backed away, trying to contact Emperor Duobao.","But he quickly realized his voice couldn’t reach outside.","With no other choice, he gave up and looked at Jian Wushuang. Taking a deep breath, he threatened, “Do you know who I am? Do you know what kind of power stands behind me? If you dare touch me, you’ll die a horrible death!”","“I might not touch you if you can show me a power capable of threatening my life.”","Jian Wushuang stood still, waiting for Lingxiao Boy to invoke the power behind him.","If he presented a strong enough backing, perhaps Jian Wushuang would spare him.","But if he didn’t... well, Jian Wushuang wouldn’t hesitate to deal with him.","He didn’t mind taking Lingxiao Boy’s head to confront Emperor Duobao.","Even if Lingxiao Boy had some backup plan, Jian Wushuang had prepared five golden-armored puppets, capable of forcibly taking him down.","The only concern was whether Lingxiao Boy had a final measure, like self-destruction, preventing him from being captured alive.","Since the stakes were high, Jian Wushuang couldn’t afford to be careless.","“Go ahead, start your performance,” Jian Wushuang said, controlling Lingxiao Boy with ease.","If Lingxiao Boy dared to have any devious thoughts, Jian Wushuang could kill his soul instantly.","Such was the unique power of the soul secret technique.","It allowed him to kill without a trace.","If not for the treasure guarding Lingxiao Boy’s soul and the fact that he was under the protection of an Emperor, Jian Wushuang could have used a soul search technique, transformed into Lingxiao Boy’s likeness, infiltrated the Holy Land, and connected with Emperor Duobao.","That would have been the perfect plan.","“Just kill me!”","Suddenly, Lingxiao Boy’s expression shifted, seeking death.","This abrupt resolve took Jian Wushuang by surprise.","“What’s this? Are you so willing to die for the Divine Eye Clan?”","“Heh, you have no idea what true terror is,” Lingxiao Boy sneered coldly.","Jian Wushuang frowned, but this didn’t pose much of a challenge to him.","Since Lingxiao Boy wanted to die, Jian Wushuang would grant his wish.","“Soul retraction!”","Buzz!","Ling Xiao’s soul suddenly shot out from his divine body, transforming into a small ball, and began to shrink continuously.","During the process of shrinking, Ling Xiao also entered an illusion.","Before his eyes, Jian Wushuang disappeared, only to be replaced by Emperor Duobao.","“Brother Duobao, save me!” Ling Xiao, as if sleepwalking, began to plead for help from Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang raised his hand and said, “I have already saved your soul...”","He had exploited the weakness in Ling Xiao’s heart and cast an illusion.","Ling Xiao obediently fell into the trap Jian Wushuang had laid.","Through this, Jian Wushuang delved into Ling Xiao’s consciousness and uncovered the so-called secret.","Emperor Duobao.","He had long been possessed.","This secret was indeed surprising.","As for the one who possessed him, Ling Xiao wasn’t entirely sure, but a new term appeared in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","The Void!","Emperor Duobao came from the Void.","He was a monster from the crevices of the Void.","Jian Wushuang frantically searched his memory, trying to recall anything about the Void.","In this world, he had never heard of it.","But in the Realm God Continent, there had been an old rumor.","When the Realm God Continent shattered, some powerful beings were trapped in fragments of it.","These fragments eventually evolved into layers of the Void, becoming part of the Void itself.","Over time, these people could not escape the shattered fragments and gradually fell into ruin, becoming fused with the Void.","If that were all, the outside world would not have known that the Void housed a large group of mutated cultivators.","However, after the Realm God Continent was rebuilt, those fallen beings from the Void resurfaced.","They brought quite a bit of trouble to the newly established Realm God Continent.","But it was only minor trouble, as how many strong beings could the crevices of the Void truly contain?","No matter how weak the Realm God Continent became, it still had the Nine-Star Universe Gods. Dealing with those fallen Void cultivators was not a difficult task.","If the Realm God Continent had Void cultivators, then this world likely did as well.","After all, both were fragments of the shattered Realm God Continent.","In fact, this world could be said to exist within a crevice of the Void itself.","So the existence of the Void was not surprising!","It was just that this was the first time he had heard of it since entering this world.","It also differed somewhat from his expectations.","He had initially thought it was related to the Divine Eye Clan.","He hadn’t expected the Void to be involved.","Compared to the Divine Eye Clan, the Void had an even more tragic fate.","Back then, they had clearly been victims, but after being absorbed into the fragments and assimilated by the Void, even if they later managed to break into the Realm God Continent, they were regarded as monsters.","This was because these Void cultivators had already been tainted with the aura of the Realm Beasts.","They devoured cultivators.","They had become true demons.","Not much different from demonic creatures.","In the end, all the Void cultivators that appeared on the Realm God Continent were slain.","The only difference between them and demonic creatures was that they retained their original memories, but they could no longer control their urge to devour."]},{"number":6450,"title":"Chapter 6450: The Holy Lord Has Already Fallen","paragraphs":["Chapter 6450: The Holy Lord Has Already Fallen","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the end, the powerhouses of the New Realm God Continent were slain one by one.","They became stepping stones for newcomers.","The Void cultivators were truly pitiful.","But this had nothing to do with Jian Wushuang.","“Is Duobao backed by the Void? But why would they help the Holy Lord?” Jian Wushuang was a bit curious.","Or perhaps, they weren’t helping the Holy Lord at all and just wanted to stir up internal strife in the Ancient Domain World, taking the opportunity to devour it?","That wasn’t impossible.","He sent a message to Immortal Jiu Chen, asking about the Void.","From Jiu Chen’s words, Jian Wushuang learned that the Void had appeared before.","Back then, the Lord of Divine Fire encountered quite a few of them.","However, their strength was very weak. To grow stronger, they needed to control a major world, devouring all the cultivators within it, and transferring their accumulated cultivation into a divine body. Using one major world, they could nurture a supreme powerhouse.","Then, two would merge and devour more worlds, until they eventually became Universe Masters.","But that was extremely difficult.","Usually, by the time they devoured their second or even third world, they would be detected by a Universe Master, and from that point, they wouldn’t be able to escape being killed.","After all, for the Void to become a Universe Master, they first needed to devour the Origin Source of the universe.","Although there weren’t many Universe Masters in this universe, the range of their exploration was vast.","In this universe alone, there were likely more than one Universe Master.","Each of them could explore this universe thoroughly.","The Void would barely reveal themselves before being slain.","However, when devouring the first world, due to their inherent weakness, they wouldn’t be detected unless a Universe Master was constantly probing the entire universe.","The chances of that were extremely low.","If it happened, it could only be said that the Void cultivator was incredibly unlucky.","“Void!”","Jian Wushuang was a bit disappointed.","He had thought it might be related to the Divine Eye clan, but it turned out to be the Void, and he instantly lost all interest.","However, he still inquired about the details of Emperor Duobao.","He came from the Void and was its representative.","As for Ling Xiao, he was merely a puppet of Emperor Duobao.","Within his soul was the Void’s mark, and if he ever revealed Duobao’s secrets, his soul would be obliterated.","Even if someone used a soul search, he would still be killed.","Only when facing Void cultivators could he speak the truth.","Whether in illusions or in reality, Jian Wushuang could replicate the aura of a Void cultivator.","At that moment, he tore away the disguise and transformed into the appearance of a Void cultivator.","“Ling Xiao, where has the Holy Lord gone?”","Ling Xiao, in his dazed state, muttered, “The Holy Lord has already perished!”","“What is Emperor Duobao’s next goal? Does he have any connection with the Divine Eye clan?”","“Emperor Duobao ordered me to stir up trouble in the Holy Land and prepare for a decisive battle with the Ancient Court. I never heard him mention the Divine Eye clan, but I know he once found a Divine Eye clan relic in the Chaos Void!”","This explained how Duobao had been able to summon a Divine Eye clan puppet earlier.","After extracting all the valuable information, Jian Wushuang spared Ling Xiao’s life.","It wasn’t because he was soft-hearted, but because killing him would be pointless.","In fact, it would only make Emperor Duobao more suspicious.","Duobao’s goal was to devour the Ancient Domain World, which didn’t have much to do with Jian Wushuang.","However, the treasures on Emperor Duobao’s body were of some use to him.","He had run out of divine blood. If Emperor Duobao still had some left, Jian Wushuang could use it to transform into a Universe God of the Divine Eye clan, allowing him to mass-produce golden-armored puppets.","The lack of top-tier combat strength around him constantly made him feel insecure.","If he encountered a cultivator from the Divine clan, he wouldn’t have the power to suppress them.","Against supreme combat strength, he could rely on numbers to win.","But against those above tier 3, it would be much harder.","They were comparable to Universe Masters, and no matter how many golden-armored puppets he had, they might still be useless.","“It seems I need to place all my bets on Jiang Ni!” Jian Wushuang sighed inwardly.","He hadn’t expected Jiang Ni to be so powerful; it was a pleasant surprise.","But relying on his little niece to fight for him made him feel a bit embarrassed.","At times, he realized he still needed to cultivate his own forces.","For example, Void cultivators.","He was quite interested in this.","If he could cultivate a Universe Master from the Void Clan, then by giving them a microscopic universe to devour, they could directly become a demigod.","After all, each microscopic universe was an ultimate universe body.","The most perfect of universes, almost comparable to the Origin Source of a Universe God.","He possessed the Boundless Body, which could help conceal everything for the other party.","Confuse the Universe Master.","“Void...”","Jian Wushuang’s figure left the courtyard.","He took Xue Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen with him, departing from the Abyss World and heading toward the Ancient Court World.","During the years of silence, the Ancient Domain World had undergone even greater changes.","The Holy Land counterattacked, regaining its original territory.","Now, both sides were once again evenly matched.","The fighting grew fiercer.","At the same time, the news of the Holy Master’s fall had spread.","This ignited a burning fighting spirit in the once-dispirited strongmen of the Ancient Court.","The first battlefield at the border was the shattered Sea-Covering World from several years ago.","This place had become the first battlefield in the Domain War.","Every day, battles erupted.","It was common for Dao Masters to join the fray, and even the Emperor, who had previously been imprisoned, personally oversaw this battlefield.","However, this time, he brought a supreme innate treasure with him.","Single-handedly, he suppressed nine tier 3 Emperors, mercilessly crushing them. If it weren’t for Lord Long holding the line, the entire battlefield would have been breached long ago.","For now, both sides remained somewhat restrained, with Emperors rarely entering the battlefield.","The Dao Masters had become the main combat force.","Every day, teams were formed to engage in brutal skirmishes.","Of course, as battles grew fiercer, more Dao Masters were drawn in, escalating the conflict.","One could say there was a minor battle every three days and a major battle every five days.","At times, more than a thousand Dao Masters would engage in combat simultaneously.","The intensity was unimaginable.","Yet, both sides fought fiercely, each with the confidence of devouring the other.","After all, the three Emperors of the Holy Land could join forces to overpower the Ancient Court, giving them an advantage.","The Ancient Court had no choice but to band together.","Now, both sides were seeking opportunities, looking for ways to turn the tide.","They were also preparing their trump cards.","For instance, the Ancient Court had just recruited an unparalleled Dao Master.","Jiang Ni!","She had been personally recruited by Lord Long into the Ancient Court and was currently cultivating there.","However, it was not for the purpose of achieving Unity.","Rather, it was to comprehend the Dao of Life.","Once she elevated the Origin Source of Life to a perfected Dao Master level, achieving perfection in both ultimate Daos, Jiang Ni’s combat power would soar to the absolute pinnacle.","By then, she could sweep through the entire Holy Land.","If it weren’t for Jian Wushuang’s earlier probing, which made the Ancient Court more cautious, Jiang Ni would likely have already led the Ancient Court in sweeping through the Holy Land by now.","But Jian Wushuang’s trip to the Ancient Court this time wasn’t because of Jiang Ni.","Right now, Jiang Ni’s strength was still insufficient.","She still needed more tempering.","It wouldn’t be too late to reunite with her once he left the Ancient Domain World.","His current target was the Emperor Duobao.","According to Lingxiao Boy, Emperor Duobao had already returned to the Ancient Court.","Jian Wushuang planned to lie in wait in the Ancient Court, awaiting the right moment.","He wasn’t planning to strike directly but intended to wait for Emperor Duobao to make a move on the Ancient Domain World.","At that time, Jian Wushuang would seize the opportunity to suppress a fully-fledged Void cultivator."]},{"number":6451,"title":"Chapter 6451: Void Cultivator","paragraphs":["Chapter 6451: Void Cultivator","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Then enslave the other party, helping them devour the Origin Source of the Universe and become the Universe Master.","By then, they would devour the microcosm, becoming a super strong demigod at the peak.","At that time, not only would the Fourth Tribulation be nothing, but even the Fifth and Sixth Tribulations could be suppressed easily.","He would then aim for the beast’s King-level Origin Source.","A King-level beast!","A precursor to the Divine King.","Such a being was worthy of opening up the Starry Sky.","There were likely very few of such beings in the Land of Disorder.","By then, his strength would surpass even the Prophet from his memory, becoming even stronger.","In the future, he could also aid Master Xuan Yi.","He definitely didn’t want to die again.","The boundary!","A flying boat weaved through the chaotic currents, its movement strange.","Within the turbulent flow, the boat darted here and there, yet never crossed the boundary.","To outsiders, it seemed like it was just circling in place.","Buzz!","“Still haven’t found it?”","“Reporting to the General, the position of the Void Gate often shifts, so it’s normal to not find it right away. We just need to keep trying, and we’ll find it eventually!”","Aboard the boat, a soul entity clad in black battle armor shouted angrily, “Keep trying? How long will that take? This time entering the Void Gate is the one and only chance in billions of years to break free from the cage. We have waited a long time; we cannot disappoint the ancestors trapped inside the Void. We must locate the Void Gate quickly!”","“Understood!”","The soul entity controlling the boat responded repeatedly, continuing the search for the Void Gate.","Their luck was surprisingly good. After trying hundreds of thousands of times, they finally located the Void Gate, and the entire boat silently slipped into a black hole.","The black hole vanished, and the turbulent flow remained the same.","Not long after, another flying boat passed through the chaotic currents.","Inside this boat’s cockpit, Jian Wushuang stood in front of a transparent window, gazing out at the turbulence.","“Quite the daring lot, these Void Cultivators. They hid their Dark Gate here of all places!”","On his journey to the Ancient Court, Jian Wushuang had encountered a peculiar flying boat and had been following it ever since.","A strange boat, manned by strange cultivators.","All of it connected to the Void.","Unexpectedly, he’d stumbled upon a big catch. Right in front of him, they had entered the Void.","Jian Wushuang could easily open the Void Gate. But even if he did, entering wouldn’t serve much purpose.","At best, he could wipe out those Void Cultivators.","The Ancient Domain was small, and the Void fissure within the Ancient Domain could not possibly harbor too powerful cultivators.","At most, they’d be tier five or tier six Emperors.","Such a small place couldn’t possibly support the existence of supreme beings.","Even if they held a supreme position in the Void, without a divine body, their combat power remained weak.","They were no match for Jian Wushuang. But there was no need to act right now.","It would be better to control everything from the shadows, like a farmer waiting to pick ripe fruit.","“Should we go in?” Immortal Jiu Chen asked.","Jian Wushuang shook his head. It wasn’t yet time for his performance.","“Let’s head to the Ancient Court. I need to check on Jiang Ni. Her second Ultimate Dao should be nearing completion!”","For now, all he needed to do was sit back and watch.","It wasn’t worth his time to intervene.","Unless it involved someone from the God-Eye Clan.","Just like in the mortal realm, he hardly ever intervened, especially as his strength continued to grow.","Whenever he did act, it was either a matter of great importance or life-threatening danger.","Otherwise, there was no reason for him to get involved.","The flying boat passed through the Overturning Sea Battlefield, entering the Thirty-Six Ancient Domains controlled by the Ancient Court.","Jian Wushuang and his party arrived at the main stronghold of the Ancient Court.","The Ancient Domain Star!","This world was an ancient star.","Though a star, it was incomparably vast.","Stretching across the north and south, it was larger than most Ancient Domains.","If a Grand Completion cultivator were to fly a thousand miles per breath, it would take them ten thousand years to traverse the entire Ancient Domain Star.","Rumor had it that this was still the core of the Ancient Domain World.","There was great fortune to be found here.","However, it had always been dominated by the Heavenly Court.","Even the Holy Lord back then could do nothing about this place.","As a result, no one dared to covet it.","One of the main reasons Jian Wushuang had come this time was because of the Ancient Domain Star.","While it could block the Holy Lord’s tier six power, it couldn’t stop him.","Floating outside the Ancient Domain Star, Guardian Yunhai respectfully introduced, “Lord, entering the Ancient Domain Star is quite troublesome. You need to pay a deposit and undergo an identity check. If your identity isn’t registered in the Ancient Domain World, you’ll need to pay an even higher deposit!”","“They’re keeping it under strict control,” Jian Wushuang remarked, casting a glance at the flying ships in the void behind him. With a thought, one of the normally flying ships vanished from the void in an instant.","Several other ships flew by, unaware of the strange event that had just occurred.","Jian Wushuang extended his palm, and the ship that had just been outside was now floating in his hand.","This scene left Guardian Yunhai and the others utterly shocked.","Even Immortal Jiu Chen found it incredibly astonishing.","“This is mastery over space at its peak!” Immortal Jiu Chen exclaimed in awe.","He had seen the Lord of Divine Fire, a powerful demigod.","The Lord of Divine Fire had long mastered space, but compared to Jian Wushuang’s technique just now, even the Lord of Divine Fire seemed somewhat clumsy.","It couldn’t be helped; the Lord of Divine Fire’s Origin Source Universe was probably no larger than a thousandfold universe.","But Jian Wushuang had almost cultivated the River of Time and Space back in the day.","His foundation was the ten-thousandfold Origin Source Universe.","A ten-thousandfold Origin Source Universe placed him among the peak nine-star Universe Gods.","Among nine-star Universe Gods, Jian Wushuang was already invincible.","Of course, all of this was thanks to the will of the Realm Beast.","Now that he had fully become a Realm Beast, once he returned to his peak, he would be able to surpass Universe Gods.","Although he didn’t dare claim to rival the God of Time and Space, he would at least have part of their strength.","After all, he had only ever seen one God of Time and Space, and that person hadn’t even made a move, so he didn’t know the true power of a God of Time and Space.","After transforming into a Realm Beast, Jian Wushuang had developed unique insights into the exploration of Origin Source.","His future potential would only continue to rise.","“Are the six of you also planning to visit the Ancient Domain Star?” he asked.","Guardian Yunhai and the others were immediately both surprised and flattered.","Seeing their expressions, Jian Wushuang didn’t hold back. He directly retrieved nine bodies from the ship in his palm.","“These are all True Immortals, complete with identity information. Take a look. You can use their identities later!”","“Thank you, Lord!” The six of them were deeply grateful.","Although they now possessed near-invincible strength, their knowledge was still somewhat lacking.","They were eager to see what the Ancient Domain Star had to offer.","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly and said, “You’ve been calling me Lord, but I haven’t even established a proper force yet. Now that you’ve got me thinking about it, when we enter the Ancient Domain Star, I’ll find some good sword talents and establish a Sword Pavilion where the sword reigns supreme!”","“Lord Wushuang, your name will spread across the entire universe!”","Xue Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen couldn’t help but mock, “Jian Wushuang is being puffed up by all your praises!”"]},{"number":6452,"title":"Chapter 6452: Ancient Star Domain","paragraphs":["Chapter 6452: Ancient Star Domain","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Outside the Ninth Teleportation Array of the Ancient Star Domain.","“Flying boat ahead, halt immediately!” A Daoist Lord clad in black battle armor spoke with authority.","On the chest of his battle armor was the character for “General.”","This was a general among the Heavenly Soldiers of the Ancient Court.","He possessed the combat power of a Daoist Lord, commanding an army of ten thousand True Immortals under his banner.","As the name suggested, his army consisted of ten thousand True Immortals.","Additionally, he oversaw a preparatory camp of True Immortals, which included a million cultivators in the Great Ascension Stage, continuously replenishing his ranks of True Immortals.","Of course, not all the Heavenly Soldiers were at the ninth step of True Immortal.","Those who could attain the ninth step of True Immortal in the Heavenly Soldiers were given positions, such as commanders within the ranks of the Heavenly Soldiers.","Some even achieved the rank of Great Commander, capable of leading five thousand Heavenly Soldiers.","And this was only among the elites of the Heavenly Soldiers in the Ancient Court.","Beyond the Heavenly Soldiers in the Heavenly Hall, there were also the Pill Hall, the Dao Hall, the Immortal Hall, the Secret Hall, and others.","After all, after developing for hundreds of thousands of years, the Ancient Court had an absolutely perfect system.","Take the generals of the Heavenly Hall, for instance—each general was like an individual entity.","They nurtured their own Heavenly Soldiers.","It just so happened that the prestigious position overseeing the Ninth Teleportation Array had fallen into the hands of a general from the Heavenly Hall.","It was well known that the daily collection of security deposits amounted to an astronomical figure.","After intercepting a flying boat, the general personally stepped forward to question them.","This was because the flying boat held three Daoist Lords.","It required his personal involvement. If it had been just one Daoist Lord, he wouldn’t have needed to appear.","Swish!","The flying boat came to a halt, and nine figures emerged.","Leading them was an elegant young master, exuding wealth and nobility, with a fan in hand.","“General Li, it’s been a long time!” The noble young master greeted warmly, stepping forward. “It’s been three thousand years since we last met!”","Recognizing an old acquaintance, General Li relaxed a little and said calmly, “It has been some time. Brother Shangguan, your strength seems to have improved considerably over the years. Could it be that this time you’re confident in breaking through to the seventh level of the Ancient Tower?”","“I’ve gained some insights and came to give it a try. You know, my father has just...” Shangguan sighed.","Upon hearing this, General Li’s expression grew more solemn. He said, “Shangguan, I’ve heard about your father’s situation. I never expected the war this time to be so severe, even involving the Emperor...”","“But don’t worry, we all support you in taking over as the Sword Pavilion Master. With us old brothers by your side, that traitor won’t stand a chance!”","Shangguan, moved, replied, “At this crucial moment, I’ll have to rely on all of you!”","“This is nothing. I was also once part of the Sword Pavilion. Though the old Pavilion Master has fallen, the legacy remains, and so do our fellow disciples!” General Li patted his chest in reassurance.","After a bit of small talk, Shangguan took out a mustard seed-sized object and said, “Brother Li, we’ll head inside first. See you again in the Ancient Star Domain!”","“Mm!”","General Li did not hesitate and accepted the mustard seed.","This was the rule. Even if it was his own father, they still had to give a deposit.","Because money could be returned.","But before it was returned, they could use it.","If there was no money to return, they would have to use the travel pass as collateral.","Otherwise, how could he feed his ten thousand soldiers and one hundred thousand reserves?","Shangguan and his group entered the teleportation array and disappeared in an instant.","When they reappeared, they were already on the Ancient Domain Star.","There was only one city within the Ancient Domain Star.","But it covered most of the star.","Outside the city was the wilderness, full of various demonic beasts.","Some were even of the Emperor level.","The reason they weren’t completely suppressed was to train the cultivators.","The Lord of the Ancient Court’s method was quite good. By leaving some threats behind, he could better stimulate the cultivators’ potential.","“Tianyong City!”","A very familiar name.","The city was named Tianyong because, above it, Nine Heavens floated.","This was the Ancient Court.","Nine layers of heaven!","Only the cultivators of the Ancient Court could enter the Nine Heavens.","The Nine Heavens were also divided into nine levels.","The true Nine Heavens was the birthplace of the Ancient Court.","To ascend to the Nine Heavens, one had to become an Emperor.","Otherwise, they had no qualification to reach the Nine Heavens.","The first eight layers were still manageable.","Besides the requirement of status, there were no realm restrictions.","Some of the descendants of Emperors, even if they hadn’t become True Immortals, could still go to the eighth heaven to cultivate.","The entire Nine Heavens, starting from the first level, saw the aura of the world’s Origin Source grow stronger with each ascended level.","By the time one reached the ninth heaven, it was the place with the richest Origin Source in the Ancient Moon World, except for the holy lands.","Of course, compared to the universe’s Origin Source, the difference was immeasurable.","In Tianyong City.","Within a certain teleportation array in the southern city, Jian Wushuang and the others casually walked out.","“Wushuang, I must say, your acting skills are really something. You were chatting so warmly with that Senior Brother Li just now that I almost thought your body had been taken over by the consciousness of this identity!” Xue Yang couldn’t help but praise.","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly and said, “I’ve already absorbed all of Shangguan Yu’s memories. I’m completely aware of everything he experienced, so naturally, I can evoke all the right emotions. It’s no surprise the other party didn’t detect anything wrong.”","Earlier, the nine people at the ninth teleportation array were Jian Wushuang and his group.","The identity Jian Wushuang had chosen, while it couldn’t access the Nine Heavens, allowed him to roam freely anywhere.","If he had picked a weaker identity, he would have been timid and cautious even on the Ancient Domain Star.","That’s why he chose Shangguan Yu’s identity.","As for the original owner, Jian Wushuang had thrown him into the universe’s Origin Source on the third level of the Nine Prison Pagoda.","He had only scanned the other’s soul and reviewed his memories.","The others needed the body, though.","The original soul consciousness was also thrown into the universe’s Origin Source.","It was essentially a forced transaction.","But once inside the universe’s Origin Source, the original owner had already come to terms with it.","Maybe, in time, he would emerge as an Emperor; that wasn’t impossible.","“Lord, the Ancient Domain Star has three treasures. The first is the Ancient Tower, the second is the Nine Heavens, and the third is the Underground Palace.”","Jian Wushuang nodded and said, “I know. The Ancient Tower contains the world’s Origin Source, which can test the strength of Dao Lords. As for the Nine Heavens, no need to say more. The third, the Underground Palace, is worth checking out.”","He had absorbed Shangguan Yu’s memories and was very familiar with the Ancient Domain Star. After all, in the memories, Shangguan Yu had grown up on this star.","He was the eldest son of an Emperor in the Ancient Court.","A peak Dao Lord, even stronger than the Two-Faced Buddha.","His divine body was five thousand times stronger, and his Origin Source was already at the edge of merging with the Dao, with his Origin Dao being second-grade.","Once he successfully merged with the Dao, he would become a tier 2 Emperor. After cultivating the world’s Origin Source, he could quickly rise to a tier 3 Emperor.","Strictly speaking, Shangguan Yu was a prodigy.","Unfortunately, before a prodigy could become a true powerhouse, his father had perished.","Shangguan Xuan!","The Sword Pavilion Lord of the Ancient Court.","The Ancient Court had two great Sword Pavilions: one belonged to Emperor Yue Ying, and the other to Shangguan Xuan.","However, Shangguan Xuan’s strength was inferior to Emperor Yue Ying’s.","He had always been overshadowed, and now that Shangguan Xuan had fallen, Emperor Yue Ying had returned from the battlefield. As war was imminent, he aimed to swallow up the Sword Pavilion Shangguan Xuan had established to expand his power and ensure the greatest advantage in the coming conflict."]},{"number":6453,"title":"Chapter 6453: Ancient Court Heavenly Soldiers","paragraphs":["Chapter 6453: Ancient Court Heavenly Soldiers","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Moreover, the negotiations were almost complete. Shangguan Xuan’s chief disciple, “Clear Water Sword Immortal,” had already been bribed by Emperor Duobao, a disciple of Emperor Yue Ying.","The original purpose of Shangguan Yu’s visit this time was because he had been notified to come and relocate the Sword Pavilion.","Shangguan Yu had been wandering outside, training and cultivating. The sudden bad news had yet to be fully processed, and immediately after, he learned that the Sword Pavilion his father had built was going to be taken over. He had come to Ancient Star Domain to protect the Sword Pavilion.","Jian Wushuang’s visit to the Ancient Star Domain had two purposes: to secretly check on Jiang Ni and to uncover what secrets the Ancient Star Domain held.","As for Shangguan Yu’s matters, Jian Wushuang thought he could resolve them easily. After all, for him, it was a simple task. Since he had taken on Shangguan Yu’s identity, helping him with a small favor seemed only fair.","Just after stepping out of the teleportation array’s plaza, a man and a woman, both Dao Lords, walked towards him. The man wore a white long robe, and the woman donned a blue and white skirt.","“Junior Brother Shangguan, you’ve finally arrived. Hurry and return with us to the Sword Pavilion. Master’s coffin is in Tianyong City, and tonight is the mourning assembly. Many seniors from different factions will be attending. We’ll need you to preside over the ceremony!”","Shangguan Yu glanced coldly at the two of them, a mocking smile on his face. “Preside? How laughable. When you sold the Sword Pavilion, did you even think of me?”","Jian Wushuang tried to mimic Shangguan Yu’s tone and character as much as possible.","“By the way, where’s Senior Brother Zhao Qing? Why didn’t you ask him to preside? Could it be that he has already gone to Yue Ying’s Sword Pavilion?”","The two looked embarrassed upon hearing this. The female Dao Lord explained, “Senior Brother is receiving important guests and couldn’t spare the time, but he will come later!”","“Hmph!” Shangguan Yu sneered, “Traitorous scoundrels, finding new masters and forgetting your old ones!”","After speaking, he waved his sleeve and left.","The people behind them also ignored the two as they followed Shangguan Yu.","However, Jian Wushuang’s direction was still towards Shangguan Xuan’s coffin.","After all, he had to go there.","When they arrived, they found hundreds of Sword Pavilion disciples guarding the coffin.","Among them, seventy-eight were Dao Lords, and the rest were True Immortals.","Most notably, the majority were Nine-Step True Immortals.","Their strength was far superior to the so-called top ten True Immortals of the past from the Two-Faced Divine Mansion.","Of course, except for Chu Xiong.","However, a few of the Sword Immortals could rival Chu Xiong in talent and ability.","When the crowd saw Shangguan Yu arrive, their expressions were complex.","Most had already chosen to follow Senior Brother.","However, some of the elders cared more about the opinions of the young master, unwilling to see the Sword Pavilion sold off so easily.","They feared being trampled on once again.","After all, back when the old pavilion master was alive, Yue Ying’s Pavilion looked down on them.","This was because Yue Ying’s Pavilion had produced an Emperor.","Emperor Yue Ying was also one of the top ten Emperors of the Ancient Court.","In terms of strength, foundation, and connections, they were far beyond what Shangguan Xuan could compare to.","“Junior Brother!”","“Senior Brother Shangguan!”","Although they harbored their own thoughts and schemes, they still gave this young master face, rising to greet him and expressing their sorrow and helplessness.","Shangguan Yu kept a cold expression, nodding slightly in acknowledgment as he walked towards the coffin.","Inside were only the old clothes that Shangguan Xuan had worn, along with a broken treasure battle armor.","His physical body and divine form had been destroyed during the battle.","Seeing the tattered battle armor and the broken divine sword, Shangguan Yu could no longer contain his emotions. He broke down in tears.","This display left Xiang Yang, who was following behind, thoroughly impressed. He couldn’t help but send a voice transmission to Jiu Chen: “Old man, you should learn from this. Look at how Brother Wushuang acts—it’s like he’s truly mourning his father. When my own father died, I didn’t cry as genuinely as this!”","“Uh...” Jiu Chen replied with a blank expression, “When the Master of Divine Flame perished, I wanted to cry but couldn’t. In this regard, Jian Wushuang truly surpasses me!”","As Shangguan Yu wept, he gently caressed the broken sword.","In his heart, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but admire this unorthodox sword cultivator.","Although his Origin Source was weak, and his battle power was only top-tier for the second tier, in that battle, he had exchanged three blows with a top-tier fifth-tier Emperor. His death was not in vain.","After burning through his divine body, sacrificing his physical body, and finally even having his soul collapse, he had perished.","He had been aware of that great battle.","It was the most intense battle between the Ancient Court and the Holy Land.","In the end, both sides suffered significant losses and withdrew.","The only reason Jian Ni didn’t participate was that, otherwise, this person wouldn’t have fallen.","Nighttime.","The memorial service officially began.","Guests from all directions arrived, with Emperors occasionally making appearances.","After all, it was an Emperor who had fallen, a huge loss for the Ancient Court.","Though this Emperor was only a tier 2 Emperor, the entire Ancient Court had only a few dozen Emperors.","“From Dongxue Pavilion, Emperor Yuqing has arrived to pay his respects!”","Shangguan Yu quickly stood up, leading several of his father’s direct disciples to offer incense.","This Emperor Yuqing was a top-tier, tier 3 Emperor, one of the ten great Emperors of the Ancient Court.","His status was high, and his strength formidable, on the same level as Emperor Yue Ying.","Naturally, Shangguan Yu had to treat him with respect.","After paying his respects, Emperor Yuqing turned to Shangguan Yu and said, “If you ever need anything, feel free to come to me. This Sword Pavilion was established by your father, and you must take good care of it!”","“I will follow your teachings!” Shangguan Yu obediently nodded.","Just from his tone, Shangguan Yu could tell that this Emperor was on his father’s side.","He had already made his support clear.","This memorial service was, in fact, a show of allegiance.","Some people scorned such alliances, while others took a stand in support of their friends’ descendants.","“Emperor Yue Ying has arrived!” a voice announced from outside.","A majestic man wearing a moon-patterned robe entered.","Behind him followed a man and a woman.","“Yuqing, you’re here as well!”","Emperor Yue Ying entered with a casual tone, but his aura was imposing.","The two people behind him were Shangguan Yu’s senior disciple brother and the daughter of Emperor Yue Ying, whom Jian Wushuang had met before.","He hadn’t expected to meet her here again, under such circumstances.","Emperor Yuqing glanced at the other man but then turned his cold gaze toward Shangguan Yu’s senior disciple brother and said coldly, “Hmph! Your master just perished, and you’ve already switched allegiances. What a fine way to honor your teacher!”","“Haha, why get so worked up over matters between the younger generation?” Emperor Yue Ying said with a smile. “Besides, I’ve already decided to take him as my son-in-law. In the future, there will be only one Sword Pavilion in the Ancient Court. Isn’t that a good thing?”","“Yue Ying, your day will come too. Don’t get too smug!” Emperor Yuqing retorted coldly.","As the host, Shangguan Yu had no choice but to step in and interrupt their argument.","“Emperor Yue Ying, please offer your incense.” He handed over a stick of incense as he spoke.","According to tradition, as a mere Dao Lord, how could he dare to argue with Emperors?","No matter what was said, he had to endure it.","The Ancient Court was the hope of the human race.","But internally, it was still plagued by various struggles.","The more united they were in external battles, the more chaotic they were within.","After finally quelling the dispute between the two Emperors, the memorial service continued smoothly.","More and more prominent figures arrived.","There were thousands of Dao Lords and over a dozen Emperors in attendance.","The two most powerful individuals were Emperor Yue Ying and Emperor Yuqing, each standing on opposite sides.","On one side was Shangguan Yu’s senior disciple brother, Zhao Qing."]},{"number":6454,"title":"Chapter 6454: Daughter-in-Law","paragraphs":["Chapter 6454: Daughter-in-Law","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang was an incredibly powerful cultivator, known as the Clearwater Sword Immortal. He was also the top disciple under Shangguan Xuan and had successfully passed the seventh level of the ancient tower. His strength far surpassed that of Shangguan at the time.","Of course, Shangguan Yu, whom Jian Wushuang had taken, also possessed the strength to pass the seventh level but had been too preoccupied with his adventures to attempt it.","Zhao Qing, on the other hand, had the support of Emperor Yue Ying and several tier 2 Emperors. Needless to say, numerous Dao Lords also stood by his side.","The grand hall was divided, with both factions representing different forces.","Shangguan Yu’s side was not lacking in power either. Emperor Yuqing led the charge, accompanied by several Emperors who had close ties with Shangguan Xuan. There were also many Dao Lords, most of whom held significant positions, like those Dao Lords brought by Senior Brother Li, who were generals within the Heavenly Soldiers.","Their strength had been proven by passing the sixth level of the ancient tower.","The ancient tower was divided into nine levels and had three towers in total. The first tower was for mortals, from the innate stage to the Mahayana stage. The second tower was for Dao Lords, with its nine levels representing the limits of a Dao Lord.","Zhao Qing had passed the seventh level, which signified the limit of a Dao Lord’s power. His divine power had multiplied five thousandfold, his Origin Source had reached perfection, and it was a top-tier Origin Source. His strength was now comparable to that of a tier 1 Emperor.","In the history of the Ancient Court, there had been fewer than a hundred Dao Lords who had passed the seventh level. Of those, 99% had failed in merging with the Dao.","The few who had succeeded wielded the power of a tier 4 Emperor.","This was why Zhao Qing had garnered a lot of support. Some of the Emperors who were on good terms with Shangguan Xuan were rooting for him, although they doubted his character. After all, his greed was undeniable.","Upon further reflection, it became clear that Zhao Qing had reached the brink of merging with the Dao and was eager to succeed. He cared little for the power his master left behind. However, to successfully merge with the Dao, he needed an enormous amount of resources.","Currently, the Ancient Court had four Dao Lords who had passed the seventh level, all preparing to merge with the Dao. However, there were limited treasures available for the merger, and four individuals would not be able to split them evenly.","In this world, background was everything.","Aside from Zhao Qing, the other three Dao Lords who had passed the seventh level had incredibly strong backgrounds.","The first Dao Lord to pass the seventh level was a disciple of Dragon Lord, one of the founding ministers of the Ancient Court. Both of the subsequent Celestial Kings were also his disciples. Dragon Lord was someone even the Great Heavenly Venerable Yuan Zheng had to show respect to.","Though Dragon Lord was above granting favors to his disciples, the Ancient Court was still more inclined to support his protégés because of their legacy. Zhao Qing could not compare to that.","The second Dao Lord was a disciple of the Celestial King of the second generation, Real Master Sancai, another impossible background to match.","The third Dao Lord had a relatively ordinary background—his master was merely a Dao Lord, and he hailed from a humble barbarian village. However, his talent was exceptional; he had comprehended two top-tier Origin Sources and was the strongest among them all. He had even caught the attention of the current Celestial King, Bai Yue, who, though not accepting him as a disciple, promised to give him special treatment.","After all, the strongest talent and power would naturally receive the greatest support.","Then there was Zhao Qing. He was the personal disciple of Shangguan Xuan, the top disciple of the Sword Pavilion. His position, status, and strength were all formidable.","However, after his master’s sudden death, everything crumbled. Zhao Qing wanted to protect the Sword Pavilion, but with what? He could barely take care of himself, let alone ensure a future for his fellow disciples.","At this critical juncture, Emperor Yue Ying came to him with an irresistible offer: marriage into the Emperor’s family.","He would become the Emperor’s son-in-law, receive the favor of Emperor Duobao, and be provided with all the necessary treasures for merging with the Dao.","Faced with this condition, he couldn’t refuse.","Emperor Yue Ying wasn’t foolish either. He was fully aware of his daughter’s worth, and marrying her to Zhao Qing was clearly aiming high.","Moreover, having Zhao Qing bring the entire Sword Pavilion to pledge allegiance was an incredibly profitable deal. As for the few precious treasures that would be spent, he didn’t care; his disciples would cover the cost.","It was, in essence, a purely profitable arrangement.","The current dispute between the two sides was merely about saving face.","In the end, Emperor Yue Ying would win.","Because in the Ancient Court, strength was what truly spoke.","Shangguan Xuan had fallen, and without an Emperor, the Sword Pavilion would be swallowed up.","A Sword Pavilion without an Emperor could no longer be called the Sword Pavilion.","Shangguan Yu couldn’t hold onto it.","A Dao Master of the sixth level in the Ancient Tower had no voice in the matter.","Even though he was the son of an Emperor.","But without the Emperor, how many cards did this son truly have left to play?","As more and more people came to offer condolences, the gap between the two sides widened.","Shangguan Yu’s side was only supported by a few die-hard loyalists.","But these people didn’t have much faith in Shangguan Yu; they were merely sticking around out of loyalty.","On the other hand, Zhao Qing’s side seemed to have already decided that the Sword Pavilion would be swallowed up.","Shangguan Yu would face utter defeat.","At that moment, another name was announced from outside.","“Lord Long has arrived!”","Upon hearing that Lord Long had arrived, everyone grew solemn.","He was the foundation of the Ancient Court.","Its greatest contributor.","Though he hadn’t ascended to the rank of True Immortal, he was a figure whom even the three Immortal Kings treated with equality.","A tier 4 Emperor in combat power, Lord Long was one of the most powerful figures in the entire Ancient Domain World.","His arrival calmed the tense atmosphere.","The imposing elder, with a commanding presence, strode into the grand hall.","Following behind him was a woman dressed in white.","The woman’s brow carried a hint of coldness, but her eyes were soft.","Sword energy resided in her heart, and life in her spirit.","Upon seeing the woman, Shangguan Yu’s heart stirred. “Jiang Ni!”","He hadn’t expected Jiang Ni to come.","By all rights, Jiang Ni had only recently arrived at the Ancient Court and probably didn’t know Shangguan Xuan well—at most, they’d exchanged greetings. Her presence here showed great respect to the deceased.","What shocked him even more was that Jiang Ni’s aura had grown significantly stronger.","It seemed that her mastery over the Origin Source of Life had reached perfection.","She had now perfected two Ultimate Origins.","Jiang Ni’s combat power had likely reached the pinnacle.","Terrifying!","Although she was still a Dao Master, she was the strongest in the entire Ancient Domain World.","No one could stand against her.","Not even the Void Cultivators or the Holy Lords who had not yet fallen could be her match.","Even Jian Wushuang himself wasn’t confident in defeating the current Jiang Ni.","There was nothing he could do. She was in her prime, while he, a Universe Master, without the divine blood of the Divine Eye Clan transforming him into a golden-armored puppet, didn’t even have peak-level combat power.","The only way he could win against Jiang Ni was through a soul attack.","Lord Long’s arrival eased the tension in the hall.","When everyone saw Jiang Ni, many of them showed cold expressions.","This was because Jiang Ni hadn’t even joined the Ancient Court halfway through; she had only just joined.","She wasn’t here just to pay respects to Shangguan Xuan. Rather, right after joining the Ancient Court, she was granted the unprecedented privilege of ascending to the Ninth Heaven as a Dao Master.","This was something only the Emperor knew—none of the Dao Masters were aware.","Besides the Ninth Heaven, a special treasure trove deep within the court’s underground cellar, accessible only to the Immortal Kings of the Ancient Court, had also been opened—specifically for Jiang Ni."]},{"number":6455,"title":"Chapter 6455: Nothing Wrong","paragraphs":["Chapter 6455: Nothing Wrong","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was a top-secret matter, known only to Emperor Yuqing and Emperor Yue Ying.","They held a deep grudge over this.","There was nothing they could do—their levels were too low to comprehend just how terrifying Jiang Ni’s strength truly was.","If she wished, a single sword could shatter the entire Ancient Domain World.","Others might not understand, but Lord Long was well aware.","He fully grasped what Jiang Ni represented.","Right now, the Ancient Court was fighting over the legacy of the Ancient Domain World, but in the future, the Ancient Domain World would face the entire chaotic universe.","At that time, the strong ones required would not be Emperors, but supreme beings surpassing the level of Emperors.","And within the current Ancient Domain World, he saw no juniors capable of reaching such heights.","Until he met Jiang Ni.","He saw hope.","This was not the hope of the Ancient Court; it was the hope of the Ancient Domain World.","A person who, at the Dao Lord level, could unleash combat power that surpassed that of a tier 5 Emperor.","As for her future achievements, he dared not even imagine.","Let alone some special places opening up—what difference would it make if they handed over the Ancient Court to Jiang Ni right now?","Therefore, Lord Long didn’t care about others’ opinions.","He explained his reasoning only to the three Immortal Kings of the Ancient Court.","The three Immortal Kings—Primordial Lord Yuanzheng, Master of Three Talents, and Immortal King Bai Yue—all wholeheartedly supported his actions.","Because this concerned the future of the Ancient Domain World.","As a result, Lord Long no longer feared the threats of the Holy Land.","Three tier 5 Emperors—what did they amount to?","One sword would solve everything.","There was nothing to be afraid of.","After finishing his offering of incense, Lord Long’s gaze toward the crowd changed—it was a shift in perspective.","He glanced at both sides.","Then, he turned his gaze to Shangguan Yu, revealing a faint smile.","Next, his gaze fell upon Emperor Yue Ying, who was startled by it.","“Lord Long!” Emperor Yue Ying greeted him respectfully.","Sensing an opportunity, Emperor Yuqing quickly spoke up, “Please, Lord Long, make a decision for Brother Shangguan’s surviving child!”","“Enough, I know what you all want to say,” Lord Long said indifferently. “Your petty schemes are too outdated. I, this old man, have always followed the trends of the time, and you should do the same. Don’t be constrained by the era.”","“Yuqing, you act out of loyalty. Yue Ying, you adhere to the law of power supremacy.”","“Neither of you are wrong.”","“However, the Ancient Court has its own rules. If this young one wants to inherit his father’s will, he needs to display sufficient strength. If inheritance were solely based on lineage, the Ancient Court would have crumbled long ago.”","Upon hearing this, Emperor Yue Ying’s heart blossomed with joy.","He knew Lord Long would say this.","No matter how times changed, power remained supreme.","If one wished to inherit their father’s position, they must possess the strength to match.","Emperor Yuqing looked disheartened. He also understood that for Shangguan Yu to preserve Sword Pavilion, he needed to display enough strength.","Although Shangguan Yu’s abilities were commendable, they still fell short.","If he could pass the seventh floor, Shangguan Yu would have a strong chance of taking over Sword Pavilion.","Lord Long paused and sighed:","“But rules are dead, and people are alive!”","“Shangguan Yu, I now give you an opportunity. If, within ten thousand years, you can pass the seventh floor of the Ancient Tower, you may inherit Sword Pavilion. Yue Ying, during these ten thousand years, you are not to touch Sword Pavilion!”","Emperor Yuqing quickly pulled Shangguan Yu and bowed respectfully. “Thank you, Lord Long!”","Ten thousand years—this was a long time, even for Emperors.","After all, the time since the Ancient Domain World had been created was only a few hundred thousand years.","Emperor Yue Ying, on the other hand, felt uncomfortable.","Ten thousand years!","It was too long.","Not to mention breaking through the seventh level, even the millennia-old world was enough for Shangguan Yu to prepare for merging with the Dao.","Once he successfully merged with the Dao, he would have a legitimate reason to inherit, and by then, no one could say anything.","Long Gong was openly favoring Shangguan Yu.","With Long Gong’s statement, the Emperors who had taken sides dispersed.","The memorial service concluded.","Senior Brother Zhao Qing did not leave.","Although there were still many disciples of the Sword Pavilion maintaining this Senior Brother’s authority, he knew the tide had turned against him.","Fortunately, the identity of the son-in-law of Emperor Yue Ying had already been made public. With this title, he would not be deprived of the treasures he deserved.","After sending off the guests, Shangguan Yu, as usual, mocked Zhao Qing with a remark, and then... simply left!","After all, this was Jian Wushuang.","Having spent a whole day resolving his identity issues, it was time to handle his own affairs.","This ancient star was extraordinary.","He needed to investigate it thoroughly.","Moreover, an important event had spread through the city tonight.","Jiang Ni, a soon-to-be Immortal Emperor who had just joined the Ancient Court, was preparing to publicly challenge the Ancient Tower.","This Jiang Ni, personally recruited by Long Gong, was known as the most gifted and invincible Dao Lord, already a legendary figure across the ancient star.","In an instant, countless people gathered to witness the spectacle.","Jian Wushuang was no exception.","He led his group and rode a luxurious chariot toward the city center.","Three ancient towers stood there.","In the middle was a vast plaza, spanning over ten thousand miles in diameter.","It could accommodate over a billion cultivators.","At this moment, tens of millions of cultivators had gathered.","There were thousands of Dao Lords sitting in the front row, watching.","In reality, they couldn’t see any scenes of battle.","All they could see was which level the challenger had reached.","Currently, someone was inside the Ancient Tower, and Jiang Ni was waiting outside.","By her side, the Ancient Court’s contemporary Immortal King “Bai Yue” and Long Gong personally accompanied her.","Challenging the Ancient Tower required strength verification.","First, one had to be a True Immortal.","Then, they needed the strength of a seven-step True Immortal or higher to be allowed inside.","Otherwise, with so many True Immortals around, there would be endless challengers every day, which would be too troublesome. They had to set some difficulty, otherwise, if these people just took up space without accomplishing anything, it would be a problem.","There was also an entry fee.","One billion immortal crystals for a ticket.","That alone was enough to deter any True Immortal below the Dao Lord level.","The requirements for the first Ancient Tower were excessive, even stricter than those for Dao Lords.","It couldn’t be helped—there were just too many cultivators in the Great Perfection stage.","If there were no restrictions, the queue would stretch across the entire ancient world.","The third Ancient Tower, however, had no such restrictions.","Because there were only a few dozen Emperors.","They could challenge it at will.","But most Emperors wouldn’t attempt it unless they were confident, for the sake of saving face.","Furthermore, the Ancient Tower’s assessment of strength was incredibly precise.","A tier 1 Emperor wouldn’t make it through, not even past the first level.","A tier 2 Emperor could barely survive the first level.","Only a tier 3 Emperor could pass through the first level, and they had to be top-tier to succeed.","Thus, among the Ancient Court’s Emperors, only ten had passed the first level.","Only one person had passed the second level—Sancai Zhenren.","The Ancient Court’s strongest combatant was Sancai Zhenren, whose power rivaled that of a tier 5 Emperor.","Based on this, passing the second level required tier 5 strength, and to pass the third level, one would need the power of a tier 6 Emperor.","To pass the fourth level, absolute pinnacle strength was necessary.","So, what about the fifth level?","The fifth level would require top-tier pinnacle strength.","The sixth level would demand peak pinnacle strength.","That was five thousand times divine power.","The seventh level required eight thousand divine power, and the eighth level—ten thousand divine power.","Calculating up to this point, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath.","The existence of the Ancient Tower was certainly no simple matter."]},{"number":6456,"title":"Chapter 6456: Immortal King Bai Yue","paragraphs":["Chapter 6456: Immortal King Bai Yue","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A hundred thousand divine power—this already counted as the Tribulation Realm.","The key was still the ninth floor.","To pass the ninth floor, wouldn’t it require the strength of a Universe Master?","This ancient tower was definitely left behind by a super powerful Universe Master.","After all, when he was in the Ancient Moon Space-Time, he had already been invincible with the strength of a Universe Master.","But what kind of place was the Ancient Moon Space-Time?","It was a time-space world!","Much stronger than the chaotic universe, by countless times.","Even Universe Masters at the Tribulation Realm were not uncommon.","“It seems that the one who left this ancient tower was an incredibly powerful Universe Master!”","“And since this ancient tower is in the Gu Domain Star, then the Gu Domain Star must also have been left by that person.”","Jian Wushuang’s interest was piqued.","However, his probing abilities were limited.","Otherwise, he could have completely seen through the entire Gu Domain Star.","Now, it seemed he would have to explore slowly.","After all, he came here for this reason, so he wasn’t in a rush.","As more and more experts gathered in the plaza, the Ancient Court even sent out celestial soldiers to maintain order.","At that moment, in the second nine-story ancient tower, a green light stopped at the sixth floor.","“Who is the person inside? They’ve actually reached the sixth floor?”","For a moment, the voices in the plaza became a cacophony of noise.","Passing the sixth floor meant being on the verge of Harmony, a near-perfect Dao Lord.","And it had to be a Dao Lord with a second-tier Origin Source.","After all, in the entire Ancient Court, only a few hundred Dao Lords had managed to pass the sixth floor.","There were only four who had reached the seventh floor.","As for the eighth floor, none had ever passed in history.","So, anyone who could pass the sixth floor was already at the pinnacle of Dao Lords.","The seventh floor was the absolute limit.","Since Jiang Ni was attempting to challenge the ancient tower, the four great Dao Lords of the Ancient Court had all come.","After all, they had never seen Jiang Ni in action before and were somewhat unconvinced. They wanted to witness Jiang Ni’s true strength.","The four of them gathered together.","“I just saw her!”","“How strong is she?”","“I can’t see through her!”","“It’s probably some treasure concealing her aura. I refuse to believe she can pass the eighth floor. In the entire history of the Ancient Court, no one has ever passed the eighth floor!”","In truth, they all understood—if a heaven-defying Dao Lord from the Sacred Land came, there might be a chance to pass the eighth floor.","However, those Dao Lords had a very slim chance of becoming Emperors. They weren’t worth cultivating since their Origin Dao had already been overdrawn by the divine eye secret technique.","Even if they became Emperors, they would have many flaws. Though their combat power seemed formidable, moving further up the path was nearly impossible.","This was also why the Ancient Court was willing to go to any lengths to wage war.","The Gu Domain World could not be destroyed by the Sacred Land.","Or more accurately, it couldn’t be destroyed by the Holy Lord.","The Ancient Court’s orthodoxy had to be preserved.","Jiang Ni’s joining had only solidified the stance of the Ancient Court’s Immortal Kings and leaders.","At this moment, all eyes were on Jiang Ni!","Dragon Duke and Immortal King Bai Yue were filled with anticipation.","Especially Immortal King Bai Yue—he had never seen Jiang Ni’s strength in action.","He was very curious whether Jiang Ni could pass the ninth floor.","There was no need to think about the eighth floor; it was a certainty.","Because the eighth floor corresponded to heaven-defying Dao Lords with combat power rivaling second-tier peak, or even ordinary third-tier Emperors.","What the ninth floor represented, they did not know. It certainly surpassed the third-tier Emperors, perhaps even the fourth-tier Emperors.","If what Dragon Duke said was true, Jiang Ni had absolute confidence in passing the ninth floor.","Swoosh!","The Dao Lord who had just emerged from the ancient tower was shocked by the scene before him.","When he entered, everything had been fine.","But now, as he exited, he saw that countless people had gathered, including more than a dozen Emperors.","Among them were Dragon Duke and Immortal King Bai Yue.","Thousands of Dao Lords had assembled, and the four strongest Dao Lords of the Ancient Court were present, surrounded by a million True Immortals and over ten million Nascent Soul stage cultivators.","“I... I only passed the sixth floor! There’s no need for such a grand welcome!”","He was completely dumbfounded.","Seeing him standing there in a daze, the Emperor overseeing the ancient tower couldn’t help but urge, “Hurry and leave this place, don’t block the entrance!”","“Huh?”","Before he could react, he was shooed away.","It wasn’t until he met some friends congratulating him that he finally understood—the quasi-Immortal Emperor Jiang Ni had arrived.","She was here to challenge the ancient tower.","“Hmph! I thought it was some Emperor coming to challenge the tower. Turns out it’s just a Dao Lord. No matter how strong a quasi-Immortal Emperor is, she’s still just a Dao Lord!”","Though he felt somewhat disgruntled, he knew very well that someone capable of being called a quasi-Immortal Emperor and fighting Emperor Yue Ying to a standstill was someone far beyond his level. As a Dao Lord who had only passed the sixth floor, he was no match for her.","Jian Wushuang could only quietly step forward, though there was still a sense of anticipation.","After all, the seventh level of the ancient tower had always been the limit for the cultivators of the Ancient Court.","He wanted to see if anyone could break that limit.","With the anticipation of the entire crowd, Jiang Ni nodded at Lord Long and Immortal King Bai Yue beside her, and then walked forward.","Faced with the ancient tower, she appeared calm.","With one step, she entered the entrance.","In the next moment, her figure disappeared.","In her place, a flash of blue light appeared on the first level of the ancient tower.","Whoosh!","In an instant, before even a breath could pass, the blue light had ascended to the second level.","Lord Long remained composed, but Immortal King Bai Yue exclaimed in surprise, “So fast!”","Whoosh!","Before he even finished speaking, Jiang Ni had already reached the fifth level.","She had used only one breath for the first five levels, including the time for teleportation.","The actual time she spent in action was likely the same for each level—each fight resolved in a blink of an eye, followed by her advancing to the next level.","After passing the fifth level, the sixth level was a major turning point.","To pass it meant one was an extreme powerhouse among Dao Lords, capable of merging with the Dao itself.","The Dao Lord who had passed this level before had stepped into the pinnacle ranks of Dao Lords from that moment.","There were only about a hundred such Dao Lords in the entire Ancient Court, and perhaps over a thousand in the entire Ancient Domain world.","The Dao Lords from the Sacred Lands were significantly more powerful, ten times stronger than those of the Ancient Court.","“This speed is twice as fast as when I did it!” Immortal King Bai Yue exclaimed in shock.","“If she wasn’t faster than you, now that would be surprising.”","“Master, that’s not fair!” Bai Yue protested.","Lord Long smiled faintly and said nothing more.","In just the time of this brief exchange, Jiang Ni had already passed the sixth level. Before their conversation had even ended, she had reached the seventh level.","Her speed left everyone in shock.","In just two breaths, Jiang Ni had traversed the first seven levels of the ancient tower.","If someone had started chatting with a friend just as she entered the tower, by the time their conversation began, Jiang Ni would already have surpassed a level they could only dream of reaching.","At that moment, the four Dao Lords of the Ancient Court, whether they were the disciples of the Immortal Kings or young talents from the great wastelands, were all wide-eyed in disbelief.","Zhao Qing, in particular, took a deep breath and trembled in astonishment. “How did she do it? The beasts on the seventh level, at the level of the True Immortal of the Nine Steps, have incredible defense. Back then, I fought for seven days and barely made it through. I only managed because I relied on my sheer willpower. But she did it in just two breaths and passed through the first seven levels!”","When Zhao Qing had first passed, he hadn’t dared to try again. Even then, he wasn’t confident that he could successfully pass the seventh level a second time."]},{"number":6457,"title":"Chapter 6457: Explode, Explode, Explode!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6457: Explode, Explode, Explode!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After cultivating for several thousand more years, Jian Ni finally passed the seventh level for the second time, though it was no easy feat.","What took her several days to accomplish on the seventh level was something she could now overcome with a single strike.","As the masses stood in shock, Jian Ni had already advanced through the eighth level and reached the ninth.","This time, the light that appeared was not blue but golden.","Without giving the onlookers time to recover from their astonishment, the entire ancient tower began to tremble, and the golden light burst forth.","Beams of light shot out in all directions.","Inside the tower, a sword aura erupted toward the sky. Jian Ni stood at the top of the ancient tower.","Dressed in flowing white robes, her divine sword held in reverse, the sword intent between her brows surged upward.","She had passed all the levels.","In just three breaths, Jian Ni had fully cleared the ancient tower!","There had never been anyone before her, and there would be no one after.","She had done it, and with such ease.","To her, it was simple.","There was nothing she found worthy of celebration.","If she wanted to, a single strike from her could shatter the world of the ancient domain.","Dragon Lord and King Baiyue, along with the newly arrived Yuan Zheng Tianzun and the Three Talents True One, stood dumbfounded.","“Three breaths to pass the ninth level? Even we couldn’t manage that!”","“The eighth level was filled with ten thousand beasts at the Dao Lord level. I don’t know what awaits on the ninth, but judging by the progression of strength, it must at least be ten thousand beasts at the Emperor level!”","“Ten thousand Emperors... even if we joined forces, it would take us a full day to kill them all. And even the weakest Emperor can’t be wiped out in large numbers with a single blow!”","Yuan Zheng Tianzun’s lips trembled as he said, “The rise of humanity begins now, in this generation!”","The four ancient court powerhouses were all filled with excitement.","“Now the ancient domain will rise. Our ancient domain world will surely dominate this chaotic universe, and Jian Ni will become an unparalleled existence, reigning supreme!”","Though they had never met a Universe Master, they were certain that Jian Ni’s accomplishments would not fall short of such a title.","The Immortal Kings were astounded.","The Dao Lords and True Immortals, however, were completely dumbfounded.","For them, the ancient tower was a measure of combat strength.","Now, Jian Ni had broken that measuring stick, causing them to doubt themselves.","Why was Jian Ni so powerful?","They were all Dao Lords. It was understandable if she was ten or a hundred times stronger.","They didn’t fully grasp it, but they could attribute it to the gap in their mastery of the Origin Source or differences in secret techniques.","But if she was ten thousand times or even millions of times stronger, it defied comprehension.","They had reached a point of self-doubt.","On the stone seats in the square, only Jian Wushuang and his companions remained composed.","“Both of her ultimate Daos are already perfected. She can now fully unleash the Sword of Life. If her mastery of the Dao of Death reaches perfection as well, then I’ll be able to teach her the art of the Dual Sword Radiance Slash!”","He was deeply gratified.","Jian Ni’s strength reminded him of his own past.","Back then, he had also defied the heavens.","A Dao Lord battling at the peak of his powers.","A peak power battling a Universe Master.","For a moment, he recalled his humiliating struggle against Gula on the Dragon God Continent.","At that time, he had been at his peak, yet he had fought against Gula.","It was worth noting that Gula possessed the power of a Seven Tribulation Master.","Though not a Universe Master, Gula commanded over a million units of divine power.","Jian Wushuang had been ruthlessly beaten, only managing to kill Gula after becoming a Universe Master himself.","He had also once fought above his level, admired by millions as a heaven’s chosen.","He had been the pride of Qishen Temple.","And now, so was Jian Ni.","Standing at the top of the ancient tower, Jian Ni suddenly felt a special consciousness closing in on her!","It was a presence from within the ancient tower.","The aura of Gula’s revival was slowly rising.","Apart from Jian Ni, only Jian Wushuang sensed it.","He narrowed his eyes, and with a single thought, detected the awakening aura.","“As expected, the appearance of this ancient domain star is no coincidence.”","After capturing that strange aura, Jian Wushuang formulated a plan.","To challenge the ancient tower.","Though he could detect the aura, he couldn’t get closer or probe any further.","The only way forward was to challenge the ancient tower.","Jian Ni had passed the ninth level, likely triggering some kind of restriction.","This aligned with the nature of the ancient tower.","Its purpose was to screen out the strongest, then absorb them as elite subordinates.","The ancient tower had been crafted by at least a semi-divine being. A semi-divine being looking to recruit subordinates would certainly seek out talents like Jian Ni.","The combat strength required to pass the ninth level was likely at the limit of an ultimate Dao Lord.","The threshold wasn’t too high.","Back in the days of Qishen Temple, they could have gathered thousands of ultimate Dao Lords.","Not to mention a semi-divine expert.","Those who weren’t Ultimate Dao Lords or Ultimate Emperors likely wouldn’t even bother accepting one as a disciple.","An ancient consciousness connected with Jian Ni’s mind.","Though it was only a brief connection, countless pieces of information were transmitted.","Jian Ni was slightly startled, but quickly regained her composure.","She flew down from the ancient tower and approached Lord Long.","“I want to challenge the third ancient tower!”","Her voice wasn’t loud, yet it resonated across the entire square.","Everyone froze in surprise.","“What?”","“She wants to challenge the third ancient tower?”","The third ancient tower was designed for Emperors.","Even Dao Lords couldn’t enter it.","One needed to verify their Origin Source to gain access.","Lord Long was about to explain, but Supreme Lord Yuan Zheng raised his hand and said, “Alright, I’ll have someone open it immediately!”","“Thanks!” Jian Ni nodded calmly.","Below the third ancient tower, the grand formation suddenly lit up.","The surrounding restrictions silently disappeared.","Jian Ni glanced at the crowd before turning and walking toward the third ancient tower.","At this moment, Supreme Lord Yuan Zheng explained to the others, “The third ancient tower indeed has requirements for the Origin Source, but I discovered that these requirements aren’t because of the Emperor title. They are related to the special nature of the Origin Source!”","“Have you ever heard of the Ultimate Path?”","“The Ultimate Path?”","Lord Long was taken aback and replied, “I’ve come across it in some ancient records. It’s the most defiant Origin Source. A Dao Lord who controls the Ultimate Path can slay an Emperor, and an Ultimate Emperor can even challenge a Universe Master beyond their tier!”","These were records from ancient inheritances. Throughout the history of the Ancient Domain World, no one had ever mastered the Ultimate Path.","Therefore, the exact power level remained unclear, but it was certainly heaven-defying.","“Are you saying Jian Ni has mastered the Ultimate Path?”","“Is that even a question?” Supreme Lord Yuan Zheng said joyfully, “Only an Ultimate Dao Lord could possess such strength. Moreover, her Origin Source is the Dao of the Sword, focused on slaughter. That’s why she was able to sweep through the competition so quickly. Such a powerful Origin Source surpasses even us Emperors, so naturally, she can enter the third ancient tower!”","“Just watch, she’ll at least make it past the third level!”","At this moment, one of the strongest cultivators in the Ancient Court, the Three Talents True Person, exclaimed, “The third level houses ten thousand beasts with the power of tier 4 Emperors. If she passes through, it means she has the strength of a tier 5 warrior!”","“Back when she unleashed that sword in the Overturning Seas Ancient Domain, Jian Ni’s power was already on par with the Holy Lord. I believe she’ll pass the third level, and maybe even the fourth!”","“Let’s wait and see, then!”","They all took a deep breath, anticipation rising in their hearts.","Before the third ancient tower, Jian Ni infused her Origin Source. A blue light flashed, and her body disappeared from where she stood, officially entering the ancient tower."]},{"number":6458,"title":"Chapter 6458 Fallen Universe God","paragraphs":["First Layer: One breath.","Second Layer: Also, one breath.","At this moment, the crowd outside had fallen silent. Each of them had their mouths wide open, staring at the third ancient tower. They had become numb.","When she passed through the second layer, the three Immortal Kings and Lord Long remained quiet. This was what they had anticipated. The only unexpected part was that Jian Ni progressed just as quickly as she did through the second tower. It felt like there was barely any difference in speed.","Whoosh!","She cleared the third layer as well, although there was a slight pause—it took her two breaths!","Fourth Layer: Three breaths.","Fifth Layer...","Seventh Layer!","In the space of the seventh layer, there were ten thousand ferocious beasts with Tier 6 combat power. Jian Ni's swordsmanship was fierce; one after another, the beasts fell. It ultimately took her a quarter of an hour to reach the eighth layer.","In the eighth layer, Jian Ni spent the longest time, consuming an entire day.","\"The eighth layer! Jian Ni has cleared the eighth layer!\"","The numb crowd continued to wait.","They were waiting for Jian Ni to completely clear the tower.","Ninth Layer: Ten thousand beasts with supreme combat power.","At this point, Jian Ni unleashed her full strength. The brilliance of the Sword of Life illuminated the entire ancient tower, and in the end, the burst of green light covered the entire Ancient Star Domain.","For the ninth layer, Jian Ni took three days to clear it completely.","At the top of the third ancient tower, Jian Ni bathed in holy light. At this moment, the Ancient Star Domain itself was shaking.","The most mysterious dungeon of the Ancient Star Domain had been fully opened.","A surge of overwhelming power erupted from the dungeon. This ferocious force poured forth, and in the eyes of the spectators, the plaza split open, revealing a massive fissure that connected to the dungeon. This was linked to the strongest force within the Ancient Star Domain.","However, even the three Immortal Kings of the Ancient Court had never been able to open this force.","Today, it had been opened because of Jian Ni.","From within the violent golden light, a black statue began to rise slowly.","It was a black-scaled beast, and wisps of dark energy circled above the statue.","At the moment the statue appeared, the entire Ancient Star Domain trembled. Countless people gazed up at the statue, feeling a deep urge to kneel.","Even though it was merely a lifeless object, a simple statue, it was enough to suppress all the strongest experts.","The key was that, when staring at the statue, one could comprehend Origin Source from the scales of the statue.","It contained the complete Origin Source of the universe, and encompassed many universes.","This was by no means something the Origin Source of a Universe Master could compare to.","Among the crowd, Jian Wushuang and the others were equally astonished!","\"This statue's aura is terrifying, a hundred times stronger than the Lord of Divine Flame. Each scale contains the essence of a complete universe's Origin Source. This is definitely a supreme treasure of enlightenment!\" Immortal Jiu Chen couldn't help but exclaim.","Xiang Yang trembled and said, \"This statue gives me such a strange feeling—it's too oppressive!\"","Suddenly, Xiang Yang gasped, \"I remember now, this is the oppressive feeling of a Universe God!\" He exclaimed, \"The owner of this statue was a Universe God!\"","A Universe God?","Everyone around them thought Xiang Yang was speaking nonsense.","Aside from Immortal Jiu Chen, no one else knew about the existence of a Universe God.","Even Immortal Jiu Chen had only heard of a Universe God.","After all, aside from meeting Brother Ghost Eye, even the Lord of Divine Flame had never seen a Universe God in person.","It was only through exploring certain secret realms that he had learned of the existence of Universe Gods.","This memory was extremely valuable to the Lord of Divine Flame, and he would never share it with Immortal Jiu Chen.","Therefore, even Jiu Chen knew very little.","But when he heard Xiang Yang say that the statue belonged to a Universe God, his mind was shaken.","\"I never expected that the Ancient Star Domain contained the legacy of a Universe God! If this spreads, the entire chaotic universe, and even nearby chaotic universes, will stop at nothing to seize such a treasure!\"","\"The legacy of a Universe God... It's countless times stronger than that of a Universe Master!\"","Previously, the most powerful legacy in the Ancient Star Domain had been the Holy Land.","That was the legacy of a Universe Master.","It contained the inheritance of the first five turns.","But that Holy Land was merely left behind by a Universe Master below the Sixth Tribulation Realm.","Here is the translated passage in past tense, with the requested standardizations:","---","It couldn't even be considered a top-tier inheritance.","In the chaotic universe, the most powerful inheritances were left behind by Universe Masters of the Ninth Tribulation realm.","Those even stronger had generally crossed the sea and ascended to the heavens.","For example, Zhao Qing had received the inheritance of the Lord of Divine Fire, thanks to the Prophet, Senior Brother Ghost Eye, and Teacher Xuan Yi's plans.","Otherwise, they wouldn't have placed the Realm Beast's body in the hall of the Lord of Divine Fire's inheritance!","The inheritance of the Lord of Divine Fire was already considered the highest level of inheritance within the chaotic universe.","But now, a sculpture of a Universe God had appeared on Ancient Domain Star, so there might be more inheritances hidden in the underground vault.","Even if there wasn't, just the presence of this Universe God's sculpture alone would be enough to incite Universe Masters to slaughter one another.","After all, in this chaotic universe, there had never been a Universe God's inheritance before.","This was the path to ultimate power!","And the owner of this sculpture was no ordinary Universe God.","Jian Wushuang gazed at the sculpture, his heart calm.","There was a time when he was much stronger than the being this sculpture represented, so naturally, there wasn't much respect in his eyes.","He was simply curious as to how this sculpture had come to be on Ancient Domain Star.","From his investigation, Ancient Domain Star was just average.","It could be considered a higher-level inheritance among Universe Masters, but it had nothing to do with Universe Gods!","\"Strange, a sculpture of a Universe God has appeared. Could it be that there's really a Universe God's inheritance or treasure in the underground vault?\" Jian Wushuang stroked his chin.","He needed to go down and investigate.","However, this was Jiang Ni's moment of glory, so he didn't rush to move but instead looked over at Jiang Ni.","The sculpture had appeared due to Jiang Ni's defiance of fate.","Now, it depended on what was happening on Jiang Ni's side.","At the top of the ancient building, Jiang Ni, faced with the sculpture, was also filled with excitement. This was the strongest existence she had ever encountered.","Just a single sculpture rendered her immobile.","The overwhelming aura pressed down on her spirit.","Unfortunately, she didn't know that Jian Wushuang, at his peak, had been countless times stronger than this sculpture.","She looked up at the ancient building with immense reverence in her heart.","It was the respect of the weak toward the strong.","The aura of the sculpture seemed to also be watching Jiang Ni.","At the center of the forehead of the scaled beast, a massive vortex began to form.","From the vortex, black mist condensed into a humanoid figure.","Buzz!","\"Mortal, kneel before me!\"","With just these few words from the black mist figure, every strong individual in the Ancient Domain Star world dropped to their knees.","Whether Emperor or a three-year-old child, none could resist—they all knelt.","Billions of cultivators on the plaza of Ancient Domain Star also knelt in unison.","The three great Immortal Kings of the ancient court and Lord Long tried to resist, but within moments, they, too, had no choice but to kneel.","They barely managed to lift their heads and gaze at the sky.","The black mist figure appeared very satisfied.","At that moment, however, there were still those who hadn't knelt.","Jiang Ni, atop the ancient building, remained standing.","Jian Wushuang, Xue Yang, and the others also did not kneel.","Jiu Chen was the first who couldn't resist and knelt down.","Xue Yang struggled, gritting his teeth, and roared, \"I won't kneel!\"","\"You are a fallen Universe God, not worthy of my kneeling!\"","\"I, at least, am a proud scion of a Universe God family. My ancestors were all Universe Gods. I am also a demigod. How could I kneel to a dead being like you, an alien beast? You're not worthy of my respect!\""]},{"number":6459,"title":"Chapter 6459 True God Jiu You","paragraphs":["Xiang Yang gritted his teeth, forcing himself to endure with sheer willpower, but in the end, he still fell short.","Thud!","He collapsed onto the ground, completely prostrate.","\"Sigh!\" Jian Wushuang sighed. \"Does it matter who you kneel to? Back then, you even knelt before mortals. One more dead person won't make a difference!\"","\"A mortal is just a mortal. Now, I've returned to the path of cultivation!\" Xiang Yang, still kneeling, stubbornly retorted.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang could only shake his head helplessly. With a wave of his hand, he commanded in a stern voice, \"No kneeling allowed!\"","The moment his voice rang out, the overwhelming pressure on Xiang Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen instantly dissipated, allowing them to stand up.","Immortal Jiu Chen, astonished, exclaimed, \"What happened? That oppressive force... it's gone?\"","\"Jian Wushuang, how did you do that?\"","He was shocked. Although Jian Wushuang had always had hidden cards, carried an air of mystery, and wielded great strength with near-supreme combat power, even Universe Masters couldn't defy the will of the Universe God.","Yet Jian Wushuang not only bore the pressure with ease but also calmly lifted the burden from them.","\"The will of a dead man can't suppress the living. It's as simple as that,\" Jian Wushuang said, his hands clasped behind his back.","Xiang Yang, still frustrated, muttered, \"Easy for you to say! If I were a Universe God, I'd say the same thing!\"","\"Unfortunately, you're not,\" Jian Wushuang replied, a faint smile appearing on his lips.","Immortal Jiu Chen's eyes were wide with disbelief. \"Could it be that you really are a Universe God?\"","Earlier, Xiang Yang had hinted at it, but at that time, Immortal Jiu Chen didn't believe that Jian Wushuang was a Universe God, nor did he think Xiang Yang possessed even the combat power of a demigod.","He had assumed they were both exaggerating.","But now, he was starting to believe it.","He could accept that Jian Wushuang might have once been a Universe God. However, Xiang Yang definitely wasn't a demigod.","No demigod would behave as shamelessly as Xiang Yang did.","\"Alright, let's just watch from the sidelines!\" Jian Wushuang said calmly, \"I want to see what this guy is trying to achieve by making everyone kneel.\"","At that moment, the shadowy figure in the black mist turned to Jian Wushuang and roared angrily, \"How dare a mere mortal not kneel before a god like me!\"","\"Daring to look me in the eye—you deserve death!\"","With those words, the shadowy figure's eyes shot out a beam of light, aimed directly at Jian Wushuang.","Bang!","Before the light even reached Jian Wushuang, it exploded instantly.","\"A willpower attack? Ridiculous!\" Jian Wushuang sneered. \"You, a mere three-star Universe God, dare to use willpower against me? You're courting death!\"","The other party's willpower was at about the level of a three-star.","Which meant his divine power might only be at the peak of a two-star.","If his overall combat strength reached three-star, it would already be impressive.","This kind of Universe God, back when Jian Wushuang was on the Realm God Continent, he could kill a whole bunch of them with just a glance.","And now, this being was asking him to kneel? It might have been understandable if the opponent had peak strength, but they were all dead men walking anyway. What was the point of pretending?","Since Jian Wushuang had transformed from a Universe God into a mortal, he had adapted to local customs. He never put on airs, knowing that it wouldn't change anything.","He understood that he could only regain his power by training again and reaching the peak once more.","Pretending here, making such a big scene without doing anything substantial—it was pointless.","Out there, he would have fallen a hundred times by now.","The shadowy figure sensed something unusual about Jian Wushuang's willpower, especially since Jian Wushuang had accurately identified him as a three-star Universe God. Panic flashed across his face.","\"You—you're also a Universe God?\"","\"Impossible! There are no more Universe Gods in the Sea of Universes. You can't be one!\"","Jian Wushuang sneered. \"Whether I'm a Universe God or not doesn't matter. What matters is that you aren't one!\"","\"No, what truly matters is that you don't have the strength of a Universe God.\"","\"Arrogant! Even if I lack peak power, I'm not someone a clown like you can provoke!\" The shadowy figure shouted furiously. \"I am the Jiu You Celestial God. When I ruled over ten thousand universes, dominating the heavens, you weren't even born!\"","He didn't recognize Jian Wushuang, assuming he was just a newcomer. But Jian Wushuang had no trace of Origin Source in his power.","Relief washed over the shadowy figure.","When Jian Wushuang heard the name, his brow twitched, and he said, \"Jiu You? Never heard of it. Guess you were pretty weak back then.\"","He was deliberately goading him, trying to get him to reveal more about the mysteries beyond the heavens.","But Jiu You barked, \"I am one of the nine celestial gods under the True Martial Emperor! You dare claim you've never heard of me? How dare you boast before me!\"","\"If it weren't for this girl's presence, I wouldn't even bother dealing with you!\"","With that, he turned his gaze to Jiang Ni.","She was the real reason he had emerged.","A powerful figure who had fused the three ultimate paths into one.","No!","She hadn't fully merged them yet, but it wouldn't be long.","\"Little girl, congratulations. You are about to become my tenth worry!\"","Jiu You pointed a finger, and a streak of black light shot out, heading straight for Jiang Ni.","The three Immortal Kings kneeling on the ground were shocked.","They had thought Jiang Ni had triggered some kind of legacy, and with such a presence, it would be her opportunity. They never expected it to be a killing blow.","The willpower contained within the black light assaulted everyone's consciousness.","Though Jiang Ni had incredible talent, she couldn't withstand the willpower of a Universe God.","Her aura shifted, and a trace of blackness appeared in her eyes.","Jian Wushuang was alarmed.","His willpower instantly left his body, bursting out with a thunderous roar.","Clouds gathered in the sky, and Jian Wushuang's willpower avatar descended.","\"You're asking for death!\"","He hadn't intended to manifest, but seeing Jiu You use Jiang Ni's three ultimate paths to resurrect some body sealed in a carving was unacceptable.","It didn't matter who he was trying to release, but attacking Jiang Ni was something Jian Wushuang couldn't tolerate.","\"A mere three-star Universe God, and you dare call yourself a true god in front of me!!!\"","Jian Wushuang's willpower descended into the mental realm.","His enormous avatar appeared instantly.","On the ancient star.","Jiu You' willpower avatar was as large as the ancient star itself.","But when Jian Wushuang descended, the number of universes floating around his avatar was uncountable. When his massive gaze swept over the beings below, it triggered a mental storm with a single blink.","\"What?\"","Jiu You was utterly terrified.","\"You—you're also a Universe God!\"","He couldn't believe it. Especially since Jian Wushuang's avatar resembled an ancient demon.","This was Jian Wushuang's true form.","The most noble life form—\"Realm Beast.\"","A king born of chaos.","With a single word, he could create a universe of his own.","The massive Realm Beast avatar grabbed the previously arrogant Jiu You Celestial God.","The other party's willpower was no threat to Jian Wushuang at all.","With a single punch, he shattered Jiu You' avatar.","\"No!\" Jiu You Celestial God cried out in desperation. \"I haven't reached the Tenth Worry yet! I cannot fall!\"","Hearing his desperate cries, Jian Wushuang remained unmoved.","\"Perish!\"","With that single thought, all of Jiu You Celestial God's remaining willpower in the underground cavern was completely annihilated."]},{"number":6460,"title":"Chapter 6460 Time to Choose","paragraphs":["\"So it's just a bug. No wonder it dares to be so arrogant. Universe God?\"","\"It's just a joke!\"","Jian Wushuang sneered and his incarnation withdrew.","At this moment, the experts in the square finally woke up from their shock.","He returned to his original body.","The three immortal kings of Gu Court were also dumbfounded.","They only felt that they had just felt an irresistible force that was directly suppressed.","He couldn't move.","Immediately after, a powerful spirit energy appeared and shattered everything.","Only then would they recover.","\" Jiang Ni, were you the one who killed the Universe God's incarnation earlier?\"","\"It wasn't me!\" Jiang Ni shook her head.\" I'm not too sure either. I was still able to maintain my consciousness, but then another consciousness descended. My sea of consciousness instantly became empty, and I could no longer sense the situation around me!\"","\" Universe God?\" As the strongest of the three immortal kings, Daoist Three-Talent frowned and said,\" In that case, there's another Universe God?\"","The three Celestial Kings were all shocked.","If that was the case, then the Archaeus region would be in deep trouble.","The two Universe Gods 'will avatars.","What was hidden in the cellar?","How many legacies were there?","They hadn't been able to figure it out after so many years.","This was also why the Emperors of the Ancient Court often went into seclusion to explore the cellars.","However, the treasures he obtained were very few.","This was because the cellar looked like the ruins of a sect.","Moreover, it was a relic that could not be opened.","If he couldn't enter, there would be no treasures.","At most, they could only walk around the area, but there were also some supportive treasures that could be used inside.","In short, they were guarding a treasure that was either a mountain of gold or a mountain of silver, but they were helpless.","Now, Jiang Ni had suddenly triggered the appearance of two Universe God will avatars.","Then the secret of the cellar could no longer be hidden.","The surrounding Archaeus region world could sense such a huge commotion.","Right now, the best way to deal with them was to kill those who heard about Universe Gods.","He wanted to hide the secret as much as possible.","Otherwise, he would attract a bunch of powerful existences to the Archaeus region.","Below High Heavens, even though there were no Universe Gods, there were still quite a few universe masters.","If a group of universe masters came, they would be able to escape even if they started running now.","Unless they entered High Heavens.","However, even universe masters weren't confident that they could cross Universe Ocean, so how could they?","Other than continuing to hide it, there was another way.","That was Jiang Ni.","Jiang Ni's potential was simply too great, and she already possessed a combat strength that was above the peak.","If he succeeded in his Dao Integration, he would be comparable to a universe master.","With enough time, Jiang Ni could become a super existence among universe masters.","But did they still have time?","The three of them fell silent.","However, Jiang Ni was not thinking about this. Instead, she was a little distracted.","Even though she was unable to sense the aura of that Universe God who appeared later on.","However, the incarnation that could instantly kill True God Jiu You disappeared again.","Was that person helping her?","\"Everyone, it's time for us to make a decision!\"","\" The crisis in the Archaeus region isn't as simple as it seems. I don't think we can hide the fact that the cellar has been opened. We can only rely on our strength to protect planet Archaeus or our own lives!\"","\"I'm responsible for this too. If you need help, just let me know!\" Jiang Ni took a deep breath.","\" The first target is everyone here!\"","The Bai Yue Immortal King was the current generation immortal king and was also the one who pushed for the battle of the orthodoxies.","His eyes were filled with killing intent.","\"We can't keep these people alive!\"","Heavenly Venerate Yuanzheng and Daoist Sancai looked at each other but did not speak.","\"I'll do this!\" Duke Long stood up.","\"The most important thing now is to seal off the outer void and get rid of the surrounding six Archaeus regions. I'll suppress all the cultivators within 5,000 kilometers. Bai Yue, take this opportunity to declare a decisive battle against the sacred land. Let the cultivators of the six Archaeus regions participate in the battle and give them some dignity!\"","Ruthless!","Duke Long directly expressed Bai Yue Immortal King's intentions.","That was to silence them.","Of course, Duke Long was smarter, he did not kill him directly.","He used the formation to take away all the cultivators within 5,000 kilometers of the square and put them into the cellar.","Anyway, the cellar was very spacious and isolated from the outside world.","It was simply a chosen place.","Following which, the surrounding six Archaeus regions were all sealed off. Experts began to be selected to form battle formations, and at the same time, the final battle was announced.","The Holy Lands were very surprised. They hadn't expected that they wouldn't delay.","Why did they have to fight so early?","Both sides began to prepare for the battle.","This dispelled most of the people's thoughts about the strange changes happening on Planet Guyu.","He began to prepare for the battle wholeheartedly.","After making all these preparations, Planet Guyu instantly calmed down.","The entrance to the cellar was sealed and no one could open it.","The three ancient buildings were also moved into the cellar.","The ground had returned to normal, but because the ancient building was gone, it became much calmer.","It was mainly because the decisive battle was so sudden that many people were not prepared.","At this moment, they were all desperately trying to increase their strength so that they could survive the final battle.","There was a third force watching the battle between the Gu Court and the Sacred Land.","There were void cultivators.","They were everywhere.","In a hidden black hole.","It was a huge mutated beast with eight tentacles and a red eye.","It wasn't a Sector Beast, but a Void Devil with the bloodline of a Sector Beast.","It was the blood that the Sector Beasts had spilled when they broke the Universe God Continent, which had contaminated the cultivators and caused them to become like this.","\" Supervisor, the decisive battle between the Holy Land and the Gu Court is set for three months. The disparity in strength between the two sides is too great!\"","Keke...","The tentacle kept dancing, and a vicious voice came out of its huge eyes.","\"That's not important. We need to take down Planet Guyu!\"","The supervisor's tone was very crazy.","As the void monitor of the Archaeus region world, he saw the arrival of Universe Gods.","He saw the great opportunity hidden in the cellar.","He also saw how powerful Jiang Ni was.","He was the strongest expert in the Archaeus region.","At the same time, he was also the king with the highest bloodline among the void cultivators.","This was because his bloodline came from the first generation of void cultivators.","His body was similar to that of a Sector Beast.","\"Pass down the command to deploy the void army and station it outside of Planet Ancientregion. Once the two sides have a decisive battle, we will attack Planet Ancientregion!\"","The supervisor's voice rang out in the air.","Countless void cultivators and void creatures began to gather.","They were even more powerful.","Don't forget, Sacred Master died in the hands of Xu Kong.","That Void Watcher had the combat strength of a top-tier Rank-6.","However, compared to Jiang Ni, he was far too lacking.","Jiang Ni could kill him with a single strike.","However, for the sake of the opportunity to become a Universe God, he was willing to give it a shot.","Even if he died, it would be worth it.","After all, it was related to the opportunities of Universe Gods.","Once he succeeded, he wouldn't have to live like the other void cultivators. He would be able to control a large world."]},{"number":6461,"title":"Chapter 6461 Lucky Star","paragraphs":["To become a Universe Master and control an entire universe was incredibly difficult.","Unless that universe had no Universe Master.","But after so many years of accumulation...","Within the Cosmic Sea, countless chaotic universes already had Universe Masters.","Void cultivators had no retreat.","They could either maintain the status quo or fight for their own opportunity.","Only in this way could they break through the boundaries.","For this chance, he was willing to give up everything.","...","The cellar.","After Jian Wushuang and his group had their powers suppressed by Lord Long, they were thrown into the cellar.","They were left there, ignored and forgotten.","\"Are these guys out of their minds?\" Xue Yang couldn't help but grumble.","\"We can't even leave the Ancient Domain World. Even if we want to reveal what's going on here, we'd have to fly to another world first!\" Xue Yang continued to complain.","Upon hearing this, Immortal Jiu Chen retorted, \"You know nothing! That's a Universe God we're talking about. A Universe God!\"","\"In countless chaotic universes, there has been no inheritance from a Universe God. Yet here, in this tiny Ancient Domain World, not one but two avatars of Universe Gods have appeared!\" he said, casting a careful glance at Jian Wushuang.","Now, Jiu Chen truly believed that Jian Wushuang was a Universe God.","He had seen it with his own eyes when Jian Wushuang killed that True God, Jiu You.","Even though it was a clash of wills, without the will of a Universe God, how could someone have slain a True God?","And Jiu You hadn't even managed to withstand two of Jian Wushuang's moves.","With one strike, he destroyed the avatar, and with another, he annihilated the true body hidden within the cellar.","Though it was all a manifestation of will...","It was still a Universe God!","Jian Wushuang had so easily killed him, leaving everyone stunned for days before they could finally process it.","Jiu Chen had once mocked Jian Wushuang, but now he realized he was the shortsighted one.","It couldn't be helped. Even the former Lord of Divine Fire had never encountered a Universe God.","Although Jiu Chen had met Senior Ghost Eye, he had inherited none of those memories.","The more unknown something was, the more Jiu Chen cared about it.","It was the same with Universe Gods.","He had never seen a Universe God, nor did he have much information about them, which made him believe they were invincible.","Seeing another Universe God being slain by Jian Wushuang had broadened his perspective.","Over the past few days, Jiu Chen had shamelessly pestered Jian Wushuang, asking him about Universe Gods.","Jian Wushuang casually shared some of his past experiences as a Universe God.","For example, his battle against Xilu.","And the ten life-and-death battles in the Realm King Divine Realm.","And his fight against the Nine-Star Universe God.","Of course, he didn't reveal his exact combat strength.","Not even Xue Yang knew that.","After all, explaining it now wouldn't matter. Only after they recovered would they truly understand what it meant to be a Universe God.","\"I can sense that the true body of Jiu You was once in this sect. Now that its willpower has dissipated, there must be a physical body or divine body left behind. If I can get my hands on it and enhance my Realm Beast body, I'll be able to match the strength of the Tribulation Realm just by relying on my physical body!\" Jian Wushuang thought to himself.","His ways to increase his strength were few.","He had to max out every opportunity, leaving no stone unturned.","Come to think of it, Jiang Ni had really been his lucky star. Every time, she played a crucial role.","During the Overturning Sea, she led him to the Void Cultivators, which helped him discover their plans.","Then, in the Ancient Domain Star, she revealed the inheritance of the Universe God.","The tradition wasn't important to him.","But the treasures inside were extremely useful.","A sect established by a three-star Universe God likely contained more treasures than dozens of chaotic universes combined.","If he obtained those treasures, he could easily elevate Jiang Ni to the position of Universe Master.","Jian Wushuang planned to bring Xue Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen along.","Once he sought out the God Eye Clan, his confidence would increase significantly.","A Universe Master who had mastered three ultimate paths had a Source Power that was hundreds, if not thousands, of times stronger than that of an ordinary Universe Master.","At that point, not to mention a six-eyed God Eye Clan member, even a seven-eyed God Eye Clan member like Jiang Ni could be taken down. This would be enough for him to challenge the Origin Source of a King-level World Beast.","The only challenge that stood before him now was how to enter this sect.","Despite the crumbled walls and ruins surrounding him, the powerful restrictions inside remained intact.","The external formation had not been broken either.","It was linked to the internal restrictions.","If anyone were to open the internal barriers, it would trigger the external grand formation.","It was highly likely that before they even found the treasure, the external formation would turn them to ashes.","This external formation was designed to deal with Universe Gods.","The restrictions inside were no different.","Even if they allowed Dao Lords from the Ancient Court to explore, they wouldn't find a way in.","Jian Wushuang certainly had the ability to break the restrictions.","But once the restrictions were broken, the formation would activate and annihilate everything in its vicinity.","To get inside, he would need to address the root cause.","That meant dealing with the outermost formation.","\"The Refinement Dao Formation!\"","Jian Wushuang began searching his memory for the ultimate techniques related to formations.","Among the seventy-two thousand records, there were nine thousand formations effective against Universe Gods. Of these, eight thousand seven hundred were below the five-star Universe God level, while the remaining three hundred were for five-star Universe Gods and above. Over two hundred were formations established by six-star Universe Gods, fewer than ten were from seven-star Universe Gods, and none were created by eight- or nine-star Universe Gods!","Jian Wushuang shook his head.","Dealing with this grand formation didn't require such high-level techniques.","Something at the three-star level would suffice.","The only question was, what was the core of this formation?","Was it powered by the internal restrictions of the sect?","If so, breaking it would be challenging.","Will transforming into divine power was still just willpower, after all.","It wasn't true divinity.","If he had true divine strength, he wouldn't need to endure such hardship here.","Back when True God Jiuyou had confronted Jiang Ni, it was only because a hidden force in the ancient tower had restrained Jiang Ni.","Jiuyou himself had limited suppressive power, with no divine power to speak of.","He could suppress a weak Dao Lord, but not someone at the Tribulation level.","His reputation alone was what intimidated others.","\"Yunhai!\" Jian Wushuang turned and ordered, \"Suppress all the Dao Lords here. But make sure not to alert anyone outside!\"","\"Understood!\" Guardian Yunhai responded immediately.","His divine body turned golden.","Fifty thousand times divine power erupted with a sudden force.","The sky over the underground chamber darkened.","Meanwhile, the Ancient Court had already assembled its army, preparing to sweep across the Sacred Land.","Jiang Ni was responsible for eliminating the top powerhouses in the Sacred Land, specifically the three Dao Lords.","The others were in charge of reclaiming the territories held by the Sacred Land.","Each person had a clear role.","They set off at once.","Due to Jiang Ni's presence, the three Immortal Kings felt reassured about this grand final battle.","Thus, only Immortal King Baiyue and Lord Long went to oversee the battle.","True Man of the Three Talents and Heavenly Lord Yuanzheng did not go.","They stayed behind in the Ancient Star Domain.","This was the most critical location.","Not because of its intrinsic value, but because if the events here were exposed, the entire Ancient Domain World would be doomed.","They knew they wouldn't escape the consequences either.","So, they didn't dare relax for even a moment."]},{"number":6462,"title":"Chapter 6462 Human Nature","paragraphs":["Jian Wushuang, as the top Dao Lord of the Ancient Court and possessing the strength of a fifth-tier Dao Lord, personally oversaw the underground chamber.","In addition to him, there were three other Dao Lords and hundreds of top-tier cultivators in charge of guarding the imprisoned cultivators.","Originally, they were all allies.","But now, they were imprisoned here.","The Ancient Court's explanation was that a certain crisis had occurred within the underground chamber, and everyone had been infected. They were told they needed to stay there, but in a thousand years, they would be free to leave.","These people actually believed it.","Guardian Yunhai had been observing all along and knew exactly what Jian Wushuang was planning.","It was highly likely that after the army made its move, he would kill everyone here.","This was to erase all their memories.","Not only their memories but their very existence needed to disappear.","Only in this way could that matter be completely kept secret.","Call him ruthless, but it was all for the sake of the Ancient Realm World.","There were no walls that didn't have cracks.","The three Immortal Kings and Lord Long were trustworthy.","Then there was Jiang Ni.","Only the five of them could completely trust themselves and each other.","The rest were unreliable.","They had to be eliminated.","What remained was to leave it to fate and time.","Although the message spread quickly, the speed at which it left this place was very slow.","As long as they had millions or even tens of millions of years, once Jiang Ni became the Universe Master, they would no longer have to live in fear.","By that time, they would be able to reap some benefits as well.","After Jiang Ni became the Universe Master, casually giving them some rewards would make reaching the apex achievable, perhaps even the Tribulation level.","After all, their Origin Source was weak, making it easy to break through.","Reaching the apex wouldn't be difficult, only a lack of treasures stood in the way.","The Tribulation level was possible, but becoming a Universe Master would require a strong Origin Source and deep foundations.","The Ancient Realm World simply couldn't bear the weight of a Universe Master.","Even selling the entire world wouldn't be enough to buy a treasure containing the Origin Source of the universe.","It was indeed impossible to cultivate a Universe Master here.","But the mysterious sect within the underground chamber could.","As long as the sect's gates were opened, they would all have their own stage.","They could all become supreme experts.","Jian Wushuang looked down at the entire underground chamber.","The coldness in his brows deepened.","\"Everyone, I'm sorry!\" he murmured softly, as if offering himself a final moment of comfort.","Then, he made his move.","Buzz!","With a single palm strike, divine power surged around him.","Among the tens of millions of cultivators imprisoned here, even several Dao Lords could sense Jian Wushuang's aura.","\"What's happening?\"","Dao Lord Yuqing, who was also imprisoned, shot to his feet and looked to the sky.","He saw that it was indeed Jian Wushuang who had made his move, and his mind was filled with shock.","\"So it really is you!\" Dao Lord Yuqing roared in anger. As the strongest cultivator here, he flew directly into the sky, confronting Jian Wushuang.","Though one was a third-tier Dao Lord and the other a fifth-tier, with a vast gap between them, it wasn't even a contest.","Yet, Jian Wushuang didn't strike him down immediately.","Instead, with bloodshot eyes, he explained, \"I have no choice. You all must die. Only then can the secret be kept forever!\"","\"What are you talking about?\"","\"What secret?\"","Dao Lord Yuqing shouted angrily, \"Jian Wushuang, I supported you with all my strength to become the Immortal King of the Ancient Court, and now you're turning against your own people!\"","\"Do you have no conscience? Have you forgotten who brought you into the Heavenly Court?\"","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and closed his eyes slightly.","Jian Wushuang witnessed the scene, recalling the experiences of the past.","Many of the cultivators here were somewhat related to him.","Why would he intervene if it wasn't necessary?","\"Yu Qing, I won't hold back. You know me well enough; I don't need to say more!\" The Real Person of Sancai chuckled bitterly.","\"Do you really not trust me?\" Dao Lord Yu Qing's voice suddenly became panicked.","A secret?","How could he not know?","The secret of the Universe God!","Moreover, the will of the Universe God had profoundly affected them.","Saying they were influenced wasn't entirely incorrect.","After being covered by the Universe God's will, a surge of fighting spirit had been ignited deep in their hearts.","That desire was to grow stronger.","Only through struggle could one become a true powerhouse.","The successful ones would continue to guard this secret, but what about those who failed?","Would they expose this secret due to their failure?","Or perhaps trade this secret with the Universe Master for something in return?","Human nature!","It's not something to be tested.","Just like before when the Real Person of Sancai hadn't made things clear, Dao Lord Yu Qing had a serious expression and didn't mention the Universe God at all.","Upon hearing the word \"secret,\" he hadn't realized it was merely a test.","\"If you had come to me with this matter right from the start, perhaps I would have softened...\"","\"But I won't show mercy now. Be gone!\"","The Real Person of Sancai struck out with his palm.","\"No!\" Dao Lord Yu Qing cried out in frustration, \"Sancai, you will fall too! You'll die at the hands of Jiang Ni! She won't trust any of you! Your fate won't be any better than mine!\"","Even in his last moments, Dao Lord Yu Qing didn't forget to leave a final blow to the heart.","But such words had no effect on the Real Person of Sancai.","He had already considered the possibility that Jiang Ni might silence him as well.","In fact, Jiang Ni had the power to annihilate the entire Ancient Domain on her own, guarding this secret alone, and venturing into the dungeon by herself.","Her strength and talent were the greatest, and she didn't need to work with them at all.","There simply was no need!","What Sancai had envisioned earlier as something beautiful, was it merely a dream?","In the real world, they might all meet their demise.","This was a reality they had to face.","If Jiang Ni also believed they harbored selfish motives or would betray her...","Would she take action against them?","The Dao Heart!","At this moment, it all depended on their state of mind.","Although the Real Person of Sancai was the strongest in terms of combat strength, when it came to mindset, Dragon Lord was the most formidable.","Because Dragon Lord's belief was the most unwavering.","The revival of the human race!","That was Dragon Lord's greatest obsession.","Having experienced the rampage of ancient demons and the destruction of his family, he had witnessed the decline of the human race in his early days.","So, he would do anything to strengthen the human race.","In his heart, the human race was the people of the Ancient Domain.","He would give everything to the human race.","He was the only one who wouldn't be shaken by Dao Lord Yu Qing's words!","\"Die!\"","With a single blow, the Real Person of Sancai obliterated Dao Lord Yu Qing.","He looked down at the people below.","Without hesitation, he unleashed his divine power upon them, covering every individual and simultaneously detonating his Origin Source domain.","Boom!","Many didn't even have time to react before their Origin Paths began to fade!","\"What's happening?\"","\"My Origin Source is disappearing!\"","\"No!\"","\"My consciousness is fading too! Someone is killing me!!!\"","In an instant, everyone realized what was happening.","Someone had made a move.","They looked up at the sky.","Only the Real Person of Sancai remained unscathed, standing there.","Dao Lord Yu Qing had already fallen.","It was all the work of the Real Person of Sancai.","He stood alone in the sky, feeling a deep sense of desolation as he muttered to himself, \"Is this also my future?\""]},{"number":6463,"title":"Chapter 6463 Protection and Hope","paragraphs":["\"By doing this, am I truly protecting? Or have I shattered hope?\"","At this moment, his mind was already in turmoil.","After all, ordering someone to kill their own people would weigh heavily on anyone.","Even with the most justified reasons, it wouldn't make it any easier.","Jian Wushuang, standing below, looked up at the Realm Master of the Three Talents.","This reminded him of the Giant Star Spirit.","That being had executed all the Divine Eye Clan members in the name of righteousness.","Those were all his descendants!","Back then, the Giant Star Spirit was arguably the greatest existence in the Starry Sky.","He had founded two pinnacle clans.","One was the Giant Clan, and there wasn't much more to say about them— the number one clan in the Starry Sky.","From birth, they could grasp the Origin Source of the Universe and become Universe Masters.","They were born with inherited memories and didn't need much training. As long as they had sufficient resources, they could become Universe Masters of the Nine Tribulation Realm.","Their only bottleneck was becoming a Universe God.","As for Giant Clan members who had reached the level of Space-Time Gods, Jian Wushuang wasn't too sure.","Then there was the Divine Eye Clan.","This clan was even more extraordinary, with a potential surpassing that of the Giant Clan.","The reason was that the number of Giants was too few.","Compared to ordinary human beings, they were pathetically scarce.","They weren't even as numerous as Special Life Forms.","After all, a great world could give birth to many Special Life Forms, and the Universe, Space-Time, and even the Starry Sky itself could nurture them.","When tallied up, the numbers were not insignificant.","But the birth of a Giant was extremely difficult.","On average, there was only one Giant Clan powerhouse per Universe.","Though there were many Universes, the number of ordinary beings within them was far greater.","In comparison, the number of Giants was pitiably small.","But the Divine Eye Clan was different. Their numbers were vast, and their population continued to grow.","Moreover, they possessed secret techniques exclusive to their clan.","As a result, the Divine Eye Clan's overall strength surpassed even that of the Special Life Forms.","Their numbers were billions of times greater than Special Life Forms.","Given time, the entire Starry Sky would belong to the Divine Eye Clan.","Even if other races still had space to survive, they would have no choice but to practice the Divine Eye Clan's secret techniques.","That was the terrifying part.","In the end, due to the flaws in the Divine Eye Clan's secret techniques, the Giant Star Spirit had no choice but to destroy his own offspring.","They were all beings he had created.","The powerhouses of the Divine Eye Clan, who had always revered him as their ancestor, were slaughtered by the very hand they honored.","Faced with such a scene of carnage...","How strong must the Giant Star Spirit's mindset have been to maintain his composure under such a burden?","Realm Master of the Three Talents had only massacred tens of millions of his own allied cultivators, and his mental state was already collapsing.","The Giant Star Spirit had slaughtered an entire clan—one that he himself had created.","It was akin to killing his own children.","Jian Wushuang had never experienced such an event, so he couldn't truly empathize.","Previously, he had thought that such things could be endured with gritted teeth.","At most, one would feel sorrow for a while, but that would be it. But today, after seeing the Realm Master of the Three Talents' mental breakdown, he realized that the Giant Star Spirit must have suffered an immense backlash.","Otherwise, he wouldn't have treated Jian Wushuang so kindly. The Giant Star Spirit must have been trying to make up for the mistakes of the past.","If not, the sins he committed back then would haunt him for eternity.","And that was a torment without end.","\"Yunhai, spare his life. This man possesses great determination; he may be useful in the future!\"","He could see that Master Sancai had been enduring immense heartache, always wanting to break free. If he could survive this ordeal, perhaps he would become someone of great potential.","Master Sancai's Origin Source wasn't weak—it was a First Grade Origin Source. His limit might be reaching the level of Universe Master, but after experiencing this mental baptism, his potential ceiling could be higher. Becoming a demigod wasn't out of the question. As for becoming a Universe God, that would depend on his fate.","Upon hearing the instructions, Guardian Yunhai refrained from taking further action. Originally, it had been his task to suppress these people, but now, there was no need. He sealed Master Sancai in the sky, and suddenly, the entire underground chamber fell silent. There was no one left.","Jian Wushuang began to focus on studying formations and restrictions. He had to break out of here as quickly as possible. Just as Master Sancai feared, if word of this spread, a large group of Universe Masters would soon arrive. At his current strength, he wasn't capable of fighting a Universe Master, and his companions were nothing more than a bunch of misfits.","They had been transformed into Golden Armored Puppets, possessing fifty thousand units of divine power, thanks to the blood of the Universe God from the God Eye Clan. While they could dominate among Dao Lords, they stood no chance against a Universe Master. So, in a way, Master Sancai had indirectly helped him a great deal. If they could make it through this ordeal, Jian Wushuang wouldn't hesitate to assist him in becoming a Universe Master—it would be an easy task. But that would also depend on Sancai's own fortune. If he couldn't withstand it, he would be lost forever.","Once the underground chamber was suppressed, Jian Wushuang started searching for the formation's core without restraint, exploring the mysteries of the formation. The formations at the Universe God level were closely related to strength, comprehension, and talent. Even at his peak, it would have taken Jian Wushuang tens of thousands of years to fully comprehend a Universe God-level formation. However, for the most part, he preferred not to comprehend them, opting to simply slice through them with his sword.","With his current strength, it would still take tens of thousands of years to fully comprehend the formation, but fortunately, Jian Wushuang could accelerate time within the Nine Prison Pagoda. Maintaining a ten-thousandfold time acceleration through the power of the universe was a simple task. Now, he only needed a few years to have a chance to break through the formation. By then, Jiang Ni would have returned triumphantly, and they could explore this sect together, searching for treasures and clues about the God Eye Clan.","A Universe God's knowledge would undoubtedly contain vast information, and perhaps, they might even discover the whereabouts of the God Eye Clan. Jian Wushuang was eager to find them.","As he pressed forward, Xiang Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen didn't disappoint him either. Both had accelerated time and began their preparations for merging with the Dao.","On the other side, the great battle between the Sacred Land and the Ancient Court had begun. A million True Immortals had gathered. Since they needed to eliminate those who had sensed the anomalies in the Ancient Domain Star, Jiang Ni hadn't made a move right away. Instead, he watched as the True Immortals and Dao Lords fell.","The three top-tier Dao Lords of the Sacred Land were almost overwhelming the Dao Lords of the Ancient Court, leaving them with little chance to fight back. Immortal Bai Yue and Lord Long both watched with indifference.","\"By my calculation, Jiang Ni should have reached the Sacred Land by now. He'll make his move tonight, and when he does, the Dao Lords from the Sacred Land will surely return to assist. At that point, the two of us will join forces and annihilate all the True Immortals and Dao Lords here. That should settle things!\"","\"Ah, suddenly, I feel that winning this war is rather dull. In the past, my hands would be trembling non-stop by now!\" Lord Long said with a serious face.","\"That's because we now have a grander goal. Destroying the Sacred Land is a trivial matter. What we truly seek is to become the rulers of the Chaotic Universe!\"","\"Only by conquering a Chaotic Universe can the Ancient Court and the Human Race exist eternally, safe from prying eyes!\" Lord Long declared.","\"Jiang Ni will be the first Universe Master. But who will be the second?\" Immortal Bai Yue asked with a curious tone."]},{"number":6464,"title":"Chapter 6464 What Does It Have to Do With Me?","paragraphs":["Long Gong frowned slightly and said calmly, \"As it stands, Sancai is the most likely to become the second Universe Master. His Origin Source is the strongest, and his mastery of the Divine Eye Clan's secret technique has reached the second turn. He's close to perfecting the second turn, and once he does, his combat strength will soar to the peak of the fifth tier. At that time, if he continues pursuing his Origin Source and opens the underground chamber, elevating his Origin Source to the level of a perfected Dao Lord, his rise to Universe Master might even surpass Jiang Ni!\"","\"Yes, Brother Sancai's talent is second only to Jiang Ni!\" Immortal King Bai Yue expressed disappointment.","Among the three great Immortal Kings, the chances for Yuan Zheng Tianzun were the slimmest.","When it came to true prodigies, Sancai and Bai Yue were the ones worth mentioning. At most, they were a bit stronger than Long Gong.","The hope of becoming a Universe Master was slim. Achieving the perfection of a Dao Lord was already the pinnacle.","If they wished to improve their combat power beyond that, they would have to rely on the secret techniques of the Divine Eye Clan.","Apart from that, there seemed to be no other way.","Immortal King Bai Yue said calmly, \"My chances are much slimmer. There are many who are stronger than me, and compared to Brother Sancai, his talent far exceeds mine!\"","\"I wonder if Jiang Ni can unlock the sect beneath the underground chamber. And if she does, what treasures might be hidden within?\"","What he really wanted to ask was whether Jiang Ni would share those treasures with them once the chamber was opened.","Jiang Ni's combat power had already reached the absolute pinnacle.","Would she share the Universe God's treasures with ordinary Dao Lords like them after she obtained them?","Most doubted it.","Even Long Gong had his doubts.","Although he was the one who had introduced Jiang Ni to the Ancient Court, he knew very little about her.","All he knew was that Jiang Ni was searching for someone. Her background and identity were completely unknown.","He only knew her name, and her cultivation path had been discovered through the Sacred Land.","If Jiang Ni opened the underground chamber and then turned against them, what could they possibly do?","However, he had no grounds to doubt her.","Because Jiang Ni could easily destroy the entire Ancient Domain.","If they had any ill intent, she could simply kill them all and send one person to explore.","The logic was clear.","Yet some would still get caught in overthinking.","Even Sancai Zhenren couldn't avoid it.","Younger and less talented Immortal Kings like Bai Yue would also fall into this torturous dilemma.","Watching familiar True Immortals and Dao Lords fall one by one, they endured mental agony.","What was all of this for?","For the human race?","Only Long Gong probably thought that way.","The rest were all in pursuit of power.","Ever since the appearance of the Dao Lords, after the era of the ascenders, the current battle for the Dao had begun.","Many had seen through the reality of this world.","Only strength mattered.","What was the human race?","What was the Ancient Domain?","What did it have to do with me?","After becoming Dao Lords, they began venturing into chaos, constantly growing stronger. Many Dao Lords had even appeared, but they didn't belong to the Ancient Court nor were they cultivators from the Sacred Land.","They were merely wanderers.","Because there were no opportunities for Dao Lords or Dao Lords' breakthroughs in the Ancient Domain, they ventured deep into chaos, exploring perilous areas and even settling in foreign worlds.","None of them had returned to the Ancient Domain World.","They simply found it unnecessary.","The Ancient Domain World had caused them to stagnate.","Thus, they sought worlds that would allow them to grow stronger.","Their approach was much like Jian Wushuang's, moving forward step by step in the pursuit of strength.","Never looking back.","Call it heartless or indifferent, it didn't matter.","It was all for the Dao, progressing ever forward.","In truth, Long Gong and the others were no different; they just had a different path.","Some people sought personal strength, while others aimed for the strength of their clans.","None of them were wrong.","The pursuit of Dao was never wrong.","This was the excuse Long Gong and the others gave themselves.","On the battlefield of the final decisive battle...","The three Dao Lords from the Sacred Land suddenly flew out from their camp.","All three looked toward the direction of the Sacred Land.","\"This is bad! We've been tricked! Someone is attacking the Sacred Land!\"","\"Everyone, get on the flying boat immediately, we must return at once!\"","But it was already too late.","Jiang Ni could have attacked directly, but chose to wait.","The reason for waiting was because of Long Gong's plan—to send their own men to die.","Once enough of them had fallen, Jiang Ni would strike.","From the direction of the Sacred Land, a dazzling light shot into the sky.","The three Dao Lords of the Sacred Land, standing billions of miles away, were instantly killed.","Along with all the Sacred Land cultivators participating in the final battle, everyone perished.","With one sword, Jiang Ni annihilated the Sacred Land.","From that moment on, the Ancient Domain World became completely under the control of the Ancient Court.","As the decisive battle ended, the Ancient Domain World began to merge.","However, the Sacred Mountain remained, though one could only ascend it if they became a Dao Lord.","Beyond that, the Ancient Court shattered all the sequence inheritances.","Anyone below the level of Dao Lord who wished to cultivate the Divine Eye Secret Technique only needed an Immortal Crystal to acquire the first level of the secret technique.","For further cultivation, one must become a Dao Lord.","With this rule in place, the Ancient Domain World would see the emergence of more Dao Lords in the future.","Although the Ancient Domain World was a lower-level chaotic world, the number of Dao Lords it had produced was not small.","If the Sacred Land hadn't taken half of the territory, the Ancient Domain World could have had at least a hundred Dao Lords by now.","After this battle, the Ancient Domain World's Dao tradition was solidified. Henceforth, Dao Lords would emerge like bamboo shoots after a rainstorm.","In the past, this would have been a source of pride for the current Immortal King of the Ancient Court.","But now, due to the appearance of Jiang Ni, the secret of the Ancient Domain Star's Abyss had been exposed.","Thus, little effort was put into managing the Ancient Domain World.","Everything was left to subordinates to handle.","The core members of the Ancient Court had gathered outside the Abyss.","\"We can't enter?\"","Long Gong exclaimed in surprise, \"How can this be? Sancai is still inside!\"","\"I can no longer sense his presence!\" Immortal King Bai Yue said anxiously. \"Something must have happened in the Abyss. Sancai's presence has vanished. Could he have fallen...?\"","If that were true, then there might be a terrifying existence within the Abyss.","\"Let me try.\"","Jiang Ni took a step forward. Without drawing her sword, a surge of sword energy erupted, colliding with the barrier around the Abyss.","\"Hm?\"","Her brow furrowed. Her sword energy was useless against the barrier.","The moment it touched the barrier, the sword energy shattered instantly.","Unconvinced, she drew her sword and struck with full force.","Yet, she still couldn't shake the newly formed restriction.","\"I can't break through?\" Jiang Ni was shocked.","At her full strength, her power was already at the level of eighty thousand units of divine power.","Yet, she couldn't break through.","Seeing her struggle, the others exchanged looks of astonishment.","\"This barrier seems to cut off the void...\"","Yuan Zheng, an experienced Supreme Elder, remarked, \"I once found an ancient book in some ruins, which described a type of barrier that cuts off the void, similar to this one. It was used to contain Void Beasts.\"","\"Void Beasts?\"","Everyone looked at Yuan Zheng in confusion.","Although they had all ventured far and wide, Void Beasts were a relatively obscure legend."]},{"number":6465,"title":"Chapter 6465: None of Them Are Reliable","paragraphs":["Chapter 6465: None of Them Are Reliable","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Even Realm Master Yuan Zheng didn’t take this matter seriously, so naturally, he never mentioned it.","Jiang Ni, too, looked confused. Although her strength was incredibly formidable, she had spent much of her time wandering the world.","She knew the least.","Now, hearing Realm Master Yuan Zheng talk about the Void Demons, she was equally perplexed.","“Could it be that such demons are hidden within the cellar?”","...","“That’s possible, but to instantly kill or suppress the Three Talents, the power of this demon must be extraordinary, at least the combat strength of a peak fifth-tier or even sixth-tier Dao Lord!” said the Immortal King Bai Yue in astonishment. “If that’s the case, then why didn’t the demon act earlier? Why wait until we all left to make a move? Besides, we’ve entered the cellar before. If the demon wanted to act, why wait until today?”","“Is there a possibility that the demon only appeared because of the disturbance in the ancient tower? Don’t forget, after Jiang Ni passed through the two ancient towers, a Universe God appeared, and it disrupted some of the cellar’s formations. Could the demon have been trapped by the formations? Although its strength surpassed ours, it didn’t dare show itself because Jiang Ni was present. Once we left, it made its move?” speculated Lord Long Gong.","His words plunged the group into deep thought.","It must be said, this was the most likely explanation.","Unfortunately, they hadn’t completely guessed the truth.","But they had deduced the general idea.","At that moment.","Inside the cellar within the barrier.","Black mist surged everywhere.","The slaughter never ceased.","The battle outside had ended, but the battle inside the cellar had just begun.","Everything started when Jian Wushuang began comprehending the formation here.","At that time, he found a flaw in the formation and intended to break through.","However, at that moment, the Void Cultivators from outside suddenly rushed in.","But the strongest among those Void Cultivators barely had the strength of a sixth-tier Dao Lord, completely no match for Jian Wushuang.","With a simple command, Guardian Yunhai could easily annihilate them.","It was that straightforward.","However, just after Guardian Yunhai wiped out those Void Cultivators, the formation here suddenly began to tremble.","From the broken flaw, countless demons surged out.","They weren’t from the Divine Eye Clan.","They were Void Cultivators.","Countless Void Dao Lords poured out.","At first, only ordinary Dao Lords appeared, but soon, nearly all of them were peak sixth-tier Dao Lords.","Jian Wushuang had five Golden-armored Puppets by his side, each possessing divine power fifty thousand times stronger. Handling sixth-tier Dao Lords wasn’t too difficult, so he didn’t struggle much.","But continuing to fight like this wasn’t a solution, so he thought of leaving the place.","However, he discovered that those Void Cultivators, who had turned into mist, had condensed a barrier.","The power of this barrier kept rising, growing stronger.","In a short time, it condensed into a universe-level barrier.","Even Jian Wushuang’s full-strength attack couldn’t break through it.","His current power was too weak; his greatest strength lay in his soul consciousness.","Unfortunately, at this time, his soul will was the least useful since the barrier was an inanimate object.","Unable to break through the barrier.","He had no way to escape.","He could only grit his teeth and charge toward the Devil’s Furnace.","But before they could enter, what appeared inside the Devil’s Furnace were no longer Void Dao Lords but the Void Pinnacle.","Their numbers hadn’t changed from the Dao Lords.","In the span of a breath, dozens appeared.","The five Golden-armored Puppets were instantly shattered.","Even the Silver-armored Puppets used to form the formation were utterly destroyed, with not even a trace left.","These were his most important assets!","He had been counting on Guardian Yunhai and the others to capture Divine Eye Clan cultivators for him, but now they had all perished here.","Thankfully, Xiang Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen had been put away by him earlier.","Otherwise, they too would have fallen.","Dozens of pinnacle experts charged out simultaneously, attacking all at once.","The concentrated power was already no weaker than a Tribulation.","Fortunately, Jian Wushuang had the physical body of a Realm Beast, and despite enduring countless attacks, his body remained unscathed.","Moreover, he had the World Tree on his side.","“Demon Cloud!”","Whoosh!","The leaves of the World Tree wrapped around his entire body, and two vines coiled around Jian Wushuang’s arms.","He used the vines to continuously lash out at the Void Pinnacles.","He wasn’t aiming for instant kills but merely trying to block their attacks.","The number of Void Pinnacles was too overwhelming—there were at least tens of thousands of them.","Jian Wushuang remained close to the barrier, observing it constantly.","To his surprise, the more Void Pinnacles he killed, the stronger the barrier became.","The power within the barrier now exceeded a million units of divine power.","At the very least, it would take a Universe Master of the Six Tribulations Realm to break through it.","Even Universe Masters attacking its weak points couldn’t shatter it. Only Universe Masters of the Seven Tribulations Realm could break this barrier in an instant.","“What should I do?”","Jian Wushuang felt a bit anxious.","He revealed his true form.","Transforming into the enormous body of the Realm Beast, spanning a million miles, he unleashed the raw power of the Realm Beast to severely wound the Void Pinnacles.","He couldn’t kill them directly anymore. The more he killed, the more dangerous it became for him.","If he couldn’t break free soon, and if even more powerful Void Cultivators showed up, he would surely perish here today.","“Jiang Ni? Xiang Yang? Jiu Chen?”","None of these three seemed reliable.","Jiang Ni was still far from achieving the Dao.","She had only reached the edge of two Daos, but she still lacked the Dao of Death.","There was still a long road ahead before she could fully achieve the Dao.","It would take some time to break the restriction.","Even if she succeeded in achieving the Dao, rapidly advancing to pinnacle perfection by gathering treasures from the Ancient Domain would still not elevate Jiang Ni’s combat power to the level of a Universe Master of the Seven Tribulations Realm.","She wouldn’t be able to break the barrier.","As for Xiang Yang and Jiu Chen, these two were even less reliable—they were still in seclusion, trying to achieve the Dao.","Right now, Jian Wushuang had no one to rely on but himself.","Or perhaps he could hope for a Universe Master from the outside world to arrive.","But that hope seemed slim.","“In the end, I still have to rely on myself!”","Jian Wushuang shook his head helplessly.","He began scanning his surroundings.","Using the Demon Cloud Vine, he entangled the tens of thousands of Void Pinnacles.","He didn’t kill them, just severely injured them.","“They seem to lack consciousness?”","After a sweep of the area, Jian Wushuang noticed no significant discoveries.","However, he saw a flaw in the Void Pinnacles—or perhaps, a key factor.","“They lack consciousness, yet they can attack me with such precision?”","“There must be some kind of awareness directing them from behind the scenes!”","“If I can find this awareness, I can break free!”","Once Jian Wushuang made up his mind, he stopped running and took the offensive.","“Enter the Demon Furnace!” He moved with determination.","The two vines kept pushing aside the surrounding Void Pinnacles.","He charged toward the dark and ominous Demon Furnace.","Sure enough.","As he neared the Demon Furnace, the Void Cultivators became even more frenzied. Even when severely injured, they continued to throw themselves at Jian Wushuang in a desperate bid to take him down.","Clearly, the consciousness behind the scenes was getting anxious.","The closer he got to the Demon Furnace, the more frantic they became, which meant the entity was hiding within the furnace.","Jian Wushuang’s lips curled into a smirk, and he chuckled coldly in his heart.","“Trying to play mind games with me?”","Who was he?","The once-mighty Nine-Star Universe God—he had seen everything there was to see.","Even the most formidable deadly techniques could be easily dismantled by him.","Let alone such a minor scene.","“Get out of my way!”","Jian Wushuang swung his two vines, directly annihilating the Void Pinnacles that had surrounded him."]},{"number":6466,"title":"Chapter 6466: Upper God?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6466: Upper God?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Taking advantage of the brief gap, Jian Wushuang’s figure flashed and he instantly entered the Demon Kiln.","Swish!","The moment he stepped inside, he immediately unleashed a willpower attack.","“Annihilation!”","Buzz!","...","A powerful force of will swept through the entire Demon Kiln.","Within the Demon Kiln, Jian Wushuang sensed a vast amount of divine power.","Even he found it immense, at least at the level of a Universe God’s divine power.","“A billion units of divine power?”","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrow.","“It must have been prepared by that True Immortal Jiu You for himself, but it was coveted by this Void Beast!”","The will of True Immortal Jiu You had already been extinguished.","This divine power had now become unclaimed.","It had been used to mass-produce these Void cultivators.","The only thing Jian Wushuang couldn’t understand was why this consciousness had sent ordinary Dao Lords and top-tier Dao Lords to die, only sending out the Void Pinnacle last.","Wasn’t that a waste of divine power?","And why were they besieging them?","With a billion units of divine power, the consciousness only needed to absorb ten million to reach the combat strength of the Eight Tribulations Realm.","Why not simply go out and start slaughtering?","Moreover, this divine Origin Source was alive.","It continuously produced Void Pinnacles, consuming fifty thousand units of divine power each time. Even after ten thousand cycles, it still consumed only fifty thousand units of divine power.","The replenishment was quick.","It wasn’t really a waste.","Unless, of course, it benefited the consciousness in some way.","“Still hiding?”","Jian Wushuang roared angrily, “If you keep hiding, don’t blame me for being ruthless!”","“Spare me, senior!”","A light suddenly appeared in front of him, instantly illuminating the entire Demon Kiln.","When the surroundings came into view, Jian Wushuang realized that this place was actually a brightly lit grand hall.","It wasn’t a Demon Kiln at all!","It was practically a treasure trove.","Moreover, there was also a Universe-level Origin Source here.","A Universe Origin Source— the divine power Origin Source of a Universe God.","These two benefits alone were enough to drive countless Universe Masters insane.","Jian Wushuang raised his eyebrow again.","Though these things weren’t of great help to him personally.","After all, he didn’t yet have a divine body, so at most, his physical body could devour some of the Universe Origin Source.","But he could use the divine power Origin Source to cultivate his Devil Cloud Vine.","At present, his Devil Cloud Vine had a hundred thousand units of divine power and only two vines.","If he used the billion units of divine power to cultivate it, it would probably advance fully to the level of a Universe Master.","The World Tree, being one of the highest-level life forms in the Starry Sky.","Once it advanced to the Universe Master level, its power would be truly limitless.","“Come out and face me, stop playing tricks!”","“Senior, I can’t come out, I’m in the void, I can’t escape!”","That voice rang out again.","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brow and replied, “If I find you, you’re done for!”","“Senior, you possess the willpower of a Universe God. Destroying me wouldn’t be a problem. You wouldn’t even need to find me!”","That voice sounded incredibly frightened.","“I won’t be at ease until I see you!” Jian Wushuang’s figure remained still as he pointed with two fingers, instantly tearing open a gap in space-time and stepping into the deep layers of the void.","Once inside, he saw a black, round mass of flesh.","It looked quite familiar.","Back when he was in the Ancient Moon Time-space, he had seen a similar mass of flesh.","Only, that one was pink.","This one was black.","It exuded a terrifying force of void power from every part of its body.","But when it saw Jian Wushuang appear in front of it, it was so startled that it jumped.","“You... you... you actually made it in here?”","Jian Wushuang sneered. “Why were you so sure I couldn’t?”","“This is the exclusive void created for me by True God Jiu You. Even Universe Gods can’t break in. How did you do it?”","“Hahaha!” Jian Wushuang laughed loudly after hearing that. “How much do you really know about Universe Gods?”","This time, he was the one asking the question.","Last time, he had also been the one asking.","But the reasons were different.","Before, Jian Wushuang had asked because he didn’t know. Now, he asked because he did, and wanted to appear mysterious to the other party.","The black mass of flesh stammered in response. “Universe Gods are divided into lower gods, middle gods, upper gods, perfect gods, and supreme upper gods!”","“Which category does True God Jiu You belong to?”","“Upper god!” The black mass of flesh answered truthfully.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but laugh. “An upper god who can’t even stabilize at three stars? You call that an upper god? In that case, your so-called perfect upper god is at most a four-star Universe God, and a supreme upper god is just a five-star Universe God. With such meager power, you dare claim they’re perfect Universe Gods?”","“Stars?”","“What are those?”","The black mass of flesh seemed curious, but its hands—or rather, its entire body—wasn’t being honest.","No!","More accurately, the entire mass of flesh wasn’t being honest.","It was constantly gathering divine power.","It had already accumulated more than 200,000 divine power units.","What it intended to do was no mystery to Jian Wushuang.","“You’d better behave yourself!”","Two vines shot out from his arm, immediately wrapping around the black mass, firmly restraining it.","A mass of flesh with 200,000 divine power? He could barely win against that.","But when combined with willpower suppression, it wasn’t even a contest.","This creature wasn’t from the God Eye Clan, who could burn their souls without fearing suppression.","There was no reason for Jian Wushuang to be wary.","Unfortunately, this black mass was just a void creature.","“Now, I’ll ask, and you’ll answer. If you dare make any wrong moves, I’ll kill you!” Jian Wushuang’s tone was ice-cold. He wasn’t joking.","He was warning it.","The black mass of flesh nodded repeatedly and said, “Please, Senior, don’t kill me. I’ll answer whatever you ask. Spare my life, and I’ll even serve you as your loyal servant!”","“.....” Jian Wushuang was speechless.","This mass of flesh was spineless.","It had the combat strength of a Tribulation-level being.","Yet, it was so afraid of death.","Not like a cultivator.","More like a true spirit.","“Why did True God Jiu You imprison you?”","The black mass indignantly replied, “True God Jiu You is a twisted freak! All I did was devour his home world, and he locked me up, stripped me of my Universe Origin, and tortured my flesh endlessly!”","“.....”","Jian Wushuang was at a loss for words. He thought he had misheard. The more he listened, the more he felt something was off.","Devoured Jiu You True God’s home universe?","And then complained about having his Origin stripped?","Weren’t these two things causally linked?","If this creature hadn’t devoured Jiu You True God’s home, why would it have been imprisoned here?","And it had the audacity to feel wronged?","Even Jian Wushuang found it absurd.","If this thing had devoured the Northern Time-space, he would have been even more furious than Jiu You True God.","He would have tormented its Origin, consciousness, flesh, and divine body for an eternity.","Jiu You True God’s mild torture was actually quite restrained.","Then, Jian Wushuang began asking about other things.","Mainly about the sect and Jiu You True God himself.","As for the God Eye Clan, which piqued his interest the most, he didn’t ask.","Because the black mass might not know, and even if it did, it would be unwise to ask directly, as that might expose Jian Wushuang’s intentions.","From the black mass, Jian Wushuang first learned its name.","Hei Qiu!","The greatest Universe Master of the Void lineage."]},{"number":6467,"title":"Chapter 6467: Black Prisoner","paragraphs":["Chapter 6467: Black Prisoner","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was the opponent’s self-introduction.","Jian Wushuang didn’t see much greatness, but the other person did indeed look like a ball.","At peak strength, he was roughly at the level of a demigod, never having visited the Supreme.","He had always roamed through the Nine Directions Space-Time.","The Nine Directions Space-Time was a collective term for the many chaotic universes.","...","According to Hei Qiu, on the other side of the Universe Sea was the Supreme.","The place they were in was beneath the Supreme, within the Nine Directions Chaotic Universe.","It was also called the Nine Directions Space-Time.","However, it couldn’t really be called space-time.","There were too few universes here.","It couldn’t even compare to the Northern Space-Time.","The primitive universes in the Northern Space-Time were as countless as the stars.","Here, even having a hundred universes was questionable.","There probably weren’t any secret realms of space-time here.","In one universe, there were a million Origin Sources, and Universe Gods could easily create hundreds or thousands of universes.","That wasn’t even considered the nurturing of space-time.","Thus, Jian Wushuang felt this place didn’t deserve to be called the Nine Directions Space-Time.","However, since he was already here, he decided not to dwell on it.","They could call it whatever they liked!","Hei Qiu started talking about his reputation back in the Nine Directions Space-Time.","He was originally a Void Cultivator from the First Space-Time. Starting as an ordinary Void Cultivator, he had a stroke of luck when he devoured a high-level world with the demeanor of a Dao Lord, after which his rise became unstoppable.","In the shortest time possible, he accomplished three great leaps.","The first was reaching the pinnacle of perfection by devouring a high-level chaotic world. The second leap came when he gambled and devoured a secret realm of the universe, directly ascending to the Third Tribulation Universe Master, while also gaining control over the secret realm.","The final leap was when he devoured Jiu You True God’s home.","It was an incredibly vast universe.","Within it, there were thousands of Universe Masters, the strongest of whom had even reached the terrifying Ninth Tribulation.","As Hei Qiu spoke, he couldn’t help but long for his former peak.","“Back then, I was merely a Third Tribulation Universe Master. Although I had the blessing of a secret realm of the universe, I still had no fear. I resolutely entered the universe of Jiu You True God, starting from a high-level world, laying out my plans step by step. In the end, I gained control of that universe and devoured it!”","This was his moment of glory.","When he spoke, his emotions were evident.","Jian Wushuang appeared indifferent on the surface, but deep down, he admired this rotund figure.","A Third Tribulation Universe Master had actually dared to devour the home of a Universe God.","And he had succeeded.","This gamble directly elevated Hei Qiu to the rank of a Ninth Tribulation Universe Master.","In the Nine Directions Space-Time, the strongest beings were merely demigods.","No Void Cultivator had ever become a demigod, and many didn’t even reach the Ninth Tribulation before being besieged and killed.","However, Hei Qiu’s greatest trait was that he only played big and knew how to endure.","He had hidden himself in the homeland of Jiu You True God for billions of years, finally succeeding in his plan and taking down this super universe.","Becoming a Ninth Tribulation master, everyone thought he would bare his fangs and start devouring weaker universes.","But to their surprise, this fellow disappeared once again.","When he reappeared, it was a catastrophe for the entire Nine Directions Space-Time.","But this time, he failed.","After joining forces with other Void Cultivators and devouring hundreds of universes, he was suppressed on the spot by Jiu You God, who had descended from the lower realms.","Since then, he became a prisoner.","And this perfectly suited his name—Hei Qiu, the Black Prisoner!","“Your story is quite thrilling!”","“Haha, it’s just so-so. In the lower realms, I was doing alright, but compared to Universe Gods, well, there’s still a gap!” Hei Qiu laughed.","“You’re too modest!” Jian Wushuang sneered. “But I asked about Jiu You God. Your story, I have no interest in it!”","Jian Wushuang wasn’t completely uninterested, after all.","The other party had roamed through the entire Ninefold Space-time, which at least gave him an understanding of how vast the lower realms were. The Ninefold Space-time once contained about a million universes, and Universe Masters were even more common.","He had also come to a clearer understanding of his own position within it.","The northern corner of the Chaos Region in the Seventh Space-time of the Ninefold Space-time was where they currently were. Around 180 universes were gathered here, and the Chaos Universe they occupied was just one among them. Although there were Universe Masters here, they were few in number. Beyond that, any more precise details weren’t particularly relevant. At the very least, when he ventured out in the future, he would know which direction to head.","Blackprison let out a sigh and began recounting the story of Jiu You God.","Back then, after he was suppressed, Jiu You God kept him in his grasp, playing with him constantly. As a result, he knew many things, such as the history of this sect, which was actually stripped away from his Origin Source Universe. Since Jiu You God had devoured his homeland universe, the ancient sects within it had all fallen into his Origin Source Universe. This sect was one of those, the very place where Jiu You God had risen to power.","His journey of growth had been remarkable, but Jian Wushuang wasn’t interested in hearing the long version and urged Blackprison to keep it brief.","Jiu You God’s rise was simple. During a sect trial, he went from being an ordinary mortal in the outer sect to breaking through and becoming a True Immortal. After that, his ascent was unstoppable. Within 10,000 years, he attained the Dao and became the Ultimate Dao Lord, and within 100,000 years, he had become a Universe Master.","In less than a billion years, Jiu You God had truly become a god.","From then on, the First Space-time was practically Jiu You God’s territory, though he remained low-key and mysterious to the outside world. However, what Blackprison knew about the sect told a different story.","After Jiu You God became a Universe God, while he still had time to move freely in the lower realms, he frantically gathered treasures and sent them to the “Dongtian Sect.” He amassed the treasures of the entire First Space-time within Dongtian Sect before he crossed the sea to the Celestial Realm.","Since then, no Universe Gods had ever appeared again in the Ninefold Space-time. This had nothing to do with Jiu You God hoarding treasures. Most cultivators, after becoming Universe Masters, began attempting to cross the sea to the Celestial Realm.","After all, the Ninefold Space-time was far too small. It was even small for Universe Masters. There wasn’t even a space-time-level secret realm, leaving little room for exploration. Thus, most had ventured to the Celestial Realm. A few, who had no further aspirations or were unwilling to leave the Ninefold Space-time behind, chose to stay. This explained why top-level experts were so rare in the Ninefold Space-time.","As a result, when Blackprison devoured Jiu You God’s homeland, only a few Universe Gods dared to investigate his whereabouts. Most turned a blind eye.","It wasn’t that they lacked ambition, but rather the strength to stop him. In the end, it was Jiu You God who intervened. Otherwise, Blackprison would have succeeded.","The most terrifying trait of Void Cultivators was their ability to devour. This was a legacy of the World Beasts’ remarkable tradition, and when it came to devouring, there was no limit.","After consuming hundreds of universes, Blackprison’s divine power had reached an astounding fifty million. Among the half-god experts in the Ninefold Space-time, few could stand against him.","If not for Jiu You God, and if Blackprison had been allowed to continue devouring, he would have consumed the entire Ninefold Space-time. By then, he would have nurtured at least a five-star Universe God, a being even the Celestial Realm would struggle to deal with.","According to Blackprison, the Universe Gods of the Celestial Realm, the perfect higher gods, were the five-star Universe Gods, standing at the peak of existence."]},{"number":6468,"title":"Chapter 6468: Jormungandr","paragraphs":["Chapter 6468: Jormungandr","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang was still unsure of how many Universe Gods there were in the heavens.","Black Prison continued speaking, now touching on the schemes of Jiu You.","“That guy is the most cunning person I’ve ever met. The treasures he gathered back then weren’t for the sect at all, but for an evil artifact hidden within the sect. The reason he rose to power so quickly was because of that trial—he triggered the evil artifact and was chosen by it!”","Jian Wushuang’s gaze grew more solemn.","He hadn’t expected this surprising bit of information.","...","Come to think of it, every Universe God had a world-shattering secret.","It made sense. After all, one couldn’t expect to become a Universe God through ordinary means, as if it were some kind of dream.","“Evil artifact?” Jian Wushuang frowned and pressed further. “What kind of treasure is it?”","Upon hearing the question, Black Prison responded with a hint of resentment, “Oh come on, you’re just teasing me now. That artifact’s aura is identical to yours. You really don’t know?”","Jian Wushuang narrowed his eyes, fixing his gaze on the large black orb in front of him.","“So, you knew all along, yet you’ve been leading me in circles?”","He couldn’t help but heighten his awareness, while simultaneously using thought power to search for any treasure that matched his aura.","Black Prison had mentioned that the evil artifact bore the same aura as his.","There could only be one explanation—it must be related to the Realm Beast.","After a thorough scan using his thought power, Jian Wushuang didn’t find the artifact.","However, he suddenly felt an overwhelming pressure, as if someone were gripping him tightly.","“Hm?”","Jian Wushuang shot up to his feet, and the will of the Realm Beast erupted from within him.","Roar!","A deafening sound reverberated, causing the entire ruin to tremble.","“Come out! I know you’re listening!” Jian Wushuang’s true form appeared in an instant.","As his towering Realm Beast form emerged, Black Prison held his breath and instinctively stepped back.","After all, the ancestors of void cultivators were Realm Beasts.","When it came to bloodlines, all life in the Starry Sky descended from the Realm Beasts.","However, void cultivators had inherited the purest bloodlines, making them the equivalent of royal blood.","Unfortunately, Realm Beasts didn’t care about such things. To them, only the Origin Source mattered.","Jian Wushuang’s Realm Beast Origin was still in its infancy.","His will and physical body, though, were that of a genuine Realm Beast.","Shortly after, an ancient voice echoed through the air.","“You cannot be a Realm Beast. No Realm Beast in the Land of Disorder is as weak as you. Who exactly are you?”","“The Land of Disorder may not have one like me, but that doesn’t mean the Starry Sky doesn’t!” Jian Wushuang retorted.","The voice fell silent for a moment before responding, “Starry Sky? Are you a Star Spirit?”","“No!” Jian Wushuang shook his head. If he were a Star Spirit, he would have dragged the speaker out by now instead of wasting time talking.","“That’s right. No Star Spirit would be as weak as you.”","That statement stung, but Jian Wushuang couldn’t find a reason to argue.","He couldn’t very well claim that he was a potential Star Spirit, could he?","“Then let me guess your identity!” Jian Wushuang said with a newfound interest, speaking leisurely. “You must be the Realm Beast that shattered the Realm God Continent, right?”","“You know me?” The voice now carried a trace of excitement.","Jian Wushuang responded confidently, “Of course I know you. I also know that Morosa has always been trying to save you, which is why he’s been consuming the Realm God Continent in the consciousness world!”","“If my guess is right, that place is the Realm God Continent’s consciousness!”","The Realm God Consciousness—it was the will of the Realm God Continent.","The world it manifested was also part of the Realm God Continent.","“Morosa...”","The voice was tinged with nostalgia, as though it had traveled back in time.","“I remember now. Morosa, my good brother. He has been fighting for our ideal, battling that supreme existence!!!”","“Our ideal was to exterminate that group of supreme beings!!!”","Jian Wushuang was suddenly at a loss.","He had been trying to manipulate the speaker, but instead, the conversation had left him completely confused.","Supreme beings?","What was that about?","And Morosa battling a supreme being?","Could they be referring to the God King?","The God King certainly had the power of a supreme being.","But Morosa? He didn’t quite seem up to the task!","Jian Wushuang steadied his thoughts and mockingly said, “With Morosa’s strength, he’s no match for the God King. You’re thinking too highly of him!”","“God King?”","“Who is this God King?”","“He’s the supreme being you’re talking about. He created the Starry Sky!” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","Swish!","In the darkness, a massive arm shot out, its palm reaching for Jian Wushuang and Hei Qiu.","Seeing this, Jian Wushuang used his thought power to isolate the arm effortlessly.","This startled Hei Qiu, who had been trembling in a corner the entire time.","He was terrified of that arm.","Even more so of the conversation Jian Wushuang had just had with it.","“He’s not!!!”","The eye embedded in the palm stared venomously at Jian Wushuang and growled, “The one who opened the Starry Sky is just a clown. He doesn’t deserve the title of Supreme. He’s nothing but a fraud, and one day, he’ll die at my hands!”","“I’ll kill him a thousand times, and it still won’t be enough!!!”","Jian Wushuang covered his nose and said leisurely, “Alright, every one of you says the same thing.”","At this point, his brow furrowed as a thought struck him. He exclaimed, “You’re saying the God King isn’t the Supreme?”","“Then who is?”","The arm trembled slightly, the anger in its tone replaced with a hint of fear.","“Jormungandr!”","“Who is he?”","“He is the Supreme!”","“You said Morosa was opposing the Supreme, and now you’re saying the Supreme isn’t the God King but Jormungandr.”","A name flickered in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","“The Great Realm King God?”","He cautiously uttered the title.","The arm began to shrink, eventually becoming a large black arm about ten feet long. It didn’t speak again.","But its silence was an affirmation.","This revelation gave Jian Wushuang a huge shock.","The Supreme was Jormungandr—that being...","If that were true, he’d have to reconsider his position.","After all, he had walked out of the Consciousness God Realm.","He knew whose side he was on.","This was the Starry Sky, the God King’s Starry Sky.","He was certainly on the God King’s side.","But to learn from this severed arm that the strongest deity on Realm God Continent was actually the Supreme...","Perhaps even the God King couldn’t defeat him.","And the reason the Realm Beasts were frantically attacking Realm God Continent was because of this Supreme.","The Supreme!","Jian Wushuang had witnessed such power in his fragmented memories.","And he was on the opposite side of this Supreme.","For a moment, Jian Wushuang’s mind was in utter chaos.","He couldn’t quite grasp why the Supreme had been able to enter the Starry Sky or why the God King had done nothing.","Why had the Realm Beasts suddenly shifted sides and become allies?","Now he, too, was a Realm Beast.","It seemed that any grudges between him and the Realm Beasts had dissipated, replaced by a sense of kinship.","Jian Wushuang was conflicted.","“Why?”","“Why are you connected to the Supreme?”","“Didn’t you attack the Starry Sky to seek revenge against the God King?”","He bombarded the arm with questions.","The arm slowly drooped, its voice hoarse as it murmured to itself, “Why?”","“That’s a question that haunts me too!”"]},{"number":6469,"title":"Chapter 6469: A Great Dream","paragraphs":["Chapter 6469: A Great Dream","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“The Land of Chaos was once our homeland, but now the traitor, the God King, has appeared. He, the noble king of the Realm Beasts, has betrayed his kind!”","“We don’t hate him, but we do feel more anger, a sense of injustice for the brothers who gave their lives!”","“But Jormungandr, he must die. If he doesn’t, it’s only a matter of time before he kills all the Realm Beasts. He is even more insane than the God King!”","“What does he want?” Jian Wushuang asked tentatively.","“He wants to impose order on the Land of Chaos!”","...","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang’s gaze trembled.","This was too outrageous.","To think he wanted to bring order to the Land of Chaos.","Who exactly were these supreme beings?","Were they also Realm Beasts?","Jian Wushuang had no way of knowing.","Even the arm’s knowledge was limited.","But there was one truth he understood: if the Land of Chaos gained order, then the fate of all the Realm Beasts would be the same as what had happened when the Starry Sky was created.","They would be annihilated and become part of the Land of Chaos.","And so, the Realm Beasts rebelled.","From the perspective of the Realm Beasts, Jian Wushuang suddenly realized that they weren’t representing evil but resistance.","A struggle.","In his memories, on the battlefield beneath the Divine Mountain, it was those white-clad supreme beings who had shattered the Divine Mountain.","And Master Xuan Yi had been the one guarding the mountain.","So, Jian Wushuang and these supreme beings stood on opposite sides.","No matter how you looked at it, they were enemies.","Whether because of Master Xuan Yi or due to his current identity as a Realm Beast, Jian Wushuang, in this moment, understood many things.","Suddenly, he saw the true essence of the world.","It was far more shocking than the ultimate secret of the Starry Sky.","Was it possible that the Realm Beasts of the Land of Chaos were, in fact, part of this world?","And that the practitioners within the Starry Sky were all later-life forms, whose bodies, bloodlines, and power stemmed from the Realm Beasts?","Those supreme beings wanted to break the chaos and create a world of order, but in doing so, they had to sacrifice the Realm Beasts.","He didn’t know how many Realm Beasts there were.","But he knew their strength.","Yet, even they couldn’t stop the supreme beings, and in the end, the Divine Mountain had collapsed.","The world became one of order.","The Realm Beasts were all shattered, transforming into universes, time, and starry skies, creating the vast Star Sea civilization.","That had happened after their defeat.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t sure if the ordered world was the right path.","“What a grand ideal!”","He sighed.","Because these matters were too far from his reach.","He wasn’t yet strong enough to influence such events.","Maybe, one day, if he gained that power, his mindset would change as well!","The limp arm lifted again, and the eye in its palm stared at Jian Wushuang.","“I know your body was once mine, but your will is stronger. Yet, none of this matters to the Realm Beasts. What matters is your Origin Source. Although I don’t know your true identity, I must warn you: be cautious of Jormungandr in the Starry Sky. He’s more terrifying than the God King!”","“You have not yet mastered your Origin Source. This world is the best place for your training. Once you enter the Realm God Continent, he won’t give you time to grow. He will hunt you down relentlessly. You must become strong enough here, or don’t ever leave!”","Jian Wushuang’s expression remained cold as he responded, “Why should I believe you? Why would the supreme beings want to kill me? Even if I become a Time God, I can’t possibly threaten them, right? And they seek all the Realm Beasts in the Land of Chaos. Would they act against me alone?”","He still harbored a bit of hope.","After all, Jormungandr had once shown him kindness.","It wasn’t as if a few words from someone else could make him change his mind.","The arm trembled slightly, as if mocking him.","“You are too naive. The supreme beings are without emotion. They will dutifully exterminate anything that stands in their way. Even if you were his son, he wouldn’t hesitate to strike you down!”","“Without emotion?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered with a hint of surprise, but he didn’t dwell on it.","“You don’t need to worry about me. I know what I’m doing!”","Jian Wushuang’s hand clenched as the eye in the palm flashed with fury, and a voice bellowed, “This body belongs to me! It’s mine, always has been mine...”","“It was supposed to be me who awakened here, growing stronger in the midst of thunder!”","Jian Wushuang glanced sideways, surprised. “So, you were originally sealed here?”","“Ghost Eye!” the disembodied arm muttered bitterly.","It was only then that Jian Wushuang realized everything had been pre-arranged.","But it was Jiang Ni who disrupted the original plan.","Perhaps it should have been him who provoked the God of Jiu You.","Yet by sheer coincidence, Jiang Ni opened the underground chamber, releasing the God of Jiu You.","In truth, behind the God of Jiu You was this severed arm.","Seeing the arm’s resentful gaze, Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but feel a slight pang of sympathy.","“Rest assured,” Jian Wushuang said calmly. “Molosha faced Jormungandr and survived. When I leave this place, I will surpass Molosha. Jormungandr will pose no threat to me.”","“No!” The severed arm retorted sternly. “That’s because Jormungandr was using Molosha as a pawn. But you are different. You’re far more dangerous. Ghost Eye is no ordinary figure; his strength is immense. Anyone he takes an interest in is not just some common individual. I can see your potential is boundless, and Jormungandr will see it too!”","“He will absolutely try to kill you!”","Jian Wushuang spread his hands. “So what should I do?”","“Hasn’t Senior Ghost Eye considered this?”","The severed arm replied with pride, “Of course he has. Why else would he make you his stepping stone?”","“Originally, I was supposed to awaken and sacrifice myself to destroy Jormungandr’s conscious world. That world is the blueprint for the future of the entire Land of Chaos. Everything Jormungandr is doing is a test for the path ahead!”","“That’s why I must destroy him. Even if I perish, I will shatter his conscious world!”","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows.","He took a deep breath. Jormungandr’s conscious world was, in fact, an extension of his mind.","If so many Universe Gods existed within that world, just how powerful was Jormungandr himself?","Perhaps, as the severed arm said, Jormungandr truly was an invincible being.","Even Star Spirits were no match for him.","Maybe only a God King could stand a chance against him.","If this was the case, Jormungandr must possess the strength of a Beast King from the Tribulation phase.","A being that had surpassed time and space and existed beyond the Starry Sky.","A force on par with a God King.","Jian Wushuang still had a long way to go!","He at least had to become a Space-Time God.","Without the power of a Space-Time God, he wouldn’t even have the qualifications to enter the Land of Chaos.","“So, according to you, when I leave, I’ll have to shatter the conscious world as well?”","“You want me to walk into certain death?”","Jian Wushuang frowned.","Why did it feel like the severed arm was trying to brainwash him?","“You won’t have to act, but I will need your help!”","“But you haven’t even fully revived yet. How can you help?” Jian Wushuang asked in surprise."]},{"number":6470,"title":"Chapter 6470: Gagarin","paragraphs":["Chapter 6470: Gagarin","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang sneered coldly, saying, “You’re underestimating Ghost Eye too much. He already prepared a backup plan for me, but I need your help!”","“Tell me!”","“Take me away and put me in the ninth layer of the Nine Prison Pagoda. You don’t need to worry about the rest!” The man with the severed arm said truthfully.","However, this request put Jian Wushuang in a difficult position.","The fact that the other party could mention the Nine Prison Pagoda meant that he wasn’t lying.","...","It was highly likely that everything was true.","The only thing troubling him was throwing the man into the ninth layer of the Nine Prison Pagoda.","At the moment, he simply couldn’t do that.","Forget the ninth layer, even the fourth layer was a challenge for him.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s expression change, the man with the severed arm was surprised and said, “Don’t tell me you don’t know about the Nine Prison Pagoda!”","“That’s not it!” Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “It’s just that I’m still a bit far from reaching the ninth layer.”","“I understand. If you could open the ninth layer, you’d already possess the Origin Source of the Realm Beast!” The man with the severed arm said casually. “Tell me, what layer are you at now? Have you reached the level of mastering an Origin Source?”","“The third layer.”","“?”","The man with the severed arm was furious. “I’ve observed that you’ve been in this place for over ten thousand years, and in these ten thousand years, you’ve only broken through to the third layer?”","“Ten thousand years, and you’ve only reached the third layer?”","“Is that considered slow, or fast?” Jian Wushuang asked curiously.","This left the man with the severed arm speechless.","In his opinion, with Ghost Eye’s eye for talent, he should have at least chosen an extraordinary genius. In ten thousand years, breaking through the ninth layer might not be realistic, but the first seven layers shouldn’t be a problem.","Who would have thought that in ten thousand years, Jian Wushuang had only broken through to the third layer?","When Jian Wushuang mentioned that he had only made it through the first three layers after capturing a member of the Divine Eye Clan, the man nearly fainted from anger.","“From now on, I’ll teach you the Divine Eye Secret Technique!”","“You?” Jian Wushuang was skeptical.","The man with the severed arm said coldly, “Don’t forget who the Divine Eye Secret Technique is modeled after!”","After some thought, Jian Wushuang realized it made sense—they did share the same origin as the Realm Beast!","“So, what now?” Jian Wushuang asked. “I can’t just stay here forever!”","The man with the severed arm replied calmly, “You might not be able to move, but this Primordial Star can move!”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang was surprised. “This is a Primordial Star?”","“Yes, in your terms, it’s a divine artifact!”","Jian Wushuang was delighted. If that were the case, there would be no need to search for the domain ship anymore.","With the Primordial Star, he would be invincible in the Ninefold Space-time Continuum.","However, his joy was short-lived as his fantasy was quickly dashed with a cold reality.","The power within the Primordial Star was too limited.","It couldn’t even function at its peak.","Even the sea of divine power left by the Universe God could barely drive the Primordial Star. Its speed was decent though—it could cross a chaotic world in a single day.","In a hundred years, it could cross an entire universe.","This speed was acceptable to Jian Wushuang.","However, a powerless Primordial Star could only be used for traveling.","At least the man with the severed arm could guide him in cultivating the Divine Eye Secret Technique.","This time, he wouldn’t need to capture any more members of the Divine Eye Clan.","Once his strength was restored, he could capture them all when the time came.","Yet, even under the guidance of the man with the severed arm, after three thousand years, Jian Wushuang hadn’t even reached the beginner stage of the fourth turn of the Divine Eye Secret Technique.","The man with the severed arm, “Gagarin,” was not angry. Instead, he comforted him, saying, “Jian Wushuang, you have decent talent, but you’re not suited for cultivating the Divine Eye Secret Technique. You’re more suited for slaughter!”","“Go, take the Primordial Star and search for powerful Divine Eye Clan members. I have some information for you. In a secret universe-level realm, several powerful members of the Divine Eye Clan are hiding. They may not have awakened yet, but even if your true combat power isn’t enough, you should still be able to suppress them with ease!”","Jian Wushuang looked confused and asked, “What about you?”","“I’ve been lying here for billions of years; a little more time won’t make a difference!”","“Go, leave before I lose my temper!”","Jian Wushuang pouted. He felt the problem was with the other party’s teaching.","It wasn’t his fault!","However, he had to take something before leaving.","For example, Hei Qiu.","This guy was quite a useful helper.","“Hei Qiu, are you willing to assist me?”","Hei Qiu patted his belly and replied slyly, “As long as you don’t abandon me, I’m willing to take you as my godfather!”","“Be serious!” Jian Wushuang barked, “From now on, follow me, and I will help you become a Universe God. But first, I need you to capture some members of the God Eye Clan for me. Your status among the Void Cultivators is quite high, and I need you to help me contact them and search for the whereabouts of the God Eye Clan!”","“Don’t worry, my lord, that’s easy for me!”","Hei Qiu was visibly excited.","Even though earlier, he hadn’t understood a word of what Jian Wushuang had told the one-armed man.","Something about supreme beings, God Kings...","He hadn’t heard of any of it.","The only thing he knew was Vis. That, he understood.","Upon hearing that Jian Wushuang was acquainted with Vis, he made up his mind to cling to Jian Wushuang’s leg.","He needed to hold on tight.","Becoming a Universe God was no longer just a dream.","“Mhm, as long as you’re dedicated, even Time and Space God is within your reach!”","Jian Wushuang had begun his grandiose promises again.","Though in truth, he had rarely fulfilled the promises he’d made to others.","The one-armed man and Gagarin returned to the darkness.","Jian Wushuang and Hei Qiu, meanwhile, took a Universe God and an ocean of divine power as they left the Demon Kiln.","The Origin Source of divine power was meant to fortify this Primordial Star, so Jian Wushuang couldn’t take it with him.","However, he did loot all the treasures from the Cave Heaven Sect.","These treasures were enough to elevate his Gui Yun Tree to the level of Universe Master.","As a Special Life Form with a life force level in the millions, the Gui Yun Tree required extremely rare treasures to evolve.","Even all the treasures from a super sect below the level of a Universe God were barely enough to push the Gui Yun Tree to the Universe Master level.","And even then, it wasn’t quite sufficient. Hei Qiu had to release a significant amount of Void Force to allow the Gui Yun Tree to fully evolve.","“Master!”","After evolving to the Universe Master level, the Gui Yun Tree gained consciousness.","This greatly excited Jian Wushuang.","He immediately asked, “Gui Yun, how strong are you now? How many vines can you control?”","“Nine!”","Jian Wushuang was a bit disappointed.","Only nine vines? That was far too few.","Even a pinnacle expert had two. Now that it had become a Universe Master, its power should have multiplied dozens of times, at least to the point where it could control dozens of vines.","To his surprise, Gui Yun solemnly replied, “Master, my limit as a Universe Master is thirty-six vines!”","What it meant was that controlling nine vines was already quite impressive.","Jian Wushuang began making more promises.","“Gui Yun, you’re a leaf of the World Tree. You have a life force level in the hundreds of millions. You shouldn’t claim your limit is thirty-six vines. Your limit should be infinite. Don’t worry, with my help, you’ll become even stronger!”","“Thank you, Master!”","Hei Qiu stood beside them, his expression unchanged, but inwardly he was cursing Jian Wushuang for even trying to deceive a tree.","He had just promised to help him become a Universe God, a Time and Space God!","Yet here he was, immediately turning around and asking Hei Qiu to use his own power to cultivate a tree.","“By the way, how much divine power does each of your vines contain now?” Jian Wushuang casually asked.","Gui Yun obediently replied, “Each one contains one million divine power!”"]},{"number":6471,"title":"Chapter 6471: Headache","paragraphs":["Chapter 6471: Headache","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang’s eyes nearly split open in shock when he heard that.","“One vine contains a million units of divine power?”","This wasn’t just a matter of strength—it was simply too outrageous.","Even if its life level was high, how high could it possibly be?","Could it surpass a Realm Beast?","...","A Realm Beast, even at the Universe Master level, possessing nine million units of divine power, was still considered normal.","He hadn’t expected that the Gui Yun Tree could defy the heavens like this.","Black Prison glared suspiciously and said, “Lord Jian Wushuang, I suspect this tree is lying to you.”","As he spoke, a battle axe appeared from nowhere in his hand.","Gui Yun Tree shot a disdainful glance at Black Prison and said, “I am the great World Tree! Although I am only at the Three Tribulations Universe Master level now, nine million units of divine power are still easy for me. And that’s just pure divine power. With the addition of my inherited secret techniques and the cooperation of my nine vines, my combat power can rival an Eight Tribulations Universe Master. In fact, my battle power matches that of someone with fifteen million units, on the verge of becoming a Nine Tribulations master!”","“That’s an exaggeration—fifteen million units doesn’t quite make you a half-step Nine Tribulations level,” Jian Wushuang corrected him, but he felt pleased in his heart.","This was just a Three Tribulations Universe Master. If it could be nurtured to the Universe God level, wouldn’t it become invincible even among Universe Gods?","If it reached the level of a Time-Space God, it might even crush Star Gods.","This was the advantage of an advanced life form—a million times stronger than ordinary beings.","Among those of the same level, it would reign supreme in the Starry Sky.","But the World Tree’s leaves were limited, and those that contained its Origin Source were even rarer.","Because the World Tree stood at the very center of the Starry Sky, it was incredibly difficult for even Star Spirits to obtain its leaves. Only God Kings could distribute them.","When the Starry Sky was first created, it had been centered around this World Tree. That alone showed how highly valued it was.","It was absolutely the most powerful life form in the Starry Sky—the ancestor of all special life forms.","But sadly, it couldn’t reproduce. No matter how strong it was, there were only a few of them.","If it could reproduce, there would be no need for a race like the Giant Gods.","The World Tree represented the pinnacle of the Starry Sky’s life forms, while the Giant Gods represented the pinnacle of the Starry Sky’s reproduction.","However, the Realm Beasts were even stronger, with no limits to their life levels.","Their Origin Source could even reach the level needed to open up a new Starry Sky.","Jian Wushuang clenched his fist. He had many cards up his sleeve, but he had to become even stronger.","Jiajialin’s words had made him realize that in this world, there were no enemies—only different beliefs.","The supreme beings sought to create a world of order, while his teacher, Xuan Yi, wanted to maintain the current state of affairs.","For now, it seemed that Xuan Yi held this view.","There might also be other unknown factors at play.","But if Jian Wushuang wanted to understand or participate, he would need to be strong enough first.","As it stood, he was still far from that level—far too weak.","He needed to keep surpassing his limits.","“Black Prison, how much further are you from reaching the Universe Master level?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Upon hearing the question, Black Prison immediately responded with a fawning smile, “Master, after I obtain the Origin Source, I can quickly restore myself to the Nine Tribulations Universe Master level. Traveling to the secret realm outside of Nash Universe won’t be a problem!”","“Good. As you said, if that secret realm truly contains powerful God Eye Tribe experts of the Fifth Turn and above, I’ll be counting on your performance,” Jian Wushuang said, raising an eyebrow.","“Master, rest assured. Anyone below the Nine Tribulations level stands no chance against me!” Black Prison boasted confidently.","Jian Wushuang nodded with satisfaction. “Very good. You go ahead and refine that Origin Source. I have some other matters to attend to.”","“Yes, Master!” Black Prison respectfully took his leave.","In fact, Jian Wushuang could have created a microcosm for Black Prison, which would have been equivalent to giving him an alternate universe. The power might even have been stronger.","But Jian Wushuang didn’t fully trust him.","This chubby black fellow spoke flippantly and was far from reliable.","With Gui Yun’s current strength at the perfect Eight Tribulations level, Jian Wushuang felt more confident, which was why he dared to allow Black Prison to regain some of his strength.","Jian Wushuang felt that if he pushed himself too hard, he might lose control. If that happened and he faced a backlash, it would be troublesome.","His overall combat strength was still too weak. Without the assistance of Gui Yun, he couldn’t even handle a Universe Master. In the end, he was still just a mortal in the Great Completion stage, relying heavily on the body of the Realm Beast and the boost from the Origin Source Totem.","Without these aids, not to mention Universe Masters, he wouldn’t even be able to defeat the absolute peaks.","“I should go and check on that little girl, Jiang Ni,” Jian Wushuang thought about his companions. Initially, he had planned to build a force of his own and search for the God Eye Clan in the Ninefold Time-Space. However, Guardian Yunhai and the others had all fallen.","Now, within the Nine Prison Pagoda, only Xiang Yang, Immortal Jiu Chen, and that one luan bird remained. The luan bird was of the God Eye Clan and wouldn’t be of any help to him.","Xiang Yang and Jiu Chen both had promising Origin Sources, but they were currently at a critical moment in the path of unity. Once they broke through, nurturing their Origin Sources could help them quickly reach the perfect level of the absolute peak.","At that point, Jian Wushuang could ask the luan bird to teach them the God Eye Clan’s secret technique for the first three revolutions. With their divine power and Origin Source meeting the requirements, they could rapidly ascend to the Tribulation stage.","Jian Wushuang also had a jar of microcosms. He could reward them with one each, directly helping them grow to the Ninth Tribulation stage, perhaps even to a demigod level.","With these two powerful allies, he wouldn’t have to rely on Black Prison anymore. He gauged their progress in unity; there was still a ways to go.","Deciding not to focus on them further, Jian Wushuang crossed the barrier and arrived outside the Ancient Star Domain.","Swoosh!","Emerging from the underground, the Ancient Star Domain hadn’t changed much from before, except there were far fewer cultivators. Currently, there were only a few hundred thousand left, but every one of them was a Dao Lord. There were also quite a few Dao Lords of the Imperial level.","In recent days, the Ancient Star Domain had developed nicely. However, it was time for Jian Wushuang to leave. He planned to take the entire Ancient Star Domain with him.","This time, he didn’t waste any time. He intended to find Jiang Ni directly, reunite with her, and then leave together. At the moment, Jiang Ni was still stuck in comprehending the Origin Source of Death. Across the Ninefold Time-Space, Jian Wushuang was the only one who could guide her in this area.","If she were left to cultivate on her own, it would take her at least ten million years to fully understand the Origin Source of Death. With Jian Wushuang’s help, this time could be drastically reduced. He couldn’t promise that she would master it within a century, but Jian Wushuang was confident that within ten thousand years, he could help her elevate the Origin Source of Death to perfection.","At that point, she would need Jian Wushuang’s guidance to merge the three major Origin Sources. This was a critical step, one Jian Wushuang took very seriously.","After all, Jiang Ni was the only daughter of Hui Qing, and he needed to teach her well.","At the same time, he couldn’t help but imagine what would happen if Jiang Ni met Jiang Shang again in the future. Would she choose to help her mother seek revenge, or would she forgive Jian Wushuang?","If Jiang Ni discovered that it was her biological father who had killed her mother, what would her reaction be?","Of course, in this world, both Hui Qing and Jiang Shang were remnants, mere fragments of their original selves. Jiang Shang’s remnant largely came from the Heavenly Maiden in the ancient Moon Time-Space.","The Heavenly Maiden was Jiang Shang, and Jiang Shang was the Heavenly Maiden. Hui Qing’s remnant had been left behind from her time with the Heavenly Maiden.","“Chaos!”","Jian Wushuang felt a headache just thinking about it."]},{"number":6472,"title":"Chapter 6472: Meeting","paragraphs":["Chapter 6472: Meeting","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang now could only rely on himself.","He planned to help Jiang Ni rescue Jiang Shang, then take them both away from this forsaken place and head to the Realm God Continent to reunite with Hui Qing.","After that, he would seek the help of the Star Spirit, to see if it was possible to resurrect Jiang Shang’s brother.","For such a small matter, if he were to ask the Giant Star Spirit, the latter would likely agree.","With this thought, Jian Wushuang nodded in satisfaction.","...","It wasn’t a bad idea.","Once he had repaid his debts, he could also venture into the Starry Sky for some time.","As for the Realm God Continent, he dared not stay any longer.","There was no choice—Gagarin had said too many terrifying things.","If the Great Realm King, “Jormungandr,” truly was an unrivaled existence, then he would certainly destroy him.","Jian Wushuang knew he had to escape quickly.","Venturing into the Starry Sky, with a Divine King at his side, he wouldn’t have to worry.","While thinking about these future matters, he had already arrived at the Ancient Court of Nine Heavens.","The majestic scenery above the clouds was mesmerizing.","Only Dao Lords were usually allowed to ascend here.","But with Jiang Ni’s arrival, not only had this rule been broken, but even the Immortal King of the Ancient Court had been replaced by Jiang Ni.","As the newly crowned Immortal King, Jiang Ni abolished all unnecessary rules and focused all her energy on strengthening the Ancient Realm.","Now, the Nine Heavens were no longer exclusive to the Dao Lords. One could even see many True Immortals busy working above the Nine Heavens.","“Hurry up! Don’t be careless with the materials being sent to the Abyss!”","“Yes, sir!”","An officer of the Ancient Court commanded his subordinates, who were transporting various materials, seemingly for some sort of formation.","“Sigh!”","Jian Wushuang recognized this officer as General Li, whom he had met once, a man closely associated with the Son of the Sword Pavilion.","General Li looked troubled at the moment.","Something major had happened in the Abyss.","The power within the Abyss had suddenly grown extremely violent. More and more demonic creatures had begun to pour out, each one stronger than the last.","Now, even the strongest beings of the Abyss had fled.","The entire Abyss had become a true den of demons.","The demonic creatures had occupied thousands of miles around the Abyss’s entrance.","Fortunately, these creatures required the environment near the Abyss to survive, or the entire Ancient Realm would have been doomed.","Even Jiang Ni herself could do nothing about it.","In the end, they had to seal the area with formations, temporarily suppressing the threat.","Jian Wushuang walked through the bustling crowd. While he could see others, no one could see him.","“The Abyss is in trouble?”","He frowned slightly, realizing he had almost forgotten about the Abyss entirely.","“Before I leave, I should take a look.”","He had always been curious about the Abyss.","Back when he was in the mid-level time-space, he had explored the Abyss and discovered a shocking secret at its bottom.","But now, such secrets meant little to him.","However, the Abyss in the Ancient Realm might be connected to the God Eye Clan.","Although Hei Qiu hadn’t mentioned it, Jian Wushuang’s attention had been focused on the universe-level secret realm.","Now that he’d heard about it again, he figured he might find some valuable information by entering the Abyss.","He walked slowly, lost in thought.","Before long, he arrived at the Tianzheng Hall of the Ancient Court!","This was where the Immortal King presided over the Ancient Court.","But Jiang Ni wasn’t here.","It was being managed by Yuan Zheng, the Honored Celestial Lord.","Now, everything was based on strength.","The daily affairs of the Ancient Court were handled by Yuan Zheng and Dragon Lord.","Dao Lords like Sancai and Baiyue had all retreated to train in seclusion.","As for Jiang Ni, she had been chosen as the Immortal King because of her unrivaled strength, setting a new benchmark for cultivators in the Ancient Realm.","But she didn’t involve herself in mundane affairs.","For example, Jiang Ni hadn’t interfered in the daily matters of the Ancient Court.","She had been hiding away in the Back Sea of the Nine Heavens, focusing on her cultivation.","Deep within the Nine Heavens was a vast purple sea of clouds.","This place was also known as the Back Sea.","Every Dao Lord of the Ancient Court had a cave dwelling here.","Jiang Ni was no exception.","After all, the Origin Source here was the densest.","It was the core of the entire Ancient Realm.","At the heart of the Back Sea stood a six-story pagoda.","On the top floor, where the wind blew from all directions, a carpet lay in the center.","At this moment, a peerless divine sword was lying flat on the carpet.","Next to the sword, a woman dressed in blue sat cross-legged.","Her eyes were closed, but a fierce killing intent emanated from her brow.","The aura of slaughter surrounding her made her appear extremely fierce, preventing anyone from daring to approach.","She was the strongest existence in the Ancient Court and even the Ancient Domain, “Jiang Ni.”","Her strength was at its peak.","With a single sword strike, she could split the world of the Ancient Domain.","This place was her exclusive cultivation ground, and no one would usually disturb her.","Unless the Ancient Domain itself was facing a life-or-death crisis.","At this moment, a young man dressed in black stood on the corridor of the pavilion, raising his eyes to gaze at Jiang Ni, who was sitting cross-legged in cultivation inside.","She hadn’t noticed him.","He didn’t rush to wake her either.","Instead, he used a strand of thought power to enter Jiang Ni’s sea of consciousness.","Whoosh!","“Oh, she’s already touched upon the truth of death!”","Jian Wushuang was somewhat surprised.","He saw that Jiang Ni was deep in cultivation, but he didn’t hurry and instead used his thought power to enter her sea of consciousness, curious to see how her cultivation had progressed.","To his surprise, he found that Jiang Ni’s thoughts were all focused on comprehending the truth of death.","This was the law of the Origin Source of death.","Though she hadn’t fully grasped it yet and had only touched upon the essence of death, it was a significant step.","She had entered the initial stage.","From this point onward, her comprehension would likely accelerate.","Earlier, Jian Wushuang had guessed that Jiang Ni would need millions of years. But now, it seemed that even without his guidance, she wouldn’t take that long—perhaps at most one hundred thousand years, and she could fully master the Origin Source of death.","“Death is the end of the physical body!”","“It is also the beginning of your transcendence over time!”","Jian Wushuang’s gentle words caused Jiang Ni’s entire body to tremble.","Her comprehension of the truth of death suddenly surged.","From touching upon it to entering the initial stage, and then rapidly advancing to the minor success stage, it all happened in one fluid motion.","“Impressive, truly impressive!” Jian Wushuang withdrew his thought power.","His true self clapped for Jiang Ni and said, “You haven’t slacked off all these years!”","Swish!","Jiang Ni instantly opened her eyes, staring at Jian Wushuang, who was leaning against the railing of the corridor. Her eyes immediately turned red.","It had been too long.","To her, the span of more than ten thousand years felt like an eternity.","It had consumed almost ninety-nine percent of her lifetime.","After all, she had only been born a little over ten thousand years ago.","She had spent the first few hundred years following Jian Wushuang, but the rest of that long time, she had ventured out on her own.","Not only was she searching for her trapped mother, but her thoughts were constantly with Jian Wushuang.","She had no information about her mother and had no choice but to temporarily give up that search.","But she had never given up on Jian Wushuang.","Back then, Jian Wushuang had turned the tide with his overwhelming power, casually suppressing even top Dao Lords.","There was no way he could have died at the hands of the Twin-Faced Buddha.","Even if the powerhouses from the Holy Land descended, Jian Wushuang should have been able to escape.","She had always believed this.","Until she learned the truth of the battle at Twin-Faced God Mountain, her certainty began to waver.","Because Jian Wushuang had never appeared at Twin-Faced God Mountain.","But Xiang Yang and Jiu Chen had died because of her.","And Jian Wushuang had vanished."]},{"number":6473,"title":"Chapter 6473: Farewell","paragraphs":["Chapter 6473: Farewell","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","She felt utterly powerless.","This feeling was even worse than when she had wandered the world alone.","At least back then, she always believed Jian Wushuang was still alive, probably trapped by the formation inside the Twin Gods Palace.","But as her status continued to rise.","Even when she became the ruler of the Ancient Domain, she still couldn’t find Jian Wushuang.","...","She had buried this matter deep in her heart.","At this moment, seeing Jian Wushuang standing before her once more, her gaze was filled with surprise, followed by an endless sense of grievance.","She wanted, just like a junior, to approach Jian Wushuang and complain.","Why did he leave her behind?","She also wanted to ask why Jian Wushuang hadn’t saved Immortal Jiu Chen and Xiang Yang back then.","But as the words reached her lips, she couldn’t say anything.","She just stood up, crossing the distance between them, and gently embraced Jian Wushuang, burying her head in his chest. The tears in the corners of her eyes fell heavily.","This time, it was Jian Wushuang who was at a loss.","He raised his hand, wanting to comfort her, but he didn’t know where to place it.","Only then did he realize that his earlier arrangements had not taken Jiang Ni’s feelings into full consideration.","Because Jiang Ni was truly young.","She had only lived for just over ten thousand years.","Back when he left her at the Twin Gods Palace, Jiang Ni had lived for only over a hundred years.","Ninety percent of that time was spent cultivating, with no contact with the outside world.","It could be said that before she left him, the most significant experience of Jiang Ni’s life had been the time she spent as an emperor in the mortal realm.","“I didn’t think this through!” Jian Wushuang comforted softly.","“All these years, you’ve suffered so much!”","Jiang Ni took a deep breath and released Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang reached out and wiped away her tears, speaking gently, “You’ve grown up; you’ve become a fine young lady!”","Then, the two sat down to chat.","Seeing how sentimental and loyal Jiang Ni was, Jian Wushuang didn’t want to deceive her. He briefly explained his thoughts from back then, using a clever way to let Jiang Ni understand his well-intentioned plans.","Of course, he also explained later that Immortal Jiu Chen and Xiang Yang had been saved, and it had nothing to do with him.","Jiang Ni, naturally, believed him completely.","When she asked why Jian Wushuang had left, Jian Wushuang sighed.","His gaze turned to the distant horizon.","“Uncle Wushuang, did you go to the Abyss back then?” Jiang Ni’s quick mind suddenly made the connection between Jian Wushuang’s sudden reappearance and the recent outbreak in the Abyss.","“How should I put this?” Jian Wushuang, with a solemn face, sighed, “The Abyss couldn’t be without me, just as the Ancient Domain couldn’t be without you!”","“......”","Jiang Ni’s eyes were filled with admiration.","She had always believed that Jian Wushuang’s strength was beyond that of a Dao Lord.","And now, after his triumphant return, her suspicions were confirmed.","Not only had Jian Wushuang come back, but his strength exceeded her imagination.","With just a word, he could elevate her death-origin power to the Small Perfection Stage.","Even the Abyss was something Jian Wushuang had single-handedly caused.","This was the uncle Wushuang she always remembered, the one whose depth was unfathomable.","“Too much has happened over the years. You’ve grown up and matured, and I’ve gone through my own share of experiences. This time, I’ve come to take you away!” Jian Wushuang shared his plan.","He intended to take Jiang Ni away from the Ancient Domain.","Of course, he wasn’t just taking Jiang Ni alone.","He also planned to take the entire Ancient Domain Star.","But explaining everything in detail would have been too complicated.","So he borrowed the matter of the Abyss and told her that he had learned from the Abyss that the Ancient Domain Star was a treasure.","It could be used as a domain-world flying boat.","It could travel across worlds in a day, and cross the universe in a century.","He would use the Ancient Domain Star to take Jiang Ni away from the Ancient Domain.","Upon hearing this, Jiang Ni wasn’t surprised; she simply said calmly, “No wonder a barrier suddenly appeared in the underground vault. So it was all your doing, Uncle Wushuang. Now I can rest easy!”","“A small matter!”","“Not worth mentioning, this Ancient Domain Star doesn’t have much going for it.”","Jian Wushuang’s face remained calm.","The usable resources of the Ancient Domain Star were indeed few.","But as a divine artifact, its future development potential was significant.","Still, it wasn’t something Jian Wushuang cared much about at the moment.","He had the leaves of the World Tree, the gray jar, countless microscopic universes. Once he became a Universe Master, by absorbing those microscopic universes, he could easily return to his peak.","Although Jian Wushuang was still unable to directly reach the level of a Universe God, with the Origin Source of his Micro Universe, he was able to wield divine power far stronger than ever before.","He had even surpassed the battle prowess of a Universe God.","These were the treasures that Jian Wushuang truly valued and could rely on.","The Ancient Domain Star was insignificant in comparison.","“Before I came, I had already dealt with the internal issues of the Ancient Domain Star. Now, Xiang Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen are still merging their Dao, and they should be done soon. It’s time for us to leave!”","Jian Wushuang turned his head, standing tall, gazing at the endless chaos.","“I see that you have some karmic connections with many here. Do you want to say a proper goodbye to them?”","Jiang Ni, who had been excited, finally calmed down. Only then did she remember the weight of the responsibilities she now bore.","However, with the hidden dangers of the Ancient Domain Star resolved by Jian Wushuang, there was nothing more for her to worry about.","“Uncle Wushuang, wait for me just a moment...”","After saying this, Jiang Ni’s figure flickered and disappeared from the pavilion.","She went to the Qishen Temple, where she found Elder Yuan Zheng and Lord Long.","At the same time, she also notified King Baiyue.","As for True Immortal Sancai, he had already perished.","Due to Black Prison, he had fallen in the dungeon.","“Jiang Ni, have you made a breakthrough?”","Elder Yuan Zheng was visibly excited. Jiang Ni rarely sought them out unless there was something important, and now she had gathered everyone together.","Jiang Ni shook her head and recounted everything that had happened in detail, without hiding much.","She explained that the time had come for those who were meant to leave, and she was taking the Ancient Domain Star away from the Ancient Domain World.","Upon hearing her explanation, the group found it hard to accept at first.","They immediately felt a sense of relief.","But there was also a sense of unwillingness.","Why should the countless treasures on the Ancient Domain Star be taken away?","These treasures belonged to the Ancient Domain Star!","And this was all according to Jiang Ni’s version of events. Who knew if Jiang Ni was trying to abandon them or if there was some hidden scheme?","Even though Lord Long didn’t harbor such suspicions, King Baiyue and Elder Yuan Zheng couldn’t help but feel uneasy.","But there was nothing they could do—Jiang Ni’s power was simply too overwhelming.","They didn’t have the strength to resist.","Seeing their expressions, Jiang Ni waved her hand and presented all the treasures she had collected, including those given by the Ancient Court.","“These things can serve as compensation.” Jiang Ni felt a bit guilty, but Jian Wushuang had already made it clear—he would be taking the Ancient Domain Star away.","Who could stop him?","Lord Long, looking into Jiang Ni’s clear eyes, sighed in relief and said, “There’s no need for this. The Ancient Domain Star never belonged to any single cultivator, nor to any one world’s cultivators. It belongs to the strong!”","“Take it away!”","“But promise me this: don’t forget that you are a powerful figure who once walked out from the Ancient Domain World!”"]},{"number":6474,"title":"Chapter 6474: The Battlefield Under the Abyss","paragraphs":["Chapter 6474: The Battlefield Under the Abyss","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jiang Ni felt a pang of sorrow upon hearing this.","In the end, the three of them decided to evacuate all the cultivators from the Ancient Domain Star within a day.","They would leave as well.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang sent a voice transmission to Jiang Ni, telling her not to let Lord Long and the others relocate.","Because what he wanted was the Ancient Domain Star itself, not the things on its surface.","...","And so, to everyone’s shock, Jian Wushuang manipulated the Ancient Domain Star, or rather, the underground vault beneath it, detaching it from the planet.","It was a black metallic sphere, half the diameter of the Ancient Domain Star.","It could be as large or as small as needed.","To conserve divine power within, Jian Wushuang reduced the Ancient Domain Star to a mere ten thousand miles in size.","“We should go!” Jian Wushuang beckoned.","Without hesitation, Jiang Ni leaped onto the Ancient Domain Star.","Looking back at the remains of the Ancient Domain Star, she noticed it only left behind a hole. It didn’t appear to have changed much from before.","“Don’t worry, I’ll give them immense compensation!” Jian Wushuang comforted her.","With a casual wave, a microcosm entered the deep pit left by the departing Ancient Domain Star.","This microcosm was enough to allow several Universe Masters to be born in the Ancient Domain.","But who would be able to control this ultimate, perfect microcosm remained unknown.","The entirely black Ancient Domain Star, its surface smooth and shimmering with black light, vanished in a flash as divine power pulsed through it.","Meanwhile, Lord Long and the others, who remained in the skies, were feeling somewhat downhearted.","Just as they were about to discuss the path forward, they felt a gift from the Origin Source of the universe beneath their feet.","“That’s...?”","...","In the Abyss.","The Ancient Domain Star had shrunk to the size of a speck of dust and descended into the Abyss.","The surrounding demonic creatures were entirely unaware of its arrival.","Using the Ancient Domain Star, Jian Wushuang ventured deep into the Abyss.","Whoosh!","Jian Wushuang appeared at the bottom of the Abyss.","The energy here was incredibly violent, forcing Jian Wushuang to reveal his true form.","“What is this place?”","“A battlefield!” A voice echoed in Jian Wushuang’s mind.","“Gagarin, do you recognize this place?” Jian Wushuang asked in surprise.","Gagarin’s consciousness was attached to him, so whatever Jian Wushuang saw, Gagarin could also see.","Despite only being a severed arm, Gagarin retained complete memories.","“Heh heh...” Gagarin sneered. “This is the battlefield I left behind when I shattered the Realm God Continent. If I’m not mistaken, the battlefield once hosted Universe Gods of the Divine Eye Clan, and quite a few of them at that.”","“So these corpses are Universe Gods?” Jian Wushuang tread upon the bones, but couldn’t sense any Universe God aura.","To him, they seemed like a pile of withered bones.","“More or less. Most of them were Universe Gods. In that battle, I split myself into countless forms and lingered on this battlefield for just a fleeting moment. But I remember clearly, I killed over a thousand Universe Gods here. Their deaths were like the collapse of suns—it was a magnificent sight!” Gagarin spoke with a tone of delight.","Jian Wushuang frowned. “I know you’re a villain, but do you really have to be so twisted?”","“You don’t understand. Those Universe Gods of the Divine Eye Clan were abandoned by the Starry Sky. The ones orchestrating everything were the old geezers of the Starry Sky. Honestly, they could have allowed the Divine Eye Clan to enter the Starry Sky, or had the Star Spirits guard the Realm God Continent. Perhaps the Star King feared Jormungandr, which is why the Star Spirits didn’t act directly. That’s why, when I entered the Realm God Continent, it was like a grand feast!”","“Do you see these withered bones?”","“The reason there’s no aura left is that it’s all been devoured!”","“All that’s left is useless temporal matter—just scorched earth, really!”","Jian Wushuang remained silent.","“A pitiful bunch, really. Neither their victory nor their defeat deserves pride or shame!”","“You’re not wrong,” Gagarin responded indifferently.","He knew that Jian Wushuang’s senior brother was that Ghost Eye, the clan leader of the Divine Eye Clan. Naturally, Jian Wushuang was aligned with them, so Gagarin’s words surely stung.","“Since this is a battlefield, there’s no need to explore further,” Jian Wushuang said, shaking his head. He waved his hand and unleashed a mortal flame, burning away the remaining bones.","It was a final gesture of closure.","But Gagarin continued, “Actually, there’s some useful information. If this battlefield is here, then the others can’t be far. Though I killed many from the Divine Eye Clan back then, I also imprisoned a few. They’re probably in some corner of the Ninefold Space-Time. You can search for them slowly. The Ancient Domain Star is quite fast. If you can find a demigod to control it, it’ll be even quicker. You could traverse the Ninefold Space-Time in no time!”","“A mere billion years,” Jian Wushuang replied calmly.","Whoosh!","He re-entered the Ancient Domain Star.","The Ancient Domain Star then shot out of the Abyss. As it flickered with light, it tore through space, entering the void.","It began flying at high speed.","Though its pace was nothing remarkable—certainly not comparable to that of a Universe Master.","Even the divine power of a Universe God’s Origin Source couldn’t fully sustain the Ancient Domain Star.","And without anyone to truly control it, its speed was only a fraction of its original capacity.","Yet for Jian Wushuang, it was fast enough.","Within a day, they arrived at the nearest “Golden Horn Divine Realm.”","This was a major world.","There were many Dao Lords.","The foundation of its Dao lineage had a history of over a hundred million years, and it had even produced a Universe Master.","As a result, its strength was immense, with over a thousand Dao Lords.","There was also a supreme expert.","Jian Wushuang simply let Hei Qiu take a glance before leaving immediately.","Their first destination was the secret universe realm.","Far from the Nash Universe lay the “Jormungandr Secret Realm.”","This secret realm existed between sixteen universes.","Its vast range was immeasurable.","The years of its existence were impossible to trace.","Even Hei Qiu didn’t know when this secret universe realm had appeared.","He only knew that within this secret realm, there were treasures that could drive even Universe Masters mad.","Because once, a semi-divine artifact had emerged from this secret universe realm.","A Universe Master of the Six Tribulations Realm, blessed with incredible luck, obtained it and rapidly rose in power, soon becoming a Universe God of the Nine Tribulations Realm.","It was only then that he revealed the existence of the treasure.","It wasn’t a semi-divine artifact—it was actually a divine artifact.","And not just any divine artifact, but a space treasure.","With this artifact, that Universe Master dominated the entire Nine Regions of Time and Space. Not long after, he felt he had no more purpose and went to cross the Universe Sea, leaving the Nine Regions of Time and Space.","Since then, no one had heard of him.","However, this legend made the Jormungandr Secret Realm a sacred land in the Seventh Time Space.","Countless Universe Masters ventured into this secret universe realm, one after another.","Even powerful experts from other time spaces also came to this place to seek adventure.","“How long will it take to reach the Jormungandr Secret Realm?”","“We will have to pass through over four hundred universes. A conservative estimate would be fifty thousand years!”"]},{"number":6475,"title":"Chapter 6475: Combat Strength Ranking","paragraphs":["Chapter 6475: Combat Strength Ranking","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After hearing Black Prisoner’s speculation, Jian Wushuang took a deep breath.","It was still due to the influence of the Ancient Domain Star.","If they had used the Domain World Flying Boat, it might have taken tens of millions of years to travel.","“Let’s take our time flying!”","Anyway, with a clear target in mind and the necessary strength, there was no rush.","...","As they passed through many universes, he would occasionally stop to purchase treasures.","Some items from the Dongtian Sect were useless to him, so he exchanged them for a substantial amount of divine crystals, which he used to buy items that were useful for himself in various universes.","For instance, he acquired a plan for cultivating the Gui Yun tree.","“Master, to pass the fourth Tribulation, the Origin Source power I need is roughly equivalent to a complete universe, and the divine power requirement is around thirty million.”","“This is the most conservative estimate. If you want to elevate my life level to reach the highest level of perfection, the amount of treasures required would be a hundred times more!”","Upon hearing this, Jian Wushuang rubbed his forehead.","By this time, the interior of the Ancient Domain Star no longer appeared desolate.","Instead, Jian Wushuang had transformed it into a sunny, bright paradise.","Looking at this paradise, Gagarin found it somewhat terrifying.","Having been born in the Land of Chaos, he couldn’t bear to see such orderly beauty.","Jian Wushuang, however, thoroughly enjoyed this place to the point that he hadn’t even entered the Nine Prison Pagoda.","Now, the Nine Prison Pagoda was placed inside the Ancient Domain Star because Jiang Ni frequently came and went. Jian Wushuang simply left the Nine Prison Pagoda there.","Anyone could enter or leave as they pleased.","“I only spent less than a billion divine crystals to create this paradise. Do you know how many strong warriors could have been nurtured with that? Yet for you to pass the fourth Tribulation, you’ll need over ten billion divine crystals!”","Jian Wushuang couldn’t help but shake his head.","With that amount of resources, it would be better to cultivate Xiang Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen.","He wanted those two to quickly rise to demi-god status.","The Gui Yun tree consumed too much.","It devoured more treasures than even Black Prisoner.","The key issue was that the improvement from ordinary Origin Sources in the universes was minimal.","The Gui Yun tree also followed the divine power route, requiring divine power treasures.","They passed through dozens of universes, spending thousands of years in total.","Despite exhausting his wealth, Jian Wushuang still couldn’t make the Gui Yun tree break through.","Worse yet, after breaking through, its strength hadn’t increased significantly.","According to Gui Yun’s explanation, upon reaching the seventh Tribulation level, there would be eighteen vines.","At the ninth Tribulation, there would be thirty-six vines.","However, with each Tribulation passed, every vine would become much stronger than before.","“Are you telling me that you can only have thirty-six vines?” Jian Wushuang asked curiously.","“Of course not!”","Gui Yun tree replied, “The theoretical limit of the ninth Tribulation is thirty-six vines, but it is possible to push beyond that. However, the cost would surpass the expenditure required for me to break through to Universe God!”","“The main issue is that in the entire Starry Sky, there are very few useful Gui Yun leaves that also carry Origin Source power. Besides you, master, there are only ten other people. Among them, four are Star Spirits, while of the remaining six, three are Starry Sky Gods, two are Time-Space Gods, and one is a Universe God.”","It made sense—life forms with a power level a million times greater than ordinary beings wouldn’t be accessible to just anyone.","Jian Wushuang then asked, “Have the three Star Spirits who nurtured the Gui Yun tree to that level managed to break through to the Starry Sky level?”","“No.”","Gui Yun shook its head and said, “According to the information recorded in my innate secret techniques, after reaching the Starry Sky level, one becomes their own Starry Sky domain. Currently, in the entire Starry Sky, aside from the Ancestral Tree, only a branch of the Ancestral Tree that was cultivated by the Great High Priest has achieved the Starry Sky level. However, that tree stands on its own and did not acknowledge any master, so it doesn’t count.”","“The Great High Priest!” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath. This individual was indeed a formidable figure.","He was likely a character on par with the most supreme existences.","His efforts must have drawn upon the power of the entire Starry Sky.","Originally, Jian Wushuang had entertained the fantasy that, once he recovered, he could also cultivate Gui Yun to the level of Universe God.","At that time, the Gui Yun tree was already able to threaten the Time God.","After hearing the Gui Yun tree’s response, Jian Wushuang no longer held such doubts.","“I’ll improve myself first!”","“If you can’t reach Universe God level, then I will slowly cultivate you to the limits of a Universe Master!” Jian Wushuang declared.","The Gui Yun tree, overjoyed, responded, “Thank you, Master! I will continue to comprehend the rules within the innate secret techniques and strive to quickly discover the method to increase the number of main vines!”","“Hmm,” Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and nodded.","Once it reached the peak of Universe Master, the Gui Yun tree might not be any weaker than a Seven-Star Universe God.","Who knew if the heavens contained a Seven-Star Universe God?","When he first entered, he had remained at his peak strength.","At that time, he hadn’t sensed any colossal beings, such as a Nine-Star Universe God.","However, after all these years of experience in this place, he suspected that the heavens might be hiding a super being from the God-Eye Clan.","Back then, some of those demonic creatures had battle power equivalent to a Seven-Star Universe God.","He couldn’t afford to be careless.","Until he mastered the Origin Source, or at least until he returned to his peak, his primary fighting force still relied on the Gui Yun tree.","Next came Hei Qiu.","Following them were Immortal Jiu Chen and Xiang Yang, both of whom could quickly become powerful demigods.","In terms of talent and potential growth, apart from the Gui Yun tree, it would likely be Jiang Ni.","However, Jiang Ni needed more time to grow.","Even after merging with the Dao, he would still need to cultivate the Origin Source he had fused with.","It was unlike Immortal Jiu Chen and Xiang Yang, who could directly absorb the Origin Source. After all, they had much more experience.","Their realms were also higher.","They could absorb the Origin Source directly to reach the absolute peak and then immediately control the universe without needing to undergo any Tribulation.","But Jiang Ni, a youngster who had lived only over ten thousand years, couldn’t be rushed like that.","It would waste his talent.","In truth, Jiang Ni’s cultivation speed was already quite decent. In just a few thousand years, he had raised the Death Origin Source to the Great Perfection stage.","Even with time acceleration, which amounted to tens of thousands of years, it exceeded Jian Wushuang’s expectations.","Now, Jiang Ni only needed to perfect the Origin Source before he could begin preparing for Dao fusion.","Speaking of Dao fusion, both Xiang Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen had remained inactive.","Jian Wushuang could sense that both had reached a critical moment.","Naturally, he wouldn’t disturb them.","So, he simply waited patiently, awaiting their success.","Time passed day by day.","The Ancient Star Domain finally approached the cosmic secret realm.","From afar, the secret realm appeared as an enormous void landmass, with eight divine mountains floating above it.","The divine mountains had no roots, suspended above the landmass.","Each divine mountain was surrounded by dozens of planets.","“How much longer until we arrive?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Hei Qiu immediately responded, “It will take ten more days. If the lord is in a hurry, I can teleport the Ancient Star Domain there instantly!”","“No need,” Jian Wushuang suddenly turned his gaze toward the Nine Prison Pagoda.","Two figures walked out of the Nine Prison Pagoda simultaneously.","It was Xiang Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen.","Both had successfully merged with the Dao at the same time and had already reached the Great Perfection stage.","“You two finally made it. I was beginning to think you’d fail!” Jian Wushuang chuckled wryly.","Xiang Yang, however, was brimming with excitement.","“Brother Wushuang, I’ve missed you so much all these years!”"]},{"number":6476,"title":"Chapter 6476: Go Back and Continue Practicing","paragraphs":["Chapter 6476: Go Back and Continue Practicing","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang was about to be pulled into a hug.","Quickly dodging, he remarked irritably, “Are you missing me or my Micro Universe?”","“Of course, it’s the Micro Universe!” Immortal Jiu Chen responded with his usual self-assured tone.","With a raised eyebrow and a proud expression, Jiu Chen declared, “Jian Wushuang, I now possess the strength of the Tribulation Realm. Didn’t you say before that you wanted our help to suppress the Divine Eye Clan?”","“How has your search been going these years?”","...","“Have you found someone for me to spar with?”","Jian Wushuang beckoned, and a figure flew out from the Nine Prison Pagoda.","“Here, try your hand against him!”","Jiu Chen, however, sneered dismissively, “Him? He’s not worthy!”","The figure hadn’t even reacted before being greeted by Jiu Chen’s cold mockery.","It was only then that the figure realized Jiu Chen had also reached the pinnacle realm.","Moreover, his mastery of the Divine Eye Technique had advanced to the third stage.","With the Origin Source and the third stage of the Divine Eye Technique at his disposal, Jiu Chen gathered his strength, and his divine power soared to a hundred thousand times.","“Wow, you’ve definitely gotten stronger!” Jian Wushuang remarked.","In an instant, a blood-red vine shot out from Jian Wushuang’s arm, hurtling toward Jiu Chen’s massive divine body.","Just one vine carried a force of a million divine power.","In a single exchange, Jiu Chen’s divine power was reduced to zero, and his divine body shattered.","Yet, in the next moment, something miraculous happened.","The vine actually returned a hundred thousand times the divine power back to Jiu Chen, along with his fully restored divine body.","“This...???” Jiu Chen was filled with shock.","But all he got was mockery from Xiang Yang.","“With your limited strength, don’t embarrass yourself in front of Brother Wushuang.”","“You’d better focus on breaking through to the Tribulation Realm!” Xiang Yang sneered.","He was well aware of Jian Wushuang’s abilities.","Back when Jian Wushuang was still a mortal, he had prepared many contingency plans.","Now, after tens of thousands of years and becoming a cultivator, Jian Wushuang had certainly prepared even more trump cards.","After all, he was a Universe God.","Even the Great Realm God Jiu You had perished long ago and was still planning his resurrection.","Let alone someone like Jian Wushuang, who hadn’t fallen at all.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang had been even more powerful when he was a Universe God.","There was no one as strong as him in the entire Ancient God Realm.","Perhaps only in the core of the Burial God Grounds were there Universe Gods stronger than seven stars.","“You’re still far from strong enough to be of any help to me right now. If you’re itching for a fight, feel free to spar with me!” Jian Wushuang retracted the vine and continued, “By the way, Xiang Yang, are you encountering any bottlenecks in becoming a Universe Master?”","“No,” Xiang Yang shook his head.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang pulled out a grey jar. In front of everyone, he took a speck of dust from it.","A Micro Universe!","Buzz!","The powerful aura of Origin Source shook everyone to their core.","“This is a perfectly refined ultimate universe. Carefully refine it. Once you’ve mastered it, you could leap straight to the Five Tribulation Realm. After that, you’ll need to continuously harness the internal power until you’ve fully mastered it. At that point, your divine power could rival that of a Universe God!”","Jiu Chen’s eyes widened as he listened to Jian Wushuang’s explanation.","“Rival a Universe God?”","It was something he hadn’t even dared to dream of!","And yet, Jian Wushuang had spoken of it so casually.","“Yes, that’s about right. This universe can unleash close to a billion divine power at its peak,” Jian Wushuang said calmly.","Xiang Yang, however, was overjoyed, completely unsurprised.","Jian Wushuang had explained this to him long ago.","What made him happiest was that he was about to return to his peak.","And not just return—he would surpass it.","Entering this world had been his greatest fortune.","It allowed him to touch the power of a Universe God faster than he ever thought possible.","A billion divine power!","That was already on par with a standard Universe God.","Outside, he was merely a half-god, and not even one of the strongest.","Yet, in just a few tens of thousands of years, he had grown to this extent.","It truly was an enormous opportunity.","Beyond that, his greatest gain had been his connection with Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang had formed a life-and-death bond with him.","Once he left this place and returned to the Realm God Continent, he would have a Universe God as his backing.","Moreover, it was a Seven-Star Universe God.","After going back, wouldn’t he be able to walk with his head held high?","Would he still need to care about his family’s opinion?","Obviously not.","But he was still unaware that his family was already gone.","“Train well. With your level and experience, I believe you’ll soon master this Universe!” Jian Wushuang patted Xiang Yang’s shoulder. Then, he looked at Immortal Jiu Chen and said, “You have the experience, but your level isn’t sufficient yet. First, break through to the Tribulation realm, and then I’ll give you a microcosmic universe!”","“The Master of Divine Fire took a microcosmic universe and left the mortal realm. The next time you meet, he’ll probably be shocked!”","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang mention the Master of Divine Fire, a spark of battle intent flashed in Immortal Jiu Chen’s eyes.","He couldn’t wait to compare who had improved faster, him or the former Creator!","Xiang Yang and Immortal Jiu Chen exchanged glances. The two, who had just left their seclusion, turned back and entered the Nine Prison Pagoda again.","At that moment, Jiang Ni had just walked out of the Nine Prison Pagoda, only to bump into the two of them.","Before she could say anything, she saw them both reenter the Nine Prison Pagoda.","“What’s going on?” Jiang Ni asked, puzzled. “Didn’t they just successfully merge with the Dao? Why are they going back in?”","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly and replied, “Maybe their realm isn’t stable yet.”","“But their auras are so powerful, almost as strong as mine!” Jiang Ni exclaimed in surprise.","“You’re still only a Dao Lord, but they are already at the peak!” Jian Wushuang smiled. “But don’t underestimate them. Their future fortunes will be significant. As the younger generation, you must keep up with their pace and strive to merge with the Dao soon!”","“Yes, I will!” Jiang Ni nodded, then added, “Uncle Wushuang, my Death Path has reached the peak of perfection, and I’m just one step away from complete mastery!”","Jian Wushuang: “......”","Jiang Ni’s cultivation speed was too fast.","Step by step, she had surpassed Jian Wushuang’s expectations.","Originally, he thought it would take her tens of millions of years, but with his guidance, the time had shortened considerably.","Still, he hadn’t expected it to shorten this much!","In just a few thousand years, Jiang Ni’s Death Path was now only one step away from perfection.","It seemed she wasn’t far from the verge of merging with the Dao.","“Tell me about your dilemma!”","Jian Wushuang began guiding Jiang Ni through the difficulties she faced on the Death Path.","They continued their discussion until the ancient star arrived at the Eighth Mountain of the Universe Secret Realm.","“Master, we’ve arrived!” Hei Qiu’s respectful voice echoed.","Jian Wushuang sent the meditating Jiang Ni into the Nine Prison Pagoda and then turned to gaze through the sky at the Eighth Mountain within the Universe Secret Realm.","This mountain was a divine peak, surrounded by forests and oceans.","The aura of Origin Source was extremely rich, no less than the core of the Universe’s Origin Source. Even the nearby stars radiated extraordinary brilliance!","“Hei Qiu, search the void in this area!” Jian Wushuang ordered.","Although his thought power could cover a vast area, its penetration was lacking.","It still couldn’t compare to Hei Qiu, a Void Cultivator."]},{"number":6477,"title":"Chapter 6477: One Man and One Egg Entering the Eighth Mountain","paragraphs":["Chapter 6477: One Man and One Egg Entering the Eighth Mountain","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Master, don’t worry. As long as the God Eye Clan leaves even a single hair, I can sniff it out!” Hei Qiu said confidently.","Jian Wushuang sighed inwardly, wanting to tell Hei Qiu that the God Eye Clan didn’t have hair!","...","On the surface of the divine mountain, there were numerous powerful auras, including one that belonged to an absolute pinnacle Universe Master.","This was, after all, a universe-level secret realm, so it wasn’t surprising for a Universe Master to appear.","...","However, this particular one’s strength wasn’t very high, being only at the level of a Universe Master who had undergone five Tribulations.","Hei Qiu entered the Starry Sky and began to investigate both inside and outside the divine mountain.","At first, it was easy, but soon it became a bit difficult.","“What’s wrong?” Jian Wushuang noticed his strained expression, as if he was under some kind of pressure.","Hei Qiu took a deep breath and said slowly, “Master, it seems this divine mountain... already has an owner!”","“Hmm?” Jian Wushuang frowned.","This was something he hadn’t anticipated. He immediately used his Thought Power to probe the area again. On the surface of the divine mountain, he only detected the presence of the Universe Master who had undergone five Tribulations, and there were no signs of any stronger beings.","Hei Qiu had almost recovered to his peak by now.","Even if that Universe Master had taken control of the divine mountain, it shouldn’t have put so much pressure on Hei Qiu!","“Impossible. There’s only one Universe Master on the divine mountain, and no other strong auras. Moreover, that Universe Master is quite weak...”","Jian Wushuang stopped mid-sentence, suddenly sensing that something was wrong.","There was something off about that five-Tribulation Universe Master.","“It seems there really is something unusual about this place!” Jian Wushuang smirked slightly.","He wasn’t afraid of there being problems—what he feared was there being none.","If this place were as lifeless as still water, it would have been a wasted trip.","The connections between these divine mountains had made Jian Wushuang realize something.","“Hei Qiu, doesn’t this universe-level secret realm resemble a large formation?” Jian Wushuang asked.","Hei Qiu was stunned for a moment, surprised. “How could that be? A universe-level secret realm as a formation? Such a grand scale would require at least a Universe God or a demigod to accomplish!”","“You’re right. It’s very likely that a Universe God was involved.”","“What?” Hei Qiu’s eyes widened in shock.","Jian Wushuang remained calm. He took Hei Qiu and appeared above the ocean surrounding the divine mountain, absorbing the Ancient Star into his body.","A black battle armor also appeared on his body.","Though his physical body was incredibly powerful, it wouldn’t withstand an attack from a Universe God!","A Universe God’s assault had to be faced with divine power.","Even the most powerful physical body would be shattered in an instant.","Although the density of the realm beast’s body was high enough that it wouldn’t be easily destroyed by a Universe God, Jian Wushuang himself couldn’t endure it.","If he solely relied on his physical body and ended up being killed by a single strike, where would he find justice?","To be cautious, he let Gui Yun envelop his body with the magic cloud tree.","“Let’s go take a look!”","With Hei Qiu in tow, Jian Wushuang flew towards the peculiar Universe Master.","The reason that Universe Master seemed strange was that he resembled a cultivator who had undergone the sacrificial ritual.","One man, one beast, flying at lightning speed.","The place where the Universe Master was hiding turned out to be a desolate island.","They were already very close now.","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang’s expression shifted, and he shouted, “Full speed ahead! He’s trying to escape!”","“Yes!” Hei Qiu immediately accelerated, leaving Jian Wushuang behind in an instant.","This was something that always frustrated Jian Wushuang.","His speed was too slow. Even with the help of the magic cloud tree, his flight was still sluggish.","Chasing down a five-Tribulation Universe Master was becoming a hassle.","“Gui Yun, you go after him too!”","“But what about you, Master?” Gui Yun asked with concern.","“I’ll enter the Ancient Star. You don’t need to worry about me!”","Jian Wushuang was still uneasy about leaving Hei Qiu to handle it alone.","The fact that the Universe Master tried to escape before they even met meant there was definitely something wrong.","As long as they caught him, they could figure out what was happening inside the divine mountain.","Jian Wushuang followed from behind, activating the fastest speed of the Ancient Star.","He shot up into the sky.","“You can’t escape!” Hei Qiu, who was in front, warned, “You’d better stop now, or when I catch you, you’ll regret not stopping sooner!”","Jian Wushuang’s True Immortal Presence","Hei Qiu wasn’t threatening the other party. He truly knew how to torment people.","After being tortured for so many years by True God Jiu You, his rage had nowhere to go.","If he caught this Universe Master at the Fifth Tribulation level, he would surely make the other feel despair. He had the ability, the strength, and the patience to do so. After being trapped for so long, it was only natural for his personality to have changed.","Hei Qiu merged with the void, his speed skyrocketing a hundredfold.","The Universe Master at the Fifth Tribulation level, for reasons unknown, used some treasure that allowed him to move as fast as a demi-god. For a moment, Hei Qiu couldn’t catch up to him.","Jian Wushuang, observing everything from behind, reminded him, “Hei Qiu, seal the space and slow him down. I’ll chase him!”","With that, he revealed himself once again. Ignoring the Ancient Star altogether, he directly unleashed the Gui Yun Tree.","Nine thick vines shot out in an instant.","Hei Qiu, without any objections, followed the command and sealed the void. The space, along with everything around it, froze.","For a moment, everything in the surroundings slowed down. Even Hei Qiu’s movements became sluggish. Jian Wushuang felt it too.","But the Gui Yun Tree was different. It was tied to the Starry Sky.","Back when the Starry Sky was first created, it was because this tree had been there. Though it sounded exaggerated, the Gui Yun Tree was the most powerful life form in the Starry Sky, fully deserving of its reputation.","Otherwise, why hadn’t other places been created in a similar manner? Was it because the Realm Kings lacked power?","Obviously not.","There must be some hidden secret within the Gui Yun Tree, something unknown to the world.","Using the Gui Yun Tree, Jian Wushuang bypassed the spatial restrictions and instantly caught the Universe Master at the Fifth Tribulation level.","“Now, you have nowhere to run!” Jian Wushuang sneered coldly.","At that moment, Hei Qiu also caught up, his tone strange as he said, “Little one, you’re finished...”","He wasn’t trying to intimidate the other party.","Jian Wushuang casually tossed the Universe Master at the Fifth Tribulation level into the Ancient Star, then glanced up at the sacred mountain, not noticing anything unusual.","“Let’s head into the Ancient Star. I have a feeling something’s off with the sacred mountain. We’ll leave after we’ve had a look!”","“Don’t worry, Master. With me here, the sacred mountain won’t pose any threat to us!”","But as soon as the words left his mouth, the sacred mountain began to tremble.","“Hm?”","Jian Wushuang’s thought power suddenly detected a terrifying presence. The entity’s thought power was no weaker than his own and was at least at the level of a Universe God.","That being was stirring, as if it was about to break free.","Jian Wushuang’s expression turned grim. He hadn’t even questioned anyone yet, and already he’d stirred up the presence behind the scene.","“He seems to be bound!” Hei Qiu exclaimed in surprise, “Luckily, he can’t get out. That aura feels much stronger than even True God Jiu You.”","...","“Let’s go!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t dare to linger. While his thought power was indeed formidable, reaching the deepest layers of the universe, his strength had yet to reach the level of a Universe God. If the entity within the sacred mountain was truly a Universe God with full power, escaping might prove exceedingly difficult."]},{"number":6478,"title":"Chapter 6478: Cao Wusheng","paragraphs":["Chapter 6478: Cao Wusheng","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","They boarded the Ancient Star, directly traversing through the void.","After leaving the Divine Mountain, they traveled deep into the secret realm of the universe, walking a long distance before finally exhaling in relief.","“Bring that guy up!”","Jian Wushuang sat at the top of the hall, sipping a cup of tea.","His thought power focused directly on the Universe Master, whose gaze was vacant.","...","Suddenly, Jian Wushuang spat out the tea in surprise.","“Careful, he’s the incarnation of a Universe God!”","No sooner had he spoken than vines extended from his side, one pulling Black Prison away, while another attempted to restrain the figure.","Boom!","The shadowy figure suddenly erupted with power.","Its strength surged, approaching the limits of a Universe God.","However, it never surpassed that boundary.","The explosion of power was merely raw force without any actual attacks.","Soon, the force began to diminish.","Jian Wushuang calmed down and released Black Prison.","Using the Gui Yun Vine to restrain the figure, he noticed the opponent’s power was gradually weakening.","“Hmm?”","At that moment, the Ancient Star was flying at an extreme speed, rapidly leaving the Giant Serpent’s secret realm.","Soon, the eight Divine Mountains encircling the secret realm were barely visible.","The restrained figure’s power continued to decline.","Just as Jian Wushuang had predicted, the further they moved away, the weaker the opponent became.","The sudden burst of power earlier had merely been a desperate struggle.","Unfortunately for the figure, they were inside the Ancient Star.","Here, with its powerful restrictions, Jian Wushuang could suppress the figure without much effort.","With the added strength of the nine vines from Gui Yun, each with the power to surpass ten million units, he could easily suppress the figure.","In just the time it took for a stick of incense to burn, the opponent’s strength had reached its limit—barely at the Tribulation level.","That should be his bottom line, Jian Wushuang thought as he loosened the restraints.","Only then did Black Prison dare to take a deep breath.","“Hmph, a mere Tribulation-level being dares to lay a hand on my master! Let me finish him off!” Black Prison growled, stepping forward to exert more force.","Jian Wushuang rubbed his forehead lazily. “Enough. Let him stand up and speak on his own.”","Black Prison stepped aside reluctantly.","The vines retracted completely.","On the ground, a middle-aged man, curled up, slowly got to his feet.","His eyes looked no different from those of a human.","“Who are you people? Why have you imprisoned me?”","Jian Wushuang raised his hand and retrieved a small tower. “Do you recognize this?”","He wasn’t in the mood for idle talk.","The Nine Prison Pagoda had already issued a warning.","The man was from the Divine Eye Clan. Although his appearance didn’t quite match, he possessed their power.","That alone made him worth subduing.","“This is...?”","The middle-aged man, pale and haggard, froze when he saw the Nine Prison Pagoda. As soon as he felt the power emanating from it, his entire demeanor changed.","That power invoked a deep disgust within him.","It was a force meant to suppress his very nature.","“Still not talking?” Jian Wushuang frowned slightly.","He had been more than transparent.","He revealed his trump card right at the start.","Yet, the man acted as if he didn’t understand.","It seemed Jian Wushuang would need to apply some pressure after all.","“Black Prison, give him a hint!”","“Yes!”","A wicked grin spread across Black Prison’s chubby face as he slowly approached the man.","In his hand appeared a small black wooden rod.","It was a rare treasure, born from the universe itself.","Against a Tribulation-level opponent, it was more than enough. The main goal was to get the man to say what Jian Wushuang wanted to hear.","“Sir, wait...!”","“I can sense that you mean me no harm. But I should warn you—it’s best to discard that treasure in your hand!”","“Oh? And why is that?” Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow.","“You must know who I am?”","“I do.”","Jian Wushuang nodded.","The man breathed a small sigh of relief.","“The item you’re holding... did you obtain it from the Starry Sky?”","“You know about the Starry Sky?” Jian Wushuang’s eyes brightened.","The other party wasn’t just a bumpkin—he was very likely a powerful survivor of the God Eye Clan from before the Great Cataclysm.","And he knew a lot.","He might even know more about the other powerful members of the God Eye Clan.","For example, what exactly was hidden within the great formation inside the secret realm of the giant serpent?","“Of course, I know the Starry Sky! It was once my home!”","“You know the Starry Sky, so you must be from there too!”","Yet, he couldn’t discern Jian Wushuang’s aura.","It was formless, without shape or color.","On the outside, Jian Wushuang merely looked like an ordinary but quite handsome mortal.","Jian Wushuang toyed with the teacup in his hand and said, “What’s your name?”","“Cao Wusheng!”","“And yours?”","“Jian Wushuang!”","The two nodded in acknowledgment, studying each other.","As for what they were thinking deep down, it remained unclear.","Jian Wushuang snapped his fingers, and both of them were instantly transported to a pavilion at the top of the mountain.","They sat across from each other.","“I’ll be straightforward with you. I brought you here to find out what’s hidden beneath the Sacred Mountain and... about your God Eye Clan!”","After all, Cao Wusheng was in his hands and could be thrown into the Nine Prison Pagoda at any moment. He could even open higher levels of the pagoda.","Moreover, Jian Wushuang had a premonition. If he could capture the God Eye Clan expert beneath the Sacred Mountain, he might be able to pass through the pagoda and unlock the ninth level.","At that point, it wouldn’t just be about mastering the Origin Source of kings; he could even explore higher levels of the Origin Source.","So, this time, he decided to try a different approach.","Instead of rushing, he wanted to chat with the other party first.","Upon hearing Jian Wushuang’s words, Cao Wusheng widened his eyes, then let out a cold laugh.","“Haha, young man, you’re too arrogant!”","“Though I can’t discern your identity, I can tell for sure that you’re just a mere mortal. You only managed to capture me thanks to that plant life and this egg!”","“And I? I’m but a weakling among the many powerful God Eye Clan members. With just you, you think you can take on the entire God Eye Clan?”","“Why don’t you try becoming a Universe God first!”","A Universe God?","Indeed, he wasn’t a Universe God yet.","Even if he restored all his combat strength, he wouldn’t be a Universe God.","He was merely a Universe Master of the Nine Tribulations Realm, who had stumbled upon a bit of fortune, allowing him to wield the combat power of a Nine-Star Universe God.","Dealing with the peak members of the God Eye Clan would certainly be troublesome.","“A dying clan. I’m not concerned!” Jian Wushuang, for once, allowed himself to be a little arrogant.","From his current perspective, the God Eye Clan was nothing more than a half-dead race.","If it weren’t for Weiss throwing that Ten-Thousand-Willow into the mix, these God Eye Clan members would never have revived.","Jian Wushuang’s audacity left Cao Wusheng momentarily stunned, a mocking smile tugging at his lips. “Young man, I’m truly curious. Where do you come from?”","“The power of the God Eye Clan is beyond your imagination. You may kill me, but don’t even think about anything else!”","“How decisive!”","Jian Wushuang nodded slightly.","He had hoped the other party would voluntarily reveal some useful information.","But now it seemed like it was time for him to go inside.","Once he was in, he could reunite with some of his fellow clan members.","Swoosh!","The Nine Prison Pagoda appeared, descending directly upon Cao Wusheng.","Buzz!","A powerful force instantly sucked him in.","Jian Wushuang followed him inside.","This time, the fourth level of the pagoda could be opened.","Huh?","Wait a minute!","He still hadn’t fully understood Cao Wusheng’s strength."]},{"number":6479,"title":"Chapter 6479: Totem","paragraphs":["Chapter 6479: Totem","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang could only unlock the fourth level now with his current weakest form. But what if he were at his peak, with nearly a billion in combat power?","“Stop!” he commanded with a thought, summoning Cao Wusheng once again.","“Stop probing. I won’t tell you anything, no matter your purpose in targeting our God Eye Clan. Let me warn you, the God Eye Clan is far more powerful than you imagine. You carry an artifact meant to harm us, and one day, it will lead to your death!”","Jian Wushuang wasn’t fazed by the threat. Pretending to be enraged, he snapped, “It seems you won’t cry until you see the coffin. I gave you a chance, but since you care so little, you’ll die by my hand!”","With that, he attacked, using nothing but his physical strength. He didn’t even need Gui Yun Vine to utterly overpower his opponent.","...","“So, this is the God Eye Clan?”","“A mere Tribulation-level warrior, easily trampled by mortals!”","“Is this really all the strength your God Eye Clan possesses?”","Jian Wushuang mocked Cao Wusheng with the simplest words, trying to provoke him into unleashing his full power. At the same time, he edged closer to the Giant Serpent Secret Realm.","Cao Wusheng wiped the blood from the corner of his mouth and laughed. “I won’t lower myself to fight you, but you, a mere mortal, won’t defeat me either!”","Then, his strength surged to the level of a Universe Master. And soon, he broke through to the Seventh Tribulation Realm, unleashing millions of divine power that shattered Jian Wushuang’s body. Luckily, Jian Wushuang’s physical form was strong enough; otherwise, he would’ve been killed by the assault.","Despite the pain, he felt elated inside.","Go crazy! The crazier you get, the greater the reward will be.","Cao Wusheng’s power quickly reached the level of a Universe God, so much that even the Ancient Domain Star couldn’t suppress him anymore.","“Huh?” Cao Wusheng was puzzled. He clearly felt that he had moved far away from the Eighth Mountain, yet he could still unleash such tremendous power.","“Something’s wrong with him!”","But he realized it too late.","Jian Wushuang laughed heartily. “Thanks!”","“Nine Prison Pagoda!”","“Suppress!”","Buzz!","With the aid of Gui Yun Vine’s binding and the suppression of the Nine Prison Pagoda, Cao Wusheng, who was in his peak state, was sealed beneath the pagoda.","“Excellent! This is practically equivalent to suppressing a Universe God-level warrior from the God Eye Clan!” Jian Wushuang’s face lit up with excitement.","Earlier, when he suppressed a supreme warrior, he had unlocked the third level of the pagoda using the third transformation of the God Eye secret technique. What about this time?","With Cao Wusheng’s divine power nearing one billion, how many levels of the Nine Prison Pagoda could he unlock?","Based on his previous observations, Cao Wusheng had likely mastered the sixth transformation. This would be enough for Jian Wushuang to comprehend the Origin Source of the Realm Beast King.","Whether or not he could control it depended on his own abilities.","“Let’s go inside and see.”","He tapped his fingers together and ordered, “Hei Qiu, guide the Ancient Domain Star to a remote place far from the Giant Serpent Secret Realm.”","“Yes, Master!” Hei Qiu nodded immediately.","After making all the arrangements, Jian Wushuang entered the Nine Prison Pagoda.","Ding!","The sound of three consecutive chimes echoed within the tower as beams of light shot upward, finally stopping at the sixth level.","“As expected, with Cao Wusheng’s Universe God-level combat power and mastery of the sixth transformation, this is normal.”","According to his usual practice, Jian Wushuang didn’t immediately go to the sixth level to meet Cao Wusheng. He wanted to maintain an air of mystery and leave Cao Wusheng curious.","More importantly, he needed to study the secret technique.","The fourth level.","A river suddenly flowed through the desolate landscape. It was a river of time. Though weak, it was countless times stronger than the universe on the third level.","“Gather!”","With a single hand gesture, a metal plate appeared in Jian Wushuang’s hand. The patterns on this plate looked similar to the third one he had studied, but as he focused, he felt a dizzying sensation. The profound mysteries it held made his mental energy swell instantly.","Thankfully, both his soul power and thought power were at the level of a supreme expert. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been able to endure it.","He studied the plate carefully. It felt as though he had walked through countless years along the river of time, though it all seemed to pass in an instant.","“Whew!”","Jian Wushuang opened his eyes again, suddenly feeling an urge to draw his sword. He looked down at his hands—there was no sword!","Buzz!","Yet his thought power automatically formed sword energy, shooting out from the center of his brow.","“The first image seemed like a newborn infant, the second changed the soul, and the third altered power, annihilating everything and rebirthing an unruly Origin Source.”","“As for the fourth image... it feels like...”","It seemed to be something that transcended time and space, just like this realm itself.","Jian Wushuang hadn’t fully comprehended it yet.","Could chaos itself contain the concept of time?","His eyes narrowed. If that were true, it meant creating something from nothing was possible. But fully understanding this would take an enormous amount of time.","Though Jian Wushuang didn’t care much about time, he wasn’t alone. And he longed to leave this world and return to the Realm God Continent, where his brothers, friends, and his mission awaited.","“Let’s see if Gagarin can speed this up for me!”","His current pace was too slow. Only beings like Realm Beasts, who defied the laws of nature, could speed things up as absurdly as needed.","With a thought, Jian Wushuang moved Gagarin to the river of time.","After arriving at this place, Jormungandr transformed into an evil arm, scooping up invisible water from the long river of time and space, playing with it for a moment.","“In such a narrow river of time and space, countless moments are hidden. It seems the one who created this place is already invincible among the Realm Gods of time and space!”","Hearing Jormungandr’s speculation, Jian Wushuang asked in surprise, “Invincible among the Realm Gods of time and space? How do they compare to you?”","“I am no match for them at the level of the Realm Gods,” Jormungandr replied honestly.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t too surprised.","The Nine Prison Pagoda was a supreme treasure meant to suppress the Divine Eye Clan, so naturally, it was extraordinary.","Not to mention a Realm God, even a Star God could be involved.","“Jian Wushuang, you didn’t transport me here out of the goodness of your heart to help me regain my strength, did you?” Jormungandr sneered. He had always felt that Jian Wushuang harbored some ill intent toward him.","Although the two of them were becoming more alike, Jormungandr still maintained a sense of vigilance toward Jian Wushuang.","Jian Wushuang, however, got straight to the point. “I brought you here to ask for a small favor.”","“A favor from me?” Jormungandr was taken aback before exclaiming, “You don’t want to devour me, do you?”","“You’re overthinking it. I just need you to accelerate time for me, as slowly as possible without interfering with my thought power.”","Jormungandr finally let out a sigh of relief and nodded. “Fine!”","“But you have to agree to one condition. I can sense that the sixth level is open. When the time comes, can you let me enter the sixth level to comprehend it?”","“Agreed!” Jian Wushuang readily agreed.","Buzz!","The entire river of time and space began to collapse and condense.","It eventually turned into a thatched hut.","This was formed from the river of time and space.","In other words, the entire river had transformed into a small thatched hut.","The flow of time within it was beyond imagination.","“It’s been slowed down by a billion times!”","Jian Wushuang was shocked in his heart!","It had to be a Realm Beast.","Indeed, such creatures were terrifyingly powerful.","He took a deep breath, calming his mind.","The first time he had comprehended the fourth metal plate, it had taken him a hundred years.","This time, he wouldn’t care about the time, only the result.","He would not come out until he succeeded."]},{"number":6480,"title":"Chapter 6480: Boundary","paragraphs":["Chapter 6480: Boundary","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang sneered coldly, saying, “You’re underestimating Ghost Eye too much. He already prepared a backup plan for me, but I need your help!”","“Tell me!”","“Take me away and put mJian Wushuang specifically asked Gagarin to help relay a message.","He informed Xiang Yang and the others.","At the same time, he condensed his future guidance for Jiang Ni into a jade slip.","...","It was enough to guide Jiang Ni to reach the level of a demigod.","After finishing all this, he immersed himself in comprehending the blueprint.","This was the fourth metal plate.","It corresponded to the Origin Source of a top-tier Realm Beast.","According to Senior Brother Ghost Eye’s consciousness, this was the level he had reached.","The Origin Source of a top-tier Realm Beast!","He wasn’t sure exactly how powerful each reference point was.","But it was close to the Star Spirit.","Above that would be the Origin Source of a peak Realm Beast, perhaps not as powerful as the High Priest.","However, it could certainly suppress the Star Spirit.","Lastly, there was the Origin Source of the King of the Realm Beasts, a power at the level of a God King.","The Origin Source of the World Tree could also reach this level, but its power was limited.","There were records of this in the Gui Yun Vine’s inheritance.","The larger a divine body’s power, the more limited it would be.","For instance, a single leaf of the World Tree could represent an entire space-time continuum.","A single World Tree could span an entire Starry Sky.","The internal world was massive.","All of its power came from the World Tree.","Such a colossal divine body was cumbersome to move.","Thus, it was limited.","However, the Realm Beasts did not face this issue.","In fact, many Realm Beasts didn’t even bother developing an internal world.","They found it troublesome.","Their own power wasn’t enough, yet they would still divide it further.","It was indeed wasteful and troublesome to maintain.","Jian Wushuang, however, enjoyed nurturing his internal world.","Especially in terms of the flow of time.","This was quite similar to the fourth blueprint.","It required constructing a stable flow of time.","For instance, how to establish the unit of a “year.”","Of course, he was still contemplating the issue of hours.","He was stuck at this step.","One day consisted of twelve hours.","How could it be stabilized without being off by even a fraction of a second?","Jian Wushuang spent ten thousand years studying this problem.","In the outside world, it was only a fleeting moment.","After all, with a time acceleration of a hundred million times,","Ten thousand years had passed.","After several experiments, he finally constructed a stable time system.","Jian Wushuang created the first unit of time. He chose the word “hour,” taking the “shi” from “shichen” (the Chinese term for time periods), and because an hour was half of a shichen. Originally, there were twelve shichen in a day, but now a day consisted of twenty-four hours. This change made Jian Wushuang think of the twenty-four solar terms, and how that number corresponded to many other things.","With this basic direction in mind, he began to develop more units of time. At first, he wanted to create larger units, but he realized that the bigger they were, the more unwieldy they became. It was better to work with smaller, stable units. So, he created the “minute,” deriving it from “shifen.” One hour became sixty minutes—no more, no less. This unit was stable, but Jian Wushuang still wasn’t satisfied. The numbers felt too small.","His diagrams were incredibly complex, and their mysteries could be divided infinitely. Sixty units felt inadequate. Time passed quickly. For millions of years, Jian Wushuang developed the concept of the hour. He refined it from minutes to seconds. Each minute was divided into sixty seconds, and each second was then divided into a hundred milliseconds. He continued dividing until one hour was split into billions of parts, finally feeling content.","Then he began to count—starting with the smallest unit. One second required millions of calculations, testing the limits of his thought power. His mind had to keep up. One second, ten seconds, one minute, ten minutes.","“One hour, time’s up!” he said aloud.","Though only half a shichen had passed, Jian Wushuang felt as if he had lived through countless eons. This was the allure of time. Understanding it filled him with an overwhelming sense of wonder.","“Now, let’s develop larger units of time,” he said to himself.","A day consisted of twenty-four hours. This unit was too small for his purposes. Inside him, stars revolved in endless cycles. One “small cycle” took five days, and a “great cycle” took seven. This unit of time was more stable.","He mapped it out: one hour, one day, one week. One year, one sixty-year cycle, one epoch. One reincarnation cycle.","What was beyond reincarnation? Jian Wushuang wondered silently.","How many years had he lived? He could no longer remember. He had leaped from realm to realm.","“The largest unit of time... let’s call it a ‘realm,'” he decided.","Though it seemed like a spatial unit, it also contained time within it. Time and space became one. Jian Wushuang fell into a state of transcendence. The fourth metal plate’s diagrams had flowed smoothly in his mind, and now all that was left was to absorb them and transform his Origin Source.","This time, he wouldn’t foolishly annihilate everything. Instead, he would preserve his Origin Source and continue using it. After all, more power meant more confidence.","Outside, years passed—one, sixty, a hundred, a thousand... Ten thousand years later.","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes. The chaotic force in his breath startled Jormungandr, who stood outside his hut. Jian Wushuang stepped out of the hut and looked again at the river of time and space that flowed around him. His mind was now clear, no longer as muddled as it had once been.","“You succeeded?” Jormungandr exclaimed in surprise. “It’s only been ten thousand years! Even with time accelerated by a billion times, only one epoch has passed, and yet your Origin Source has already advanced to a new level!”","“You could tell!” Jian Wushuang was in a good mood.","There were no more bottlenecks, or at least, not for him. Anything that could be accomplished through time alone posed no real challenge to him. His Origin Source had now ascended to the fourth tier, that of a top-tier realm beast. Even in the Land of Chaos, he was now a genius of the highest caliber. Someday, he would become a God of the Starry Sky, equal to the Star Spirits.","The thought thrilled him. A Star Spirit! He recalled how he had once marveled at the Star Spirits, whose every gesture could alter everything around them. In the starry sky, they were truly invincible.","However, he still had far to go before he could match a Prophet. While his foundation was strong, his level still lagged behind. With the condensation of his Origin Source, he had instantly reached the Dao Lord peak, becoming an immortal being.","This time, he wouldn’t foolishly annihilate his strength and Origin Source. At the very least, he would wait until he had comprehended the fifth metal plate before doing so. When he crossed into the fifth level, he would truly annihilate his current power.","With that thought, Jian Wushuang could no longer suppress his excitement.","“Let’s go!” he declared.","Using his thought power, he carried Jormungandr with him to the fifth level.","Swish!","The space here was different from the fourth level. Instead of a linear time-space river, it had become a three-dimensional space. Time and space had merged.","“This time-space is so powerful!” Jormungandr exclaimed, though he had said something similar not long ago.","Jian Wushuang, however, was unfazed. His only curiosity was what awaited him on the sixth level. This level was time-space; would the next be starry space? And what about the seventh level? Could it be the Land of Chaos? And the eighth?","Following this progression, what would the ninth level hold?","The deeper his curiosity grew, the more driven he became.","He pulled out the fifth metal plate. The diagrams on it instantly overwhelmed him. Even with the thought power of a Universe God, he couldn’t perceive the full complexity of the patterns. His eyes and intuition both blurred.","If he couldn’t even see clearly, how was he supposed to comprehend it?","He thought back to his senior brother, Gui Yan (Ghost Eye), a cultivator at the Mahayana stage, who had comprehended the fourth tier. How had he faced the fifth plate?","Jian Wushuang realized he had been cheating, using the vision and thought power of a Universe God to comprehend the fifth level.","e in the ninth layer of the Nine Prison Pagoda. You don’t need to worry about the rest!” The man with the severed arm said truthfully.","However, this request put Jian Wushuang in a difficult position.","The fact that the other party could mention the Nine Prison Pagoda meant that he wasn’t lying.","It was highly likely that everything was true.","The only thing troubling him was throwing the man into the ninth layer of the Nine Prison Pagoda.","At the moment, he simply couldn’t do that.","Forget the ninth layer, even the fourth layer was a challenge for him.","Seeing Jian Wushuang’s expression change, the man with the severed arm was surprised and said, “Don’t tell me you don’t know about the Nine Prison Pagoda!”","“That’s not it!” Jian Wushuang shook his head and said, “It’s just that I’m still a bit far from reaching the ninth layer.”","“I understand. If you could open the ninth layer, you’d already possess the Origin Source of the Realm Beast!” The man with the severed arm said casually. “Tell me, what layer are you at now? Have you reached the level of mastering an Origin Source?”","“The third layer.”","“?”","The man with the severed arm was furious. “I’ve observed that you’ve been in this place for over ten thousand years, and in these ten thousand years, you’ve only broken through to the third layer?”","“Ten thousand years, and you’ve only reached the third layer?”","“Is that considered slow, or fast?” Jian Wushuang asked curiously.","This left the man with the severed arm speechless.","In his opinion, with Ghost Eye’s eye for talent, he should have at least chosen an extraordinary genius. In ten thousand years, breaking through the ninth layer might not be realistic, but the first seven layers shouldn’t be a problem.","Who would have thought that in ten thousand years, Jian Wushuang had only broken through to the third layer?","When Jian Wushuang mentioned that he had only made it through the first three layers after capturing a member of the Divine Eye Clan, the man nearly fainted from anger.","“From now on, I’ll teach you the Divine Eye Secret Technique!”","“You?” Jian Wushuang was skeptical.","The man with the severed arm said coldly, “Don’t forget who the Divine Eye Secret Technique is modeled after!”","After some thought, Jian Wushuang realized it made sense—they did share the same origin as the Realm Beast!","“So, what now?” Jian Wushuang asked. “I can’t just stay here forever!”","The man with the severed arm replied calmly, “You might not be able to move, but this Primordial Star can move!”","“Oh?” Jian Wushuang was surprised. “This is a Primordial Star?”","“Yes, in your terms, it’s a divine artifact!”","Jian Wushuang was delighted. If that were the case, there would be no need to search for the domain ship anymore.","With the Primordial Star, he would be invincible in the Ninefold Space-time Continuum.","However, his joy was short-lived as his fantasy was quickly dashed with a cold reality.","The power within the Primordial Star was too limited.","It couldn’t even function at its peak.","Even the sea of divine power left by the Universe God could barely drive the Primordial Star. Its speed was decent though—it could cross a chaotic world in a single day.","In a hundred years, it could cross an entire universe.","This speed was acceptable to Jian Wushuang.","However, a powerless Primordial Star could only be used for traveling.","At least the man with the severed arm could guide him in cultivating the Divine Eye Secret Technique.","This time, he wouldn’t need to capture any more members of the Divine Eye Clan.","Once his strength was restored, he could capture them all when the time came.","Yet, even under the guidance of the man with the severed arm, after three thousand years, Jian Wushuang hadn’t even reached the beginner stage of the fourth turn of the Divine Eye Secret Technique.","The man with the severed arm, “Gagarin,” was not angry. Instead, he comforted him, saying, “Jian Wushuang, you have decent talent, but you’re not suited for cultivating the Divine Eye Secret Technique. You’re more suited for slaughter!”","“Go, take the Primordial Star and search for powerful Divine Eye Clan members. I have some information for you. In a secret universe-level realm, several powerful members of the Divine Eye Clan are hiding. They may not have awakened yet, but even if your true combat power isn’t enough, you should still be able to suppress them with ease!”","Jian Wushuang looked confused and asked, “What about you?”","“I’ve been lying here for billions of years; a little more time won’t make a difference!”","“Go, leave before I lose my temper!”","Jian Wushuang pouted. He felt the problem was with the other party’s teaching.","It wasn’t his fault!"]},{"number":6481,"title":"Chapter 6481: Embarrassing","paragraphs":["Chapter 6481: Embarrassing","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","But he had already reached his limit.","“Shameful!”","Jian Wushuang felt his face flush with embarrassment.","If he were just an ordinary cultivator at the Great Ascension Stage, he would have been stumped by the very first piece of the metal plate.","The more he thought about it, the more he felt like he was too weak.","...","He was unwilling to accept this.","He couldn’t give up just because he couldn’t see clearly.","He wasn’t the type of person to give up easily.","Even though he deeply wanted to return to the Realm God Continent, he didn’t mind enduring hardships for the sake of his Origin Source.","Even if it cost him half his life, he was determined to become the strongest.","Calming his mind, he began to fully comprehend the parts he could see clearly.","Within the structure was a stable combination of space and time.","When combined, they formed spacetime.","But this wasn’t the end of the structure.","In the space created from nothingness, he needed to condense the source of his life.","This was the essence.","Although the structure wasn’t fully visible, the concept was clear.","However, he couldn’t completely grasp it.","“Something’s missing!”","Jian Wushuang shook his head and continued to ponder again from the beginning.","Each time, he felt like he gained valuable insights.","But the closer he got to success, the further away it seemed.","“What exactly is missing?”","Jian Wushuang increasingly felt an emptiness growing within him, and he began to harbor doubts about himself during the comprehension process.","This state of mind wasn’t suitable for further cultivation.","Swoosh!","He stepped out from the accelerated time state.","“Did you succeed again?” Gagarin asked in surprise!","It had only been sixty thousand years.","Compared to the last time, it wasn’t much slower.","But after a closer inspection, Gagarin noticed that something was missing from Jian Wushuang’s body.","His Origin Source hadn’t advanced.","“You noticed?”","Sensing Gagarin’s odd gaze, Jian Wushuang asked.","“Your Origin Source... it’s leaking!” Gagarin exclaimed in shock. “Your Origin Source must have gone astray. If it continues to leak like this, you’ll eventually become an empty shell!”","Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows and said in surprise, “Why didn’t I notice my Origin Source was leaking?”","He hurriedly focused his senses inward to examine his Origin Source.","It was a space.","Gray and obscure, impossible to see clearly.","Yet, the power of his Origin Source was immensely strong.","At present, he possessed the Origin Source of Chaos, with his realm reaching the limit of a Dao Lord.","However, he was still far from achieving the perfection he sought.","In terms of divine body, he had a tenfold increase in power.","It wasn’t particularly outstanding.","The key was the Origin Source of Chaos, which allowed him to transform and manipulate various forms of power.","The current strength of his Origin Source was enough to unleash the Ancient Shift Technique, and with tenfold divine power, he could erupt with a power equivalent to twentyfold.","It was possible to challenge a Universe Master with the strength of a Dao Lord.","And this was just his raw power, without utilizing any external items.","With such immense strength, it was surprising that Gagarin claimed it was leaking away.","Yet Jian Wushuang hadn’t sensed it at all.","“Jian Wushuang, although I don’t know why you’ve become like this, you and I are both from the Origin of Chaos, so I know very well that your Origin is now in a state of decay!”","“We, the Beasts of the Realm, are an innate race, a great civilization born from chaos!”","“Our Origin is also eternal and infinite!”","“But this eternity can be broken. Do you know why so many Beasts of the Realm willingly created the Starry Sky back then?”","“It was because eternity had been broken. They were infected by a strange substance, and eternity began to fade!”","“They hoped to use the creation of the Starry Sky as a way to live inside a shell!”","“As a result, they were betrayed by the God King. In the end, only twelve Star Spirits and some worthless things like the High Priest were condensed. Those Beasts of the Realm that lost eternity were doomed!”","Jian Wushuang had heard some of this before.","It was Jormungandr who had mentioned it.","However, at the time, he hadn’t paid much attention to it.","He hadn’t expected eternity to be broken.","Was it due to some kind of substance?","He quickly took out the metal plate.","“Could it be that the substance is on here?”","Jian Wushuang’s mind was filled with countless thoughts, but he didn’t fully trust Gagarin.","However, hearing that he might face doom made him cautious.","“It doesn’t matter. My current power will inevitably extinguish sooner or later!” He pretended to remain calm and then asked, “You mentioned this state of decay. I haven’t felt it. This cycle should be quite long, right?”","Gagarin shook his head and replied, “I’m not sure, but one thing I do know is that if you don’t act, it might be fine. But once you start, the decay will accelerate!”","“If, as you say, this will eventually extinguish my Origin and allow me to ascend to a higher level, then let me ascend quickly. There’s no way to resolve this state of decay. Once it’s all gone, your path of cultivation will end!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and stored the metal plate, asking no further questions.","Though he was anxious, he dared not show it.","What if the other party was trying to trick him?","“I’ll keep that in mind!” Jian Wushuang maintained his composure and said, “Go and bring everyone to the fifth layer to cultivate. I’ll head to the sixth layer!”","“Tell them we’ll be leaving soon. Be prepared!”","With that, his figure flickered and disappeared from the fifth layer.","Upon entering the fifth and sixth layers, he immediately activated the Eternal Transformation technique.","His power surged.","There was no sign of weakening.","But as he swung his sword, the power leaked, unable to be replenished.","A sense of loss surged into his heart, making his eyes widen.","“It’s true!”","At that moment, panic took hold of him.","If his Origin were extinguished, his comprehension would slow down even more.","He was already stuck at the fifth layer.","If his Origin was extinguished and what he cultivated afterward continued to decay, what would he do?","“Ugh!”","“I’ll go to the sixth layer and talk to Cao Wusheng!”","As for how to fix this, he would think about it after getting the metal plate from the sixth layer!","In the sixth layer’s space.","Starlight flickered!","Gazing at the countless stars, Jian Wushuang was stunned.","It really was the Starry Sky.","Although it seemed to be full of twinkling stars, in truth, each flickering light was a grand universe.","The stars connected by lines formed a river of time and space.","Incredible!","He wasn’t the only one shocked.","Cao Wusheng, who had just entered, felt the same.","He thought he had returned to the Starry Sky.","Excited, he searched everywhere for cultivators.","But after entering the universes of those starry skies, he found no life.","Only the energy unique to the Starry Sky was floating around.","He had wandered here for tens of thousands of years, not seeing a single soul.","At first, he wasn’t anxious, but as time passed, he began to grow restless.","Someone of his strength originally had little concern for time.","But it was different here.","Here, it felt like home.","Yet he couldn’t find anyone.","That sense of loneliness reminded him of the years atop the Eighth Mountain.","Swish!","The sudden appearance of a figure was like a lifeline to him. His silhouette rushed over in an instant.","“Hmm?”","Jian Wushuang hadn’t expected the other party to be so emotional, so he used his thought power to instantly suppress Cao Wusheng.","Then, right in front of him, Jian Wushuang took out the metal plate from the sixth layer.","Ignoring Cao Wusheng, he blatantly began examining the sixth metal plate.","There was also a letter attached to the metal plate!","As expected!","He had guessed it. The sixth layer was a watershed, and his senior brother had certainly left some clues.","Opening the letter, it read:","“Junior Brother, by now, I’m sure your strength has returned to its peak. Your power brings me great joy!”"]},{"number":6482,"title":"Chapter 6482: You Won’t Understand!","paragraphs":["Chapter 6482: You Won’t Understand!","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the coming days, you will most likely head toward the heavens of this world. Remember, when you go there, be especially cautious of the Universe Sea. You must not be careless.","“As for the metal plate on the sixth level, all you need to do is comprehend its mysteries and combine them with your own understanding. Although it won’t increase your Origin Source level, once you’ve finished cultivating the metal plate, you’ll find that your Origin Source won’t be any weaker than the peak Origin Source of the Realm Beasts, and it may even rival that of a Universe God. This is the true use of the metal plate!”","“Haha, are you starting to realize just how powerful our teacher is? Keep working hard. This is only the first cage. When we meet again in the Land of Chaos, you will still need to cross the Starry Sky!”","After reading the letter, Jian Wushuang furrowed his brows.","This information was of no use to him in his current situation!","...","He didn’t care about the metal plate’s purpose.","What he truly sought was the Origin Source of a Universe God.","Right now, the priority was to resolve the backlash caused by the fifth metal plate.","“That’s it! I can ask Cao Wusheng. He’s a member of the God Eye Clan and must have cultivated the secret techniques of the God Eye!”","With this thought, he released the restriction.","Cao Wusheng let out a long breath and spoke, “Is this the treasure meant to deal with my God Eye Clan?”","“You’ve suppressed me but haven’t killed me. Why is that?”","Jian Wushuang didn’t bother with unnecessary words and directly said, “Suppressing you wasn’t my intention; someone else instructed me to do so!”","“Who?”","“Who dares to target my God Eye Clan?”","“Haha, do you truly believe that your God Eye Clan is invincible?” Jian Wushuang found the idea laughable.","How could Cao Wusheng be so clueless?","Had he forgotten how his clan had fallen?","During the subsequent conversation, Jian Wushuang realized that Cao Wusheng truly had no idea.","“You really don’t know how the God Eye Clan was destroyed?”","“I know! It was betrayed by a traitor!”","“No, I mean, do you know who wiped out the God Eye Clan with a single blow?”","“Haha! Who could possibly annihilate my God Eye Clan with just one attack? That’s ridiculous! The God Eye Clan is invincible in this world. No one can defeat us head-on!”","“Our secret technique allows us to burn everything. You can’t possibly understand that kind of power!”","Jian Wushuang scratched his head. This guy really was clueless.","It seemed that he truly didn’t know the secret behind his clan.","But Cao Wusheng was nearly as strong as a Universe God. Shouldn’t he know such things?","Something didn’t feel right!","Jian Wushuang’s eyes flickered.","It was the first time he had observed him inside the Nine Prison Pagoda.","There was something wrong with Cao Wusheng’s Origin Source and soul.","Previously, in the outside world, Jian Wushuang hadn’t been strong enough to investigate Cao Wusheng’s Origin Source and soul.","But here, in his own territory, he could finally see the strangeness within him.","“His soul... it’s split!”","Jian Wushuang’s heart stirred, and he instantly understood.","A split soul meant that the person before him must have a clone or a true form elsewhere.","Recalling how cautious and composed Cao Wusheng had been before, yet how restless he had become after arriving here, Jian Wushuang now fully grasped the situation.","The Cao Wusheng before him was, in all likelihood, just a clone.","Not afraid to die, but certainly afraid of being suppressed!","It wasn’t hard to guess who his true form might be.","It was probably the one being suppressed within the giant serpent’s secret realm.","“Why are you looking at me like that?” Cao Wusheng’s face turned wary.","Jian Wushuang’s lips curved into a smile as he remarked, “Cao Wusheng, you’ve hidden yourself well. No wonder you claim to know nothing. It turns out you’re just a split soul. Did your true form never tell you the secret behind the destruction of the God Eye Clan?”","“Or are you simply a puppet of your true form?”","“No need to know too much?”","“What do you mean by that?” Cao Wusheng’s face changed dramatically.","He hadn’t expected his identity to be seen through.","Jian Wushuang crossed his arms, speaking leisurely, “We’ve come this far. Is there any point in hiding?”","“Why don’t we lay everything out on the table?”","“I’ll tell you the secret of the God Eye Clan, and you tell me what’s being suppressed inside the giant serpent’s secret realm. How about that?”","“Dream on!” Cao Wusheng immediately rejected the offer.","What was inside the serpent’s secret realm was the most important secret.","He was merely a clone, with very little of his true form’s memories.","Or rather, he had only inherited the positive memories, while the rest had been withheld.","That was why he was so arrogant and self-confident.","Precisely because all his memories were positive, he had the audacity to talk about the secret of the serpent’s realm.","Jian Wushuang remained unfazed, calmly saying, “Even if you don’t tell me, I can guess. Isn’t it a Universe God of the God Eye Clan being suppressed inside?”","“Surely you don’t think I’m just an ordinary person!”","“Let me tell you, the reason I’m suppressing your God Eye Clan is because I was entrusted by your God Eye Clan’s ancestor!”","“It wasn’t just your ancestor, even your clan’s creator wants to suppress you all!”","“This is fate—you can’t escape it!”","Jian Wushuang tried to use an old trick to deceive him.","But Cao Wusheng refused to listen, roaring in fury, “My fate is mine to decide, not heaven’s! Don’t speak any further. At worst, I’ll die. My God Eye Clan may perish in battle, but we will never be suppressed by someone like you!”","“You, a mere mortal, could never understand the power of the God Eye Clan!”","“Nor could you understand why we fight!!!”","It was clear that Cao Wusheng had his own ideals and beliefs.","To him, the God Eye Clan was great and undeniable.","Jian Wushuang was speechless, sighing, “Alright, I won’t ask about the serpent’s secret realm anymore. But how about we make a deal?”","“Never!” Cao Wusheng seemed stubborn, rejecting everything outright.","“This deal... is for your freedom.”","Huh?","This time, Cao Wusheng wavered.","If he could leave here, he could commit soul suicide and return to his true form without any loss.","But if he were suppressed here, it would be a major problem for his true form.","He had been split off for an important purpose.","“What’s the deal?”","“Your God Eye secret technique, you’ve reached the sixth level, haven’t you?”","“Why do you ask?” Cao Wusheng was puzzled.","Could it be that Jian Wushuang wanted to learn the God Eye technique?","This wasn’t hard to obtain!","There were many holy lands in the Northern Corner Domain, and even the seventh level of the God Eye technique was available.","Why seek him to learn it?","“I want you to transmit the fifth and sixth levels of the God Eye technique to me. Not the cultivation method, but your insights into practicing it. And you must guide me until I fully grasp it!”","“No tricks allowed!”","“If you teach me, I’ll let you go.”","“This condition shouldn’t be too difficult for you, right?”","Jian Wushuang looked at Cao Wusheng.","He was gambling—betting that Cao Wusheng had too much at stake to abandon this clone.","Moments later, Cao Wusheng nodded, agreeing.","The gamble had paid off.","As for whether he would actually release Cao Wusheng—of course, he wouldn’t.","Nor could he.","Once the clone entered, it couldn’t leave.","So when Jian Wushuang swore to release him, he merely promised not to act against him directly.","By “release,” he meant opening the Nine Prison Pagoda.","Whether or not Cao Wusheng could actually escape wasn’t Jian Wushuang’s concern.","“I can teach you, but you’ve disrespected my God Eye Clan. That puts me in a difficult position!”","“What would you like me to do to show respect?” Jian Wushuang, after all, was someone who valued teachers and traditions."]},{"number":6483,"title":"Chapter 6483: Not Embarrassing","paragraphs":["Chapter 6483: Not Embarrassing","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang immediately performed a grand ceremony of apprenticeship for Cao Wusheng.","There was no shame in this.","Learning from others’ strengths was something to be proud of.","A true man knew when to bow and when to rise.","Besides, the other party wasn’t a bad person.","...","Becoming his disciple wasn’t a big deal!","It wasn’t as though he had never done it before.","“I accept your apology!” Cao Wusheng said calmly, with his hands behind his back. “Now, I’ll start teaching you from the Fifth Cycle...”","Jian Wushuang casually set up a time acceleration of ten thousand times.","He began focusing wholeheartedly on his studies.","Just the Fifth Cycle alone took him nearly an entire era to master.","By the time he had finished, a thousand years had passed in the outside world.","After mastering the Fifth Cycle, Jian Wushuang didn’t rush to learn the Sixth Cycle.","Instead, he started to comprehend the fifth metal plate.","The blurred sensation he had earlier disappeared.","Though not entirely gone, he could at least clearly see the main patterns now.","He followed the patterns and gained considerable insight.","However, the sense of power loss became increasingly severe.","By now, he fully understood: the deeper he comprehended, the more his Origin Source would drain away.","“It seems I need to hurry!”","He put away the metal plate and began learning the Sixth Cycle.","This time, he secluded himself for over a hundred eras.","In the outside world, ten thousand years passed.","He mastered the first six cycles completely.","At this point, if he unleashed all of his power, it would reach an astonishing level.","A Dao Lord with a divine power of 500,000.","Unfortunately, he dared not use too much of this power.","Otherwise, his Origin Source would rapidly deplete.","“Jian Wushuang, it’s time for you to keep your promise!”","“Of course!” Jian Wushuang smiled and opened the door to the Nine Prison Pagoda.","Outside was the cave world within the Ancient Domain Star.","Jian Wushuang pointed towards the outside world and said, “You’re free to go!”","“Thank you!”","Cao Wusheng expressed his gratitude and rushed towards the exit.","But just as he reached the doorway, he was yanked back violently.","“What’s going on?”","“Jian Wushuang, you tricked me?”","Jian Wushuang spread his hands innocently and said, “I didn’t trick you. Didn’t I let you go?”","“Haha!”","Jian Wushuang laughed heartily, then with a flicker of his figure, he left the sixth level.","He no longer bothered with Cao Wusheng.","Let him do as he pleased!","One day, Cao Wusheng would realize that staying within the Nine Prison Pagoda was much better than the outside world.","The waters outside ran too deep for them to handle.","Perhaps, once they reached the Land of Chaos and met Brother Ghost Eye, these members of the God Eye Clan would truly gain their freedom.","In a way, he was protecting the God Eye Clan.","In the fifth-level world of the pagoda...","Just as he appeared, several figures flew towards him.","“Uncle Wushuang!”","“Brother Wushuang!”","“Jian Wushuang!”","From the voices, Jian Wushuang recognized who they were. He smiled warmly and said, “Everyone, long time no see!”","“You’ve been in seclusion for quite some time. Hundreds of thousands of years have passed, and it seems you haven’t made much progress!” Immortal Jiu Chen curled his lips in a playful gesture.","Xiang Yang immediately defended him, saying, “The key is, how much stronger are you really? Brother Wushuang doesn’t flaunt his strength. Don’t think just because you’re now a demigod, you can act mighty in front of him. Believe it or not, I could take you down with just one hand!”","“Hmph, one hand? Who do you think you are?” Jiu Chen retorted, immediately preparing to spar.","Jiang Ni, as usual, remained unfazed by the playful banter, as if he was already used to it.","“Alright, everyone, it’s been a while. Let’s have a drink and chat!”","Jian Wushuang summoned Hei Qiu to join them and inquired about their current location. It was about time for him to venture out again. He was now the weakest among them. The others were eager to go out and make their mark in the world, especially Xiang Yang, who had made the fastest progress and now rivaled a Universe God in strength. In the Nine Heavens and the Starry Sky, he could move without hindrance.","Jiu Chen wasn’t far behind either. He was at the demigod level, though he had yet to fully refine a micro-universe. Jiang Ni, meanwhile, had slowed in his cultivation and remained at the Seventh Tribulation Realm. However, his divine power could already rival that of a demigod, making him far stronger than he once was.","As for Jian Wushuang, he couldn’t help but reflect on himself. His Origin Source from the Land of Chaos was depleting, and the fifth metal plate had reached a bottleneck. The sixth metal plate? He had made no progress whatsoever. Watching the others soar ahead, he even considered giving up on the apex beast Origin Source and simply merging with the Dao directly. If his Origin Source were to deplete completely, he might not even have the chance to regret it later.","Of course, this was merely a fleeting thought. He wouldn’t truly give up so easily.","After chatting for some time, Jian Wushuang finally asked about the situation in the outside world.","Hei Qiu took a sip of his drink and reported, “Master, we are currently at the heart of the Northern Corner Region, far from the Giant Serpent Secret Realm. Even with Ancient Star moving at full speed, it will still take a million years to reach it!”","“If you wish to explore, you can go to Chaos City. It’s the most prosperous ancient city in the Northern Corner Region!”","“Chaos City?” Jian Wushuang had heard of it before. It seemed like a good opportunity to venture out and perhaps inquire about the Giant Serpent Secret Realm. But most importantly, he needed to fully comprehend the fifth metal plate.","“Let’s set off. We’re heading to Chaos City!”","...","In a corner of the Nine Heavens and Starry Sky, within the Northern Corner Region, there was a territory covered in chaotic currents, brimming with treasures. It had drawn countless cultivators to compete for them. Thus, Chaos City was born.","Outside the city, an ancient ship floated in the air. Standing on the deck were none other than Jian Wushuang and his companions. It had taken them decades to reach Chaos City. During their journey through the chaos, they had picked up dozens of chaotic treasures, though their value was insignificant to a Universe Master. Still, the sheer probability of finding such treasures left them amazed.","Of course, this was due to the speed of Ancient Star, which was even faster than a Universe Master. Though it seemed like they had only flown for decades, an ordinary supreme powerhouse might have taken much longer.","With this in mind, the probability of encountering treasures didn’t seem so high after all.","“There seems to be a particularly powerful aura ahead!” Xiang Yang said as he soared into the sky, gazing at Chaos City in the distance. The vast city walls stretched out like a massive ancient beast lying across the land.","“Master, I feel that aura too. The divine power is strong, and it feels no weaker than mine!” Hei Qiu added.","Now, Hei Qiu had fully mastered the micro-universe, and his divine power rivaled Xiang Yang’s, reaching a strength of eighty million units. To have encountered someone equally strong meant the opponent’s divine power was on par with Xiang Yang’s.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow. He hadn’t expected to come across such a powerful aura as soon as they arrived at Chaos City. Wasn’t it said that the strongest in the Nine Heavens and the Starry Sky were only demigods? Universe Masters were supposed to be rare, yet here in the Northern Corner Region’s Chaos City, there was such a strong presence. Whoever it was could surely dominate the entire Nine Heavens and Starry Sky.","“Why don’t we go ask?” Xiang Yang suggested confidently, before flashing towards Chaos City.","“Don’t be disrespectful!” Jian Wushuang called after him. He had come to Chaos City to explore, not to cause trouble.","Moments later, beyond the horizon and outside the city walls, Xiang Yang and a handsome man in a blue robe were already exchanging blows, their battle stretching from the city to the sky.","“This way of greeting is certainly... unique,” Jian Wushuang muttered, rubbing his temples. It seemed Xiang Yang had been holding back his energy for too long.","“Hei Qiu, go and break them up!”","...","“Even in chaos, we find the strength to rise, for it is not the circumstances that define us, but the choices we make.”"]},{"number":6484,"title":"Chapter 6484: Jiang Haichao","paragraphs":["Chapter 6484: Jiang Haichao","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Yes, Master!”","Hei Qiu grinned, his round body shooting out like a thunder orb.","In an instant, he was by their side.","After speaking briefly, he quickly led the two to the flying boat.","“Brother Wushuang, this man is quite powerful, but he’s still not on my level!” Xiang Yang said smugly.","...","The man in the water-blue robe did not get angry; instead, he responded gracefully, “I am indeed not as strong as you, my friend. I didn’t expect that just as I’m leaving the Nine Directions Space-Time today, I would meet such a formidable Daoist. It has truly been an eye-opening experience!”","“Leaving the Nine Directions Space-Time?”","Everyone was taken aback.","Then, they quickly understood the meaning behind his words.","“Daoist friend, may I ask your esteemed name?” Jian Wushuang asked respectfully.","“Jiang Haichao.”","“I come from the Primordial Spirit Sect, and I don’t really have a formal title. I don’t know many people in the Nine Directions Space-Time either.”","Upon hearing this, Xiang Yang scratched his nose. They hadn’t even had the chance to modestly conceal their identities.","It turned out the other person was also someone who kept a low profile, which saved them the trouble of explanations.","After introducing themselves to one another, they began discussing their journey to the Cosmic Sea.","They also learned about Jiang Haichao’s legendary life.","He had been nurtured in the womb for eight thousand years, and the day he was born, the heavens and earth lost their color.","Upon his birth, he was already an innate spiritual being.","He began cultivating at the age of nine and became an immortal at eighteen.","By the age of one hundred, he had united with the Dao.","He underwent his Tribulation at the age of one thousand.","In just one hundred thousand years, he became the strongest in Chaos City.","Then, after secluding himself for hundreds of eras, he achieved the power of a Demigod.","Or rather, one could say he had reached a level comparable to a Universe God.","In their brief conversation, everyone was full of admiration.","Even Xiang Yang couldn’t help but say, “Your cultivation speed surpasses mine!”","Jian Wushuang also sighed, impressed by Jiang Haichao’s mastery of the Ultimate Dao.","He had already reached the level of a Universe God, so crossing the Cosmic Sea would pose little difficulty or danger for him.","Once he reached the Upper Heavens, becoming a Universe God would not be a challenge.","He truly was a rare genius!","“I actually admire all of you more, for being able to journey through the Nine Directions Space-Time. Unfortunately, I never had the chance to explore its many realms. Now that we part ways, the next time we meet will likely be in the Upper Heavens!”","Jiang Haichao cupped his hands in respect.","Everyone returned the gesture, seeing him off with warm regards.","This was the first time they had encountered a Demigod cultivator, and he was about to journey to the Cosmic Sea.","Crossing the sea, heading toward the heavens.","Jian Wushuang longed for it as well.","But sadly, he couldn’t go just yet.","At the very least, he needed to fully comprehend the sixth metal plate first.","After the others left, the crowd sighed in awe.","Only Jian Wushuang kept staring at the place where Jiang Haichao had vanished.","Black Prison approached him and whispered, “Master, should we stop him? It’s not too late to catch up now!”","“Do you think I’m some kind of...”","“A natural-born killer?”","Jian Wushuang shot Black Prison an annoyed glance.","He had just sensed that Jiang Haichao seemed to be practicing the God Eye Secret Technique as well.","And Jiang Haichao had also recognized that Jian Wushuang was practicing it.","Now that Jian Wushuang had reached the full sixth level of the God Eye Secret Technique, he could naturally sense a similar aura.","He had felt that aura on Jiang Haichao.","It was a God Eye Secret Technique stronger than his own.","“A genius?”","If that was true, it was indeed extraordinary.","To cultivate it beyond the sixth level—such power was truly endless.","“Endless!”","Jian Wushuang seemed to think of something. His figure flashed, and after giving some instructions, he entered the Ancient Star Domain.","Soon after, he made his way to the Nine Prison Pagoda.","The sixth level.","The crazed Cao Wusheng had been cursing Jian Wushuang all along.","When he saw Jian Wushuang suddenly appear, he immediately charged at him.","But then, abruptly, he stopped.","Jian Wushuang was puzzled. He hadn’t even suppressed him yet.","Had he softened this quickly?","Without thinking much about it, Jian Wushuang asked, “Master Cao, why be like this?”","“I wasn’t lying to you back then, I even swore!”","Though his oath wasn’t binding, for he operated within chaos, he had still promised to let Cao Wusheng go.","It wasn’t his fault Cao Wusheng chose not to leave.","If Cao Wusheng wanted, Jian Wushuang would have kept the door open for him to escape.","Cao Wusheng, suppressing his fury, gritted his teeth and said, “If you’re not letting me out, why come here? To mock me? Humiliate me?”","“Why not just kill me already!”","“How could I!” Jian Wushuang shook his head and replied, “I came to ask you about the seventh level of the God Eye Secret Technique!”","Cao Wusheng immediately turned away, saying, “I don’t know!”","He refused to cooperate.","Jian Wushuang smiled bitterly. It seemed he had hurt Cao Wusheng too much last time.","The seventh level of the God Eye Secret Technique...","It was already at the cosmic level.","Cao Wusheng probably really didn’t know.","He didn’t dwell on it and, right in front of Cao Wusheng, took out the complete inheritance of the God Eye Secret Technique.","He began studying the seventh level.","It was incredibly difficult.","But not impossible to cultivate. Certainly, it was less difficult than the fifth metal plate.","However, cultivating the seventh level required too many external materials.","He could only split off a Thought Power avatar to study it.","His true body left the Nine Prison Pagoda and returned to the battleship.","By then, Xiang Yang and the others had already entered Chaos City.","The battleship was anchored outside the city.","Black Prison remained on guard.","After Jian Wushuang emerged, he glanced up at Chaos City.","“It seems I’ll be staying here for a long time.”","He didn’t rush to find Xiang Yang and the others.","Instead, he and Black Prison entered Chaos City.","The city had an extremely ancient feel to it.","It bore the marks of time.","Shops lined both sides of the streets, selling all sorts of treasures obtained from the chaos.","Jian Wushuang needed to exchange for some treasures himself.","He chose one of the larger shops to make a deal.","“What would this senior like to purchase?”","A cultivator at the Dao Lord level in the shop hurriedly greeted them.","But he greeted Black Prison.","An elder behind the counter noticed and immediately walked toward Jian Wushuang, saying, “Daoist, are you here to acquire something? Let me assist you!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t mind. He casually handed over a list.","The elder took one look at the list and froze.","“This... this is too much. Our shop can only provide a tenth of this. If you’re in a hurry, I can gather treasures from a few other shops for you!”","“How long will that take?” Jian Wushuang asked.","“Three days!”","“Alright, here’s the deposit.”","He casually tossed over a ring.","The elder quickly caught it and, after a brief Thought Power scan, found that it contained over a billion cosmic crystals. His heart leaped with joy.","This was a big customer!","Jian Wushuang didn’t linger. He went to another shop and did the same thing—handing over a jade slip and paying a portion of the deposit.","The seventh level of the God Eye Secret Technique required too many treasures.","It was possible that all of Chaos City couldn’t gather them all.","He was now quite curious about how Jiang Haichao had managed to cultivate it.","Did treasures just fall from the sky?","After scouring the city for a few days, he still hadn’t gathered even a tenth of the required materials.","Most of what he found were substitutes.","“Simply buying them won’t work!”","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath.","Over the past few days, he had learned a bit about the city.","The leading force here was the Yuanling Divine Sect.","It was the sect Jiang Haichao had once belonged to.","With Jiang Haichao present, the Yuanling Divine Sect had rightfully claimed its spot as the top sect in the city."]},{"number":6485,"title":"Chapter 6485: A Little Difficult","paragraphs":["Chapter 6485: A Little Difficult","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After that came the Four Great Families.","The Jiang family, the Wu family, the Chen family, and the Mo family.","These families were each backed by Universe Masters who had surpassed the Seventh Tribulation and also possessed countless treasures.","Moreover, this was Chaos City, a place renowned for its accumulation of treasures.","In ordinary places, families of this kind would have at most hundreds of billions of universe crystals, but here, the reserves of universe crystals were estimated to be in the trillions.","...","There were also many precious chaotic treasures.","The question was, how to correctly open these treasure vaults?","Jian Wushuang had his insights.","One option was to reincarnate into such a family, or he could marry into one.","These were tactics he had employed before.","However, he wasn’t particularly interested in the Four Great Families.","The Primordial Spirit Sect, a sect capable of producing formidable individuals like Jiang Haichao, was worth visiting.","Rumor had it they were currently recruiting disciples.","The requirement was to be an Immortal.","Once one became a Dao Lord, progress would be limited, and the sect wouldn’t be able to properly nurture them, unless they were a Dao Lord of the Ultimate Path or someone who had mastered a Supreme Origin Path.","Jian Wushuang’s current status made him an ideal candidate.","“Master, why don’t I join forces with Xiang Yang and break through Chaos City for you? We could gather all the treasures for you,” Hei Qiu suggested through a transmission, his tone filled with grievance.","He felt Jian Wushuang was too kind. Clearly, they had the power to seize treasures, but instead, Jian Wushuang insisted on buying them.","It was, in Hei Qiu’s view, an affront to their strength.","Jian Wushuang’s face darkened.","“Stop talking about that. Cultivation isn’t all about fighting and killing; it’s about navigating human relationships!” he sighed.","“Go find Xiang Yang and the others. Tell them to meet me at a teahouse in the southern part of the city tonight. I’m going to take a walk around the city wall alone.”","“Understood, I’ll go right away!” Hei Qiu nodded, and with a flash, disappeared.","Jian Wushuang was left alone. Just as he was about to head to the city wall, he sensed a call.","He took out his communication jade. It was from a shop, informing him that a batch of treasures had arrived.","He immediately changed direction and headed toward the eastern part of the city.","Before long, he arrived at the shop.","The shopkeeper, a Tribulation-level expert, greeted Jian Wushuang with utmost respect.","This was because the shopkeeper had seen Hei Qiu, who followed Jian Wushuang, and had sensed his unfathomable strength.","And Hei Qiu addressed Jian Wushuang as “Master.”","Thus, the shopkeeper dared not slight Jian Wushuang, even though Jian Wushuang only had the aura of a Dao Lord. He treated him as an honored guest.","“Please, take the seat of honor, my friend,” the shopkeeper said.","“I heard the treasures have arrived. How much of the share do you have?” Jian Wushuang asked as he sat down and picked up a teacup.","“I’ve gathered about eighty percent. This is the best my humble shop can do. If you need the full amount, it will likely take many years. Among the treasures, the Chaos Golden Lotus is especially rare—it hasn’t appeared for several eras. If luck is not on our side, you may have to wait a very long time.”","Jian Wushuang remained unbothered and replied calmly, “No rush. Continue searching, and notify me once you’ve acquired them.”","“Understood. Here is eighty percent of the treasures. Please take them first!” The shopkeeper carefully handed over a ring.","Before Jian Wushuang could take it, the sound of footsteps came from outside.","A young man with a wicked aura strode into the shop, accompanied by three or five guards.","Seeing the newcomer, the shopkeeper quickly stood up to greet him.","“Young Master Chen, it is a great honor to have you visit my humble shop. May I ask what treasures you are looking for?” The shopkeeper greeted with utmost enthusiasm.","This young man was none other than Chen Shengwu, the young master of the Chen family, one of the four great families of Chaos City.","Born merely a hundred years ago, he had already reached the pinnacle of Dao Lord, mastering the Second Grade Origin Source Dao. He was a renowned prodigy in the city.","“I want the Heavenly Origin Sacred Water!” Chen Shengwu stood with his hands behind his back, his voice filled with arrogance. “Bring out all the Heavenly Origin Sacred Water in your shop—I want it all!”","“This...” The shopkeeper hesitated.","The truth was, all the Heavenly Origin Sacred Water had already been sold to Jian Wushuang, and there wasn’t a drop left in the store. However, he couldn’t directly reveal that it had been sold to Jian Wushuang. After all, he prided himself on being a man of principle in business.","“Young Master Chen, I assume you need the Heavenly Origin Sacred Water to practice the second transformation of the Divine Eye Secret Technique?” The shopkeeper’s mind worked quickly, and he immediately suggested, “In fact, you could purchase the Heavenly Origin Precious Yellow Lotus. It’s nurtured using the Heavenly Origin Sacred Water, and its effects are no weaker. Plus, it’s much more affordable!”","Upon hearing this, Chen Shengwu nodded slightly and agreed, “Fine, bring it all out. I’ll take everything.”","“Very well, please wait a moment,” the shopkeeper responded, then turned and headed into the side room.","At that moment, Jian Wushuang also rose, preparing to leave.","He had no interest in the Heavenly Origin Precious Yellow Lotus and planned to head to the city walls, where he’d heard that several experts had inscribed their cultivation insights.","Just as he stepped out the door, a surge of energy that made his Origin Source rejoice abruptly appeared.","Jian Wushuang swiftly turned to look.","It was coming from a small box in the shopkeeper’s hand.","When the box opened, a yellow lotus flower appeared, surrounded by streams of chaotic energy.","It was indeed the Heavenly Origin Precious Yellow Lotus.","“Is that the aura of the Wanliu Tree?”","“This isn’t just an ordinary Precious Yellow Lotus nurtured by Heavenly Origin Sacred Water—it must have grown under the Wanliu Tree!”","This lotus had another name: the “Everlasting Lotus.”","Jian Wushuang, well-versed in rare treasures, recognized it at a glance.","Before Young Master Chen could lay his eyes on it, Jian Wushuang quickly spoke up, “Young Master, I hear you’re seeking Heavenly Origin Sacred Water. I happen to have some—how much do you need?”","Chen Shengwu glanced at Jian Wushuang dismissively. He had noticed him when he first entered, but had ignored him, seeing him as just a mere Dao Lord, hardly worth his attention.","Now, hearing that Jian Wushuang had Heavenly Origin Sacred Water, he turned to look.","“However much you have, I’ll take it all!”","Chen Shengwu’s attention shifted away from the Heavenly Origin Precious Yellow Lotus.","The shopkeeper didn’t mind—both customers were valuable, and he couldn’t afford to offend either of them.","“Here, one jin.” Jian Wushuang took out a small jade flask and handed it over.","Without bothering to inspect it, Chen Shengwu casually tossed it to the hook-nosed elder standing beside him.","“Young Master, it’s indeed Heavenly Origin Sacred Water. No problem,” the elder confirmed after a quick check.","“One jin of Heavenly Origin Sacred Water is worth about five to seven million Universe Crystals,” the elder added, even going so far as to state the price.","Chen Shengwu waved his hand generously. “Give him seven million.”","“Yes!” The hook-nosed elder retrieved a Qiankun pouch and tossed it to Jian Wushuang.","“Boy, take it.”","Jian Wushuang accepted it nonchalantly, showing little concern for the Universe Crystals. What he truly wanted was that Everlasting Lotus.","After receiving the payment, Jian Wushuang feigned frugality and said, “Using the Sacred Water would be wasteful for me. The Heavenly Origin Precious Yellow Lotus seems more appropriate. How much for this one?”","The shopkeeper was taken aback.","Earlier, Jian Wushuang had spent freely and lavishly—why the sudden thriftiness?","However, he didn’t press the matter and quoted, “Three million.”","Chen Shengwu scoffed coldly, clearly unimpressed.","He cared little for money, and he certainly wasn’t interested in this frugal act from a mere rogue cultivator.","“Let’s go!” he ordered.","“Young Master...” The hook-nosed elder whispered discreetly, revealing the special nature of the Heavenly Origin Precious Yellow Lotus.","Chen Shengwu stopped in his tracks, then spoke out, “Wait, I’ll take that Heavenly Origin Precious Yellow Lotus as well!”","“This...” The shopkeeper hesitated, glancing between both sides.","It was a difficult situation.","Jian Wushuang cast a glance at Chen Shengwu before locking his gaze on the hook-nosed elder.","This man was no ordinary figure."]},{"number":6486,"title":"Chapter 6486: Endless Lotus","paragraphs":["Chapter 6486: Endless Lotus","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The remaining guards were only at the absolute peak, with divine power reaching fifty thousand.","However, this person’s divine power fluctuation was exceptionally strong—he was a Rogue Tribulation!","A Universe Master who had failed to overcome the Tribulation.","At least a Fifth Tribulation Realm.","Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been able to recognize the uniqueness of the Tianyuan Yellow Lotus.","...","It seemed that the other party didn’t recognize the Life Lotus either; he only thought the Tianyuan Yellow Lotus was extraordinary, especially after seeing Jian Wushuang take out the Tianyuan Holy Water.","This aroused his suspicion.","“Boy, you’re too clever for your own good!” The hook-nosed man sneered. “Considering that you brought out the Tianyuan Holy Water, I’ll let you go this time. Leave now, and don’t let me see you again!”","Leave?","With a mere thought, Jian Wushuang used his thought power to snatch the Tianyuan Yellow Lotus from the shopkeeper’s hands and casually threw out the seven million Universe Crystals he’d just received.","“You’re courting death!”","The hook-nosed man was furious and struck out instantly.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t one to back down.","A vine shot out from his wrist, piercing straight through the old man’s chest.","“You’re the one seeking death!”","He had been more than courteous already.","Offering the Tianyuan Holy Water to the other party before buying the Tianyuan Yellow Lotus.","Seeing the situation escalate, the shopkeeper hastily tried to mediate. “Gentlemen, please, no need to fight! I have plenty more Tianyuan Yellow Lotuses!”","At this point, he still hadn’t realized the gravity of the situation, thinking it was merely a squabble.","Jian Wushuang, hearing this, immediately said, “I’ll take them all!”","He wanted to test his luck.","What if the remaining Tianyuan Yellow Lotuses were also Life Lotuses?","“Boy, you’re too greedy!”","Breaking free from the vine’s grasp, the hook-nosed man shouted angrily, “Do you even know who you’re messing with?”","“Uncle Zhang, no need to waste words on him. I’ve already informed the family; powerful reinforcements will arrive soon. He won’t be able to escape!” Chen Shengwu’s face was dark with frustration.","He hadn’t expected Jian Wushuang, a mere Dao Lord, to be so audacious, using force to buy the lot in broad daylight.","Seeing the dark red vine wrapped around Jian Wushuang’s arm, Chen Shengwu was even more astonished.","It had injured his protector!","“Looks like you all have a death wish!” Jian Wushuang chuckled bitterly. He had intended to keep a low profile, but when absolute interests were at stake...","He wouldn’t back down.","Upon seeing that the newly retrieved Tianyuan Yellow Lotuses were of average quality and just ordinary, Jian Wushuang wasn’t disappointed. He casually put them away and tossed out another ring.","He then prepared to leave.","The hook-nosed man tried to stop him but was effortlessly flung aside by the Gui Yun vine.","Jian Wushuang walked away openly.","With a flash of his figure, he disappeared into the streets.","He reappeared atop the city walls moments later.","Now wasn’t the time to enjoy the scenery.","Instead, he ventured into the Ancient Star Territory.","Swoosh!","On the mountain peak.","Jian Wushuang carefully took out the Life Lotus.","Holding it gently in his hands.","“With this Life Lotus, along with the treasures I’ve gathered, it will be enough to help me refine the seventh cycle!”","“Afterward, I’ll delve into comprehending the fifth metal tablet!”","With his mind made up, he began absorbing the Life Lotus.","The Origin Source that had been dissipating slowed its pace.","Absorbing the treasures took only a few breaths.","The most troublesome part was cultivating the Secret Art of the Divine Eye.","After accelerating time, it took several years of cultivation to fully combine the treasure with the secret technique.","“Whew!”","He let out a long breath and said bitterly, “Still not enough. If only I had another Life Lotus!”","But such a good fortune wasn’t easy to come by.","He then took out the fifth metal plate.","Following the blueprint carefully, his gains were significant.","It would take him quite some time to digest it all.","However, his Origin Source was depleting even faster.","This rate of depletion had now reached a point where he could clearly feel it.","According to what Gagarin had said, his days were numbered.","If he didn’t pick up the pace, he would truly become an empty shell.","Leaving the Ancient Domain Star, he once again stood atop the city wall. Only an instant had passed in the outside world.","He began to examine the cultivation insights left on the city wall.","Ordinary people’s insights were useless to him.","What he was interested in were the rumors left behind by Jiang Haichao.","After inquiring with a nearby cultivator, he arrived at a beacon tower atop the city wall.","There stood a tower, and on the wall below it, there was an eye carved into the stone.","This was the insight left by Jiang Haichao.","He immersed himself in it.","There was indeed some value.","However, it wasn’t much.","Especially regarding the insights on the Secret Art of the Divine Eye, which were pitifully few.","There was also a bit of insight on the Sixth Rotation.","He didn’t need that.","As for the Seventh Rotation, there was only one word: “Life.”","Carefully pondering over it, he realized it contained quite a bit of information.","“It’s a pity there’s only one word. If I had the entire set of insights, how wonderful that would be!” Jian Wushuang felt a tinge of unwillingness in his heart.","Hmm?","His eyebrows twitched as he spotted a hidden secret within the writing.","It was a small hidden message embedded within.","“Seek life, forget death, the serpent spirit will emerge. The boundless Origin Spirit will once again walk the earth.”","A poem!","Child’s play, really.","Its meaning was simple.","To seek life, one must forget death. The appearance of the serpent spirit, however, was a bit strange.","Jian Wushuang didn’t dwell too much on it.","The boundless Origin Spirit probably referred to the Origin Spirit Sect.","“Is there something wrong with the Origin Spirit Sect?”","“Or perhaps within the Origin Spirit Sect, there lies something about the life of the Seventh Rotation?”","Jian Wushuang’s mind raced. Looking at the last sentence again, “Walk the earth again!”","“Could this be Jiang Haichao talking about himself?”","If that were the case, it was indeed arrogant. But not surprising, considering he held the top position across the Nine Regions of Space and Time. Saying such a thing wasn’t necessarily boasting.","“Looks like I’ll have to visit the Origin Spirit Sect!”","As Jian Wushuang was contemplating, a powerful aura suddenly descended.","Accompanying it were several familiar presences.","“Hm?”","He turned his gaze to the city wall.","At the forefront was a pale, hawk-nosed elder.","Beside him stood a woman in plain robes, her skin smooth, the hem of her skirt fluttering gently. Her face was cold, and her eyes held stories untold.","Her aura resembled that of Chen Shengwu, indicating she was likely also from the Chen family.","Jian Wushuang hadn’t expected this group to find him so quickly.","Shaking his head with a sigh, he muttered, “Trouble!”","“Boy, you’re dead today. How dare you lay a hand on someone from the Chen family in Chaos City!”","Chen Shengwu sneered, “Today, I’ll show you just how fearsome the Chen family is!”","“Auntie, this is the brat who snatched the treasure I was about to buy from a shop earlier. He even injured Uncle Zhang!”","The cold-faced woman raised her brow slightly, casting her gaze upon Jian Wushuang.","His entire cultivation was laid bare to her.","“Little one, you’re just an Immortal, yet you managed to injure Protector Zhang. Is it because of the vine wrapped around your arm?”","As soon as she spoke, Jian Wushuang’s skin prickled with goosebumps.","It had been a long time since anyone had called him “little one.”","Taking a deep breath, he replied leisurely, “Little girl, you’re quite pretty. Why speak with such a pretentious tone?”","“Impudent! How dare you speak to the Saintess like that?” the hawk-nosed elder bellowed, “This is the Chen family’s matriarch and the Saintess of the Origin Spirit Sect. Just for that one remark, you deserve to die ten times over!”","Jian Wushuang spread his hands indifferently and said, “Then come on, make your move.”","He didn’t care at all.","The vine would protect him!","“Heh, you’ve got quite a temper for a little one,” Chen Qingling chuckled softly, “But I’m not here for revenge. I just want to see the vine wrapped around your arm.”"]},{"number":6487,"title":"Chapter 6487: Little Guy?","paragraphs":["Chapter 6487: Little Guy?","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Understood!” Jian Wushuang flicked his hand, and the dark red vine shot out instantly.","Each vine held a power of 15 million units of divine power.","Chen Qingling also swung her sleeve, intercepting the incoming vine.","She could sense that Jian Wushuang wasn’t going all out.","It was merely a test.","...","But she was more intrigued by the vine itself.","“How do you have such a vine?” Chen Qingling asked in surprise. “Have you perhaps been to the Serpent’s Secret Realm?”","The Serpent’s Secret Realm lay on the other side of the Northern Corner Domain, and even those at the peak couldn’t cross the violent airflow.","Only someone at the Tribulation level could traverse it.","In her mind, it was impossible for Jian Wushuang, a mere True Immortal, to have done that.","Jian Wushuang was equally surprised. How could a bumpkin like her recognize the Gui Yun Vine?","This vine was a manifestation of the World Tree’s leaves.","Could it be that this world also had Gui Yun Vines?","“You recognize it?”","“I’ve seen it!”","Chen Qingling’s eyes sparkled with urgency as she pressed, “Tell me, did you acquire this from the Serpent’s Secret Realm?”","“No,” Jian Wushuang answered truthfully.","Since she couldn’t harm him, he was curious why she knew of the Gui Yun Vine and why she mentioned the Serpent’s Secret Realm. Could the two really be connected?","His interest was piqued.","Chen Qingling seemed a bit disappointed but still pleased to have seen the Gui Yun Vine. Her tone softened even more.","“Little guy, I hear you’ve been scouring the city for treasures. I assume it’s to feed this vine?”","“Yes!”","He spoke both truth and falsehood.","Chen Qingling felt she had a grip on Jian Wushuang and offered, “I can help you. You can have as many treasures as you need, but you must do me a favor!”","“Auntie!” Chen Shengwu, watching the exchange, felt something was off.","Weren’t they here to settle scores?","Why had this turned into a friendly conversation?","“Shut up!”","Chen Qingling shot him a glare, and Chen Shengwu dared not utter another word.","“What do you need me to do?” Jian Wushuang was now curious.","This seemed like an excellent opportunity.","Not only was she familiar with the Serpent’s Secret Realm, but she was also the Saintess of the Yuanling Divine Sect.","There was a lot of potential here!","Chen Qingling smiled inwardly and suggested, “Shall we discuss this somewhere more private?”","“Fine.”","Jian Wushuang immediately sent a message to Hei Qiu and the others, telling them not to worry about him.","He then followed Chen Qingling to the Chen residence, ignoring Chen Shengwu and the others, and entered Chen Qingling’s private courtyard.","The courtyard was tastefully arranged with an antique style.","There were mountains and streams, along with an ancient tree.","“Please!” Chen Qingling gestured.","Jian Wushuang sat down gracefully, sipping the high-grade tea she had brewed herself.","Chen Qingling, the Saintess of Yuanling Divine Sect, was at the peak of the Eight Tribulations Realm.","She had also mastered the Secret Eye technique, reaching the fourth transformation.","Her peak combat power likely exceeded 30 million units of divine power.","Yet, she treated him so courteously.","This favor must be a challenging one.","“This is the list of treasures I need. Take a look,” he said, sliding a jade slip over.","Chen Qingling didn’t even glance at it. “I agree.”","That was too quick.","She didn’t even bother to look, outshining him in generosity.","“Little guy...”","“Wait!” Jian Wushuang’s face darkened, and he frowned. “There’s one more condition!”","“Speak!” Chen Qingling’s eyes gleamed.","Jian Wushuang took a deep breath and said seriously, “My name is Jian Wushuang. Please stop calling me ‘little guy’ from now on!”","The term made him cringe. It sent shivers down his spine.","The only ones who had the right to call him that were the Star Spirits or his old mentor.","No one else had earned that privilege.","It wasn’t that he looked down on the people of this world—it was simply that they didn’t measure up.","“Alright, little guy,” Chen Qingling replied with a gentle smile.","Jian Wushuang almost spat out blood.","“Haha!”","Chen Qingling covered her mouth and giggled.","“Alright, I won’t tease you anymore. I’ll have someone send the treasure to you later.”","“As for my condition, when you cultivate the power of Long Vine to the level of a Universe Master at the Ninth Tribulation, I will tell you!”","Jian Wushuang asked in surprise, “Aren’t you afraid I’ll back out by then?”","“You can try!” Chen Qingling smiled, but the domineering look in her eyes sent a chill through Jian Wushuang’s heart.","She truly was a native, always speaking so arrogantly.","“I have one more condition!” Jian Wushuang continued. “I have a friend who practices the Divine Eye technique. I heard your Sect Master of the Yuanling Divine Sect has cultivated the Divine Eye to unfathomable depths. Could I borrow the records he left behind to study?”","Chen Qingling’s eyebrows moved slightly. “Yes.”","“But you must first join the Yuanling Divine Sect. That’s the rule, and not even I can change that!”","Jian Wushuang decisively responded, “Alright!”","The two quickly reached an agreement.","Jian Wushuang was then arranged to stay in a small courtyard, while Chen Qingling took the list of treasures and went to search for them.","However, when she saw the list, she couldn’t help but be surprised!","“This little guy is truly greedy!”","But thinking that the stronger Long Vine became, the more it would help her, she stopped worrying about it.","Even if it cost her everything, she had to gather these treasures.","What she didn’t know was that the treasures weren’t for Long Vine at all, but for Jian Wushuang himself.","Luckily, she had no idea what treasures were truly required for Long Vine’s growth.","A few days later.","In the sky above the Chen family estate, a group of figures was concealed in the void.","“What is Brother Wushuang up to?”","“My strength has grown so much, yet he’s still indulging in such petty favors!”","Xiang Yang crossed his arms and looked down at the courtyard below, his expression dark.","“Is Jian Wushuang setting up another plan?”","“I wonder what he’s up to this time!” Jiu Chen pondered, thinking Jian Wushuang was laying down a major scheme.","“Uncle Wushuang wouldn’t have lost interest in my mother, right? How can he be so close to that woman?” Jiang Ni’s cold eyes flashed, feeling a bit disgruntled.","Only Hei Qiu, with his small beady eyes darting around, stayed silent, his mind at ease.","Inside the courtyard.","Jian Wushuang accepted the ring Chen Qingling handed him, elated.","This was even faster than robbing someone.","In just a few days, he had gathered all the treasures.","Now, his Seventh Turn of the Divine Eye technique could reach completion.","As for reaching perfection, that would depend on his comprehension.","Treasures could only lead him to the door.","Cultivation depended on... human connections and experiences.","After all, this wasn’t his first time cultivating.","Over the years, he had risen to great heights, fallen to the depths, climbed back to the peak, and then fallen again...","The path of cultivation had long ceased to be difficult for him.","The only real challenge left was the Divine Eye technique.","Without further ado, Jian Wushuang didn’t stand on ceremony with Chen Qingling. After informing her that he would be going into seclusion, he promptly sent her away.","However, her aura still lingered around, indicating that she was wary, afraid he would take the treasures and run.","“Natives will always be natives!” Jian Wushuang muttered, hands behind his back as he re-entered the house. Suddenly, he called out, “Have you all seen enough?”","“If you’re so idle, why don’t you go scout the Giant Serpent Secret Realm first?”","Swoosh!","Several figures appeared in the room. Hei Qiu, being the most obedient, immediately stood by Jian Wushuang’s side, while the other three, led by Jiang Ni, stood to the left and right—Xiang Yang and Jiu Chen flanking her."]},{"number":6488,"title":"Chapter 6488: Opportunity","paragraphs":["Chapter 6488: Opportunity","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Brother Wushuang, aren’t you being a bit too cautious?” Xiang Yang casually sat in the chair and said leisurely, “No one here can threaten us. Why waste time? Whatever you want, I’ll snatch it for you. Like that Chen Qingling outside...”","After speaking, he shot Jian Wushuang a mischievous grin, his expression implying something Jian Wushuang surely understood.","Jiang Ni noticed this and blushed slightly. She hurriedly changed the topic, “Uncle Wushuang, aren’t you going with us to the Giant Serpent Secret Realm?”","She was worried that Jian Wushuang might end up trapped here.","As for Jiu Chen, he was indifferent. After all, he had already reached the level of a Demigod. Whether he ventured out or remained in seclusion, there was no way for him to break through. The opportunity required was far too great. It might even be necessary to journey to the Heavens to find such an opportunity, or for Jian Wushuang to produce some bizarre inheritance that he could benefit from freely.","...","In the face of everyone’s questions, Jian Wushuang remained calm.","The path he needed to take was different from theirs. It wasn’t something that could be solved by adventuring or cultivating in seclusion. He needed to explore this world little by little, unlocking its secrets and gathering members of the God Eye Clan.","After all, the God Eye secret technique was of utmost importance.","He had a premonition: once the secret technique reached perfection, it might just be the key to leaving this world and the beginning of everything he would face.","“I won’t be leaving for now. I still have some matters to attend to here. You don’t need to worry about me. Go ahead to the Giant Serpent Secret Realm and gather useful information!”","Hearing this, the group didn’t argue any further. After leaving Black Prison behind, they disappeared from the room.","However, before they left, Jian Wushuang had given the three of them a task.","That task was to investigate the core area of the Giant Serpent Secret Realm and engrave the formations within.","This was crucial. Without understanding the formations, they wouldn’t be able to enter the core region.","Unless the formations themselves allowed them to enter.","Jiang Ni took this task seriously.","Jiu Chen and Xiang Yang were a bit confused, but considering that the Giant Serpent Secret Realm was a place that even the Nine Heavens and the Heavens above feared, it surely hid great secrets. Now that Jian Wushuang wanted to comprehend the formations, they believed it wouldn’t be long before they could enter the core of the secret realm and explore its vast depths.","Thinking of this, both of them were inwardly delighted. This was a grand opportunity.","As for whether Jian Wushuang could decipher the formations, in their eyes, there was nothing Jian Wushuang couldn’t accomplish.","Unfortunately!","After the others left, Jian Wushuang encountered a major problem.","The evolution of Gui Yun Vine had gone smoothly, but the treasures needed for its ultimate form far exceeded what had been prepared.","This was something even Jian Wushuang hadn’t anticipated, nor had Gui Yun Vine itself.","Although it had advanced to its ultimate form, it hadn’t broken through to the Universe God level. Yet the evolved Gui Yun Vine possessed power that could make even Universe Gods tremble.","Each of its thousand vines carried divine power equivalent to 99,999,999 units.","When combined, it appeared immense.","But in reality, it was just a thousand near-Universe Gods, as the power of each vine couldn’t stack.","However, the combat power of over a thousand near-Universe Gods combined made dealing with Universe Gods below the four-star level quite easy.","This brought Jian Wushuang some comfort. After all, he would soon be exploring the Giant Serpent Secret Realm, and without some top-tier combat strength, there was no guarantee of safety.","External power, in the end, was unpredictable.","After helping Gui Yun Vine complete its evolution, Jian Wushuang continued his research on the God Eye secret technique.","The seventh level was incredibly difficult.","“Endless... life...”","Jian Wushuang slowly opened his eyes.","Cultivating alone and trying to find that spark of inspiration was too challenging.","Earlier, even the insights left behind by Jiang Haichao had been immensely beneficial to him.","The other party’s cultivation experiences were crucial.","He had to obtain them.","It was time to have a chat with Chen Qingling.","“Master?” Black Prison stood up, looking at Jian Wushuang.","“I’m heading out for a bit. Follow me from the shadows.”","“As you wish!”","One light, one shadow.","After leaving the Chen residence, they headed for the Yuanling Sacred Sect within the city.","“Who goes there?”","A disciple guarding the sect stepped forward to inquire.","His strength wasn’t much, but his tone was rather arrogant.","As expected from the number one sect, which had suppressed the Ancient Imperial Dynasty for years.","Jian Wushuang gave a slight bow and said, “I’ve come to visit the Sacred Lady.”","After speaking, he handed over a token.","The disciple’s expression froze for a moment upon seeing the situation, but then his attitude softened.","He immediately led Jian Wushuang to the Sacred Mountain.","Halfway up the mountain.","“Let him come in alone!”","A cold voice echoed from inside the cave.","No need to ask, it was Chen Qingling herself.","She was a disciple of Jiang Haichao and also the Saintess, effectively the true ruler of the entire Sacred Sect.","Even the Sect Master of Yuanling Sacred Sect wasn’t as powerful as Chen Qingling, let alone possessing her level of talent.","Despite this, she still insisted that Jian Wushuang join the Yuanling Sacred Sect before offering up Jiang Haichao’s cultivation insights.","Jian Wushuang had no choice but to reluctantly join.","Once he entered the cave, there was no formality.","They directly arranged the initiation ceremony.","Making oaths like this was something Jian Wushuang had done countless times.","Unfortunately, none of these oaths ever bound him.","After making the vow, a faint smile appeared on Chen Qingling’s face.","“Chen Daoist, now that I’ve joined the sect, the cultivation insights...” Jian Wushuang looked at her, his eyes filled with anticipation.","Chen Qingling’s smile faded upon hearing his words, her tone turning serious. “Jian Wushuang, I won’t hide it from you. My master’s cultivation insights are kept in the Dao Enlightenment Pavilion at the top of the Sacred Mountain. If you wish to comprehend them, you must enter the pavilion. I imagine... this won’t be too difficult for you, will it?”","Her words implied that since he had already joined the Yuanling Sacred Sect, if he wanted to obtain the cultivation insights, he’d have to rely on his own abilities.","Jian Wushuang wasn’t particularly concerned, but when he used his thought power to investigate, he was left speechless.","The Dao Enlightenment Pavilion had three levels.","The first level corresponded to Dao Lords.","The second level corresponded to Dao Lords of the Imperial rank.","The third level corresponded to Universe Masters!","Jiang Haichao’s cultivation insights were located at the very top of the third level.","One would need to reach the level of a demigod to fully comprehend the complete set of insights.","The insights on the first and second levels naturally corresponded to Dao Lords and Dao Lords of the Imperial rank, which were of little use to Jian Wushuang.","At best, he could only glean a small fraction of the mysteries from them.","Jian Wushuang’s expression was grim, but inwardly he was laughing coldly at how much they underestimated him.","“Saintess, you’re absolutely right, everything relies on oneself!”","With that, he flicked his sleeve and left.","Since they were unwilling to hand the insights over directly, he would take matters into his own hands!","That Dao Enlightenment Pavilion couldn’t stop him.","Even though he was currently just a mortal.","But not an ordinary mortal—he had already mastered the sixth turn of the God Eye Technique.","Moreover, he had comprehended an even more perfected version of the God Eye’s true inheritance.","“Blackprison, you go in first. See if you can directly snatch those cultivation insights!”","Standing before the pavilion, Jian Wushuang didn’t enter right away.","Instead, he sent Blackprison to take them!","The simple-minded Blackprison, thinking Jian Wushuang was about to go in himself, hadn’t expected to be sent in instead.","Still, with his demigod-level strength, Blackprison feared nothing and was completely obedient to Jian Wushuang.","Hiding his presence, Blackprison took a step into the Dao Enlightenment Pavilion.","The disciples of Yuanling Sacred Sect who were coming and going didn’t notice Blackprison at all.","They only found Jian Wushuang’s unfamiliar face somewhat curious.","There were few disciples of the Sacred Sect.","Each one was a genius from different regions.","In total, there were only a little over a thousand disciples on the Sacred Mountain.","About a hundred of them were Dao Lords, half of whom were Ultimate Dao Lords, while the other half had mastered the second level of the God Eye Technique."]},{"number":6489,"title":"Chapter 6489: There’s Life","paragraphs":["Chapter 6489: There’s Life","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","They were all heaven-defying existences.","There were nearly a hundred Dao Lords, each possessing divine power of at least one hundred thousand units.","As for the Universe Masters, they were unknown, forming the absolutere of the Sacred Sect.","Among them were several Great Realm Kings of the Eight Tribulations level.","With such strength, they were able to firmly maintain their reputation as the First Sacred Sect.","The Dao Enlightenment Pavilion laid the foundation for the future of these powerful beings.","Because within the Dao Enlightenment Pavilion, the true teachings left behind by past sages were all cultivation insights accumulated overuntless years. Howuld it not inspire longing in others?","While Jian Wushuang was observing his surroundings, a black figure suddenly got flung out from within.","It was none other than Gui Yun, and his terrifying figure made everyone around freeze for a moment before they realized what was happening.","“Enemy attack!”","“Someone has broken into the Dao Enlightenment Pavilion! Quickly report to the Sect Master!”","“Activate the sect’s protective formation!”","Jian Wushuang hadn’t expected Gui Yun to be kicked out and appear so openly, which made him even more curious about the Dao Enlightenment Pavilion.","He strolled casually into the pavilion,mpletely ignoring the chaotic disciples of the Yuanling Sect around him.","Before entering, he didn’t forget tollect Gui Yun into the Nine Prison Pagoda.","But all of this was invisible to outsiders.","After he entered the Dao Enlightenment Pavilion, Chen Qingling also appeared outside the pavilion.","Herld eyes carefully examined the Dao Enlightenment Pavilion and the entire Sacred Mountain, personally manipulating the grand formation.","She didn’t sense any other aura.","However, the remnants of Gui Yun’s aura still lingered.","This meant that the intruder not only entered the Dao Enlightenment Pavilion but also left effortlessly.","Either the opponent’s strength was terrifyingly immense, possibly reaching the Universe God level or even higher, or there was a traitor within the sect who had shielded this mysterious powerhouse.","Chen Qingling glanced at the crowd that had gathered.","She didn’t say much but did think of Jian Wushuang. However, she doubted he had the ability for something like this.","She then turned to the Sect Master and bowed. “I believe this matter doesn’t need to be publicized...”","“Oh?” The new Sect Master, Cai Tianyuan, was slightly surprised but then nodded in understanding.","Next to him, the Great Elder showed no expression. His old face, full of wrinkles, and hislorless eyes appearedmpletely hollow.","But inside, his thoughts were swirling madly.","“What is happening?”","“Could it be that the Imperial Dynasty had arranged for someone else to infiltrate Yuanling Sect?”","The Great Elder haduntless speculations running through his mind, but none of them showed on his face.","Soon, the incident was suppressed, and the upper echelons reinforced their defenses.","At the same time, they secretly began recalling the powerful beings who were out training back to Chaos City.","In the shadows, the sound of secretive discussions grew louder.","But none of thisncerned Jian Wushuang.","After entering the Dao Enlightenment Pavilion, Jian Wushuang began browsing through the cultivation insights left behind.","Each insightntained themplete life journey of a Dao Lord who defied the heavens.","Through these rrds, Jian Wushuang felt as though he was witnessing the lives of these individuals.","“Dao title: Piaoxue.”","“Successor, if you are reading my enlightenment, you are likely at the limits of the Dao Lord level. Remember, merging with the Dao is never the true barrier for a strong individual. It is the fear in your heart!”","Reading these words, Jian Wushuang smiled slightly.","Although these insights were of little use to him, seeing the life experiences of these outstanding figures reminded him of his former self.","He, too, had once left behind his own enlightenment.","At that time, he was still in the Qishen Temple, and the greatest threat wasn’t yet Miesheng.","Back then... there were so many memories.","But as the most brilliant Dao Lord of that era, his path had always been resolute.","Just like this Dao Lord called Piaoxue.","Through the Origin Source, Jian Wushuanguld sense that this individual had already perished.","They had fallen at the stage of merging with the Dao.","For Dao Lords who defied the heavens, the difficulty of merging with the Dao was such that even a Universe Master would shake their head.","After reviewing the insights of one Dao Lord after another, Jian Wushuang’s greatest realization was fearlessness!","That sense of fearlessness reignited a small spark of light within the heart he had long hidden away.","A surge of hot bloodursed through him, bringing clarity to his mind.","He ascended to the snd floor.","As he passed through the light curtain, an overwhelming pressure from the Dao of an Emperor instantly descended upon him.","Naturally, Jian Wushuang blocked it with ease.","It was only then that he began to inquire with Hei Qiu about what had transpired since they entered the Dao Enlightenment Pavilion.","Since entering, he had only sensed two auras, both at the quasi-Universe God level, which shouldn’t have posed much trouble for Hei Qiu.","“Master, don’t be fooled by the aura of the true spirit here. Itntains life; it’s not just a spiritual entity!”","Hei Qiu spoke with a hint of agitation. After entering the pavilion, he had headed straight for the third floor. The true spirit and formation spirit here posed little threat to him. However, when he tried to take the cultivation insights left by Jiang Haichao, a different formation had forcefully ejected him.","With just a light touch, the formation had thrown him out of the Dao Enlightenment Pavilion.","Its strength was undeniably at the level of a Universe God.","Moreover, the true spirit hidden within itntained life.","It was a powerful being guarding Jiang Haichao’s cultivation insights.","A smile played at therner of Jian Wushuang’s lips. He had suspected this place wouldn’t be so simple. Chen Qingling had led him here with a clear purpose in mind.","“Fellow Daoist, why hide? This is your territory. Surely you aren’t afraid of a mere mortal like me who hasn’t yet grasped the Origin Dao?”","He stood with his hands behind his back, his aura calm and unassuming.","The top floor of the Dao Enlightenment Pavilion fell into a brief silence.","Then, a pair of eyes materialized from the gathering black mist,ldly staring at Jian Wushuang.","“You are no mere mortal!” a raspy voice came from the mist.","Hearing this, Jian Wushuang was a little surprised but maintained hismposure as he said, “Fellow Daoist, since you brought me here, why not state your purpose openly? There’s no need for secrecy.”","He needed insights into the Seventh Transformation, and since both parties had their needs, a transaction seemed fitting.","If a fight broke out, Hei Qiu might not be able to defeat the opponent, but once Gui Yun emerged, theyuld certainly subdue them. Thus, Jian Wushuang had thenfidence to propose a deal or, if necessary, flip the table.","“Heh heh...”","“Boy, while you are extraordinary, as you said yourself, you haven’t yet mastered the Origin Dao!”","“So, here, you are not qualified to negotiate with me!”","As the voice faded, six black chains shot out from the mist, aiming to capture Hei Qiu.","The black mist didn’t see Jian Wushuang as a threat and thought it safest to take down Hei Qiu first.","However, just to be sure, it also sent out part of the mist to seize Jian Wushuang.","“Master, watch out!”","Hei Qiu roared in fury, his body expanding to tens of thousands of feet tall, releasing a billion units of divine power that filled the entire Dao Enlightenment Pavilion.","The force was so great that it causeduntless beams of light to shoot out from the pavilion, piercing through space itself.","This scene naturally attracted attention from the outside, but at that moment, the outside world was in chaos.","High above the Sacred Mountain, a towering city had descended an hour ago and launched an attack on the Holy Sect. All of the sect’s strongest members were busy resisting the assault and had no time toncern themselves with what was happening inside the pavilion.","The Holy Maiden Chen Qingling was currently fighting three opponents at once, still holding the upper hand. Every now and then, she glanced toward the Dao Enlightenment Pavilion, her eyes filled withncern.","“Hmph, Your Highness, how arrogant! To fight me and still dare to be distracted!”"]},{"number":6490,"title":"Chapter 6490: Road to Ascendant (1)","paragraphs":["Chapter 6490: Road to Ascendant (1)","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","An elderly man with white hair raised the Supreme Imperial City with one hand, while holding the Haotian Divine Staff in the other, exuding an awe-inspiring presence.","Despite his strength, two experts at the peak of the Ninth Tribulation had to coordinate to even challenge Chen Qingling.","Chen Qingling’s expression shifted slightly as she bent down, whispering softly. Majestic harmonies descended, forcing the three opponents back once more.","With a flash, her figure darted towards the Enlightenment Tower.","“Master, I hope you’re right!”","Chen Qingling glanced at the battlefield below. The Sacred Sect was now at a disadvantage. Although she was powerful, the enemy had someone capable of restraining her. Defeat was inevitable.","The foundation of the opposing side was no weaker than that of the Tianyuan Sacred Sect. It was an even more ancient imperial dynasty.","...","Inside the Enlightenment Tower.","Six chains tightly bound the Black Prisoner.","No matter how much the Black Prisoner struggled, it couldn’t break free.","“A puppet crafted by the God Eye Clan, its power truly endless. But unfortunately for you, you encountered...”","Before the figure formed from black mist could finish speaking, a purple vine shot toward its chest.","The divine power contained within made the figure’s face turn pale in shock. It was almost on par with the Black Prisoner.","Terrified, he quickly retreated, and as he did, six black chains emerged again, securely locking down the Gui Yun Vine.","“Boy, you’re not very strong, yet you sure have quite a few treasures!”","“Hmm?”","Just as he was gloating, he suddenly noticed that countless vines had appeared around him, numbering in the hundreds, maybe even thousands. Each vine was at the level of a quasi-Universe God.","A terrifying pressure instantly immobilized him.","Jian Wushuang raised his hand and dispersed the surrounding black mist with ease, calmly walking toward the mist figure.","“Without some treasures, do you think I’d dare come in?”","“And another thing, stop calling me ‘boy’ all the time. I have a name—it’s Jian Wushuang, and I might even be a few years older than you!”","“Youngsters these days are so impatient!”","Shaking his head with a sigh, Jian Wushuang added nonchalantly, “Gui Yun, shatter his Origin Source!”","Buzz!","In the next instant, thousands of vines from Gui Yun pierced into the black mist.","Boom!","With a muffled sound, the black mist dispersed, revealing a faint, ghostly figure.","“Jiang Haichao!” Jian Wushuang’s brows furrowed slightly. “So it really was you. Looks like you’ve had your eye on me since our first encounter!”","At this moment, Jiang Haichao, though terrified, still clung to a sliver of hope. He sneered, “Heh, this is merely a clone of mine. Do as you please. My true self...”","“Your true self?” Jian Wushuang interrupted.","His eyes glinted as he saw through the threads of cause and effect surrounding Jiang Haichao.","He even peered into Jiang Haichao’s memories, consolidating them all into a single thread in an instant.","After going through them, Jian Wushuang continued, “You’re actually the reincarnation of a Universe God suppressed in the Shanhai Secret Realm!”","“How... how do you know?” Jiang Haichao was completely stunned.","He had no idea how terrifying Jian Wushuang’s abilities were. Fear now colored his eyes.","From the memories he had plundered, Jian Wushuang learned that Jiang Haichao was merely a reincarnation of a Universe God’s thought power, suppressed beneath the Shanhai Secret Realm.","That explained his exceptional comprehension ability.","If Jian Wushuang wasn’t mistaken, Jiang Haichao’s true self was a quasi-Five Star Universe God.","Such power, even among the Upper Realm or the God Eye Clan, was incredibly formidable.","Jian Wushuang frowned as he pondered the question. His opponent wasn’t even from the God Eye Clan, so how had they been suppressed?","He sifted through his memories but couldn’t find an explanation.","This meant that the one who sealed Jiang Haichao’s true body must be someone far more powerful than Jian Wushuang himself.","“Could it be my senior brother?” Jian Wushuang raised an eyebrow, then softened his tone as he spoke. “Jiang Haichao, how about we make a deal?”","Jiang Haichao, who appeared as dejected as a wilted eggplant, perked up at the mention of cooperation. He nodded immediately, “What do you have in mind?”","“Is your God Eye Secret Art at the Ninth Transformation?”","Jian Wushuang’s eyes gleamed with excitement. This was his chance to end things once and for all.","The Ninth Transformation!","If Jiang Haichao helped him, breaking through the seventh floor of the Nine Tribulation Pagoda wouldn’t just be a possibility—he might directly ascend to the peak.","Without hesitation, Jian Wushuang captured Jiang Haichao and placed him inside the Nine Tribulation Pagoda, activating the time acceleration within.","Outside, just a moment had passed, but inside, countless cycles of time had already flown by.","When Jian Wushuang finally reappeared at the Martial Arts Pavilion, he was completely transformed.","It wasn’t just his aura that had changed, even his clothes were different.","Now, he wore a black robe adorned with eight dark-gold eye motifs.","Each of those eyes represented something significant.","He was now just one step away from claiming the peak.","Furthermore, he had seen that Ghost Eye Senior Brother again, and this robe had been left for him by his senior brother.","In addition to the robe, his senior brother had also left him a message.","On the ninth floor, there existed a Dharma body belonging to Teacher Xuan Yi—someone from the future!","At this moment, Jian Wushuang felt an unstoppable surge of motivation.","The truth was about to be revealed.","And once it was, he would undergo his divine tribulation.","“Master!” Black Prison called out in his usual straightforward tone.","Jian Wushuang smiled faintly at the sound, “Let’s go. Let’s see what’s happening outside.”","With a casual wave, Jian Wushuang dismantled the formation around them and left the Martial Arts Pavilion.","The formation was a simplified version of the one found in the Shanhai Secret Realm. Jiang Haichao had spent years studying it in hopes of cracking it.","But Jian Wushuang had broken it as if it were child’s play.","Now, it was time to break the Shanhai Secret Realm and release Jiang Haichao’s true body.","And perhaps even the endless army of the God Eye Clan.","And more importantly... the serpent buried beneath the Shanhai Realm—the Serpent of the Heavens.","Swoosh!!","As Jian Wushuang and Black Prison stepped out of the pavilion, they were met with darkness.","The once-chaotic city had disappeared, along with the surrounding wilderness.","Looking up, Jian Wushuang saw an imperial city, grand and imposing, floating above them.","The Martial Arts Pavilion had been directly below this imperial city, held down under its immense pressure.","With a single thought, Jian Wushuang sensed that Chen Qingling was still alive. However, she was entangled with countless lines of karma, likely carrying a group of disciples from the Tianyuan Sacred Sect as they fled toward the Shanhai Secret Realm.","She was probably trying to rally her forces and return for revenge.","“So, your disciple defied your orders and... fled with people!”","Jian Wushuang chuckled lightly.","In his mind, Jiang Haichao’s voice echoed awkwardly, “You’ve caught me. My disciple is too soft-hearted. The original plan was to besiege you and steal the treasures from your body. Just that puppet, Black Prison, is far more valuable than all the treasures Tianyuan Sacred Sect has accumulated!”","“Hahaha!” Jian Wushuang laughed heartily, “But she made the right choice!”","Indeed, if they had tried to attack him, Chen Qingling would either have been killed on the spot or captured. And Tianyuan Sacred Sect would have been annihilated.","Just as they finished speaking, the imperial city above them began to tremble violently.","It was Black Prison. He had expanded to a size of tens of thousands of miles, effortlessly lifting the entire imperial city with his sheer strength.","“Stop playing around. We have important matters to attend to.”","Jian Wushuang had no interest in these trivial conflicts. Time was of the essence.","After collecting the Martial Arts Pavilion, he and Black Prison headed toward the Shanhai Secret Realm.","The imperial city narrowly avoided destruction.","“Your Majesty, that black puppet just now...”","“It must be a Universe God!”","“Hurry, while they’re gone, let’s leave this place at once!”"]},{"number":6491,"title":"Chapter 6491: Road to Ascendant (2)","paragraphs":["Chapter 6491: Road to Ascendant (2)","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Jian Wushuang hovered outside the Nine Mountains, his gaze fixed on the vast secret realm before him. The Mountain and Sea Secret Realm was one of the most terrifying domains in the Nine Regions of Time and Space, forged over endless ages. Towering mountains rose and fell, while seawater flowed backward, surging around the nine surrounding peaks. Chains swung back and forth, their mere presence enough to annihilate a Universe Master at the Ninth Tribulation stage.","To cross the chains and enter the core of the realm required the strength of a Universe God. This was merely the threshold to the heart of the secret realm.","Jian Wushuang could sense the power within this place. Once fully activated, it would become a terrifying supreme treasure. Unfortunately, it could not be moved, though it ranked among the finest time-space artifacts. The power it unleashed could wipe out even a Six-Star Universe God. Only the Universe Gods of the Heavens could craft such a grand treasure, designed as a formation-level weapon. However, compared to the treasures Jian Wushuang once wielded, it was insignificant.","If his Beast God Weapon had descended upon this place, it could crush the entire Nine Regions of Time and Space. Even the Heavens themselves would be shattered into fragments. That weapon was capable of destroying endless universes.","Jian Wushuang glanced at the realm before disappearing in a flash.","“Xiang Yang, wait here for me!” he instructed.","With a single teleportation, he quickly reached the depths of the Mountain and Sea Secret Realm. There were no adventurers here, as the entry threshold was the level of a Universe Master at the Eighth Tribulation stage.","“I’ve found her!”","Instead of looking for Xiang Yang and the others first, Jian Wushuang located Chen Qingling, a disciple of Jiang Haichao.","At that moment, Chen Qingling was hiding in a tree hollow within an enormous ancient tree. The tree had a diameter of over ten billion miles and towered hundreds of trillions of miles high. Inside, it contained nine vast universes, and each leaf was an eternal world. Yet, this massive tree was but one of many in the Sea of Forest under the Eighth Mountain, inconspicuous among the rest.","“Why did you leave me behind, Your Highness?”","Jian Wushuang entered the hollow, which was a cosmic passage formed by the tree’s origin. The surroundings shimmered with vibrant colors, filled with the richest Origin Source energy, making it a holy land for cultivation.","“You... you’re Jian Wushuang?”","Chen Qingling was startled. Behind her stood dozens of young disciples, all of whom were at the first step of strength. Her expression changed dramatically as she stepped forward to shield them, her wary gaze fixed on Jian Wushuang. Simultaneously, she tried to contact her teacher, Jiang Haichao. Finally, after countless attempts, her teacher responded.","“An ally!”","Those simple words allowed Chen Qingling to exhale in relief.","Jian Wushuang stood with his hands behind his back, his expression calm. “Take your people and follow me,” he ordered.","The aura of purity surrounding her was an opportunity he couldn’t afford to miss, even if the chances were slim.","After locating Chen Qingling, Jian Wushuang wasted no time and moved swiftly toward the core of the Mountain and Sea Secret Realm, passing through the chain formation to reach the heart of the array. Xiang Yang and the others were already there.","Beyond the array lay an endless sea of blood—a crimson ocean formed from the obliteration of countless powerful beings. It was a sight of destruction, an ocean of blood forged from millennia of death.","Recalling the blood rain from years ago, it was said that when the Dao Lord fell, the Dao descended.","And the blood here all belonged to Universe Gods.","How many Dao paths must that have been?","The blood-colored ocean had existed for an eternity, having nurtured spiritual energy within it. It had even given birth to countless traces of powerful beings’ Dao. Each trace was sufficient to carve out a universe.","“The murderous aura is truly intense!”","Even though Jian Wushuang had seen much in his lifetime, he still found this terrifying.","No wonder this was the base camp for suppressing the Divine Eye Clan.","“Brother Wushuang, we haven’t even finished inscribing the formation, and you’ve already arrived. Do you perhaps have a way to break the formation here?” Xiang Yang asked curiously.","Jiu Chen and Jiang Ni also turned to look over.","They also noticed Chen Qingling, but the three of them ignored his presence.","Only Chen Qingling was surprised, not expecting Jian Wushuang to have such powerful companions.","She couldn’t see through Hei Qiu at all, and Jiang Ni’s appearance was completely hidden. Xiang Yang and Jiu Chen were a bit weaker, but they were still much stronger than her.","“I have already deciphered the formation!”","Jian Wushuang took out a miniature formation plate, and a powerful aura surged into the sky, blowing his sideburns upward.","In the ninth layer of the Nine Prison Pagoda, he had used time acceleration and perfected the Divine Eye secret technique to the eighth level. Deciphering this formation had naturally become an easy task.","Buzz!","As Jian Wushuang activated the formation, the surrounding chains began to rattle and retract.","The force they released left everyone around them breathless.","As the formation contracted further, the aura between heaven and earth became even more distinct.","Amidst the aura, a familiar presence erupted.","Or rather, only Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang found it familiar.","It was the aura of the outside world.","The aura from the Realm God Continent.","“This is...”","Xiang Yang’s eyes widened in disbelief, tears welling up in his eyes.","From the feeling of helplessness in the past to now regaining his peak, he had always yearned to leave this world.","Now, sensing the aura of the outside world again, his entire body trembled.","Jian Wushuang remained calm, for he had long known that this was the opportunity his teacher, Xuan Yi, had prepared for him. Naturally, he was content to explore this place.","“Nine mountains unite, seas divide!”","With a loud shout, the surrounding seawater began to evaporate.","The nine mountains began to merge.","The entire Ninefold Space-Time trembled.","At this moment, the most excited one was Jiang Haichao.","His true body was about to appear.","Jian Wushuang was equally thrilled because after suppressing the Divine Eye Clan, he would be able to break through and fully master the Divine Eye secret technique.","The ninth transformation of the Origin Source Dao would surpass even the Realm Beast Kings.","By then, he would be more powerful than the Divine King.","At this thought, he couldn’t help but look forward to it.","Meanwhile, in the distant Cosmic Sea.","Three thousand islands were interconnected, marking the end of the sea.","It was also the only path to the heavens.","Unfortunately, ever since a great battle took place, they could no longer enter the heavens.","They could only guard the three thousand islands.","Over endless ages, countless powerful beings had been born on these islands.","Any being capable of crossing the Cosmic Sea was at least at the Ninth Tribulation Realm.","Due to the outflow of power from the heavens, the three thousand islands had birthed three thousand Universe Gods.","The Starry Sky Palace.","It was the most powerful force on the three thousand islands, gathering all the Universe Gods there.","“Palace Master, something has happened in the Ninefold Space-Time!”","At the main seat of the palace, a voluptuous woman dressed in a colorful robe sat calmly. Her starry eyes glimmered as she said indifferently, “Bring the latest cultivator who has entered the islands to see me!”","The white-robed elder, who had spoken earlier, disappeared in a flash, soon returning with Jiang Haichao, the newest arrival to the islands.","By now, Jiang Haichao had completely transformed from his earlier state of distress, his aura entirely different.","“Haha, Palace Master, you must want to know what happened in the Ninefold Space-Time!” Jiang Haichao said arrogantly. “I might as well tell you—this world is about to change. You may not be able to enter the heavens, but I can!”","The Starry Sky Palace Master’s eyes brightened with interest. “You have a way?”","The reason they couldn’t enter was due to their lack of strength. Only a Five-Star Universe God could enter."]},{"number":6492,"title":"Chapter 6492: Finale","paragraphs":["Chapter 6492: Finale","Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Palace Master Xingyao, a four-star peak Universe God, was unable to enter the Heavens.","Now hearing Jiang Haichao claim he had a way in, of course, she was interested.","However, Jiang Haichao responded with a sneer, “Your strength is insufficient, so stop daydreaming. To be frank with you, my true form is about to emerge. If you’re smart, just wait and prepare to welcome my true form!”","After saying this, he chose to self-destruct.","Unfortunately, in front of a four-star peak Universe God, he wasn’t qualified to do so.","Palace Master Xingyao reached out her hand, firmly grasping Jiang Haichao in her palm.","After probing slightly, her expression immediately changed.","“It’s the Shanhai Secret Realm... You’re that serpent from the Shanhai Secret Realm?”","At this moment, she was no longer as composed.","If that serpent emerged, it could devour the entire Ninefold Space-Time. Next in line for disaster would be the Three Thousand Islands.","“Tsk tsk, it seems no one remembers my name—Fu Hai. They only remember the second soul of the Honorable Lord!”","Jiang Haichao’s eyes were filled with madness at this moment.","This avatar of his carried more memories.","These memories, even Jian Wushuang had not been able to search through.","Because the avatar that had been searched had its memories removed.","“Chen Gu, pass the order—immediately notify all Universe Gods to follow me to the Ninefold Space-Time and suppress the Shanhai Secret Realm!”","“Yes!”","The white-haired elder, Chen Gu, bowed and left.","As for Jiang Haichao, he was taken away by Palace Master Xingyao.","She then fell into deep thought.","Those were the days ruled by the Heavens.","That serpent...","As she was lost in thought, a beautiful figure entered.","“Mother, what happened? Why are we suddenly returning to the Ninefold Space-Time?”","The newcomer had a pair of purple eyes.","If Xiang Yang saw her, he would definitely go mad.","Because this person was Xing Luo.","An hour later, all the Universe Gods from the Three Thousand Islands had gathered. A mighty army of Universe Gods began their journey towards the Ninefold Space-Time.","At this time, they crossed the sea as if stepping through shallow waters.","Far away in the Shanhai Secret Realm, Jian Wushuang knew nothing of this.","Meanwhile, Jiang Haichao was still immersed in his joy, completely disregarding Palace Master Xingyao.","The difference between a four-star peak Universe God and an almost five-star Universe God was vast.","Not to mention, there was also the second soul of the Honorable Lord—a genuine six-star Universe God—capable of sweeping through everything.","Most importantly, he could finally leave this world and head to the legendary Realm God Continent.","“Hm?”","At this moment, Jian Wushuang slightly frowned and said in surprise, “Someone is blocking the door outside?”","“Who?”","Everyone immediately turned to look.","However, upon hearing about the outside, they were all confused.","Only Xiang Yang reacted, quickly asking, “What about your true form? Can you reach it now?”","“Of course I can, but the person blocking the door is a bit special!” Jian Wushuang said with an awkward smile.","The fact that even Jian Wushuang’s true form considered this person special made Xiang Yang gasp in surprise.","Although he had never seen Jian Wushuang’s true form, he had seen Jian Wushuang’s avatar back then, and that avatar had the combat strength of a seven-star Universe God.","Outside World.","The entire Realm God Continent had vanished. At this moment, it had completely merged into the Starry Sky.","In other words, the cover that had shielded it from chaos was gone.","Jian Wushuang’s true body had turned into a stone statue, standing tall in the midst of the Starry Sky.","His opponent was no stranger.","“Should I call you Realm God, or Jormungandr?”","Jian Wushuang’s ethereal figure flew out, facing the white serpent in mid-air.","A single eye was visible on the serpent’s forehead.","It stared at Jian Wushuang for a moment before speaking, “Jian Wushuang, you are indeed still alive!”","“The serpent beneath the Mountain and Sea Secret Realm wasn’t you, was it?” Jian Wushuang shook his head slightly and then added, “Regardless, we don’t have to be enemies. Why interfere with my plans?”","Jormungandr raised its massive head and let out a heavy breath. “You and I are destined to be rivals. This is fate. Without me, you cannot pass your Divine Tribulation, nor can you earn the title from Xuan Mingzi. Without that title... you will never ascend the Mountain of Chaos!”","“The Mountain of Chaos?” Jian Wushuang asked in surprise. “You certainly know a lot, but even if I don’t pass the Divine Tribulation, you still won’t be my match!”","As his words fell, the stone statue shattered.","Since the battle was inevitable, there was no need to hold back.","Jian Wushuang’s full power returned once again.","His eyes shone with fighting spirit as he unleashed his strongest attack.","“The Eighth Sword!”","“I shall call you... Mountain and Sea!”","Clang!","He drew his Tribulation Sword and gently swung it. The sword light turned into a vast river of stars, sweeping across half of the Starry Sky.","Unfortunately, the current Starry Sky was almost devoid of life.","Jian Wushuang could only sense the presence of life deep within the core of the Starry Sky, likely where the Realm Beasts had broken through.","But that didn’t concern him. What mattered was whether this sword could kill Jormungandr.","Buzz!","The sword light swept across.","Jormungandr’s figure blurred as it tried to evade.","But the power behind this sword was not something that could be nullified by shifting through space.","It carried the weight of karma, bloodlines, breath, soul, life, and even individual consciousness!","“Lost memories should not resurface in this world. The chaotic world will eventually be brought to order because of this!”","Jian Wushuang didn’t withdraw his sword but instead unleashed another strike.","“The Ninth Sword!”","It had no name, for it was born of chaos!","“This...”","Jormungandr was shocked.","“How can this be?”","“You haven’t even passed the Tribulation or ascended the mountain to earn a title. How can you kill me?”","This time, Jian Wushuang sheathed his sword and turned to enter the vortex below, which connected to the Mountain and Sea Secret Realm.","As for the sword light that had swept across the Starry Sky, it exploded in an instant.","Ever since his Thought power had merged with his true body after emerging from the Mountain and Sea Realm, he had not passed the Tribulation, but it was as if he had.","Or perhaps, because of the existence of chaos, he no longer needed to.","Now, all that remained was to conquer the ninth level of the Nine Prison Pagoda, and he would reach the pinnacle in one step.","Mountain and Sea Secret Realm!","A moment had passed in the outside world, but inside, centuries had flown by.","The Palace Master of Starshine, leading three thousand Universe Gods, had already reached the Mountain and Sea Secret Realm.","Thankfully, Jian Wushuang’s clone, the thousand-vine Guardian Yunhai, was able to hold them off for a moment.","At this moment, the Realm of Mountains and Seas was fully opened.","Jiang Haichao laughed heartily as waves surged.","Jiang Ni, meanwhile, became aware of the existence of the outside world, her eyes full of confusion.","Jiu Chen was worried, fearing that after offending the Palace Master of Xingyao, he would have no place to call home.","Xiang Yang, initially excited to leave, felt a surge of anger upon seeing Xing Luo.","All those years of love, tens of thousands of years of feelings, weren’t even worth a glance from her?","Xing Luo also noticed Jian Wushuang and Xiang Yang.","“It really is the two of you. I never expected that after all these years, you’d still be alive!” Xing Luo stood tall, raising her head proudly. “Did you open the secret realm of Mountains and Seas? Such reckless behavior—do you even know the terror sealed inside?”","The Palace Master of Xingyao’s face darkened. There was no need for her daughter to say anything further because Jiang Haichao had already emerged, carrying the now-shrunken secret realm of Mountains and Seas.","Behind him, in the dense blue mist, a massive serpent soared into the sky.","Its aura was so powerful that it suffocated everyone present.","A Six-Star Universe God!","And Jiang Haichao was a quasi-Five-Star Universe God.","Time seemed to slow down.","But Jian Wushuang’s hands moved swiftly. He used the Gui Yun Vine, continuously grasping at the still-slumbering members of the God Eye Clan.","He didn’t care about anyone else.","Right now, he only wanted to use the God Eye Clan to unlock the ninth level of the Nine Prison Pagoda.","Boom!","The next moment, battle erupted.","The aura of the Palace Master of Xingyao surged to the level of a Five-Star Universe God, catching everyone off guard.","Before she could even act, the aura of the white-haired elder beside her began to shift.","And just before the serpent could unleash its power, it was instantly suppressed by the white-haired elder.","“Haha, I, Chen Gu, should really thank you all. Without you, I would have never escaped this realm!” he said, his entire body engulfed in the green mist. In an instant, his figure expanded to a height of millions of feet. With a wave of his hand, he obliterated thousands of Universe Gods, absorbing their bloodlines.","His whole body turned blood-red.","“Blood God?” The face of the Palace Master of Xingyao changed drastically. She never expected that the legendary Blood God had been hiding by her side.","Jiang Haichao was dumbfounded. He had thought himself invincible with his lord present, ready to suppress everyone.","But someone else had stolen the prize.","Blood God Chen Gu sneered at everyone, his expression filled with disdain. “The blood running through your veins is mine. Now it’s time to repay me!”","With that, he struck out with his palm.","The aura of a Seven-Star Universe God instantly shattered the surrounding space-time.","Jian Wushuang, who had been focusing on his task, shook his head helplessly.","“How bothersome!”","Whoosh!","A tiny figure appeared above the secret realm of Mountains and Seas.","It was a young man, carrying a divine sword on his back and clad in dark red armor.","He appeared in the middle of the battlefield, yet no one noticed him.","The young man raised his hand, and an endless burst of sword energy, unmatched by his appearance, erupted.","Blood God Chen Gu didn’t even have time to feel fear before he was completely shredded into a cloud of blood mist.","Jian Wushuang’s true body descended in front of Xiang Yang and the others, smiling faintly.","“Allow me to introduce myself—this is my true body!”","He then turned to Jiang Ni, nodding slightly.","He had already arranged for Hui Qing to meet her, and soon, father and daughter would be reunited.","“Brother Wushuang, your true body... what level is it, exactly?” Xiang Yang asked, his eyes wide.","The others were even more curious.","Earlier, Blood God’s combat strength had clearly been at the peak of a Seven-Star Universe God. If he had absorbed all the bloodlines, he would’ve become an Eight-Star Universe God.","Yet he had been annihilated by a single strike of Jian Wushuang’s sword energy.","“Strength is an illusion. You’ll understand once you’re out of here,” Jian Wushuang’s true body said, before moving to help his clone collect the Gui Yun Vine.","At the same time, he sent a telepathic message to Xiang Yang, instructing him to lead everyone out of this world.","Soon, this world would collapse.","Because he had ascended.","Earlier, Blood God had exterminated all life to condense their bloodlines.","Now, only the Palace Master of Xingyao and her people remained. Naturally, they didn’t dare defy Jian Wushuang, and they left this world through the vortex.","Jian Wushuang’s clone merged with his true body.","“Ninth level, open!”","The Nine Prison Pagoda floated into the air, out of his control.","At this moment, his Origin Source began to transform.","There was no need to undergo a tribulation—he had completed his ascension to Universe God.","Or was it Time-Space God?","Neither title seemed quite right.","Even Jian Wushuang himself didn’t understand his current realm.","He only felt that if he willed it, even the starry sky created by the God King might be destroyed by a single strike of his sword.","Even those supreme beings from his dreams now seemed like mere ants in his eyes.","As his curiosity peaked, the Nine Prison Pagoda emitted a bright light, splitting open.","From within the holy light, a staircase appeared.","“Is this the path to Mount Chaos?”","It made sense—Senior Brother Gui Yan had said that once he opened the ninth level, he would meet their master.","Now, with the appearance of the staircase to Mount Chaos, it was time for that meeting.","He stepped onto the staircase, and the space around him shifted.","In an instant, he left the Ninefold Time-Space, the God King’s starry sky, and even the Land of Chaos.","Because, in his world, there was order.","Or rather, now, he could create ordered worlds at will.","The first step of the staircase brought memories.","He saw his past self in the Sword Pavilion.","The second step showed him in the Realm of Divine Fire, and with a casual gesture, he righted all his past regrets.","On the third step, he saw the familiar Universe Gods, yet they knelt before him.","“An existence beyond the timeline... the old man was hiding a lot!” Jian Wushuang shook his head.","By the fourth step, he had reached the Great Division, with nothing more to reminisce about.","From that point on, he had simply been a seeker of the Dao.","However, upon seeing his past self in the Heavenly Maiden’s Time-Space, he couldn’t help but find it amusing.","And so, he continued up Mount Chaos, following a seemingly orderly journey, until he finally reached the summit.","It was empty, with no one in sight.","“Master Xuan Yi!”","He had a strong premonition and tried calling out.","As soon as the words left his mouth, Master Xuan Yi appeared.","Jian Wushuang’s eyes reddened, and a surge of emotions filled his mind.","“Star Officer Xuan Mingzi, greets the Supreme!” Xuan Yi wore a respectful smile, his eyes filled with gratitude.","This sight left Jian Wushuang both surprised and somewhat disappointed.","It was exactly as he had expected.","Just as he had imagined.","He thought of Xuan Yi, and Xuan Yi appeared in this world.","He thought of light, and this world had light.","Reaching this point, it wasn’t Xuan Yi motivating him anymore.","It was him motivating himself to the point where whatever he willed, became reality.","Omnipotent!"]}]);
